msgstr "街机模式"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Arcade Mode"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "STOP HAND-HOLDING ME!!!"
msgstr "别再手把手教我了！！！"

#. ~ Name of the "caffeine" addiction's effect as it appears in the player's
