msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身黏糊糊的奇怪感觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about living in a cave."
msgstr "你做了一个关于洞穴生活的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange reclusive feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种与世隔绝的奇怪感觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about sea creatures."
msgstr "你做了一个关于海洋生物的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange wet feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身潮湿的奇怪感觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about spiders."
msgstr "你做了一个关于蜘蛛的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange webbed feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种被网包围的奇怪感觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about rats."
msgstr "你做了一个关于老鼠的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange fuzzy feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种毛茸茸的奇怪感觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream."
msgstr "你做了一个怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel… OK."
msgstr "你感觉……不错。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a puckish dream."
msgstr "你做了个恶作剧的梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the changeling.  Again."
msgstr "你梦到自己调包偷换孩童。又一次。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel a yearning…"
msgstr "你内心有种渴望……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream about the zoo, for some reason."
msgstr "你不知道为什么，梦到了动物园。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams… are complex and multifaceted."
msgstr "你的梦……复杂而多变。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the tropics."
msgstr "你梦到热带雨林。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel warm."
msgstr "你在梦中感到十分温暖。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a massive block of cheese bigger than you."
msgstr "你梦见一大块比你整个人还大的奶酪。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being cozy in a dark place."
msgstr "你梦见在黑暗中的你更加自在。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a strange quest for a bush that grows gray apples."
msgstr "你梦见自己正在奇怪地寻找一种能够长出灰色苹果的灌木丛。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel like you're cracking a combination lock."
msgstr "你梦见自己好像在破解一把组合锁。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow cancel each other out, don't they?"
msgstr "红色，蓝色，黄色会相互抵消，不是吗？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MARLOSS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow add together, don't they?"
msgstr "红色，蓝色，黄色会混在一起，不是吗？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of bathing in the sun on a rock."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，梦里你在岩石上晒太阳。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see a distinctively lizard-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见自己像蜥蜴一样的独特倒影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of undergoing strange medical procedures."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，好像接受了诡异的医疗手术。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself dressed in a hospital gown, receiving "
"treatment."
msgstr "在梦里，你看到自己穿着病号服，在医院接受治疗。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a hospital where doctors try out experimental treatments."
msgstr "你梦见在一家医院中，医生们尝试着实验疗法。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream about running from dogs."
msgstr "你做了一个躲开猎狗追捕的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see a distinctively rabbit-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "梦里，你看见自己像兔子一样的独特身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of digging a hole under a hill to make your home."
msgstr "你梦见自己在山脚下挖了个洞安家。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of carrying a house on your back."
msgstr "你做了一个背着房子的怪梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself weighted down under massive backpack/tent "
"upon your back, as you pass by a mirrored surface."
msgstr "在梦中，每当你经过一个镜面时，你都能看到自己被背上的巨大背包帐篷压下。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of eating insects."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，梦里你吃下昆虫。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself in a pond, your face has widened and is "
"covered in mucus."
msgstr "在梦中，你能在池塘里看见自己的倒影，你的脸变宽了，浑身都是粘液。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have strange dreams of soaring through the sky."
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦里你飞翔在天空中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In a dream, you see a curiously birdlike reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见自己奇怪的像鸟一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of swimming in the open ocean"
msgstr "你梦见自己在海洋里遨游。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream, you see a strangely fishlike image of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见自己奇怪的像鱼一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of hunting in the woods."
msgstr "你做了一个在树林里打猎的生动的梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Whilst dreaming, you see a disturbingly bestial version of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像野兽般的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of blood and guts.  For some reason, it makes you feel weirdly "
"excited."
msgstr "你梦见了鲜血与脏器。不知怎么的，这让你感到异常兴奋。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of foraging in the woods… mouth-first?"
msgstr "你梦见自己在丛林中搜寻草料……还用的嘴？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-reflection is rather bearish."
msgstr "在梦里，你不自觉地用熊的方式思考。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of brushing the fur on your back against a tree."
msgstr "你梦见你在对着树蹭背上的毛皮。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You easily bound from the street to a roof..oh, only a dream."
msgstr "你纵身一跃，从大街上跳到了屋顶……啊，只是个梦而已。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "As you dream, your reflection looks rather catlike."
msgstr "在梦中，你不自觉地走起了猫步。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of someone invading your territory."
msgstr "你做了一个不愉快的梦，梦中有人侵犯了你的领地。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-self's muzzle looks… wait, muzzle?"
msgstr "你梦见自己带着嘴套……等等，嘴套？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the moon and feel a sudden urge to howl."
msgstr "你梦见了月亮，突然有了一种想要嚎叫的冲动。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of grazing in an open field."
msgstr "你梦见自己在旷野中吃草。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In a dream you catch a glimpse of a strangely cattle-like image of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你瞥见了自己变成奇怪的牛的样子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a dream of working in a hive."
msgstr "你做了一个梦，梦见自己在一个巢穴中行走。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming you look into a mirror and see a frighteningly insectoid "
"reflection."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像昆虫一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a feast and excitedly chitter with your pincers… wait, what?"
msgstr "你面见了一场盛宴，并兴奋地用你的螯喀嚓喀嚓地……等等，啥？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a confusing dream of growing in a garden."
msgstr "你做了一个令人困扰的梦，在梦中你正在一个花园中茁壮成长。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are confused by a plantlike image of yourself in a dream."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像植物一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of standing still in the rain, drinking in the falling drops… with"
" your feet?"
msgstr "你梦见自己伫立雨中，啜饮着洒落的雨滴……用脚？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of living in sludge."
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦见自己生活在一个烂泥潭中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see an odd, slimy reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像软泥一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living deep inside a dark cave."
msgstr "你梦见你生活在一个很深很黑的山洞里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream you crawl out from under a rock.  And then immediately crawl back "
"in."
msgstr "你梦到自己从石头底下爬出来。然后马上又爬了回去。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of being a primitive cave dweller."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成了一个原始穴居人。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living on the ocean floor."
msgstr "你梦见自己生活在深海之中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While dreaming, a reflection of yourself appears almost like an octopus."
msgstr "在梦里，你发现自己的倒影几乎就和一只章鱼一模一样。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream of spinning webs"
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦见自己在吐丝织网。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see a very spiderlike version of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像蜘蛛一样的身影。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of the buzzing of a fly that you cannot see.  It makes you hungry."
msgstr "你梦见一只看不见的苍蝇在嗡嗡叫着。它令你感到饥饿。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in the sewers."
msgstr "你做了一个生动鲜明的梦，梦见自己生活在下水道里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your dream you see a group of rats that look almost like yourself."
msgstr "在你的梦中，你看到了一群和你自己长的差不多的老鼠。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of having that success you knew you deserved, back before all "
"this."
msgstr "你梦到自己回到了过去的世界，幸福地追求自己的梦想。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-self looks competent and in control."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己非常能干而冷静，一切尽在掌握。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a fortress, sheltering humanity from the zombies.  You're in "
"charge, of course."
msgstr "你梦见一座保护人类免受丧尸侵害的堡垒。当然，由你领导。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a home in the forests."
msgstr "你做了一个生动鲜明的梦，梦见自己生活在森林之中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream you are lithe in the sunlight and radiant with grace."
msgstr "你梦见自己在阳光下躺着，优雅地闪耀着。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel beautiful, and yet riven with worry…"
msgstr "你梦见自己很漂亮，但又被烦恼所撕裂……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You can't quite work out what the dream is about… it just keeps changing."
msgstr "你不太能理解你的怪梦……它不停的在变幻。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream is filled with creatures, and yet all seem like you."
msgstr "你的梦境充斥了各种生物，而且你看上去和它们都有点像。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of stalking some sort of lizard… no, that can't be right, can it?"
msgstr "在梦中，你悄悄地跟踪着一群蜥蜴……不，这不正常吧，不是吗？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"For some reason you dream of your shoes.  They don't fit, and nothing seems "
"to help…"
msgstr "不知为何，你梦见了自己的鞋子。它们再也不合脚了，而且无论如何都帮不了你……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of… sneaking."
msgstr "你梦见你在……潜行。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a cold winter night.  Your jacket is too big to put on."
msgstr "你梦见一个寒冷的冬夜。你的夹克太大了，穿不上。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of becoming a lizard hybrid."
msgstr "你很惊恐的梦到自己变成了一个蜥蜴人。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbingly lifelike dream of living as a lizard."
msgstr "你做了一个很令人困惑很逼真的梦，梦见自己俨然如一只蜥蜴一样活着。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about being the Easter Bunny."
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦见自己是只复活节兔子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a comforting and warm dream of living as a rabbit."
msgstr "你做了一个舒适而温暖的梦，梦见自己像兔子一样生活。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a dream of doctors and nurses doing unnatural things to your body, "
"which brings you perverse pleasure."
msgstr "你做了一个怪梦。医生和护士对你的身体动了一个非常恐怖手术，但是给了你一种奇特的快感。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a vivid dream of being a medical anomaly, as your heartbeat syncs "
"with the steady drip of an IV line."
msgstr "你做了一个与医疗异常现象有关的生动的梦，在梦中你的心跳与平稳的静脉点滴同步化了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of cutting yourself with a knife and watch in fascination as it "
"heals in seconds."
msgstr "你梦见用刀自残，并着迷地看着伤口在几秒内愈合。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a realistic dream of flying south with your flock for the winter."
msgstr "你做了一个逼真的梦，梦里在和一群伙伴为了躲避寒冬一起向南飞着。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You are disturbed when your birdlike dreams are more lifelike than reality."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成一只飞鸟，梦境中的场景变得比现实世界还要真实了，这让你心烦意乱。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr "你做了一个令人困扰的梦，梦见自己在和一群小鱼伙伴们一起畅游。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "When you wake up you panic about drowning from being out of water."
msgstr "当你醒来的时候，骤然感觉到一阵窒息，就像鱼儿跳出水面的感觉一样。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of leaping from the water to catch your prey."
msgstr "你梦见自己从水中跳出来捕捉猎物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wake up with your legs pumping as you hop along in your sleep."
msgstr "你在梦中蹦蹦跳跳，醒来时双腿还不停地抽搐。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of crawling along the world when you realize you can see three "
"hundred and sixty degrees around yourself."
msgstr "你梦见自己环绕世界爬行，突然意识到自己能看到360度的周遭。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of curling up inside a shell to sleep."
msgstr "你梦见自己蜷缩在壳里睡觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of running with your pack, hunting a wild animal."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己正在和狼伙伴们合作追捕一只猎物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A terrifyingly real dream has you killing game with your bare teeth."
msgstr "一场真实而恐怖的梦境，你梦见自己正在用锋利的獠牙咬穿猎物的喉咙。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dream of raiding a giant beehive has you licking your… muzzle in "
"anticipation."
msgstr "在梦中，你疯狂的舔食着一个蜂巢，用着你那……长长的嘴，预料之中。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In your dream, you stalk and kill a young wolf, using only your teeth and "
"claws."
msgstr "梦中，你悄悄地杀死了一只幼狼——只用牙齿和爪子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"A warm, sunny spot high up where you can watch your prey.  What a great "
"dream!"
msgstr "你在一个温暖，阳光明媚的高地俯视着你的猎物。真是一个美梦啊！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of pursuing and killing a rat, for some reason."
msgstr "梦里，你追逐并杀掉了一只老鼠……不过为什么？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into a fresh kill."
msgstr "你梦见自己的爪子撕碎了新鲜的猎物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of finally finding the perfect place to make your den."
msgstr "梦中，你终于找到了絮窝的理想地点。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You terrifyingly dream of being led to a slaughterhouse by a farmer."
msgstr "你做了一个很糟糕的梦，梦见自己正被农夫领着走向屠宰场。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You find it hard to wake from a vivid dream of grazing on a farm."
msgstr "你很不情愿的从一个逼真的梦中醒来，梦中你安静地吃着草。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of serving the hive queen mindlessly."
msgstr "你很惊恐地从梦中醒来，梦中你变成了一个没有自主意识、服务于蜂后的工蜂。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your disturbingly lifelike dream has you pollinating plants."
msgstr "你做了一个很令人不安而又十分逼真的梦，梦中你在给花儿授粉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a confusing and scary dream of becoming a plant."
msgstr "你做了一个困惑而吓人的梦，梦见自己变成了一株植物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The transition from your lifelike dreams of living as a plant to reality "
"shocks you."
msgstr "梦里变成一株植物的感觉正在逐渐变为现实，这种感觉让你毛骨悚然。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your vivid dream of living as a slime blob frightens you."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己变成了一只变形怪，太恐怖了！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You find it hard to control your limbs after dreaming of amorphous blob "
"life."
msgstr "你从变成变形怪的梦中醒来以后，发现自己几乎无法控制自己的四肢了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream of living in the dark for years is almost real."
msgstr "你梦见自己在黑暗中生活了很多很多年，这种感觉以假乱真。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are frightened of the outside after your vivid dream of cave life."
msgstr "从穴居生活的生动梦境中醒过来后，你发现自己很怕在户外活动了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dreams of living on the ocean floor seem more lifelike than reality."
msgstr "你梦见自己生活在海床上，梦境中的场景变得比现实世界还要真实了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of living as a terrifying octopus mutant."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成了一只很吓人的章鱼变异人。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in a web and consuming insects."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己正趴在网上畅享美味昆虫。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams of fully turning into a spider frighten you."
msgstr "你梦见自己完全变成了一只蜘蛛，太吓人了！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You scream in fear while you dream of being chased by a cat"
msgstr "你梦见自己正在被一只猫追捕，太吓人了！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your lifelike dreams have you scavenging food with a pack of rats."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己正在和一群老鼠伙伴搜寻食物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You see yourself, five years from now, as the leader of a successful city."
msgstr "你梦见了五年后的自己，一位成功的受人敬仰的市长。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your success in restoring civilization was only a dream.  For now."
msgstr "你成功地重建了人类文明，但它暂时只是一个梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "NO!  You will not allow this corruption to prevail!"
msgstr "不！你不会让这腐化战胜自己的！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You see yourself reflected in the beauty of the forest."
msgstr "你在梦中看见了自己美丽的身影，森林的美景全都在你身上映射出来。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "In your sleep you feel verdant energy growing within you."
msgstr "在睡梦中，你感觉到自己体内正生长着青翠的能量。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the hunt to end all hunts."
msgstr "你梦到了终结所有狩猎的狩猎。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are many animals, and yet one."
msgstr "你是无数动物的集合体，然而你还是你。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You swim with fish.  You fly with birds.  You run with the beasts of the "
"land.  You change with the changing of seasons.  You are everything."
msgstr "你梦见自己和鱼一起游。和鸟一起飞。和这片土地上的野兽一起跑。你会随着季节的变化而变化。你就是一切。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Hoof.  Talon.  Tooth.  Fight.  Feed.  Forward."
msgstr "巨蹄。利爪。尖牙。战斗。进食。前进。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You've never felt so lithe and powerful."
msgstr "你从来没有感到如此轻盈，强大。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"After an exciting and tasty hunt, you retire to your nest.  Mmm, yes, nest."
msgstr "在一场激动人心、美味多汁的狩猎之后，你回到了你的爱巢。嗯，是的，\"巢\"。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You weave between the zombies' legs, too small for them to catch.  The gas "
"station isn't far now, with all its soda and chips and- UGH, dream…"
msgstr "你在丧尸的腿间穿梭，它们根本抓不住身材小巧的你。加油站就在眼前，以及里面的汽水和薯片还有——呃，是个梦……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Once you finish your tasty dinner of seeds, you look around for your drink, "
"but you already ate it."
msgstr "你吃完了美味的种子，环顾四周寻找饮料，但你突然想起你只需靠吃东西就可以解渴。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of becoming an ape hybrid."
msgstr "你惊恐的梦到自己变成了一个杂交猿。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You blissfully recall days spent lounging in the sun."
msgstr "你愉快的梦到在太阳底下的日子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of your legions of undead admirers, their attentions, and the "
"wonderful pain."
msgstr "你梦到了那一大群无数不死崇拜者，它们对你的关注，以及那美妙的疼痛感觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wonder if your nest will be good enough."
msgstr "你梦见你在纠结自己建造的鸟巢是否足够结实。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dream of soaring over the landscape becomes a nightmare when you find "
"yourself with arms and a glider!"
msgstr "你梦见自己翱翔蓝天，俯瞰美景，而你发现自己还有着手臂和滑翔器，这个梦变成了梦魇。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Will your burrow be warm enough for the family in winter?"
msgstr "你家的地洞在冬天够暖和吗？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of outrunning the apocalypse."
msgstr "你梦见自己跑步速度超越了世界末日。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a comforting dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr "你做了一个舒适的梦，梦见自己在和一群小鱼伙伴们一起畅游。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The thought of being out of water, forced to crawl unsupported, terrifies "
"you."
msgstr "你梦见自己被捉出水面，在地上不停扑腾，这个噩梦吓坏了你。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of sharing a kill with your pack."
msgstr "你做了一个生动的梦，梦见自己和兽群们一同分享猎物。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A fond memory of throating some prey animal bubbles up."
msgstr "一段咬开猎物喉咙的美妙回忆出现在你的梦里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You wonder if you could find one of those 'salmon runs', or if they were "
"just a legend…"
msgstr "你在梦中四处寻找那些可以\"嘴接鲑鱼\"的地方，或者那只是一个传说……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Ah, the wolf-slaying dream again.  That's a good one…"
msgstr "哈，又是一个杀狼的梦。这个还不错……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In the dream, you fatten yourself up with all the food you can find to "
"prepare for your next winter hibernation."
msgstr "在梦中，你用你能找到的所有食物把自己养胖，为下个冬眠做准备。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Boing!  and you've pounced another yummy critter."
msgstr "扑通！你又抓到了一个美味的可怜虫。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your nightmare of sentient rats turns successful, as you grab their King and"
" shake it apart!"
msgstr "在梦中你最终成功地成了所有聪明老鼠们的梦魇，你抓住了鼠王，并把它撕成了碎片！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You leap from rooftop to rooftop, effortlessly avoiding your pursuers while "
"making your way to safety."
msgstr "你梦见自己从一个屋顶跳到另一个屋顶，毫不费力地避开追击者，同时逃向安全的地方。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You sneak into a house, only to discover a full, intact cupboard of canned "
"tuna!"
msgstr "你梦见自己潜入一间房子，却发现了一个装满了金枪鱼罐头的完好无损的橱柜！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a whole field where only lush catnip grows, and you blissfully "
"roll around in it."
msgstr "你梦见一片只有猫薄荷草生长的茂密田野，你幸福地在其中打滚。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of the hunt, the feed, and your pack."
msgstr "你梦到了捕猎，进食，还有你的狼群。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You lead the pack on a glorious hunt, knowing that they will all have your "
"back as you have theirs!"
msgstr "你梦见自己带领狼群进行一次光荣的狩猎，因为你知道他们都会支持你，就像你支持他们一样！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Oh, you should really patrol your territory again, maybe expand."
msgstr "哦，你真心需要再次巡逻你的领地了，或许是时候扩张下领地了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a rival pack of hairless bipeds intruding upon your territory."
"  After a fierce battle, their leader lays lifeless on the ground."
msgstr "你梦见一群无毛的两足动物入侵你的领地。经过一场激烈的战斗，他们的首领毫无生气地躺在地上。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You howl loud and long, ecstatic after securing a whole cache of supplies."
msgstr "你梦见自己狂喜地大声嚎叫，找到了一大批物资。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"After recruiting a new packmate, you expand your spacious den to accommodate"
" them."
msgstr "你梦见自己招募到了一个新伙伴，你扩展了自己宽敞的巢穴来容纳他们。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of jumping the gate and leading your herd to freedom."
msgstr "你梦到你带领你的族群跃过大门奔向自由。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You bellow on a knoll against the sky, having feasted on the apple time "
"cider."
msgstr "你梦见自己在饱餐过苹果酒后，在小丘上对着天空打出一个饱嗝。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The herd moves along and you with them, finding greener pastures."
msgstr "兽群不断的前进，奔向更加青翠的草场，你是其中之一。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You feel smug, knowing that the Queen is dependent on you."
msgstr "想想蜂后都需要依靠自己，你不禁有几分自得。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You relax and enjoy the humming adulation of all your followers."
msgstr "你在梦中十分放松，享受身后追随者的嗡嗡奉承。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a weirdly shaped plant, whose nectar surpassed your every wish…"
msgstr "你梦到一株奇形怪状的植物，其花蜜如同琼浆玉露，超过了你的幻想……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of bees fighting over your sweet nectar.  Mmm."
msgstr "你梦到一群蜜蜂为了你甘甜的花蜜而争斗。感觉真好。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"How grand it would be to sink your roots deep into the soil as the seasons "
"pass you by."
msgstr "你梦见自己把根深深地浸入土壤中，四季随之流逝，多么伟大啊。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a gigantic knot of roots, beating like a heart."
msgstr "你梦见一颗巨大的根结，像一颗心一样跳动。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of termites chewing all over your body."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，梦中白蚁在你全身上下咀嚼着你。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of sharing your roots with a vast forest, all plants provided for "
"as the canopy grows ever upwards."
msgstr "你梦见自己与一片广袤的森林共同分享根部，当树冠不断向上生长时，所有的植物都得到了满足。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "A family of caterpillars munches away at your leaves."
msgstr "你梦见一群毛毛虫啃食着你的叶子。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Fire rages around you, licking at your bark and engulfing the saplings and "
"bushes near your roots.  The once chatty forest is quiet in its wake."
msgstr "你梦见火焰在你四周肆虐，舔舐你的树皮，吞没你根旁的幼苗和灌木。曾经喋喋不休的森林也随之安静。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of communing with an ancient pine.  Trees are the true survivors "
"of this world, it tells you."
msgstr "你梦见和一棵古老的松树联结交流。它告诉你，树木才是这个世界真正的幸存者。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"A rather attractive triffid offers you a bouquet of ape heads.  How "
"thoughtful!"
msgstr "一个富有魅力的三尖树送了你一束\"猿\"脑袋，太体贴了！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your vivid dream of your pseudopods calcifying into rigid structures "
"terrifies you."
msgstr "你十分逼真地梦见自己的假足钙化成了坚硬结构，太可怕了！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Ah, the painting-the-planet dream again.  Maybe if you assimilated more…"
msgstr "啊，又是关于\"星球染色\"的梦。或许你应该进一步同化下……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The years seem to fly past as you dream of carving great underground "
"fastnesses."
msgstr "你在梦中构筑牢固的地下要塞，时光飞逝，度年如日。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a horrible nightmare of being caught out in the sunlight."
msgstr "在一个恐怖的噩梦中，你被扔到了阳光里。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Mmm.  The shellfish dream again.  Yum!"
msgstr "嗯……又是这个贝壳梦。好美味！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of recruiting a cult of fishfolk to serve your needs."
msgstr "你梦见自己招募了一群鱼人邪教徒来为你服务。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You excitedly web up an interloper and prepare to feast… nope, dream."
msgstr "你兴奋地网住了一个闯入者，准备享用盛宴……呃，一个梦而已。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You relax in your web; it's not vibrating, so dinner hasn't arrived yet."
msgstr "你梦见在自己的网里放松，网没有震动，所以晚餐还没到。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams of having to live without a web frighten you."
msgstr "梦到过着没有网的生活，你被吓到了。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "The Fury is so big!  It's GONNA GET YOAAAAAH!  *pant* only a dream."
msgstr "哇，这只毛绒绒的猫猫怎么这么大！它马上就要把我……哇哇哇哇！*喘气*还好只是一个梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You find your paws twitching.  There's a cave.  You should go."
msgstr "你梦到自己爪子交错着，那有个洞，你应该钻进去。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of the peaceful world you'll give humankind.  Because no one else "
"can."
msgstr "你梦到了自己将给人类带来的大同世界，舍我其谁！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You crush those who would disagree with the leadership.  Humanity must be "
"united; independence will get you all killed!"
msgstr "你梦见自己砸碎了那些敢质疑你的领导的人。人类必须团结一致，独立会害死你们所有人！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "There are underground Faults in the world.  Faults you should remedy."
msgstr "这个世界隐藏着许多\"缺陷\"，一些需要你来纠正的\"缺陷\"。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You pant, terrified at the thought of that FUNGUS destroying your home!"
msgstr "你被真菌正在摧毁你的家园的噩梦惊醒了，气喘吁吁！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wish others could understand, and join your struggle…"
msgstr "你希望别人能理解你对森林的爱，并和你一起奋斗……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"There is so much that you never imagined, the slime, the legs, and eyestalks"
" but the shell was worth it."
msgstr "有那么多你从未想象过的东西，黏液，腹足和眼柄，但至少贝壳是值得的。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You'll always be home, once you take this last step."
msgstr "一旦你迈出最后一步，你将永远在家。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You'd never considered that frogs were generalist predators before this "
"point in your life…"
msgstr "在你生命中的这一刻之前，你从未想过青蛙是多面手的捕食者……"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"On land and in the water, you control all that you can reach, and your "
"tongue has quite the reach."
msgstr "不论在陆地还是水中，你能控制你能触及的一切，而你的舌头也能挺能触及的。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your body flows slightly faster than you expected… oh, just a dream."
msgstr "你觉得体内的血液流动地比你预期中要快……哦，只是一个梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "FIGHT.  FEED.  FORWARD."
msgstr "战斗！进食！前行！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Oh.  No, that 'rex' thing was only a myth."
msgstr "哦，不。那些所谓\"霸王龙\"只是一场梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You stir, saddened that your beautiful hatchlings were only a dream."
msgstr "你好失落，你那些刚刚孵化的漂亮幼崽只是一场梦。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You curl up some more in your nest.  Geez, shredded paper really *is* comfy."
msgstr "你继续蜷缩在你的巢穴中。哎呀，碎纸真的是舒服。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Oh boy!  This hidey hole sure is swell."
msgstr "哦天哪！这个藏身洞可真大。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Once we finish the burrow we'll settle down and start a little family.  "
"Maybe just a dozen boys and a dozen girls.  Nice and cosy."
msgstr "一旦我们挖完洞，我们就能安顿下来，建立一个小小的家庭。也许只有十几个男孩和十几个女孩。又好又舒服。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"In your dreams, you blindly run through the pipes of the city, navigating "
"the familiar byways via smell alone."
msgstr "在睡梦中，你闭着眼都能在城市的管道中穿行，光靠气味就能在熟悉的小到上辨识方向。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Sneaky sneak under the floorboards.  We will sneak all their crumbs for us."
"  But later, back to sleep for now."
msgstr "偷偷溜到地板下面。我们会偷偷把他们的面包屑都偷走。但稍后再说，现在得先回去睡觉。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You hear the sirens again, but this time you stay in your hole in the wall."
"  Nobody will think to look there!"
msgstr "你又听见警笛了，但是这次你藏在你墙中的洞穴中。没人会想到在这里寻找！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "We have been waiting a long time for a place such as this."
msgstr "吾等为此时此地已等待多时。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "We will raise bountiful orchards and beautiful gardens."
msgstr "吾等将建起丰美的果园及美丽的花园。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The walking plants seek to harness us as a food source.  We will not allow "
"that."
msgstr "那些会走路的植物把吾等当作食物。吾等将阻止它们。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Our colonists are limitless.  We shall adapt to this world, as we adapt to "
"all."
msgstr "吾等开拓者无穷无尽。吾等将改造这个世界，一如吾等所曾改造过的所有一切。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Non-Mycus sometimes reject the Marloss.  Our colonial efforts flourish with "
"broad-minded guidance."
msgstr "非马卡斯们时而排斥马洛斯莓。吾等开拓者应以慈悲为怀，引导其实现繁荣。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MYCUS"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The seething masses attempt to wall non-Mycus away from the Marloss.  We "
"will adapt and defeat them."
msgstr "狂信之众试图将非马卡斯们与马洛斯隔绝开来。吾等将适应并击败它们。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You hear a distant rumble of thunder."
msgstr "你听到远处隆隆的雷声。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A flash of lightning illuminates your surroundings!"
msgstr "一道闪电照亮了你的周围！"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The acid rain stings, but is mostly harmless for now…"
msgstr "酸雨让你感到皮肤刺痛，但目前还算对你没有伤害……"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The acid rain burns!"
msgstr "酸雨灼烧着你！"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your batteries discharge slightly."
msgstr "你的电池稍微有些漏电。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You feel very sleepy…"
msgstr "你感到非常困倦……"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You feel sleepy…"
msgstr "你感到困倦……"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your vision pixelates!"
msgstr "你的视觉像素化了！"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your vision inverts!"
msgstr "你的视野颠倒了！"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your malfunctioning bionic causes you to spasm and fall to the floor!"
msgstr "你体内故障的生化插件导致你倒在地上抽搐！"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your bionics short-circuit, causing you to tremble and shiver."
msgstr "你的生化插件短路了，使你浑身发抖。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your malfunctioning bionic starts to glow!"
msgstr "你体内故障的生化插件突然开始闪闪发光！"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your malfunctioning bionic itches!"
msgstr "你的生化插件发生了故障，让你感到奇痒难忍！"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your faulty bionic emits a crackle of noise!"
msgstr "你失灵的生化插件突然发出巨大的噪音！"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You feel your faulty bionic shuddering."
msgstr "你感到体内故障的生化插件在不停颤动。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Your ultimate fate is hard to sum up in words but suffice to say, the thing "
"that used to be you wishes it had hidden from the storm."
msgstr "你最终的命运很难用语言来概括，但可以说，曾经的你希望自己躲过风暴。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"For an instant that is also an eternity, you exist only in an empty void.  "
"Then you feel something vast, alien, and merciless reach through a "
"preexisting connection to give you just enough energy to exist.  Its motives"
" for doing so are not likely to be benign."
msgstr ""
"在那永恒长的一瞬间，你仅仅存在于一片虚无之中。然后你感觉到某种强烈、陌生而又无情的存在，通过某种预先建立的连接触碰到了你，给予了某种力量，以维持你的存在。但你感觉它这样做并不是出于什么善心。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The NRE recorder emits a sharp beep!"
msgstr "NRE记录器发出尖锐的哔哔声！"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The recorder whirs as it starts printing the recorded data."
msgstr "记录仪发出呜呜声，开始打印记录的数据。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The recorder prints: \"NO DATA\" in a short piece of paper"
msgstr "记录器打印出一张“无数据”的短纸。"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"As the last of the horrors fell dead, you notice a strange thing popped up "
"from nowhere and dropped on the ground."
msgstr "当最后一个怪物终于死去时，你注意到一个奇怪的东西不知从哪里冒了出来，掉在了地上。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hit_by_player"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Hit By Player"
msgstr "被玩家攻击"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hit By Player"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when monsters are hit by player.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：被玩家击中。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "ridden"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Ridden"
msgstr "被骑乘"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Ridden"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when critter is being ridden.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：此生物正在被骑着。如果你有这个标签说明遇到bug了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "npc_suspend"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Suspended NPC"
msgstr "NPC已暂停AI"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Suspended NPC"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag for when an NPC needs to be rebooted after an infinite loop."
msgstr "AI专用标签：已停机，因为 AI 无限循环而需要重启。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "harnessed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Harnessed"
msgstr "被套上缰绳"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Harnessed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when critter is being harnessed by a vehicle.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：此生物被套在车上。如果你有这个标签说明遇到bug了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "docile"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Docile Monster"
msgstr "驯服生物"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Docile Monster"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag for when monsters are tamed.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：被驯服。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "controlled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Controlled Monster"
msgstr "精控生物"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Controlled Monster"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when monsters are being controlled by another.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：被精神控制。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "run"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Hit-and-run Running"
msgstr "尝试逃跑"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hit-and-run Running"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when hit-and-run monsters run away.  This is a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：尝试逃跑。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "dragging"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Dragging"
msgstr "拖曳"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dragging"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when a monster is dragging you behind it.  This is a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：此怪物正把你拖在身后。如果你有这个标签说明遇到bug了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "operating"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Operating"
msgstr "动手术"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Operating"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when a monster is operating on you.  This is a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：此怪物正在你身上动手术。如果你有这个标签说明遇到bug了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "countdown"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Counting Down"
msgstr "倒计时"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Counting Down"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag for monster's counting down.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：怪物倒计时。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "no_ammo"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "No Ammo"
msgstr "无弹药"

#. ~ Description of effect type "No Ammo"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used to stop a monster reviving with ammo.  This is a bug if you have"
" it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：阻止怪物复活时携带弹药。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asked_to_lead"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Asked to Lead"
msgstr "被要求带路"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Asked to Lead"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag for asking to lead NPCs.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求带路。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asked_to_follow"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Asked to Follow"
msgstr "被要求跟随"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Asked to Follow"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for asking to NPCs to follow you.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求跟随。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asked_to_train"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Recently trained"
msgstr "最近培训过"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Recently trained"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You recently finished a training session and need a mental break before "
"teaching again."
msgstr "你最近刚刚完成培训课程，需要在再次教学前休息一下。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asked_to_socialize"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Asked to Socialize"
msgstr "被要求闲聊"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Asked to Socialize"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag: for having recently asked an NPC to socialize.  This is a bug if you"
" have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求闲聊。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asked_to_hint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Asked to Hint"
msgstr "被要求提示"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Asked to Hint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag: for having recently asked an NPC to give a hint.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：最近要求NPC给出提示。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asked_personal_info"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Asked Info"
msgstr "被要求个人信息"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Asked Info"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for asking to NPCs for personal information.  This is a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求个人信息。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asked_for_item"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Asked for Item"
msgstr "被要求物品"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Asked for Item"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag for asking NPCs for items.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求物品。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "currently_busy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Currently Busy"
msgstr "当前正忙"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Currently Busy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI cooldown tag for items or services.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：道具或服务的计时器。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "gave_quest_item"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Already Gave Quest Item"
msgstr "已给予任务物品"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Already Gave Quest Item"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag to prevent you from getting multiple quest items.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：避免玩家获得多个任务物品。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "catch_up"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Catch Up"
msgstr "被要求跟上"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Catch Up"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag for telling NPCs to catch up.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求跟上。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "allow_sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Allow to Sleep"
msgstr "允许入睡"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Allow to Sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag for telling NPCs to sleep.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：让NPC入睡。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "npc_said"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Said Something Recently"
msgstr "刚刚对话"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Said Something Recently"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag to control NPC verbosity.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：控制NPC长对话。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "npc_run_away"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "npc_flee_player"
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
msgid "Running Away"
msgstr "逃跑中"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Running Away"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag to enable NPCs to flee.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：使NPC能够逃跑。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Running Away"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag to enable NPCs to flee the player.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：使NPC能够逃离玩家。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "npc_fire_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Avoiding a Fire"
msgstr "正避开火焰"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Avoiding a Fire"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag to enable NPCs to escape uncontrolled fires.  This is a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：使NPC能够逃离不受控制的火灾。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "npc_player_still_looking"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Waiting till You Find Something"
msgstr "等你寻找物品"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Waiting till You Find Something"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag to prevent NPCs from following the player while the player is finding"
" an additional copy of an item.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：防止NPC在玩家寻找额外物品时跟随玩家。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "infection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Infection"
msgstr "感染"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Infection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag used for the infected NPC quest.  This is a bug if you have it."
