msgstr "AI专用标签：尖叫。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "targeted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Turret Is Targeted"
msgstr "炮塔已瞄准"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Turret Is Targeted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for turret targeting sounds.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：炮塔已瞄准。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "bounced"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Bounced"
msgstr "跳弹"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bounced"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for bouncing ammo targeting.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：弹跳弹药锁定标记。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "frenzy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Frenzied"
msgstr "狂暴"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Frenzied"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Monster effect used to buff allies.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "怪物专用标签：使同伴狂暴。如果你看到这个，说明出现了一个bug。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pushed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Pushed"
msgstr "被推开"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Pushed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for monsters pushing each other.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：怪物们互相推挤。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "worked_on"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Worked On"
msgstr "被关闭中"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Worked On"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag used for robots being disabled.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：此机器人正在被关闭中。如果你有这个标签说明遇到bug了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "venom_player1"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weak Player Venom"
msgstr "变弱毒液"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weak Player Venom"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Don't worry, you shouldn't get this."
msgstr "不要在意，你不应该在游戏里看到它。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "venom_player2"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Strong Player Venom"
msgstr "变强毒液"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Strong Player Venom"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Don't worry, you really shouldn't get this."
msgstr "不要在意，你不应该在游戏里看到它。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "dripping_mechanical_fluid"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mechanical Fluid Dripping"
msgstr "机油泄露"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mechanical Fluid Dripping"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for robot monsters losing mechanical fluid.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：机器人怪物机油泄露。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "staggered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Staggered"
msgstr "踉跄"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Staggered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been knocked off-balance by an attack."
msgstr "你被一次攻击弄得失去了平衡。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Staggered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're staggered off-balance."
msgstr "你被攻击得失去了平衡。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "acid_charged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Charged Acid Glands"
msgstr "充满酸液的腺体"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Charged Acid Glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your acid glands are full and ready to burst.  Ew."
msgstr "你的酸液腺已经被充满，随时准备喷射出去，呕。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_acid_gland"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Maimed Acid Glands"
msgstr "酸液腺受损"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Acid Glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your acid glands got all leaky."
msgstr "你的酸液腺到处都是漏洞。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "elec_charged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Charged Capacitor"
msgstr "充满电的生物电容"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Charged Capacitor"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your capacitors sizzle with bioelectricity."
msgstr "你身上的电容流淌着生物电，发出光亮。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_capacitor"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Maimed Capacitor"
msgstr "生物电容受损"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Capacitor"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can't deal with this charge."
msgstr "你没法掌控住身体里的电能。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_tail"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Maimed Tail"
msgstr "尾巴受损"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Tail"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your tail is broken.  You're not sure what to do with this information."
msgstr "你的尾巴残废了。这种消息听起来真够无厘头的。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_claws"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Maimed Claws"
msgstr "爪子受损"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Claws"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your claws broke.  Like a broken nail, but somehow worse."
msgstr "你的爪子残废了。和尾巴残废差不多，但情况更糟。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_armor"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Cracked Shell"
msgstr "碎裂甲壳"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cracked Shell"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel exposed -and pretty buggy- without your shell."
msgstr "没有了外壳，你觉得自己暴露在外——并且很不舒服。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_mandible"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Maimed Mandibles"
msgstr "残废虫颚"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Mandibles"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your mandibles are unusable.  What, you don't have mandibles?  Then it must "
"be a bug if you have it."
msgstr "你的虫颚不能用了。什么，你没有下颚？如果你有，那一定是个bug。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_leg"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Maimed Legs"
msgstr "残废腿部"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Legs"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your bugged legs are maimed beyond recognition.  How will you leap now?"
msgstr "你出bug的腿残废得面目全非。你现在怎么跳？"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_stinger"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Maimed Stinger"
msgstr "残废毒刺"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Stinger"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your beautiful stinger is broken!  That must be a bug, right?"
msgstr "你漂亮的毒刺坏了！那一定是个bug，对吗？"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_wings"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Maimed Wings"
msgstr "残废翅膀"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Wings"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your wings are useless, robbing you of unlimited flight."
msgstr "你的翅膀毫无用途，剥夺了你无限飞行的能力。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "downed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Downed"
msgstr "被击倒"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Downed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're knocked to the ground.  You have to get up before you can move."
msgstr "你倒在了地板上，你必须爬起来才能继续移动。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Downed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're knocked to the floor!"
msgstr "你倒在地板上！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "assisted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Assisted"
msgstr "外科手术协助"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Assisted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're receiving assistance to practice a surgery."
msgstr "你接受了外科手术的帮助。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "masked_scent"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Masked Scent"
msgstr "掩盖体味"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Masked Scent"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scent is masked by another one."
msgstr "你的体味被其他气味所掩盖。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "got_checked"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Got a Check-up"
msgstr "全身体检"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Got a Check-up"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your received a complete check-up and are now aware of the state of your "
"health."
msgstr "你接受了一次完整的全身检查，现在已经了解自身健康的状况。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "heating_bionic"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Heated"
msgstr "发热"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Heated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "At least one of your bionics is producing heat and warming you."
msgstr "你的某个生化插件正在产生热量，使你的身体升温。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "winded"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Winded"
msgstr "气喘吁吁"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're short of breath.  Running and fighting will be difficult until you "
"recover."
msgstr "你气喘吁吁。跑步及打斗都将更困难，直到你回复。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Winded"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your breath gives out!"
msgstr "你喘不过气来！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Winded"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You catch your breath."
msgstr "你喘过气来。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "darkness"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vision flickers and goes gray!"
msgstr "你眼前一团金星，东西开始失去色彩了！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "darkness"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The world flickers back to normality."
msgstr "闪烁的世界终于恢复正常。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "stunned"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stunned"
msgstr "被眩晕"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stunned"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your movement is randomized."
msgstr "你开始不自主的随意运动。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Stunned"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sensor scrambling"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're stunned!"
msgstr "你被眩晕了！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sensor_stun"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Sensor scrambling"
msgstr "传感器干扰"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sensor scrambling"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your artificial senses are scrambled and report false readings."
msgstr "你的生化传感器被干扰，并输出错误读数。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "dazed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Dazed"
msgstr "被震晕"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dazed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're visibly shaken up, and are having a hard time focusing on what's "
"going on around you."
msgstr "你明显被震晕了，很难集中精神注意到发生在你身边的事情。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Dazed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The scream dazes you!"
msgstr "尖叫声震晕了你！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "riding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Riding"
msgstr "骑"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Riding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are riding an animal."
msgstr "你骑着动物。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Riding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You mount your steed."
msgstr "你骑上你的坐骑。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "onfire"
#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Debug Mastery"
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "On Fire"
msgstr "着火"

#. ~ Description of effect type "On Fire"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Loss of health - Entire Body\n"
"Your clothing and other equipment may be consumed by the flames."
msgstr ""
"损失生命 - 全身\n"
"你的衣服和其他装备可能被火焰破坏。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "On Fire"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're on fire!  Wait in place to attempt to put out the fire."
msgstr "你着火了！等在原地会尝试扑灭火焰。"

#. ~ Male memorial apply log of effect type "On Fire"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Caught on fire."
msgstr "着火了。"

#. ~ Female memorial apply log of effect type "On Fire"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Caught on fire."
msgstr "着火了。"

#. ~ Male memorial remove log of effect type "On Fire"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Put out the fire."
msgstr "扑灭了火。"

#. ~ Female memorial remove log of effect type "On Fire"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Put out the fire."
msgstr "扑灭了火。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "bouldering"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Unstable Footing"
msgstr "步履不稳"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unstable Footing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your footing is unstable.  It's more difficult to fight while standing here."
msgstr "你所站的地方不太稳固。站在这里战斗会更困难。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Unstable Footing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You try to keep your balance."
msgstr "你试着保持平衡。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "blind"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/desert_region/weather/fd_dust.json
msgid "Blind"
msgstr "失明"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Blind"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Dust"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/desert_region/weather/fd_dust.json
msgid "Range of Sight: 0.  You cannot see anything."
msgstr "视野降至0，你看不到任何东西。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Blind"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/desert_region/weather/fd_dust.json
msgid "You're blinded!"
msgstr "你失明了！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Blind"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Dust"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/desert_region/weather/fd_dust.json
msgid "Your sight returns!"
msgstr "你恢复了视力！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "earphones"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Wearing Earphones"
msgstr "戴上耳机"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Wearing Earphones"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are wearing earphones and can't hear much from outside world."
msgstr "你戴着耳机，很难听到外界的声音。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "deaf"
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Deaf"
msgstr "失聪"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "deaf"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Impaired Hearing"
msgstr "听力受损"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "deaf"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Ringing Ears"
msgstr "耳鸣"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Deaf, Impaired Hearing, Ringing Ears"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can barely hear anything and your ears hurt."
msgstr "你几乎什么也听不到了，耳朵好痛！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Deaf, Impaired Hearing, Ringing Ears"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You can't hear anything and your head aches from all the noise.  You can't "
"converse with NPCs."
msgstr "你听不见任何声音，噪音让你脑袋发疼，你无法与他人对话了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Deaf, Impaired Hearing, Ringing Ears"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your hearing is impaired."
msgstr "你的听力受到了影响。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Deaf, Impaired Hearing, Ringing Ears"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your ears ring!"
msgstr "你耳鸣得很厉害。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Deaf, Impaired Hearing, Ringing Ears"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can hear again!"
msgstr "你可以再次听到声音了！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "glowy_led"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "A bionic LED is glowing softly beneath your skin."
msgstr "一个生化插件的LED在你的皮肤下柔和地发光。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "stung"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stung"
msgstr "蛰刺"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stung"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have been stung!"
msgstr "你被蛰刺了！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "poison"
#. ~ Speed name of effect type "Weakening Poison"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Poisoned"
msgstr "中毒"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Poisoned"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have been poisoned!"
msgstr "你中毒了！"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Poisoned"
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Badly Poisoned"
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Poisoned blood"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel bad inside."
msgstr "你感觉到身体很难受。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "badpoison"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Badly Poisoned"
msgstr "严重中毒"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Badly Poisoned"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have been badly poisoned!"
msgstr "你严重中毒！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "tpollen"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Short of Breath"
msgstr "呼吸困难"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Short of Breath"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The pollen makes it hard to breathe!"
msgstr "花粉让人呼吸困难！"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Short of Breath"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You cough out pollen."
msgstr "你咳出花粉。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "venom_dmg"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Poisoned Wound"
msgstr "中毒伤口"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Poisoned Wound"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The wound swells visibly and burns like hell."
msgstr "伤口明显肿大，像地狱一样灼热。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Poisoned Wound"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Ow, that stings!"
msgstr "嗷，那可真疼！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Poisoned Wound"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The burning pain subsides, but the damage is done."
msgstr "灼热的疼痛减轻了，但伤害已经造成了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "venom_weaken"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weakening Poison"
msgstr "虚弱毒素"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakening Poison"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel feeble."
msgstr "你觉得很虚弱。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakening Poison"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The sting itself barely hurt, but suddenly you feel exhausted."
msgstr "刺伤本身几乎感觉不到痛，但你突然感到筋疲力尽。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Weakening Poison"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The weight on your chest lessens."
msgstr "你胸口的重压感觉减轻了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "venom_blind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Dissociated"
msgstr "魂不守舍"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "venom_blind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Distracted"
msgstr "心神不宁"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "venom_blind"
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Inattentive"
msgstr "心不在焉"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dissociated, Distracted, Inattentive"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Everything will be fine.  Just ignore all you see, and everything will be "
"fine."
msgstr "一切都会好的。不管你看到什么，一切都会好起来的。"

