#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vision grows blurry."
msgstr "你的视野变得模糊。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Dissociated, Distracted, Inattentive"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "It was right here, wasn't it?"
msgstr "它就在这里，不是吗？"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Dissociated, Distracted, Inattentive"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Are you sure there's something there?"
msgstr "你确定那里有东西吗？"

