msgstr "化工制药"

#. ~ Description of profession "Chemical Cooking" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you produced illicit chemicals for your own consumption, or to sell "
"to others.  Or maybe you're just a real nerd about chemistry.  In any case, "
"you know your way around a Periodic Table."
msgstr "也许你所调配出的非法化学品只是为了自己消遣，或者是为了卖给别人。也许你不过是个化学书读太多的书呆子。总之，你知道化学周期表中隐藏的窍门。"

