msgid "Motorsports"
msgstr "赛车迷"

#. ~ Description of profession "Motorsports" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a big fan of cars and other things that go vroom, whether it's fixing"
" them or driving them.  You may not be a professional, but you know your way"
" around an engine."
msgstr "你是汽车和其他能轰隆隆响的东西的超级粉丝，不管是修车还是开车。你可能不是一个专业人士，但你知道应该如何对待引擎。"

