#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "plutonium generator"
msgstr "钚反应堆"

#. ~ Description of terrain "plutonium generator"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This imposing apparatus harnesses the power of the atom.  Refined nuclear "
"fuel is 'burned' to provide nearly limitless electrical power.  It's not "
"doing much good here though.  Perhaps it could be salvaged for other "
"purposes."
msgstr "一台能够利用原子能的强大设备。经过精炼的核燃料在其中\"燃烧\"以提供几乎无限的电力。但现在它留在这里什么用也没有。也许可以拆开它回收一些部件。"

