msgid ""
"This generator is broken and will not help you produce usable electricity."
msgstr "这台发电机已经坏了，不能帮你发电。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "advanced UPS"
msgid_plural "advanced UPSes"
msgstr[0] "高级UPS"

#. ~ Description of "advanced UPS"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This is an advanced version of the unified power supply, or UPS.  This "
"device has been significantly redesigned to provide better efficiency as "
"well as to consume plutonium fuel batteries rather than regular batteries.  "
"Sadly, its plutonium reactor can't be charged in UPS charging station."
msgstr ""
"这是UPS统一化电源的升级版本。此装置被大幅重新设计，以提供更高的效率，并改用钚燃料电池供电。可惜的是，它的钚反应堆不能在UPS电源充电站充电。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "money bundle"
msgid_plural "money bundles"
msgstr[0] "纸币卷"

#. ~ Description of "money bundle"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "A bundle holding many 20 dollar bills, pretty useless now though."
msgstr ""
"一捆用皮筋卷起来的20美元钞票，以前你可以用它买到任何东西，现在如同废纸一般。\n"
"\"我致力于灾变后的世界重建，这样我偷偷藏起来的钱总有一天会让我变成富豪。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "long leather rifle case"
msgid_plural "long leather rifle cases"
msgstr[0] "长步枪皮枪袋"

#. ~ Description of "long leather rifle case"
#. ~ Description of "leather rifle case"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A long soft leather rifle case.  Provides storage for long arms and rifles."
"  Includes a small pocket, strap and handle."
msgstr "一个长长的皮制步枪枪袋，提供了能放进长柄武器和步枪的储存空间。自带一个小口袋，一根背带和一个提柄。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-industrial.json
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "Compact Advanced Sterling Radioisotope Generator"
msgstr "紧凑型ASRG发电机"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Compact Advanced Sterling Radioisotope
#. Generator"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This is a stirling generator originally designed by NASA, powered by "
"plutonium-238.  Without most of the military shielding only a thin metal "
"layer remains and thus this is much closer to its original NASA incarnation."
"  Since plutonium-238 mostly emits alpha radiation it is still basically "
"safe but without its armor it's much more likely to be broken by something "
"dangerous."
msgstr ""
"全名为“先进斯特林放射性同位素发电机”，最初由NASA设计，由钚-238提供动力。它现在没有了大部分军用保护，只剩下一层薄金属层，似乎更接近它一开始在NASA那边使用的版本。由于钚-238主要散发α辐射，它基本上仍然是安全的，但没有了装甲板，它更有可能被其它危险的东西破坏。"

