msgstr "有些人会说，你身上并没有什么可圈可点之处。不过，\"你活下来了\"——这一句话胜过千言万语。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Video Blogger"
msgstr "视频博主"

#. ~ Description of profession "Video Blogger" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a video blogger, creating and commenting video content and then "
"posting it on various platforms.  Now most of your fans are dead, alongside "
"your equipment.  Maybe leading a fanbase, moderating myriads of comments and"
" surviving shitstorms has taught you something valuable after all."
msgstr ""
"你是一个视频博主，创造和解说视频内容，然后在各种平台上发布。现在你的大部分粉丝都和你的设备一起死了。也许领导一个粉丝群，审阅无数的评论，在各种节奏风暴中幸存下来之类的经历，教会了你一些有价值的东西。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Video Blogger"
msgstr "视频博主"

#. ~ Description of profession "Video Blogger" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a video blogger, creating and commenting video content and then "
"posting it on various platforms.  Now most of your fans are dead, alongside "
"your equipment.  Maybe leading a fanbase, moderating myriads of comments and"
" surviving shitstorms has taught you something valuable after all."
msgstr ""
"你是一个视频博主，创造和解说视频内容，然后在各种平台上发布。现在你的大部分粉丝都和你的设备一起死了。也许领导一个粉丝群，审阅无数的评论，在各种节奏风暴中幸存下来之类的经历，教会了你一些有价值的东西。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Sheltered Survivor"
msgstr "避难所幸存者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Sheltered Survivor" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"At the start of the Cataclysm, you hunkered down in a bomb shelter.  You've "
"spent the past months eating canned food, reading books, and tinkering with "
"stuff in the bunker.  Now it is winter - time to face the world above."
msgstr ""
"在大灾变开始时，你幸运的找到一个防空洞躲了起来。在过去的几个月里，你一直在吃罐头食品，看书，修理防空洞里的东西。现在已经到了冬天，是该出来面对这个世界的时候了。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Sheltered Survivor"
msgstr "避难所幸存者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Sheltered Survivor" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
