#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "陆军少将"

#. ~ Description of profession "Major General" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks from a no-name private to a big "
"shot Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk"
" duty have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world "
"won't protect you now."
msgstr "你从一个无名的二等兵一路晋升到一个受人尊敬的少将。不幸的是，多年的案头工作让你的射击技能变得生疏，现在世界上所有的勋章都无法保护你。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "陆军少将"

