#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Navy Diver"
msgstr "海军潜水员"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you used to be part of a Naval Special Warfare diving "
"group, a skilled soldier adept at underwater infiltration and marine combat."
"  You were just finishing suiting up for a practice dive before the screams "
"interrupted your preparations.  Now, you’ve got nothing to ward off your "
"former crew-mates except for your wetsuit, equipment, and training."
msgstr ""
"大灾变之前，你曾是海军特种作战潜水队的一员，是一名资深士兵，擅长水下渗透和登陆作战。你刚刚做好潜水练习的准备，尖叫声突然打断了你。现在，除了你的潜水服、装备和训练之外，你没有什么能阻挡你以前的队友了。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Navy Diver"
msgstr "海军潜水员"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
