#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Combat Mechanic"
msgstr "军械师"

#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Mechanic" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Early in your military career, you were hand-picked for extra training in "
"the mechanic's trade, keeping the armor running.  It's been years since you "
"last touched a rifle, and the dead men are marching again…"
msgstr "在军旅生涯开始时，你被选中参加军械相关的额外训练，保持装甲车正常运转。你已经好几年没碰过步枪了，而死人们却开始行军了……"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Combat Mechanic"
msgstr "军械师"

#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Mechanic" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
