msgstr "你是参加过数次维和任务的老兵。你像一个家长一样带领你的连队，他们指望你下达正确的命令，让他们活下去。你让他们失望了。现在只剩你一个人了。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rifleman"
msgstr "步枪兵"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rifleman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell "
"is war, but you never thought that it would happen like this."
msgstr "你年轻的时候梦想着成为一名军人。战争就是地狱，地狱就是战争，但你从没想过一切会变成这样。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rifleman"
msgstr "步枪兵"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rifleman" for female
