#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Landscaper"
msgstr "园丁"

#. ~ Description of profession "Landscaper" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the zombies came, but now you've got nothing left"
" except your tools and expertise."
msgstr "你曾经为富人修剪草坪和修剪树篱。在大灾变之前工作就已经很难找了，但是现在除了你的工具和专业知识，你什么都没有了。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Landscaper"
msgstr "园丁"

#. ~ Description of profession "Landscaper" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
