#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hobo"
msgstr "流浪汉"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hobo" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Society drove you to the fringes and left you with no home, no family, no "
"friends.  But for all the crap thrown your way, you're still breathing.  For"
" now."
msgstr "社会把你逼到了边缘，让你没有家，没有家人，没有朋友。但尽管你被这么多挫折打击，你仍旧在呼吸。只是现在。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hobo"
msgstr "流浪妹"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hobo" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
