#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Trucker"
msgstr "长途货车司机"

#. ~ Description of profession "Trucker" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the riots hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr "你曾经开的大货是马路上的王者。暴乱发生时，你跳进大货，把它开到了安全的地方。现在只剩下你和你所信赖的大货车陪你面对这个世界了。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
