msgstr "你是个伐木工而且你还活着。在世界末日前你不停地放倒树木，你估计放倒丧尸应该也不会更难。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Fast Food Cook"
msgstr "快餐店厨师"

#. ~ Description of profession "Fast Food Cook" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The diners at the fancy burger joint where you worked were even more "
"irritable and unreasonable than usual today.  You showed them the meaning of"
" fast food… by running for your life!"
msgstr "你工作的高级汉堡店的食客们今天看起来比平时更加易怒和不讲理。是时候展示快餐的奥义了……为了逃命而奔跑！"

