msgstr "你工作的高级汉堡店的食客们今天看起来比平时更加易怒和不讲理。是时候展示快餐的奥义了……为了逃命而奔跑！"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Electrician"
msgstr "电气工程师"

#. ~ Description of profession "Electrician" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Small businesses often hired you for electrical work.  You were halfway "
"through your latest job when the whole power grid went dead."
msgstr "小企业主们经常雇佣你做电气工作。你刚刚做完一单，结果整个电网都瘫痪了。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Electrician"
msgstr "电气工程师"

#. ~ Description of profession "Electrician" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
