#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hardened Scavenger"
msgstr "资深拾荒者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hardened Scavenger" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"One of the lucky few who escaped the Cataclysm, you made a life for yourself"
" amidst the ruins of civilization.  Whether through force, guile, or luck, "
"you've obtained the best gear you could find."
msgstr "作为逃离大灾变的幸运儿之一，你在文明的废墟中为自己找到了一条生路。无论是通过武力、诡计还是运气，你收集了一些你所能找到的最好的装备。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hardened Scavenger"
msgstr "资深拾荒者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hardened Scavenger" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
