msgstr "要让孩子跑几圈就已经够难的了，那会儿你还不必担心他们想吃掉你的大脑。而这些丧尸甚至在你吹完哨子后还学不会排队。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Miner"
msgstr "矿工"

#. ~ Description of profession "Miner" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a miner, not a minor!  Your canteen is dry, your jackhammer is out of"
" gas, and you're on your last pair of batteries for your mining helmet…"
msgstr "虽然你是矿工，但你不是无名之辈！（英语双关）你的水壶早已经干透，你的打桩机也耗光了燃料，而你的矿工帽只剩下最后一对电池了……"

