msgstr "这里曾经是一个度假的好地方，但你开始有些后悔离家了。你本来来着是为了体验下新英格兰的风味，现在你只希望别让新英格兰尝尝你的风味了！"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Naked and Afraid"
msgstr "原始生活21天"

#. ~ Description of profession "Naked and Afraid" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For some reason you are now completely naked!  Maybe you were robbed, maybe "
"you were in a nudist beach, or maybe you just enjoy the feeling of "
"liberation brought upon the wind touching your skin, whatever it is, you "
"lack clothes in a time when everyone wants a piece of you."
msgstr ""
"不知何故，你现在完全赤身裸体了！也许你被人抢了，也许你在裸体海滩，或者你只是享受微风吹拂皮肤所带来的解放感，不管原因为何，在每个人都想要撕碎你的时候，你没衣服。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
