#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Musician"
msgstr "音乐家"

#. ~ Description of profession "Musician" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You nailed your solo, but the audience erupted into screams instead of "
"applause.  You weren't able to grab much during the panic, but at least you "
"have your loaded six string on your back."
msgstr "你完成了你的独奏，但观众爆发出尖叫，而不是掌声。慌乱之中你没能带走多少东西，但是至少背上的六弦琴还在。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
