#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Speed King"
msgstr "速度之王"

#. ~ Description of profession "Speed King" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to rule the roads before they were filled with wrecks, undead, and "
"unspeakable horrors.  At least there's no speed limits in the apocalypse!"
msgstr "你曾经统治道路——在残骸、丧尸和不可名状的恐怖填满它们之前。至少大灾变里没有限速！"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Speed Queen"
msgstr "速度女王"

#. ~ Description of profession "Speed Queen" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
