"your things before running away."
msgstr "你来海滩是为了享受一个轻松愉快的假期。但你并不知道这里的人都是疯子，甚至想要用你的脑袋打沙滩排球，至少你成功带上了你的包和东西逃了出来。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Professional Swimmer"
msgstr "职业游泳选手"

#. ~ Description of profession "Professional Swimmer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After much practice you were sure the next competition would be your big "
"hit, but your rivals started killing each other and you had to escape with "
"only your competition gear on you.  Could your years of training save you "
"one more time?  Let's find out."
msgstr "经过常年练习，你确信下次比赛将会大获成功，但你的对手开始互相残杀，你只能带着你的比赛装备逃跑。你多年的训练能再救你一命吗？让我们拭目以待。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Professional Swimmer"
msgstr "职业游泳选手"

#. ~ Description of profession "Professional Swimmer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
