#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lifeguard"
msgstr "救生员"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lifeguard" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your job was to safeguard the lives of everyone in the beach, but when the "
"swimmers started drowning each other you knew the situation was out of your "
"hands."
msgstr "你的工作是保护海滩上每个人的生命，但当游泳的人开始互相试图把对方淹死时，你知道局面已经超出你的掌控了。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
