msgid "Hitman"
msgstr "杀手"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hitman" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Assassin" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best undercover agent they had, with a mission so vital that "
"you had to take it even with the riots going on.  Your target seems to have "
"turned feral as well as your contact, you are all alone now."
msgstr "你曾是他们手下最好的卧底探员，任务如此重要，即使暴乱仍在继续，你也不得不接受。你的目标似乎已经疯了，你的联系人也是如此，你现在孤身一人。"

