#. ~ Description of scenario "Missed" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed "
"the evacuation, and are stuck in a city full of the risen dead."
msgstr "无论是由于固执，无知，或者仅仅是运气不好，反正你错过了撤离疏散，并被困在一个充满丧尸的城市里。好好享受吧。"

