msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were convicted or working in a prison.  Now"
" the prisoners have turned into mindless horrors and the police officers "
"joined hands with them… you might need to expedite your escape plans."
msgstr "当大灾变发生时，你正在监狱服刑劳改。现在所有的囚犯都变成了没头没脑的怪物，而警卫们也都加入了它们……你或许要考虑一次越狱行动了。"

