#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter "
"this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out "
"here."
msgstr "你发现你在树丛中间。远离文明世界，那一切尖叫和呻吟都似乎和你无关，不过你最好搞明白你到这儿来是要干什么。"

