#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Finish your mission"
msgstr "完成你的任务"

#. ~ Description of mission "Finish your mission"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your mission required you to eliminate a certain high-ranking individual in "
"hiding.  Your mark seems to have turned feral while escaping and the world "
"appears to be ending, but not even that can stop you from finishing your "
"mission."
msgstr "你的任务需要你击杀某个正在躲藏的高层人士。你的目标似乎在逃跑时已经疯了，而整个世界也似乎面临末日，但即便如此这也无法打消你完成任务的决心。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Kill your mark"
msgstr "杀死你的目标"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your mark"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your employer could be no longer responding but you have decided to finish "
"your mission.  Hunt down and kill your mark."
msgstr "你的雇主可能已经失去了联系，但你早已决心完成任务。追捕并杀死你的目标。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Life vow"
msgstr "人生誓言"

#. ~ Description of mission "Life vow"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Live your life to the fullest, prove to yourself that you can survive this "
"new obstacle in the same way that you have survived the last."
msgstr "充实地度过你的一生，证明你自己，你可以像上次一样，面对这个新障碍仍然能活下去。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Prepare for your next show"
msgstr "为你的下场演出做好准备"

#. ~ Description of mission "Prepare for your next show"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Become the best clown, make sure that your next show will make everyone "
"laugh by training your social skills to perfection."
msgstr "成为最好的小丑，提升你的社交技能，确保你的下场演出能哄堂大笑。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a memory of your master"
msgstr "找回对主人的回忆"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a memory of your master"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find and wield a whip to remember your master even when separated."
msgstr "找到并手持皮鞭，即使分开，也能让你记住曾经的主人。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Obtain your black belt"
msgstr "取得黑带"

#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain your black belt"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You could have become a master in martial arts if you had the chance, so "
"train until you achieve the level of a master in the old world, and find "
"yourself a nice black belt to commemorate the occasion."
msgstr "如果有机会的话，你本可以成为一名武术大师，所以要不断训练，直到达到往日世界大师的水平，并为自己找一条漂亮的黑带来纪念这一时刻。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a real katana"
msgstr "找到真正的武士刀"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a real katana"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The world has ended, but as an authentic samurai you lack a katana, you must"
" find one, quickly."
msgstr "世界已经终结，但要成为一名真正的武士，你还缺少一把武士刀，你必须尽快找到它。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Protect your canine friends"
msgstr "保护你的狗狗"

#. ~ Description of mission "Protect your canine friends"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You have saved your dogs from the fall of the world, but they could still "
"suffer from danger everywhere.  Police dogs used some Kevlar harnesses for "
"protection…  Maybe your friends could use some too?"
msgstr "你救下了你的狗，使它们免于世界的沦陷，但它们仍然可能随时遭遇危险。听说警犬使用了某种凯夫拉犬具来当作防护……也许你的朋友也可以用？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Hunt big game"
msgstr "狩猎大赛"

#. ~ Description of mission "Hunt big game"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The end of the world could have arrived, but you still crave for that one "
"big hunt.  Search and kill a black bear to remember the old days."
msgstr "世界末日可能已经到来，但你仍然渴望来场狩猎大赛。找到并杀死一头黑熊，作为对过去的纪念。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Become the protagonist"
msgstr "成为主角"

#. ~ Description of mission "Become the protagonist"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The world has become like an anime!  Zombies, mutants, the end of "
"civilization as we know it…  You must become the protagonist if you want to "
"survive, the plot armor will help you.  Go and kill 50 zombies to show your "
"protagonist potential."
msgstr ""
"这个世界变得像是一部动漫！丧尸，变异人，我们所知文明的终结……如果你想活下去，你必须成为主角，主角光环会帮你。去杀死50只丧尸，证明你有成为主角的潜力。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Make the cops pay"
msgstr "让警察偿债"

#. ~ Description of mission "Make the cops pay"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"They wanted to put you behind bars, but are now dead, make them pay with "
"blood, unliving blood."
msgstr "他们想把你关进监狱，但现在全都死了，让他们用血、不死之血来偿债。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Continue with your evolution"
msgstr "继续进化"

#. ~ Description of mission "Continue with your evolution"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your evolution to a more perfect form was interrupted by the Cataclysm.  "
"Restart your transformation process whatever it costs."
msgstr "你向更完美形态的进化被大灾变打断了。无论付出什么代价，都要继续这个进程。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Recover a part of yourself"
msgstr "取回自己的一部分"

#. ~ Description of mission "Recover a part of yourself"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"They took away something from you, something important.  You feel a "
"connection with this weather, maybe you can recover some portion of what you"
" lost in one of these storms."
msgstr "他们拿走了你的一些东西，一些重要的东西。你觉得这和怪天气也有关系，也许你可以找回你在某场风暴中失去的那部分自己。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Social butterfly"
msgstr "交际花"

#. ~ Description of mission "Social butterfly"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You have always had good social abilities.  Go and recruit 2 followers and "
"establish your leadership among them.  Don't forget to order them to build a"
" base of operations for you in the form of a survivor camp."
msgstr "你的社交能力一直都很强。去招募两名同伴，并在他们之中确立你的领导地位。别忘了命令他们以建设营地的形式为你建个作战基地。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Kill your rivals"
msgstr "杀死你的对手"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your rivals"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"As a real ninja, you can't allow competitors for the night.  Kill 10 shady "
"zombies and demonstrate who is the real ninja here."
msgstr "作为一名真正的忍者，你不能容忍竞争对手参加今晚的比赛。杀死10只暗影丧尸，告诉它们谁才是真正的忍者。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find some cosplay suits"
msgstr "找些COS服装"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find some cosplay suits"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The world could have ended, but there are still some fantastic costumes out "
"there, just waiting for you to wear them.  Search them until you find them."
msgstr "世界可能已经终结了，但仍有一些很棒的服装在等着你穿。不停寻找，直到找到为止。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find some skates"
msgstr "找些滑冰鞋"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find some skates"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You are a skater at heart, and as such you need some skates to drive by, any"
" kind will suffice."
msgstr "你内心深处总想滑冰，因此你需要一双能滑行的滑冰鞋，任何种类都可以。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Dress with style"
msgstr "穿戴有范儿"

#. ~ Description of mission "Dress with style"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You need to always dress in style and fashion.  Find a gown or tuxedo for "
"your personal use."
msgstr "你总是需要一套时髦的时装。找一套适合你个人使用的礼服或燕尾服。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a tabletop game"
msgstr "找到一副桌游"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a tabletop game"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"As a Game Master, it's just unacceptable that you now lack your means to "
"play.  Find any tabletop game to play with any survivors you could find, "
"even a cards game will suffice."
msgstr "作为一名跑团主持人，缺少跑团工具是完全不可接受的。找到任何一副桌游，与你所能找到的幸存者一起玩，即使一起打牌也行啊。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Ready or Not"
msgstr "准备好了吗"

#. ~ Description of mission "Ready or Not"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Survive all day from the crazy inhabitants of the mansion."
msgstr "在别墅豪宅里的疯狂居民的手底下活过一整天。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find Antibiotics Before You Die!"
msgstr "在你死之前找到抗生素！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Refuel your helicopter."
msgstr "再次加油"

#. ~ Description of mission "Refuel your helicopter."
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You were flying towards a nearby private airport before your forced landing."
"  You could still reach it by ground, and scavenge it for fuel."
msgstr "在你迫降前，你正朝着附近的一处私人机场飞去。你仍然可以在地面上找到它，在那里搜寻燃料。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Reach The Mansion And Finish This Delivery"
msgstr "抵达别墅完成配送"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Kill your pursuer"
msgstr "杀死追着你的怪物"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your pursuer"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can outrun it but never truly escape it.  It won't end "
"until one of you dies."
msgstr "自从大灾变开始以来，有只怪物一直在永不停歇地追杀着你。你可以跑得比它快，但永远无法真正逃离它。只有你们中死一个，这一切才会结束。"

