msgstr[0] "建筑师立方"

#. ~ Description of "The Architect's Cube"
#: data/json/artifact/premade_artifacts.json
msgid ""
"This is a solid cube that is much heavier than its size suggests.  When you "
"look at it, it pulls your gaze inward until you fall through the sky, "
"showing you a top-down view of your position with the surroundings revealed."
msgstr ""
"这是一个实心立方体，重量比起它的尺寸所预估得要重得多。当你盯着它看时，你的目光会被它不断吸引，直到你仿佛从天而降般看见你和你周围环境的俯视图。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/artifact/premade_artifacts.json
msgid "stone of stabbing"
msgid_plural "stones of stabbing"
msgstr[0] "调试用刺击石"

#. ~ Description of "stone of stabbing"
#: data/json/artifact/premade_artifacts.json
msgid "A debug item to make sure that skills can be modified by enchantments."
msgstr "一个调试物品，以确保技能可以被附魔修改。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/items/appliances.json data/mods/Mythos/items/appliances.json
msgid "fridge"
msgid_plural "fridges"
msgstr[0] "冰箱"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A fridge.  When turned on, it will cool the food inside, extending the time "
"until the food spoils."
msgstr "一台车载冰箱。开启时，它可以冷藏食物，延缓腐烂。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
