"directly in the attached storage space."
msgstr "一套给电池充电的电器。开启后，会直接为放置其内部存储空间中的任何可充电电池（蓄电池、铅酸电池等）持续缓慢地充电。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "Compact Advanced Sterling Radioisotope
#. Generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A military-grade ASRG covered in heavy plating.  Provides constant power "
"when plugged in to your power grid."
msgstr "一台军用级ASRG发电机，覆盖着厚厚的装甲板。接入电网时提供功率恒定的电力。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "glowing tendril"
msgstr "发光卷须"

#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing tendril"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A willowy tendril growing from the floor, gently waving back and forth.  A "
"faint light spills from it."
msgstr "一根柔韧的卷须从地板上长出来，轻轻地前后摆动着。微弱的亮光从里面射了出来。"

