msgid "rrrrip!"
msgstr "咝啦！"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "down mattress"
msgid_plural "down mattresses"
msgstr[0] "羽绒床垫"

#. ~ Description of furniture "down mattress"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
msgid ""
"A squishy feather-stuffed mattress left on the floor.  While it's not as "
"comfortable as an entire bed without the mattress, it's pretty close.  If "
"it's someplace actually safe to sleep, it's practically a luxury in and of "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"放在地板上的用柔软羽毛填充的床垫。虽然它不像一张没有床垫的床那么舒适，但也差不多。如果你能在一个真正安全的地方用它入睡，这本身就是一种奢侈。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid "hammock"
msgid_plural "hammocks"
msgstr[0] "吊床"

#. ~ Description of furniture "hammock"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-sleep.json
msgid ""
"A large sheet of cloth with ropes on two sides tied to nearby objects.  It's"
" quite comfortable to sleep in, but provides no warmth."
msgstr "一块两头有吊绳的大布，被系在附近的物体上。睡在里面很舒服，但不保暖。"

