#. ~ Setting battery volume to 0 causes weirdness in vehicle tests.  Please
#. don't do that.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "battery"
msgid_plural "battery"
msgstr[0] "电池"

#. ~ Setting battery volume to 0 causes weirdness in vehicle tests.  Please
#. don't do that.
#. ~ Description of "battery"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Some free-floating battery charge.  This can be reloaded into rechargable "
"battery cells, but can never be unloaded."
msgstr "一些自由流动的电能，可以为电池补充电量，但无法被取出。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "butane"
msgid_plural "butane"
msgstr[0] "丁烷"

#. ~ Description of "butane"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A common flammable liquid used in lighters."
msgstr "打火机常用的易燃液体。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "aerosol paint"
msgid_plural "aerosol paint"
msgstr[0] "喷漆"

#. ~ Description of "aerosol paint"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A paint that comes in a sealed, pressurized container and is released in an "
"aerosol spray when a valve button is depressed."
msgstr "一种被密封在加压容器之中的油漆涂料，当容器阀门按钮压下时，它会以气体喷雾的形式被释放出来。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "permanent ink"
msgid_plural "permanent ink"
msgstr[0] "永固油墨"

#. ~ Description of "permanent ink"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A ink comprises a main carrier solvent, a glyceride, a pyrrolidone, a resin "
"and a colorant, making it water resistant."
msgstr "一种防水油墨，主要成分有主载体溶剂、甘油、吡咯烷酮、树脂和着色剂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "candle wax"
msgid_plural "candle wax"
msgstr[0] "烛蜡"

#. ~ Description of "candle wax"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A flammable solid substance used to make candles."
msgstr "一种用来制作蜡烛的易燃固体物质。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "flare pyrotechnic"
msgid_plural "flare pyrotechnic"
msgstr[0] "照明剂"

#. ~ Description of "flare pyrotechnic"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A pyrotechnic chemical used in flares."
msgstr "照明弹中使用的燃烧时产生强烈发光效应的烟火药剂。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "match"
msgid_plural "matches"
msgstr[0] "火柴"

#. ~ Description of "match"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A small stick with a red part at the end.  Strike it against a matchbook to "
"light it."
msgstr "一根红头小木棍。在火柴盒上划一下可以点燃它。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "oxygen"
msgid_plural "oxygen"
msgstr[0] "氧气"

#. ~ Description of "oxygen"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Compressed medical oxygen."
msgstr "医用高压氧气。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "betavoltaic cell"
msgid_plural "betavoltaic cells"
msgstr[0] "核能贝塔电池"

#. ~ Description of "betavoltaic cell"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Harness the power of radiation in your own home!  This looks similar to a "
"D-cell battery, but actually contains folded layers of radioactive material "
"inside.  It can produce electricity for several years at a steady voltage… "
"but it's barely enough to power a small LED, and these batteries were worth "
"hundreds of dollars.  Mostly they're a good way to brag to your neighbors "
"that you have a nuclear power source in your house."
msgstr ""
"在家中就能轻易使用的核能辐射电池！它看起来像一个一号电池，但实际上包含了很多层放射性物质，能在稳定的电压下使用很多年。问题在于，它最多只能驱动一个小型 "
"LED，而它的价格高达数百美元。因此大多数情况下，拥有这种电池的唯一好处就是可以向邻居炫耀你家里有核能。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "radioisotope thermoelectric generator"
msgid_plural "radioisotope thermoelectric generators"
msgstr[0] "放射性同位素热能发电机"

#. ~ Description of "radioisotope thermoelectric generator"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Did your neighbors brag about their cool beta-decay powered nightlights?  Do"
" them one better!  The CuppaTech 4 radioisotope thermoelectric generator is "
"a three kilogram chunk of metal - mostly lead - with a slug of cerium-244 "
"encased within.  It is capable of generating somewhere between 100-150 Watts"
" of thermal energy, although its electrical generation capacity is minimal "
"at only 2 Watts.  Careful!  Curium is great at making heat, and also "
"releases deadly gamma radiation.  Keep away from cellular life forms."
msgstr ""
"你的邻居有没有向你吹嘘他们那炫酷的贝塔衰变原子灯？我们能做得更好！CuppaTech "
"4型放射性同位素热能发电机是一块三千克重的金属，大部分是铅，内部包裹着一段锔-244。它能够产生100-150瓦的热能，但发电功率只有2瓦。小心！锔除了会释放出大量热量，也会释放致命的伽马射线，把它放置在远离生物的地方。"

#. ~ Density of 2.7 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "aluminum foil"
msgid_plural "aluminum foil"
msgstr[0] "铝箔"

#. ~ Density of 2.7 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "aluminum foil"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A thin foil made of aluminum.  Sometimes called 'tin foil' due to being made"
" of tin in the past."
msgstr "一种由铝制成的薄片。由于过去是用锡做的，有时被人称为“锡箔”。"

#. ~ = one cent, gives correct prices for cash cards
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "cent"
msgid_plural "cents"
msgstr[0] "美分"

#. ~ = one cent, gives correct prices for cash cards
#. ~ Description of "cent"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A unit of currency equivalent to 0.01 US dollars."
msgstr "等效于0.01美元的货币单位。"

#. ~ 50 weight thread - 50m per gram. Each unit is .25m or roughly 10 inches.
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "thread"
msgid_plural "thread"
msgstr[0] "棉线"

#. ~ 50 weight thread - 50m per gram. Each unit is .25m or roughly 10 inches.
#. ~ Description of "thread"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A small quantity of thread that could be used to refill a sewing kit."
msgstr "一小团细线，能装填在缝纫工具里使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "sinew"
msgid_plural "sinews"
msgstr[0] "筋腱"

#. ~ Description of "sinew"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A tough sinew cut from a corpse, usable as thread."
msgstr "一小段从尸体上截下来的筋腱，可作为缝衣线使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "plant fiber"
msgid_plural "plant fibers"
msgstr[0] "植物纤维"

#. ~ Description of "plant fiber"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Tough thin fiber, taken from a plant.  Can be used as thread."
msgstr "一小段非常结实的植物纤维，可作为缝衣线使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "yarn"
msgid_plural "yarn"
msgstr[0] "纱线"

#. ~ Description of "yarn"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Wool yarn, could be used to knit wool clothing."
msgstr "一团羊毛纱线，可用于编织羊毛衣物。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "soap bar"
msgid_plural "soap bars"
msgstr[0] "肥皂条"

#. ~ Description of "soap bar"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A cleansing agent made into bars."
msgstr ""
"一块可以用来清洗衣物或者制作其他物品的条形肥皂。\n"
"“哎呀，我的肥皂掉了，能帮我捡一下吗？”"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "moisturizer"
msgid_plural "moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜"

#. ~ Description of "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A cosmetic preparation used for protecting, moisturizing, and lubricating "
"the skin."
msgstr "一种用于保护、保湿和润滑皮肤的化妆品。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "face cream moisturizer"
msgid_plural "face cream moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（面霜）"

#. ~ Description of variant "face cream moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "This moisturizer works for all skin types and is really affordable!"
msgstr "这款保湿霜适用于所有皮肤类型，价格实惠！"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "light cream moisturizer"
msgid_plural "light cream moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（顺滑）"

#. ~ Description of variant "light cream moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"This moisturizer is smooth like milk, just like your skin after applying "
"this wonderful product."
msgstr "这款保湿霜像牛奶一样光滑，就像你涂完这个奇妙产品后的皮肤一样。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "simple moisturizer"
msgid_plural "simple moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（简单）"

#. ~ Description of variant "simple moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "This is a simple moisturizer with all-organic ingredients."
msgstr "这是一款使用纯有机成分制成的简单保湿霜。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "sensitive moisturizer"
msgid_plural "sensitive moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（温和）"

#. ~ Description of variant "sensitive moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A favorite among customers with sensitive skin."
msgstr "一款敏感肌客户最喜欢的产品。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "oil free moisturizer"
msgid_plural "oil free moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（无油）"

#. ~ Description of variant "oil free moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "If you have an oily skin, this moisturizer is for you!"
msgstr "如果你是油性皮肤，那这款保湿霜适合你！"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "hydro moisturizer"
msgid_plural "hydro moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（水润）"

#. ~ Description of variant "hydro moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"After applying this moisturizer your skin will feel hydrated and smooth."
msgstr "使用这款保湿霜后，你的皮肤会感到水润光滑。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "healthy moisturizer"
msgid_plural "healthy moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（健康）"

#. ~ Description of variant "healthy moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Using various plants as ingredients, this moisturizer will give your skin "
"all the vitamins for the day."
msgstr "使用各种植物成分，这款保湿霜将为你的皮肤提供一天所需的各种维生素。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "mushroom moisturizer"
msgid_plural "mushroom moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（蘑菇）"

#. ~ Description of variant "mushroom moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"This moisturizer contains mushroom extract to help improve the wellbeing of "
"your skin."
msgstr "这款保湿霜含有蘑菇提取物，有助于改善皮肤健康。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "anti-aging moisturizer"
msgid_plural "anti-aging moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（抗衰）"

#. ~ Description of variant "anti-aging moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A favorite among the mature customers.  This moisturizer will smooth out the"
" wrinkles on your face and make you appear younger."
msgstr "年老客户的最爱。这种保湿霜会抚平你脸上的皱纹，让你看起来更年轻。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "day and night moisturizer"
msgid_plural "day and night moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "保湿霜（昼夜）"

#. ~ Description of variant "day and night moisturizer" of item "moisturizer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"This moisturizer will work day and night.  A perfect fit for those that "
"decide their own sleep schedule."
msgstr "这款保湿霜昼夜都能起效。非常适合那些自己决定睡眠时间表的人。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "duct tape"
msgid_plural "duct tape"
msgstr[0] "强力胶带"

#. ~ Description of "duct tape"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A roll of incredibly strong tape.  Its uses are innumerable."
msgstr "一卷十分牢固的强力胶带。用途非常广泛。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "rolling paper"
msgid_plural "rolling papers"
msgstr[0] "卷烟纸"

#. ~ Description of "rolling paper"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "These are thin paper strips intended for the rolling of cigarettes."
msgstr "一些能用来卷烟的细纸带。"

#. ~ Calculated off of copper wire with an extra 0.5mm of diameter and 0.66g.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "copper wire"
msgid_plural "copper wires"
msgstr[0] "铜线"

#. ~ Calculated off of copper wire with an extra 0.5mm of diameter and 0.66g.
#. ~ Description of "copper wire"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Plastic jacketed copper cable of the type used in small electronics."
msgstr "一段包裹着塑料外皮的铜芯电线，常用于小型电子设备中的连线。"

#. ~ Calculated off of 12 AWG, at 10cm length, using
#. http://www.mtlexs.com/technical-specifications-details/40/weight-of-copper-
#. wire.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "raw copper wire"
msgid_plural "raw copper wires"
msgstr[0] "裸铜线"

#. ~ Calculated off of 12 AWG, at 10cm length, using
#. http://www.mtlexs.com/technical-specifications-details/40/weight-of-copper-
#. wire.
#. ~ Description of "raw copper wire"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Copper wire ready to be covered with plastic."
msgstr "准备好被用塑料胶皮覆盖的裸铜线。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "plutonium fuel cell"
msgid_plural "plutonium fuel cells"
msgstr[0] "钚燃料电池"

#. ~ Description of "plutonium fuel cell"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"This is neither a fuel cell, nor nuclear, but the name stuck.  It uses "
"plutonium-244 as a catalyst to stabilize a complicated nanocompound that can"
" store enormous amounts of power.  Unfortunately it cannot be recharged by "
"conventional means: expended cells had to be sent to a central reprocessing "
"facility that almost certainly doesn't exist anymore."
msgstr ""
"它其实既不是燃料电池，其中也没有任何核反应，但名字就这么被定下来了。它内部采用钚-244催化剂来稳定某种特殊的纳米复合材料，这种材料能够储存海量电能。不幸的是，你无法使用常规手段为它充电，已耗尽电能的电池需要被送至一处中央回收处理设施处理，几乎可以肯定它再也不存在了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "uranium fuel cell"
msgid_plural "uranium fuel cells"
msgstr[0] "铀燃料电池"

#. ~ Description of "uranium fuel cell"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"The uranium dioxide (UO2) powder is fired in a high-temperature, sintering "
"furnace to create hard, ceramic pellets of enriched uranium dioxide."
msgstr "二氧化铀（UO2）粉末在高温烧结炉中烧制，形成的坚硬浓缩二氧化铀陶瓷颗粒。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "plutonium slurry"
msgid_plural "plutonium slurry"
msgstr[0] "钚浆"

#. ~ Description of "plutonium slurry"
#. ~ Description of "watery plutonium slurry"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Highly radioactive slurry.  It is probably best to get far away from this."
msgstr "一些具有高度放射性的钚浆。也许你该离它远一些。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "watery plutonium slurry"
msgid_plural "watery plutonium slurry"
msgstr[0] "液态钚浆"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "barbed wire baseball"
msgid_plural "barbed wire baseballs"
msgstr[0] "铁丝棒球"

#. ~ Description of "barbed wire baseball"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A baseball wrapped with barbed wire, for when the game turns serious."
msgstr "一个用带刺铁丝包裹的棒球，仅供赛况变得焦灼时使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgctxt "stone"
msgid "rock"
msgid_plural "rocks"
msgstr[0] "石头"

#. ~ Description of "rock"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A rock the size of a baseball.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is also "
"good for throwing at enemies."
msgstr "一个棒球大小的岩石。可以当一个凑合的近战武器，也可以当作投掷武器。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "pebble"
msgid_plural "pebbles"
msgstr[0] "石子"

#. ~ Description of "pebble"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A small rock, useful as ammunition for slingshots."
msgstr "一块小石头，很适合当弹弓的弹药。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "clay pellet"
msgid_plural "clay pellets"
msgstr[0] "陶弹丸"

#. ~ Description of "clay pellet"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A handful of round projectiles made of clay, useful for slingshots."
msgstr "一把陶制弹丸，很适合当弹弓的弹药。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "marble"
msgid_plural "marbles"
msgstr[0] "玻璃弹珠"

#. ~ Description of "marble"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A handful of glass marbles, useful as ammunition for slingshots."
msgstr "一把小玻璃弹珠，很适合当弹弓的弹药。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "bearings"
msgid_plural "bearings"
msgstr[0] "滚珠"

#. ~ Description of "bearings"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A box of ball bearings, useful as ammunition for slingshots."
msgstr "一盒滚珠轴承的钢球，很适合当弹弓的弹药。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "BB"
msgid_plural "BBs"
msgstr[0] "BB弹"

#. ~ Description of "BB"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A box of small steel balls that can be fired from a BB gun.  They deal "
"virtually no damage."
msgstr "一盒BB枪使用的小型圆球状弹丸，几乎没有杀伤力。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "feather"
msgid_plural "feathers"
msgstr[0] "羽毛"

#. ~ Description of "feather"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Feathers from a bird.  Useful for fletching arrows."
msgstr "一些禽类羽毛，可以用来制作箭矢。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "down feather"
msgid_plural "down feathers"
msgstr[0] "绒羽"

#. ~ Description of "down feather"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Fluffy down feathers from a bird.  Useful for making cozy bedclothes."
msgstr "一些蓬松的禽类羽绒，可以用来制作舒适的床上用品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "120mm HEAT"
msgid_plural "120mm HEAT"
msgstr[0] "120mm 高爆反坦克弹"

#. ~ Description of "120mm HEAT"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A 120mm high-explosive anti-tank round.  It could ruin anyone's whole day."
msgstr ""
"一枚120mm高爆反坦克炮弹。它能结束任何人悲催的一生。\n"
"\"真男人从不回头看爆炸。“"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "hydrogen canister"
msgid_plural "hydrogen canisters"
msgstr[0] "固态氢罐"

#. ~ Description of "hydrogen canister"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A canister of pressurized hydrogen so heavily compressed it has turned "
"solid.  With proper equipment, it could be heated to plasma."
msgstr "一罐被高压成固态的氢气。用合适的设备可以将其加热成等离子态发射出去。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "mixed smokeless gunpowder"
msgid_plural "mixed smokeless gunpowder"
msgstr[0] "混合无烟型火药"

#. ~ Description of "mixed smokeless gunpowder"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Firearm-quality gunpowder, mixed without concern for composition, burn rate "
"or shape.  It has been slightly ground to make its properties more uniform."
"  Only the truly desperate would attempt to reload with this."
msgstr ""
"一种火器级品质的火药，制造者在完全不考虑组分、燃烧速率和形状的前提下将它混合起来，并稍稍碾碎以使其性质更加统一。没人会想尝试拿它来装填枪弹，除非迫不得已。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "smokeless shotgun powder"
msgid_plural "smokeless shotgun powder"
msgstr[0] "无烟型霰弹火药"

#. ~ Description of "smokeless shotgun powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Firearm-quality gunpowder, intended for use in shotgun shells."
msgstr "一种火器级品质的火药，可以用于霰弹的制造。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "smokeless pistol powder"
msgid_plural "smokeless pistol powder"
msgstr[0] "无烟型手枪弹火药"

#. ~ Description of "smokeless pistol powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Firearm-quality gunpowder, intended for use in pistol ammunition."
msgstr "一种火器级品质的火药，可以用于手枪弹药的制造。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "smokeless magnum powder"
msgid_plural "smokeless magnum powder"
msgstr[0] "无烟型马格南弹火药"

#. ~ Description of "smokeless magnum powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Firearm-quality gunpowder intended for use in magnum pistol ammunition."
msgstr "一种火器级品质的火药，可以用于马格南手枪弹药的制造。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "smokeless rifle powder"
msgid_plural "smokeless rifle powder"
msgstr[0] "无烟型步枪弹火药"

#. ~ Description of "smokeless rifle powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Firearm-quality gunpowder intended for use in rifle ammunition."
msgstr "一种火器级品质的火药，可以用于步枪弹药的制造。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "smokeless overbore rifle powder"
msgid_plural "smokeless overbore rifle powder"
msgstr[0] "无烟型大口径步枪弹火药"

#. ~ Description of "smokeless overbore rifle powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Firearm-quality gunpowder intended for use in large rifle ammunition."
msgstr "一种火器级品质的火药，可以用于大口径步枪弹药的制造。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "artillery propellant"
msgid_plural "artillery propellant"
msgstr[0] "炮弹发射药"

#. ~ Description of "artillery propellant"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Single base smokeless gunpowder intended for use in artillery propelling "
"charges."
msgstr "一些纯净的无烟火药，可以用于炮弹发射药的制造。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "oxidizer powder"
msgid_plural "oxidizer powder"
msgstr[0] "氧化剂粉"

#. ~ Description of "oxidizer powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Volatile powdered chemical oxidizer."
msgstr "一些粉末状的不稳定化学氧化剂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "lye powder"
msgid_plural "lye powder"
msgstr[0] "碱粉"

#. ~ Description of "lye powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Pellets of caustic soda, also known as sodium hydroxide."
msgstr "一些粉末状的腐蚀性纯碱，也称为氢氧化钠。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "shotgun primer"
msgid_plural "shotgun primers"
msgstr[0] "霰弹底火"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun primer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Primer from a shotgun shell."
msgstr "一些霰弹所使用的子弹底火。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "small pistol primer"
msgid_plural "small pistol primers"
msgstr[0] "小口径手枪子弹底火"

#. ~ Description of "small pistol primer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Primer from a small caliber pistol round."
msgstr "一些小口径手枪子弹使用的底火。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "large pistol primer"
msgid_plural "large pistol primers"
msgstr[0] "大口径手枪子弹底火"

#. ~ Description of "large pistol primer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Primer from a large caliber pistol round."
msgstr "一些大口径手枪子弹使用的底火。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "small rifle primer"
msgid_plural "small rifle primers"
msgstr[0] "小口径步枪子弹底火"

#. ~ Description of "small rifle primer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Primer from a small caliber rifle round."
msgstr "一些小口径步枪子弹使用的底火。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "large rifle primer"
msgid_plural "large rifle primers"
msgstr[0] "大口径步枪子弹底火"

#. ~ Description of "large rifle primer"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Primer from a large caliber rifle round."
msgstr "一些大口径步枪子弹使用的底火。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "rubber slug"
msgid_plural "rubber slugs"
msgstr[0] "橡胶弹头"

#. ~ Description of "rubber slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Rubber slugs from a shotgun beanbag round.  You could use them to make new "
"beanbag rounds."
msgstr ""
"一些从沙包弹里拆出来的橡胶弹头，用来制造暴力镇压示威分子们的沙包弹。\n"
"\"大灾变前维持人类社会公序良俗的必备品。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "chunk of rubber"
msgid_plural "chunks of rubber"
msgstr[0] "橡胶块"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of rubber"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A chunk of useful rubber, can be molded easily."
msgstr "一块用途广泛的橡胶，很容易塑型。"

#. ~ 80% of 8.63g/ml is 6.904g/ml.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "copper"
msgid_plural "copper"
msgstr[0] "铜块"

#. ~ 80% of 8.63g/ml is 6.904g/ml.
#. ~ Description of "copper"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Copper bits.  Could be used to craft something, for example makeshift "
"shotgun shells."
msgstr ""
"一些可以用来制造物品的废铜料，比如说自制霰弹。\n"
"\"在任何游戏中都是最低等级武器的材料。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "medical tape"
msgid_plural "medical tape"
msgstr[0] "医用胶带"

#. ~ Description of "medical tape"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A roll of medical tape, similar to duct tape."
msgstr ""
"一卷医用胶布，有一些透气用小孔，总体类似强力胶带。\n"
"\"可用于假扮木乃伊，但风干肉对丧尸而言更具风味。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "placeholder ammunition"
msgid_plural "placeholder ammunitions"
msgstr[0] "占位用弹药"

#. ~ Description of "placeholder ammunition"
#. ~ Description of "software"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/software.json
msgid "IF YOU ARE SEEING THIS IT IS A BUG."
msgstr "如果你在游戏中见到它，说明这里出bug了。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "charcoal"
msgid_plural "charcoal"
msgstr[0] "木炭"

#. ~ Description of "charcoal"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A flammable carbon-based material produced by slowly burning wood.  Utilized"
" in recipes requiring a pure, hot flame.  Can also be used in filters to "
"remove contaminants out of air and water."
msgstr "一种易燃的碳基材料，由缓慢燃烧的木材产生。可以在制造中提供纯净的高温火焰，也可用于过滤空气和水中的污染物。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "carbon electrode rod"
msgid_plural "carbon electrode rods"
msgstr[0] "碳电极棒"

#. ~ Description of "carbon electrode rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"This carbon electrode is basically made from wood and sugar, and it actually"
" works."
msgstr "这根碳电极棒基本上是由木头和糖制成的，而且它确实有效。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "calcium carbide premix"
msgid_plural "calcium carbide premix"
msgstr[0] "电石原料混合物"

#. ~ Description of "calcium carbide premix"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A powdered mixture of coke and lime ready to be smelted into usable calcium "
"carbide in an arc furnace."
msgstr "一堆焦炭粉和石灰粉的混合物，随时可以在电弧炉中熔炼成可用的电石。"

#. ~ Density somewhere around 1.5 g/cm3 (solid anthracite)
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "coal"
msgid_plural "lumps of coal"
msgstr[0] "煤块"

#. ~ Density somewhere around 1.5 g/cm3 (solid anthracite)
#. ~ Description of "coal"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Flammable black chunks of carbon-based material commonly used for cooking "
"and heating."
msgstr ""
"一些黑色易燃的碳化物，常用于烹饪和取暖。\n"
"\"远古的孢子、裸子与被子植物尸体的最终形态。\""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "albuterol"
msgid_plural "albuterol"
msgstr[0] "舒喘宁"

#. ~ Description of "albuterol"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A bronchodilator that relaxes muscles in the airways and increases air flow "
"to the lungs."
msgstr "学名为沙丁胺醇，属于支气管扩张剂，能使呼吸道的肌肉放松并增加流入肺部的空气量。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "RA21E medical ampoule"
msgid_plural "RA21E medical ampoules"
msgstr[0] "RA21E 医用安瓿"

#. ~ Description of "RA21E medical ampoule"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A tiny glass vial filled with advanced fast-healing chemicals which can only"
" be activated by a Rivtech jet injector device.  The packaged instructions "
"describe its efficacy in dealing with infections, wounds, intoxications, "
"envenomations, and general tiredness in enthusiastic detail.  A short safety"
" section at the end warn - in much smaller typeface - against using more "
"than two doses per hour."
msgstr ""
"一只小小的的玻璃瓶，装满了帮助伤口快速愈合的先进化合物，必须和Rivtech公司专用的注射器配合使用。药水瓶上印着一行警告。\"每小时最多使用两剂。让您拥有超级英雄般的愈合能力，但请遵医嘱。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "RA10K stimulant module"
msgid_plural "RA10K stimulant modules"
msgstr[0] "RA10K 兴奋剂模块"

#. ~ Description of "RA10K stimulant module"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A pressurized multi-chamber glass vial filled with powerful chemical "
"stimulants which can only be activated by a Rivtech stimulant delivery "
"system."
msgstr "一瓶具有数个单独内腔、装满了强力兴奋剂的加压玻璃瓶。里面的兴奋剂只能用Rivtech公司专用的注射器来激活使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "rebreather filter cartridge"
msgid_plural "rebreather filter cartridges"
msgstr[0] "呼吸器滤芯"

#. ~ Description of "rebreather filter cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A replacement filter cartridge for a rebreather."
msgstr "一个循环呼吸器面罩使用的过滤芯。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "filter mask cartridge"
msgid_plural "filter mask cartridges"
msgstr[0] "过滤面罩滤芯"

#. ~ Description of "filter mask cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Small replacement filter cartridge for air filtration masks."
msgstr "一个过滤面罩使用的小型过滤芯。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "gas mask cartridge"
msgid_plural "gas mask cartridges"
msgstr[0] "防毒面具滤芯"

#. ~ Description of "gas mask cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "Medium replacement filter cartridge for air filtration masks."
msgstr "一个防毒面具使用的中型过滤芯。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "nicotine liquid"
msgid_plural "nicotine liquid"
msgstr[0] "尼古丁浓缩液"

#. ~ Description of "nicotine liquid"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A liquid that is made up of propylene glycol, vegetable glycerin, "
"flavorings, and nicotine."
msgstr ""
"一小份的尼古丁原液。成分包括丙二醇，植物甘油，香料和尼古丁。\n"
"\"直接饮用会导致尼古丁中毒甚至毙命，而且也不解渴。\""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/json/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "fish bait"
msgid_plural "fish bait"
msgstr[0] "鱼饵"

#. ~ Description of "fish bait"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "A bait used in traps to lure fish."
msgstr ""
"一个鱼饵，放在捕鱼用具里用来捕鱼。\n"
"\"无法吸引一个宝箱。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "spiked homemade rocket"
msgid_plural "spiked homemade rockets"
msgstr[0] "自制尖刺火箭弹"

#. ~ Description of "spiked homemade rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A hand built rocket, consisting of a spike welded onto a pipe that was "
"filled with improvised rocket fuel.  Horribly inaccurate, as can be expected"
" of this grade of weapon, but packs a fierce punch… if it hits."
msgstr "一支手工火箭，将一根钉刺焊在填满自制火箭燃料的钢管上。鉴于这种武器的质量，它的精度低得可怕，但能打出相当猛的一击……如果打中。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "explosive homemade rocket"
msgid_plural "explosive homemade rockets"
msgstr[0] "自制爆炸火箭弹"

#. ~ Description of "explosive homemade rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A hand built rocket, consisting of a simple explosive warhead attached onto "
"a pipe, filled with improvised rocket fuel.  Not very powerful, but can be "
"made from scratch."
msgstr ""
"一支手工火箭，将简易爆炸弹头连接在填满自制火箭燃料的钢管上。伤害并不高，但至少能从零开始造出来。\n"
"\"看起来就像土著们的投掷长矛的爆炸版。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "incendiary homemade rocket"
msgid_plural "incendiary homemade rockets"
msgstr[0] "自制燃烧火箭"

#. ~ Description of "incendiary homemade rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A hand built rocket, consisting of a container of flammable gel attached "
"onto a pipe, filled with improvised rocket fuel.  Short-range incendiary - "
"handle with care!"
msgstr ""
"一支手工火箭，将装易燃凝胶的容器连接在填满自制火箭燃料的钢管上。短程燃烧弹。用的时候长点心！\n"
"\"发射不当就会招惹燃眉之急。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "unfinished charcoal"
msgid_plural "unfinished charcoal"
msgstr[0] "木炭（未完成）"

#. ~ Description of "unfinished charcoal"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"The result of an interrupted charcoal making process.  Useless, except as "
"fuel in a charcoal kiln."
msgstr ""
"一些中断了制造木炭过程，在半途就取出来的东西。无用，除了塞回炭窑当燃料。\n"
"\"半途而废的意外产物，但也是意料之中的废物。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "unfinished calcium carbide"
msgid_plural "unfinished calcium carbide"
msgstr[0] "电石（未完成）"

#. ~ Description of "unfinished calcium carbide"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"The incomplete process of converting coal and lime into calcium carbide.  "
"Useless in this state."
msgstr "煤炭和石灰反应生成电石的中间态，当前状态下无法投入应用。"

#. ~ An individual lamella is roughly 3cm x 6cm x 1mm in size.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "low steel lamellae"
msgid_plural "low steel lamellae"
msgstr[0] "金属鳞片（低碳钢）"

#. ~ An individual lamella is roughly 3cm x 6cm x 1mm in size.
#. ~ Description of "low steel lamellae"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A pile of small 3cm by 6cm steel rectangles with a pattern of holes drilled "
"into it.  For use in creating or repairing lamellar armor."
msgstr "一堆3x6平方厘米的小长方形钢片，上面有规则的钻孔，用于制造或修复札甲。"

#. ~ An individual lamella is roughly 3cm x 6cm x 1mm in size.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "hardened steel lamellae"
msgid_plural "hardened steel lamellae"
msgstr[0] "金属鳞片（表面硬化碳钢）"

#. ~ An individual lamella is roughly 3cm x 6cm x 1mm in size.
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel lamellae"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A pile of small 3cm by 6cm steel rectangles with a pattern of holes drilled "
"into it, then case hardened.  For use in creating or repairing hardened "
"lamellar armor."
msgstr "一堆3x6平方厘米的小长方形钢片，上面有规则的钻孔，并且经过表面硬化处理，用于制造或修复表面硬化碳钢札甲。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "chain link"
msgid_plural "chain links"
msgstr[0] "锁链"

