msgid ""
"Commonly used in electronics prototyping, this solderless breadboard is a "
"small brick of plastic filled with hundreds of holes connected by internal "
"electrical busses.  With a few components and scraps of wire, you could "
"quickly build a circuit on this, if you know what you're doing."
