"A small high-quality lens, useful for focusing or diffusing light.  Might be"
" useful for crafting."
msgstr "一个小型高品质镜头，可以用来聚光或散光。可用于制成其他物品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "pair of tinted glass"
msgid_plural "pairs of tinted glass"
msgstr[0] "有色玻璃镜片"

