#. ~ Description of "Kevlar chainmail hauberk"
#: data/json/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail outfit, leaving the head uncovered.  The shirt,"
" arms, and leggings have been modified with straps and combined with a "
"kevlar gambeson to deal with uneven weight distribution, cold environments "
"and to allow them to be used separately."
msgstr "一套自制的完整链甲套装，没有头盔。胸甲、护臂、护胫都用带子连接来平衡重量的分布，与凯夫拉软铠结合使它能很好抵御寒冷。它们能够分开使用。"

