msgstr "你调整你的滑雪面罩来透透气儿。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "ski mask (open)"
msgid_plural "ski masks (open)"
msgstr[0] "滑雪面罩（敞开）"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "ski mask (open)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Tighten"
msgstr "系紧"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "ski mask (open)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You adjust your ski mask for more warmth."
msgstr "你调整你的滑雪面罩来保暖。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "whistle"
msgid_plural "whistles"
msgstr[0] "哨子"

#. ~ Description of "whistle"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "A simple metal whistle, with a cord to wear it around your neck."
msgstr "一个简单的金属口哨，有着一根绳子相连，可以把它戴在你的脖子上。"

#. ~ "noise_message" action message of item "whistle"
#. ~ "noise_message" action message of item "whistle multitool"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "FWEEEET!"
msgstr "咻~~~！"

#. ~ "use_message" action message of item "whistle"
#. ~ "use_message" action message of item "whistle multitool"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You blow the whistle."
msgstr "你吹响哨子。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ 3M Peltors claim to go 100 hours on 2 AAs
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "shooter's earmuffs"
msgid_plural "shooter's earmuffs"
msgstr[0] "射击护耳"

#. ~ Description of "shooter's earmuffs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  Without batteries or when turned "
"off they function like normal earmuffs and block all sound.  They will block"
" sounds over a certain decibel amount when turned on.  The earmuffs are "
"currently off."
msgstr "一对备由射手青睐的护耳。没有电池或关闭时，它们就像普通耳罩，阻挡任何声音。现在处于关闭状态。它们能阻挡超过一定分贝的声音，前提是有电。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "shooter's earmuffs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You turn the earmuffs on."
msgstr "你启动了护耳。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "shooter's earmuffs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "The earmuff's batteries are dead."
msgstr "护耳的电池耗尽了。"

#. ~ 3M Peltors claim to go 100 hours on 2 AAs
#. ~ Description of "shooter's earmuffs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  The earmuffs are turned on.  They "
"will block sounds over a certain decibel amount, assuming it is charged with"
" batteries."
msgstr "一对备由射手青睐的护耳。现在处于启动状态。它们能阻挡超过一定分贝的声音，前提是有电。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "shooter's ear plugs"
msgid_plural "shooter's ear plugs"
msgstr[0] "射击耳塞"

#. ~ Description of "shooter's ear plugs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of in-ear drivers designed to dampen loud sounds and amplify quiet "
"sounds.  Without batteries or when turned off, they function like normal "
"earplugs and block most sound.  They will block sounds over a certain "
"decibel amount when turned on.  The earplugs are currently off."
msgstr ""
"一对入耳耳塞，能够抵消抑制过大的声音，同时放大微弱的声音。没有电池或关闭时，它们就像普通耳塞，阻挡大部分声音。开启后能阻挡超过一定分贝的声音。现在处于关闭状态。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "shooter's ear plugs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You turn the earplugs on."
msgstr "你开启了耳塞。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "shooter's ear plugs"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "The earplugs' batteries are dead."
msgstr "耳塞的电池耗尽了。"

#. ~ same power draw as the earmuffs, much smaller internal battery
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "shooter's ear plugs (on)"
msgid_plural "shooter's ear plugs (on)"
msgstr[0] "射击耳塞（开）"

#. ~ same power draw as the earmuffs, much smaller internal battery
#. ~ Description of "shooter's ear plugs (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of in-ear drivers designed to dampen loud sounds and amplify quiet "
"sounds.  Without batteries or when turned off, they function like normal "
"earplugs and block most sound.  They will block sounds over a certain "
"decibel amount when turned on.  The earplugs are currently on."
msgstr ""
"一对入耳耳塞，能够抵消抑制过大的声音，同时放大微弱的声音。没有电池或关闭时，它们就像普通耳塞，阻挡大部分声音。开启后能阻挡超过一定分贝的声音。现在处于打开状态。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "stethoscope"
msgid_plural "stethoscopes"
msgstr[0] "听诊器"

#. ~ Description of "stethoscope"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is a medical listening tool.  Use it to listen to things.  Closely."
msgstr "一个医用听诊工具。只能用来听身边的东西。靠近物体并使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "makeshift stethoscope"
msgid_plural "makeshift stethoscopes"
msgstr[0] "简易听诊器"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift stethoscope"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is a relatively cumbersome DIY child's medical listening toy.  Use it "
"to listen to things.  Closely."
msgstr "一个相对笨重的自制儿童听诊玩具。只能用来听身边的东西。靠近物体并使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "solar backpack (folded)"
msgid_plural "solar backpacks (folded)"
msgstr[0] "太阳能背包（折叠）"

#. ~ Description of "solar backpack (folded)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"Personal portable charging system consisting of an array of solar panels "
"neatly folded in a form of a large backpack.  It can be worn as one, and has"
" an integrated cable to plug it into a cable charger system CBM."
msgstr ""
"一套个人便携式充能系统，由一系列太阳能电池板组成，都被整齐地折叠并装入一个大背包。它可以一体式穿着在身上，并且集成了一条可插入电缆充电器CBM的电缆。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "solar backpack (unfolded)"
msgid_plural "solar backpacks (unfolded)"
msgstr[0] "太阳能背包（展开）"

#. ~ Description of "solar backpack (unfolded)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"Unfolded array of portable solar panels ready to push some power into an "
"active cable charger system CBM."
msgstr "一套已经展开的便携式太阳能电池板阵列，准备好为电缆充电器CBM提供能量。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "riot helmet"
msgid_plural "riot helmets"
msgstr[0] "防暴头盔"

#. ~ Description of "riot helmet"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A helmet with a plastic shield that covers your entire face.  Activate to "
"raise the face shield."
msgstr ""
"一顶保护警务人员在执行公务时抵御头部及面部受到打击伤害或其它潜在的伤害的一种警用装具，头盔采用合金材质并附有塑料护罩，提供整个头部的优良防护。激活以升起面罩。\n"
"\"来自法国GIGN宪兵特勤队的Twitch、Montagne、DOC、Rook等干员竭诚为您推荐。\""

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "riot helmet"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "motorcycle helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Raise visor"
msgstr "升起面罩"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "riot helmet"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "motorcycle helmet"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "black dragonscale helmet"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "XL black dragonscale helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "You raise your visor."
msgstr "你升起了面罩。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "riot helmet (raised visor)"
msgid_plural "riot helmets (raised visor)"
msgstr[0] "防暴头盔（面罩升起）"

#. ~ Description of "riot helmet (raised visor)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A riot helmet with a plastic face shield which is raised up.  Activate to "
"lower the shield."
msgstr ""
"一顶保护警务人员在执行公务时抵御头部及面部受到打击伤害或其它潜在的伤害的一种警用装具，头盔采用合金材质并附有塑料护罩，提供整个头部的优良防护。这个头盔的面罩已经升起。激活以降下面罩。\n"
"\"来自法国GIGN宪兵特勤队的Twitch、Montagne、DOC、Rook等干员竭诚为您推荐。\""

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "riot helmet (raised visor)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "motorcycle helmet (raised visor)"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Lower visor"
msgstr "降下面罩"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "riot helmet (raised visor)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "motorcycle helmet (raised visor)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "black dragonscale helmet (raised visor)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "XL black dragonscale helmet (raised visor)"
#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "You put down your visor."
msgstr "你降下了面罩。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "sallet helm"
msgid_plural "sallet helms"
msgstr[0] "夏雷尔盔"

#. ~ Description of "sallet helm"
#. ~ Description of "sallet helm (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A popular german helmet of the late medieval era, the sallet covers the head"
" and eyes.  Activate it to toggle the visor."
msgstr "夏雷尔盔是一款中世纪晚期流行的德式头盔，覆盖了头部和眼睛。激活它以切换面罩。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sallet helm"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You raise the sallet visor."
msgstr "你升起了面罩。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "sallet helm (raised)"
msgid_plural "sallet helms (raised)"
msgstr[0] "夏雷尔盔（面罩升起）"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sallet helm (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You lower the sallet visor over your eyes."
msgstr "你把面罩放低，遮住眼睛。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "armet helm"
msgid_plural "armet helms"
msgstr[0] "武装盔"

#. ~ Description of "armet helm"
#. ~ Description of "armet helm (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"An iconic knightly helm of the late middle ages.  When you think of a "
"knight's helmet, it looks something like this.  Activate it to toggle the "
"visor."
msgstr "中世纪晚期骑士的标志头盔。当你想象骑士头盔时，它看起来就应该像这个样子。激活它以切换面罩。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "armet helm"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You raise the armet visor."
msgstr "你升起了面罩。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "armet helm (raised)"
msgid_plural "armet helms (raised)"
msgstr[0] "武装盔（面罩升起）"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "armet helm (raised)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You lower the armet visor."
msgstr "你把面罩放低。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "scuba tank"
msgid_plural "scuba tanks"
msgstr[0] "潜水罐"

#. ~ Description of "scuba tank"
#. ~ Description of "scuba tank (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is a high-pressure 232 bar diving tank that can contain up to 12L of "
"compressed mixture of oxygen and nitrogen.  It is equipped with an on-demand"
" regulator and a mouthpiece designed mostly for underwater use."
msgstr "这是一个高压232巴的潜水罐，可以容纳多达12L的压缩氧氮混合物。它配有一个呼吸气阀和一个主要为水下使用而设计的咬嘴。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "scuba tank (on)"
msgid_plural "scuba tanks (on)"
msgstr[0] "潜水罐（开）"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "small scuba tank"
msgid_plural "small scuba tanks"
msgstr[0] "小型潜水罐"

#. ~ Description of "small scuba tank"
#. ~ Description of "small scuba tank (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is a small high-pressure 200 bar backup diving tank, that can contain "
"4L of compressed mixture of oxygen and nitrogen.  It is equipped with an on-"
"demand regulator and a mouthpiece designed mostly for underwater use."
msgstr "这是一个小型的高压200巴备用潜水罐，可以容纳4L的压缩氧氮混合物。它配有一个呼吸气阀和一个主要为水下使用而设计的咬嘴。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "small scuba tank (on)"
msgid_plural "small scuba tanks (on)"
msgstr[0] "小型潜水罐（开）"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "electric blanket"
msgid_plural "electric blankets"
msgstr[0] "电热毯"

#. ~ Description of "electric blanket"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heated blanket made of polyester.  The most comfortable thing on Earth.  "
"Its cost is usually negligible, but with the power out, it chews through "
"batteries insanely quickly."
msgstr "由聚酯纤维制成的加热毯，地球上最舒适的东西。它的价格可以忽略不计，但接通电源后，会飞快吞噬电池。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "electric blanket"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You turn the blanket's heating elements on."
msgstr "你打开了电热毯的加热元件。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "electric blanket"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "The blanket's batteries are dead."
msgstr "电热毯没电了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "electric blanket (on)"
msgid_plural "electric blankets (on)"
msgstr[0] "电热毯（开）"

#. ~ Description of "electric blanket (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heated blanket made of polyester.  It's turned on, making it nice and "
"toasty while it lasts."
msgstr "由聚酯纤维制成的加热毯。它被打开了，现在它的里面就是天堂。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "electric blanket (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You turn the blanket's heating elements off."
msgstr "你关闭了电热毯的加热元件。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Foodperson mask"
msgid_plural "Foodperson masks"
msgstr[0] "美食侠面具"

#. ~ Description of "Foodperson mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Foodperson, the mascot your stomach deserves!"
msgstr "美食侠，你的胃配的起这样的吉祥物！"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Foodperson mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"Your HUD lights-up: \"Greetings Foodperson, your shift begins now.  Good "
"luck!\""
msgstr "你的平视显示器点亮了：你好美食侠，你的轮班现在开始。祝你好运。"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "Foodperson mask"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "The mask's batteries are dead."
msgstr "面具的电池没电了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Foodperson mask (on)"
msgid_plural "Foodperson masks (on)"
msgstr[0] "美食侠面具（开）"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "pair of attached ear plugs (in)"
msgid_plural "pairs of attached ear plugs (in)"
msgstr[0] "防噪耳塞（耳内）"

#. ~ Description of "pair of attached ear plugs (in)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of industrial grade ear plugs attached together by some string.  They"
" are inside your ears, activate them to take them out."
msgstr "一对用线连接的工业级防噪耳塞。你现在正戴着它，激活以取出。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "pair of attached ear plugs (in)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "pair of makeshift ear plugs (in)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Unplug"
msgstr "取出"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pair of attached ear plugs (in)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pair of makeshift ear plugs (in)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You take the ear plugs out."
msgstr "你取出了防噪耳塞。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "pair of attached ear plugs (out)"
msgid_plural "pairs of attached ear plugs (out)"
msgstr[0] "防噪耳塞（取出）"

#. ~ Description of "pair of attached ear plugs (out)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of industrial grade ear plugs, they are attached together by some "
"string.  They hang around your neck, use them to plug them in."
msgstr "一对用线连接的工业级防噪耳塞，现在正挂在你的脖子上。激活以戴上它。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "pair of attached ear plugs (out)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "pair of makeshift ear plugs (out)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Plug in"
msgstr "戴上"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pair of attached ear plugs (out)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "pair of makeshift ear plugs (out)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You plug up your ears."
msgstr "你塞住了你的耳朵。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "pair of makeshift ear plugs (in)"
msgid_plural "pairs of makeshift ear plugs (in)"
msgstr[0] "简易耳塞（入耳）"

#. ~ Description of "pair of makeshift ear plugs (in)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of makeshift ear plugs made from lumps of wax on the ends of a piece "
"of string.  They are inside your ears, activate them to take them out."
msgstr "一对简易耳塞，由一根绳子和两端的蜡块制成。已经塞进了你的耳朵里，激活可以取出。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "pair of makeshift ear plugs (out)"
msgid_plural "pairs of makeshift ear plugs (out)"
msgstr[0] "简易耳塞（未入耳）"

#. ~ Description of "pair of makeshift ear plugs (out)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of makeshift ear plugs made from lumps of wax on the ends of a piece "
"of string.  They hang around your neck, use them to plug them in."
msgstr "一对简易耳塞，由一根绳子和两端的蜡块制成。只是挂在你的脖子上，激活可以塞进耳中。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "military flight helmet"
msgid_plural "military flight helmets"
msgstr[0] "军用飞行头盔"

#. ~ Description of "military flight helmet"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A military flight helmet.  Adorned with a visor, microphone and a noise "
"dampening system.  The helmet is also fitted with plastic rails to allow for"
" different load-outs."
msgstr "一顶军用飞行头盔。配有面罩、麦克风和消音系统。头盔还装有塑料导轨，可以安装不同的装备。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military flight helmet"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You turn the flight helmet on."
msgstr "你打开了头盔灯。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "military flight helmet (on)"
msgid_plural "military flight helmets (on)"
msgstr[0] "军用飞行头盔（开）"

#. ~ Description of "military flight helmet (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A military flight helmet with various LED's devices blinking periodically.  "
"Adorned with a visor, microphone and a noise dampening system.  The helmet "
"is also fitted with plastic rails to allow for different load-outs."
msgstr "一顶军用飞行头盔，上面的LED灯正不时地闪动着。配有面罩、麦克风和消音系统。头盔还装有塑料导轨，可以安装不同的装备。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "combo cover"
msgid_plural "combo covers"
msgstr[0] "鸭舌帽"

#. ~ Description of "combo cover"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A military officer's combo cover, or peaked cap.  It conveys an air of "
"authority, while keeping the sun out of your eyes."
msgstr "一顶军官的鸭舌帽，或尖顶帽。它散发出一种权威感，同时能避免阳光直射你的眼睛。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "combo cover"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Salute"
msgstr "敬礼"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "combo cover"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You bring your hand to your cover and issue a salute."
msgstr "你把手并拢，微接帽檐，敬礼。"

#. ~ This is based on the Sarcos Guardian, a production model with independent
#. battery power, all weather operation, and capable of lifting up to 200 lbs.
#. It uses three 12 lb batteries that provide 8 hours of operation. The
#. battery life in-game is significantly less in order to utilize medium
#. storage batteries, otherwise this would require the unit to be active to
#. reload itself. This can also be changed out to use other battery types.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "battery powered utility exoskeleton"
msgid_plural "battery powered utility exoskeletons"
msgstr[0] "电动工业用外骨骼"

#. ~ This is based on the Sarcos Guardian, a production model with independent
#. battery power, all weather operation, and capable of lifting up to 200 lbs.
#. It uses three 12 lb batteries that provide 8 hours of operation. The
#. battery life in-game is significantly less in order to utilize medium
#. storage batteries, otherwise this would require the unit to be active to
#. reload itself. This can also be changed out to use other battery types.
#. ~ Description of "battery powered utility exoskeleton"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is a skeletal frame of sturdy metal with attached motors to allow the "
"user to move heavier loads with less strain on the body."
msgstr "这是一台坚固的金属外骨骼框架，安装了辅助马达，让使用者在能搬运更重负载的同时减少对身体的压力。"

