msgid "battery powered utility exoskeleton (on)"
msgid_plural "battery powered utility exoskeletons (on)"
msgstr[0] "电动工业用外骨骼（开）"

#. ~ Battery should last two hours (02:00:07). Weight capacity bonus should
#. include weight of item AND battery, plus 90kg.
#. ~ Description of "battery powered utility exoskeleton (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is a skeletal frame of sturdy metal with attached motors to allow the "
"user to move heavier loads with less strain on the body.  It is turned on "
"and continually drawing power.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "这是一台坚固的金属外骨骼框架，安装了辅助马达，让使用者在能搬运更重负载的同时减少对身体的压力。它已经开启，不断地消耗能量。激活它来关闭。"

