"Makarov PM.  This one has been hand-reloaded to generate higher internal "
"pressure, boosting flight stability and damage."
msgstr ""
"9x18mm 马卡洛夫手枪弹，主要用于马卡洛夫PM手枪的前苏联制式子弹。这种弹药被重新装填，增加了内压，提供更高飞行稳定性及伤害。这是手工复装的型号。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
msgid "9x18mm FMJ, reloaded"
msgid_plural "9x18mm FMJ, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "9x18mm 被甲弹（复装）"

#. ~ Description of "9x18mm FMJ, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/9x18.json
msgid ""
"9x18 millimeter Makarov, an old Soviet pistol cartridge used mainly by the "
"Makarov PM.  This brass-jacketed round increases penetration slightly, at "
"the cost of reduced expansion.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a "
"survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to slightly inferior "
"performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"9x18mm "
"马卡洛夫手枪弹，一种老式苏联手枪弹药，主要用于马卡洛夫PM型手枪。这种黄铜被甲型号可以提高少许穿甲性能，同时击中目标时弹头的碎裂伤害也减少了。这枚弹药应该是由幸存者或大灾变前的业余爱好者手工重新装填的，与工厂生产的弹药相比，性能稍差。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/atgm.json
msgid "152mm ATGM HEAT"
msgid_plural "152mm ATGM HEAT"
msgstr[0] "152mm 热能追踪反坦克导弹"

#. ~ Description of "152mm ATGM HEAT"
#: data/json/items/ammo/atgm.json
msgid ""
"A tube-launched, optically tracked, wire-guided missile contained in a steel"
" tube.  Designed to be highly effective against vehicles and structures."
msgstr "一件由发射管发射，具有光学制导的热能追踪的导弹。对车辆及建筑物非常有效。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/barb.json
msgid "paralyzing barb"
msgid_plural "paralyzing barbs"
msgstr[0] "麻痹毒刺"

#. ~ Description of "paralyzing barb"
#: data/json/items/ammo/barb.json
msgid ""
"Tiny droplets of venom trickle out of the sponge-like tissue of this sharp "
"barb."
msgstr "小滴的毒液从这根毒刺海绵般的组织中渗出。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/blank.json
msgid ".22 blank"
msgid_plural ".22 blank"
msgstr[0] ".22 空包弹"

#. ~ Description of ".22 blank"
#: data/json/items/ammo/blank.json
msgid "A powder load .22 blank used for powder actuated tools."
msgstr "一个装满火药粉末的 .22 空包弹，用于火药发射工具。"

#. ~ 4 pound cannonball weighs 28000 grains,shot at 1215 ft/s by a 3in
#. ordnance rifle, equals 124459 joules of muzzle energy according to Shooters
#. Calculator, round down from square root 352.78
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/cannon.json
msgid "cannon round shot"
msgid_plural "cannon round shot"
msgstr[0] "实心炮弹"

#. ~ 4 pound cannonball weighs 28000 grains,shot at 1215 ft/s by a 3in
#. ordnance rifle, equals 124459 joules of muzzle energy according to Shooters
#. Calculator, round down from square root 352.78
#. ~ Description of "cannon round shot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/cannon.json
msgid ""
"A bundle of wadding, black gunpowder, and a cannonball, ready to be loaded "
"into a cannon."
msgstr "一捆棉絮、黑色火药和球形炮弹，准备装进大炮里。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
msgid "sprayable toxic gas"
msgid_plural "sprayable toxic gas"
msgstr[0] "喷雾式毒气剂"

#. ~ Description of "sprayable toxic gas"
#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
msgid ""
"A hazardous mixture made from household cleaning chemicals, improvised for "
"use in a chemical thrower.  Best used with some kind of mask or mouth "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"一些由家用清洁剂制成的致命喷雾，须填充于药剂喷罐喷洒。\n"
"\"最好戴上面罩或嘴部防护使用。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
msgid "sprayable fungicide"
msgid_plural "sprayable fungicide"
msgstr[0] "喷雾式抗真菌剂"

#. ~ Description of "sprayable fungicide"
#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
msgid ""
"Fungicide enhanced with sulfur to create sprayable anti-fungal ammo for the "
"chemical thrower.  Best used with some kind of mask or mouth protection."
msgstr ""
"一些抗真菌剂加硫磺制成的强化式抗真菌喷雾，须填充于药剂喷罐喷洒。\n"
"\"最好戴上面罩或嘴部防护使用。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
msgid "sprayable insecticide"
msgid_plural "sprayable insecticide"
msgstr[0] "喷雾式杀虫剂"

#. ~ Description of "sprayable insecticide"
#: data/json/items/ammo/chemical_spray.json
msgid ""
"Strong sprayable insecticide ammo for the chemical thrower.  Best used with "
"some kind of mask or mouth protection."
msgstr ""
"一些强化式杀虫剂，需填充于药剂喷罐喷洒。\n"
"“最好戴上面罩或嘴部防护使用。”"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid "12.3ln round"
msgid_plural "12.3ln rounds"
msgstr[0] "12.3ln 弹"

#. ~ Description of "12.3ln round"
#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
msgid ""
"In some alternate universe, the 12.3ln cartridge was introduced in Romania "
"in the wake of the second Carpathian conflict.  The PA md. 71 rifle using "
"this ammunition rapidly gained popularity in the Eastern Union, and from "
"there, the world.  Due to this, the 12.3ln rapidly became the standard "
"combat round in the Eurasian sphere, making it easy for the Exodii to "
"stockpile it in large quantities when they visited that version of Earth.  "
"It looks and feels quite similar to a .30-06 Springfield cartridge, but with"
" a slightly sharper taper."
msgstr ""
"在另一个平行世界中，罗马尼亚在第二次喀尔巴阡山冲突后引进了 12.3ln 弹。使用这种弹药的 PA md.71 "
"步枪迅速在东欧联盟以及世界各地流行起来。正因为如此，12.3ln "
"弹迅速成为欧亚大陆的标准弹药口径。因此流亡族在到达这个版本的地球时轻易储存了大量弹药。对你来说，它的外观和手感都非常类似于 .30-06 "
"春田弹，但弹头稍显锋利。"

#. ~ Description of "paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing black powder and a metallic projectile.  "
"Historically used to reload muzzleloaders in a more reasonable time."
msgstr ""
"一个装满了黑火药和一枚金属弹头的纸药卷，历史上用来加快老式燧发枪的装填速度至可让人接受的范围内。\n"
"\"切勿当作大麻吸食。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/black_powder.json
msgid "paper shot cartridge"
msgid_plural "paper shot cartridges"
msgstr[0] "纸卷霰弹"

#. ~ Description of "paper shot cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/black_powder.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing black powder and metallic shot.  Historically "
"used to reload muzzleloaders in a more reasonable time."
msgstr "一个装满了黑火药和许多金属弹丸的纸药卷，历史上用来加快老式燧发枪的装填速度至可让人接受的范围内。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid "flechette"
msgid_plural "flechettes"
msgstr[0] "钢镖"

#. ~ Description of "flechette"
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid ""
"A tiny steel dart.  Can be fired from a nail gun or similar weapon, or used "
"for crafting ammunition"
msgstr "微型钢镖，可以被射钉枪或者其他类似武器发射，或用来制造弹药。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid "nail"
msgid_plural "nails"
msgstr[0] "钉子"

#. ~ Description of "nail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of iron.  It can be used to construct various things with"
" a hammer."
msgstr "一根铁钉，可以用于各种建筑。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid "nut and bolt"
msgid_plural "nuts and bolts"
msgstr[0] "螺栓螺母"

#. ~ Description of "nut and bolt"
#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
msgid "A matching nut and bolt.  Useful for securing objects together."
msgstr "一对匹配的螺母和螺栓。用于将物品固定在一起。"

#. ~ Description of "paintball"
#: data/json/items/ammo/paintball.json
msgid ""
"A small paintball for recreational shooting.  Getting shot with one stings a"
" little, but you'd be hard-pressed to kill anything with it."
msgstr "娱乐休闲射击时所使用的小彩弹。被打中时有点刺痛，但你很难用它杀死任何东西。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/rpg.json
msgid "PG-7VL 93mm rocket"
msgid_plural "PG-7VL 93mm rockets"
msgstr[0] "PG-7VL 93mm 火箭弹"

#. ~ Description of "PG-7VL 93mm rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo/rpg.json
msgid "93mm single-stage high-explosive ammunition for the RPG-7."
msgstr "一枚用于RPG-7的93mm 单级高爆火箭弹。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/rpg.json
msgid "PG-7VR 64mm/105mm rocket"
msgid_plural "PG-7VR 64mm/105mm rockets"
msgstr[0] "PG-7VR 64mm/105mm 火箭弹"

#. ~ Description of "PG-7VR 64mm/105mm rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo/rpg.json
msgid "64mm/105mm high-explosive tandem ammunition for the RPG-7."
msgstr "一枚用于RPG-7的64mm/105mm多级高爆火箭弹。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/rpg.json
msgid "TBG-7V 105mm rocket"
msgid_plural "TBG-7V 105mm rockets"
msgstr[0] "TBG-7V 105mm 火箭弹"

#. ~ Description of "TBG-7V 105mm rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo/rpg.json
msgid "105mm thermobaric ammunition for the RPG-7."
msgstr "一枚用于RPG-7的热压火箭弹。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/rpg.json
msgid "OG-7V 40mm rocket"
msgid_plural "OG-7V 40mm rockets"
msgstr[0] "OG-7V 40mm 火箭弹"

#. ~ Description of "OG-7V 40mm rocket"
#: data/json/items/ammo/rpg.json
msgid ""
"40mm high-explosive fragmentation antipersonnel ammunition for the RPG-7."
msgstr "一枚用于RPG-7的40mm高爆破片反步兵火箭弹。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "birdshot, reloaded"
msgid_plural "birdshot, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "猎鸟弹（复装）"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"Weak shotgun ammunition.  Designed for hunting birds and other small game, "
"its applications in combat are very limited.  This one has been hand-"
"reloaded by a survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to "
"slightly inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"一种威力有限的霰弹枪弹药。用来狩猎鸟类和其他小玩意还行，在战斗中的实用性极为有限。这枚弹药应该是由幸存者或大灾变前的业余爱好者手工重新装填的，与工厂生产的弹药相比，性能稍差。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "dragon's breath shell, reloaded"
msgid_plural "dragon's breath shells, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "龙息霰弹（复装）"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-"
"temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything "
"in their path.  This one was made in somebody's garage.  Are you sure you "
"want to shoot this?"
msgstr ""
"一种填充镁颗粒或碎片的霰弹枪弹，主要用作紧急求救信号弹或者起火工具。当该弹药发射时，枪管会射出高温火花和火焰，点燃其路径上的一切。这个某个人手工复装弹型号。你确定要用这个吗？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, reloaded"
msgid_plural "00 shot, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹（复装）"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread "
"makes it very accurate at short range.  SWAT forces wouldn't use this "
"homebrew shell, but a sovereign citizen looking to fend off SWAT probably "
"would."
msgstr ""
"一种填满了金属圆珠的霰弹，威力极强，同时由于这种弹药的散射特性，使其在近距离射击时的命中率很高，SWAT部队也许不会使用这枚手工复装弹的弹药，但是对抗SWAT特警的觉醒公民也许会选择使用它。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "flechette shell, reloaded"
msgid_plural "flechette shells, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "镖形霰弹（复装）"

#. ~ Description of "flechette shell, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  Extremely damaging, plus the "
"spread makes it very accurate at short range.  Slices through most forms of "
"armor with ease.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a survivor or perhaps a"
" pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to slightly inferior performance compared "
"to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"一种填充了微型钢镖的霰弹。威力极大，并且近距离命中率极高，并且还附带破甲效果。这枚弹药应该是由幸存者或大灾变前的业余爱好者手工重新装填的，与工厂生产的弹药相比，性能稍差。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "shotgun slug, reloaded"
msgid_plural "shotgun slugs, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "独头霰弹（复装）"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun slug, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A heavy metal slug used to give a shotgun the range capabilities of a rifle."
"  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate.  This one has been hand-reloaded"
" by a survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm hobbyist, leading to slightly "
"inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"一种沉重的金属独头霰弹，装填在霰弹枪里使其拥有步枪般的射程，威力极大但精准度不高。这枚弹药应该是由幸存者或大灾变前的业余爱好者手工重新装填的，与工厂生产的弹药相比，性能稍差。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "birdshot, black powder"
msgid_plural "birdshot, black powder"
msgstr[0] "猎鸟弹（黑火药）"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"Weak shotgun ammunition.  Designed for hunting birds and other small game, "
"its applications in combat are very limited.  Someone was down on their luck"
" when they hand-reloaded this one - it's filled with black powder instead of"
" smokeless powder.  Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier "
"barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"一种威力有限的霰弹枪弹药。用来狩猎鸟类和其他小玩意还行，在战斗中的实用性极为有限。某人在手工重新为它装药时应当时运不济——里面装的是黑火药，而非无烟火药。这枚弹药射击时，估计会初速更慢、枪口发烟并弄脏枪管。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "dragon's breath shell, black powder"
msgid_plural "dragon's breath shells, black powder"
msgstr[0] "龙息霰弹（黑火药）"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-"
"temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything "
"in their path.  This one was made in somebody's garage, and with black "
"gunpowder to boot.  Are you sure you want to shoot this?"
msgstr ""
"一种填充镁颗粒或碎片的霰弹枪弹，主要用作紧急求救信号弹或者起火工具。当该弹药发射时，枪管会射出高温火花和火焰，点燃其路径上的一切。这个某个人手工复装的型号，还用黑火药作为装药。你确定要用这个吗？"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, black powder"
msgid_plural "00 shot, black powder"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹（黑火药）"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread "
"makes it very accurate at short range.  SWAT forces probably wouldn't use "
"this one - it's filled with black powder instead of smokeless powder.  "
"Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"一种填满了金属圆珠的弹药，威力极强，同时由于这种弹药的散射特性，使其在近距离射击时的命中率很高。SWAT特警应该不会用这枚弹药——里面装的是黑火药，而非无烟火药。这枚弹药射击时，估计会初速更慢、枪口发烟并弄脏枪管。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "flechette shell, black powder"
msgid_plural "flechette shells, black powder"
msgstr[0] "镖形霰弹（黑火药）"

#. ~ Description of "flechette shell, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  Extremely damaging, plus the "
"spread makes it very accurate at short range.  Slices through most forms of "
"armor with ease.  Someone was down on their luck when they hand-reloaded "
"this one - it's filled with black powder instead of smokeless powder.  "
"Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"一种填充微型镖头的霰弹。威力极大，并且近距离命中率极高，并且还附带破甲效果。某人在手工重新为它装药时应当时运不济——里面装的是黑火药，而非无烟火药。这枚弹药射击时，估计会初速更慢、枪口发烟并弄脏枪管。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "shotgun slug, black powder"
msgid_plural "shotgun slugs, black powder"
msgstr[0] "独头霰弹（黑火药）"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun slug, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A heavy metal slug used to give a shotgun the range capabilities of a rifle."
"  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate.  Someone was down on their luck "
"when they hand-reloaded this one - it's filled with black powder instead of "
"smokeless powder.  Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel"
" if you shoot it."
msgstr ""
"一种沉重的金属独头霰弹，装填在霰弹枪里使其拥有步枪般的射程，威力极大但精准度不高。某人在手工重新为它装药时应当时运不济——里面装的是黑火药，而非无烟火药。这枚弹药射击时，估计会初速更慢、枪口发烟并弄脏枪管。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "base shotshell"
msgid_plural "base shotshells"
msgstr[0] "基础霰弹"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot"
msgid_plural "00 shot"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread "
"makes it very accurate at short range.  Favored by SWAT forces."
msgstr "一种填满了金属圆珠的弹药，威力极强，同时由于这种弹药的散射特性，使其在近距离射击时的命中率很高，因此深受SWAT部队的喜爱。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "shotgun beanbag"
msgid_plural "shotgun beanbags"
msgstr[0] "沙包弹"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun beanbag"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A beanbag round for shotguns.  Designated 'less-lethal' and intended to "
"disable, but remember that 'less-lethal' does not mean 'non-lethal'."
msgstr "一枚霰弹枪使用的防暴霰弹。宣称“低致命性”并旨在使目标瘫痪，但请记住，“低致命性”并不意味着“非致命性”。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "birdshot"
msgid_plural "birdshot"
msgstr[0] "猎鸟弹"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"Weak shotgun ammunition.  Designed for hunting birds and other small game, "
"its applications in combat are very limited."
msgstr "一种威力有限的霰弹枪弹药。用来狩猎鸟类和其他小玩意还行，在战斗中的实用性极为有限。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "dragon's breath shell"
msgid_plural "dragon's breath shells"
msgstr[0] "龙息霰弹"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-"
"temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything "
"in their path."
msgstr "一种填充镁颗粒或碎片的霰弹枪弹，主要用作紧急求救信号弹或者起火工具。当该弹药发射时，枪管会射出高温火花和火焰，点燃其路径上的一切。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "flechette shell"
msgid_plural "flechette shells"
msgstr[0] "镖形霰弹"

#. ~ Description of "flechette shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  Extremely damaging, plus the "
"spread makes it very accurate at short range.  Slices through most forms of "
"armor with ease."
msgstr "一种填充微型镖头的霰弹。威力极大，并且近距离命中率极高，并且还附带破甲效果。"

#. ~ $30/shot thanks to tight regulation, one way or another.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "explosive slug"
msgid_plural "explosive slugs"
msgstr[0] "高爆霰弹"

#. ~ $30/shot thanks to tight regulation, one way or another.
#. ~ Description of "explosive slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell shooting a small explosive.  Banned in several states.  "
"While an explosive from a shotgun sounds impressive, its practical "
"applications are limited at best.  The loss in mass in order to accommodate "
"an explosive give it much less impact force compared to traditional "
"ammunition.  The relatively small size of the slug can only accommodate a "
"limited amount of explosives, resulting in a fairly underwelming explosion."
"  These traits make it a utility tool for damaging barriers and disrupting "
"other explosive devices, rather than something for anti-personnel use."
msgstr ""
"一种发射小型爆炸弹头的霰弹。在数个州被禁用。虽然能爆炸的霰弹听起来很强，但其实际应用场景十分有限。与传统弹药相比，为了容纳炸药而损失的弹头质量使其产生的冲击力要小得多，而弹头相对较小的尺寸只能容纳十分有限的炸药，导致爆炸强度相当低。这些特点使其成为破障和干扰其他爆炸装置的实用工具，而非用于杀伤人员。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "00 shot, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹（废料）"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with whatever scrap metal was lying around.  More "
"damaging than birdshot, but fairly inaccurate."
msgstr "一种塞进了各种金属废料的霰弹，弹丸材料完全因地制宜。威力比猎鸟弹稍微强点，就是不太准。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgid_plural "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
msgstr[0] "猎鹿弹（废料黑火药）"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with black gunpowder and whatever scrap metal was "
"lying around.  The logical conclusion of ammunition bootlegging.  It'll kill"
" zombies just fine, but your gun will suffer for it."
msgstr "一种塞进了各种金属废料的霰弹，弹丸材料完全因地制宜。自然是某人自制的弹药。它可以很好地杀死丧尸，但你的枪肯定也不好受。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid "shotgun slug"
msgid_plural "shotgun slugs"
msgstr[0] "独头弹"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A heavy metal slug used to give a shotgun the range capabilities of a rifle."
"  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate."
msgstr "一种沉重的金属独头霰弹，装填在霰弹枪里使其拥有步枪般的射程，威力极大但精准度不高。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid "paper cartridge base"
msgid_plural "paper cartridge bases"
msgstr[0] "纸卷弹弹药"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid "birdshot paper cartridge"
msgid_plural "birdshot paper cartridges"
msgstr[0] "纸卷猎鸟弹"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing a premeasured amount of black powder and an "
"equal volume of birdshot.  Used mostly for hunting small game or fowl."
msgstr "一颗纸卷弹，里面填充有预先称量好的黑火药和等量的猎鸟弹弹丸。一般用于猎取鸟类及其它小型动物。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid "pyrotechnic paper cartridge"
msgid_plural "pyrotechnic paper cartridges"
msgstr[0] "纸卷燃烧弹"

#. ~ Description of "pyrotechnic paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing a premeasured amount of black powder and an "
"equal volume of flammable metals.  When fired, burning chunks of metal and "
"sparks will shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything in their path."
msgstr "一颗纸卷弹，里面填充有预先称量好的黑火药和等量的易燃金属。击发后，燃烧的金属和火星会从枪管中射出，点燃其所及的一切物品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid "buckshot paper cartridge"
msgid_plural "buckshot paper cartridges"
msgstr[0] "纸卷猎鹿弹"

#. ~ Description of "buckshot paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing a premeasured amount of black powder and an "
"equal volume of 00 buckshot."
msgstr "一颗纸卷弹，里面填充有预先称量好的黑火药和等量的 00 号猎鹿弹弹丸。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ".62 paper cartridge"
msgid_plural ".62 paper cartridges"
msgstr[0] ".62 纸卷弹"

#. ~ Description of ".62 paper cartridge"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shotpaper.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing a premeasured amount of black powder and a .605"
" inch lead ball."
msgstr "一颗纸卷弹，里面填充有预先称量好的黑火药和一颗 .605 口径铅弹弹丸。"

#. ~ Description of "signal flare"
#: data/json/items/ammo/signal_flare.json
msgid ""
"A heavy plastic cartridge made for use in flare guns.  It appears to be a "
"modified 12 gauge shotgun shell."
msgstr "一个沉重的塑料信号弹弹药。似乎是改造自霰弹枪弹药。"

#. ~ Total range with staff sling 21 - 5 more than can be thrown by a player
#. with 10 strength
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "sling-ready Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] "投射用燃烧瓶"

#. ~ Total range with staff sling 21 - 5 more than can be thrown by a player
#. with 10 strength
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a long fuse inserted, ready to be used in "
"a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, "
"use it light the fuse.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in "
"your inventory to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""
"一瓶塞着一块长长引线的易燃液体，随时可以使用带有改进托架的弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用该物品将点燃它，当然你需要口袋里有打火机或火柴来点燃它。点燃后投掷将会引燃。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Light rag"
msgstr "点燃布条"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You light the Molotov cocktail!"
msgstr "你点燃了燃烧瓶。"

#. ~ Total range with staff sling 35 - 5 more than can be thrown by a player
#. with 10 strength
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready grenades"
msgstr[0] "投射用手雷"

#. ~ Total range with staff sling 35 - 5 more than can be thrown by a player
#. with 10 strength
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A military-grade fragmentary hand grenade, modified with a retaining fuse "
"for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without"
" a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then "
"have five seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一个军用破片手雷，随时可以使用带有改进托架的弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用此物品以拔掉插销，之后你有五秒钟的时间将它投掷出去。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "Activate grenade"
msgstr "激活"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "You snap the retaining fuse on the grenade."
msgstr "你拔掉了手雷的插销。"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投射用小型自制手雷"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from spare parts, modified "
"with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling.  To throw this item without "
"a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then "
"have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一个用各种零件拼凑成的自制手雷，用延时引信改装，随时可以使用弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用此物品以点燃引信，之后你有五秒钟的时间将它投掷出去。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready military explosive small
#. homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "sling-ready military explosive
#. homemade grenade"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "dynamite"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "dynamite bomb"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "military explosive small homemade
