"You light the retaining fuse on the improvised grenade.  Throw it before it "
"blows in your face!"
msgstr "你点燃了自制手雷的引信。赶紧在你的脸被炸掉之前扔出去！"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投射用自制手雷"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from spare parts, modified "
"with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To "
"throw this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the "
"grenade.  You will then have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would"
" be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"一个用各种零件拼凑成的自制手雷，用延时引信改装，随时可以使用带有改进托架的弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用此物品以点燃引信，之后你有五秒钟的时间将它投掷出去。"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投射用军用炸药小型自制手雷"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready military explosive small homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts, modified with a "
"retaining fuse for use in a staff sling.  To throw this item without a "
"sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have"
" some amount of time before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "一个用各种零件拼凑成的自制手雷，用延时引信改装，随时可以使用弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用此物品以点燃引信，之后你有一小段的时间将它投掷出去。"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "投射用军用炸药自制手雷"

#. ~ Same damage and ranged values as the normal grenade
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts, modified with a "
"retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw "
"this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade."
"  You will then have some amount of time before it explodes; throwing it "
"would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"一个用各种零件拼凑成的自制手雷，用延时引信改装，随时可以使用带有改进托架的弹弓发射。没有弹弓时，使用此物品以点燃引信，之后你有一小段的时间将它投掷出去。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "oxyacetylene"
msgid_plural "oxyacetylene"
msgstr[0] "氧乙炔"

#. ~ Description of "oxyacetylene"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A highly explosive fuel mixture composed of equal parts oxygen and acetylene"
" gas."
msgstr "一种高度易爆的燃料混合气体，由氧气和乙炔气按照等组分合成而成。"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 welding electrode, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm
#. of the welding seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "welding rod"
msgid_plural "welding rods"
msgstr[0] "焊条"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 welding electrode, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm
#. of the welding seam
#. ~ Description of "welding rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A length of coated welding electrode - a 3mm thick steel rod coated in a "
"special flux.  During the welding process, the hot metal of the electrode "
"fills the seam, jointing parts together while the flux protects the surface "
"of the seam from atmospheric gases and rapid cooling.  Required for arc "
"welding."
msgstr ""
"一根涂层焊条，3mm厚的钢条表面涂了特殊的助焊剂，在焊接过程中，与焊条的铁水一起填充焊缝以连接部件，同时助焊剂保护焊缝表面免受大气气体和快速冷却的影响。电弧焊接时的必需品。"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 welding electrode, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm
#. of the welding seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "aluminum welding rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding rods"
msgstr[0] "铝焊条"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 welding electrode, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm
#. of the welding seam
#. ~ Description of "aluminum welding rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A length of coated welding electrode - a 3.2mm thick aluminum rod coated in "
"a special protective flux.  Required for arc welding aluminum alloys."
msgstr "一根涂层焊条，3.2mm厚的铝条表面涂了特殊的保护剂。铝合金电弧焊接时的必需品。"

#. ~ 360 charges = 1kg spool of welding wire, 1 charge approximately
#. represents 1cm of thick welding seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "welding wire"
msgid_plural "welding wires"
msgstr[0] "焊丝"

#. ~ 360 charges = 1kg spool of welding wire, 1 charge approximately
#. represents 1cm of thick welding seam
#. ~ Description of "welding wire"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "A length of 0.8mm steel wire for MAG welding."
msgstr "一根0.8mm钢焊丝，用于熔化极活性气体保护焊。"

#. ~ 360 charges = 0.5kg spool of welding wire, 1 charge approximately
#. represents 1cm of thick welding seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "aluminum welding wire"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding wires"
msgstr[0] "铝焊丝"

#. ~ 360 charges = 0.5kg spool of welding wire, 1 charge approximately
#. represents 1cm of thick welding seam
#. ~ Description of "aluminum welding wire"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "A length of 0.9mm aluminum wire for MIG welding."
msgstr "一根0.9mm铝焊丝，用于熔化极惰性气体保护焊。"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 brazing rod, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm of
#. thick brazing seam, since brazing should have lower joining strength - we
#. use more material per 1cm of the seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "brazing rod"
msgid_plural "brazing rods"
msgstr[0] "黄铜焊条"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 brazing rod, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm of
#. thick brazing seam, since brazing should have lower joining strength - we
#. use more material per 1cm of the seam
#. ~ Description of "brazing rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "A length of 3.2mm flux-coated bronze rod, for brazing steel."
msgstr "一根涂层焊条，3.2mm厚的黄铜棒表面涂了特殊的助焊剂，用于钢黄铜感应钎焊。"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 brazing rod, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm of
#. thick brazing seam, since brazing should have lower joining strength - we
#. use more material per 1cm of the seam
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid "aluminum brazing rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum brazing rods"
msgstr[0] "铝黄铜焊条"

#. ~ 10 charges = 1 brazing rod, 1 charge approximately represents 1cm of
#. thick brazing seam, since brazing should have lower joining strength - we
#. use more material per 1cm of the seam
#. ~ Description of "aluminum brazing rod"
#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
msgid ""
"A length of 3.2mm aluminum rod, for brazing aluminum alloys.  Also suitable "
"for TIG welding."
msgstr "一根3.2mm厚的铝黄铜焊条，用于铝合金焊接，也可以用于非熔化极惰性气体保护焊。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "strange pressure"
msgid_plural "strange pressures"
msgstr[0] "莫名压力"

#. ~ Description of "strange pressure"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "You feel a strange force pressing you inwards and inside-out."
msgstr "你感到一股莫名的力量将你向内挤压翻卷。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "temporal distortion"
msgid_plural "temporal distortions"
msgstr[0] "时间扭曲"

#. ~ Description of "temporal distortion"
#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
msgid "A slight temporal distortion appears to be centered around you."
msgstr "你周围的时空似乎略微扭曲了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
msgid "ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "子弹袋"

#. ~ Description of "ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be used to store most types of small ammunition; "
"rockets, however, will not fit.  Use insert to store ammunition."
msgstr "一个小袋子，可以用来存储大多数的小型弹药，但是装不下火箭弹。使用它来存储弹药。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "ammo satchel"
msgid_plural "ammo satchels"
msgstr[0] "弹匣包（腰）"

#. ~ Description of "ammo satchel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a single "
"large magazine close at hand."
msgstr "一个绑在腰上的弹匣包。可装一个大型弹匣，保证能随手取用。"

#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "ammo satchel"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "chest ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "chest rig"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "javelin bag"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "ankle ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "leg ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "tac vest"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "leather ammo satchel"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "leather chest ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "large grenade pouch"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "combat wetsuit"
#. ~ "holster_msg" action message of item "HERC rig"
