msgid "pair of tire arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of tire arm guards"
msgstr[0] "轮胎护臂"

#. ~ Description of "pair of tire arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards made from thick chunks of tire secured by simple "
