#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight black vest used by private security, covering the chest and "
"most of the abdomen.  Soft armor plates sealed inside the fabric provide "
"solid defense against shrapnel and small-caliber rounds.  \"SECURITY\" is "
"emblazoned on the front lapel and across the back, and it features a pocket "
"for a notebook and pen."
msgstr ""
"一件轻便的黑色背心，由私人保安使用，覆盖了胸部和大部分腹部。密封在织物中的内部软装甲板让这件背心能够抵挡弹片和小口径枪支的射击。前翻领和后翻领上都印着“保安”字样，还有一个放笔记本和笔的口袋。"

