#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"Bright blue in color, this slim armor vest was used by volunteers and "
"officials from humanitarian groups during the first days of the Cataclysm "
"before order broke down completely.  \"FEMA\" is written on the front lapel "
"and across the back."
msgstr "一件轻薄的亮蓝色防弹背心，在秩序完全失控的大灾变发生前，曾被志愿者和人道救援组织的官员使用。前翻领和后翻领上都印着“FEMA”字样。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
