msgid "rain hood"
msgid_plural "rain hoods"
msgstr[0] "雨帽"

#. ~ Description of "rain hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A waterproof hood made to be worn in bad weather."
msgstr "一件天气不好时穿戴的防水兜帽。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "flame-resistant hood"
msgid_plural "flame-resistant hoods"
msgstr[0] "防火兜帽"

#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid ""
"A snug fitting garment that protects your head and neck, made from "
"lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric.  Tough yet breathable, it is light "
"and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr "一件能保护你头部和颈部的贴身服装，由很轻的芳纶防火织物制成。结实又透气，穿在其他衣服下既轻便又舒适。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "gutskin hood"
msgid_plural "gutskin hoods"
msgstr[0] "肠衣兜帽"

#. ~ Description of "gutskin hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid ""
"A hood sewn from treated and split intestines, the perfect companion for a "
"gutskin parka."
msgstr "一件用处理过的割开的动物肠衣制成的兜帽，是爱斯基摩肠制大衣的完美伴侣。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "ninja hood"
msgid_plural "ninja hoods"
msgstr[0] "忍者兜帽"

#. ~ Description of "ninja hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "A black hood commonly used by ninja."
msgstr "一条忍者常用的黑色兜帽。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "phelloderm"
msgid_plural "phelloderms"
msgstr[0] "软木皮层"

#. ~ Description of "phelloderm"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A pliable but hefty layer of living plant matter."
msgstr "一层柔软而厚重的活植物物质。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "protective bark"
msgid_plural "protective bark"
msgstr[0] "防护树皮"

#. ~ Description of "protective bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "A powerful layer of bark, thicker in parts."
msgstr "一层强大的树皮，局部比较厚。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "distributed bark"
msgid_plural "distributed bark"
msgstr[0] "分布树皮"

#. ~ Description of "distributed bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your bark is spread evenly across your body."
msgstr "你的树皮均匀地散布在全身。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "consolidated bark"
msgid_plural "consolidated bark"
msgstr[0] "固结树皮"

#. ~ Description of "consolidated bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your bark is pulled together to protect your torso."
msgstr "你的树皮被固结在一起以保护你的躯干。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "latticed bark"
msgid_plural "latticed bark"
msgstr[0] "网状树皮"

#. ~ Description of "latticed bark"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your bark is latticed into a larger frame."
msgstr "你的树皮连接成网格形成一个更大的框架。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "light fur"
msgid_plural "light fur"
msgstr[0] "轻薄毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "light fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Thin, patchy fur that clearly needs to grow more."
msgstr "薄而斑驳的毛皮，显然仍然需要更多得生长。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "fur"
msgid_plural "fur"
msgstr[0] "毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Though it's quite warm, your fur is also quite protective."
msgstr "虽然很保暖，但皮毛同样具有保护作用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "shaggy fur"
msgid_plural "shaggy furs"
msgstr[0] "浓密毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "shaggy fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A heavy shag carpet of fur, somewhere between a ballistic vest and attic "
"insulation."
msgstr "一层厚厚的毛绒地毯，强度介于防弹背心和阁楼保温棉之间。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "gray fur"
msgid_plural "gray furs"
msgstr[0] "灰色毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "gray fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The fur of a strong, wild creature."
msgstr "一种强壮的野生动物的毛皮。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sleek fur"
msgid_plural "sleek furs"
msgstr[0] "光滑毛皮"

#. ~ Description of "sleek fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The fur of a proud, wise creature."
msgstr "一种骄傲的智慧动物的毛皮。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "lynx fur"
msgid_plural "lynx furs"
msgstr[0] "猞猁皮毛"

#. ~ Description of "lynx fur"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A pile of fur around the neck, protecting from foes that go for the throat."
msgstr "脖子周围围着一圈毛皮，用来保护喉部免受敌人的攻击。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "jumbled skin"
msgid_plural "jumbled skins"
msgstr[0] "杂乱皮肤"

#. ~ Description of "jumbled skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Skin like a spilled tub of paints, splattered in abstract shapes of scales, "
"fur, and leather."
msgstr "皮肤就像一桶被泼洒出的油漆，溅成一滩滩鳞片、毛皮和皮革的抽象形状。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "patchwork skin"
msgid_plural "patchwork skins"
msgstr[0] "斑驳皮肤"

#. ~ Description of "patchwork skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Beauty is only skin deep, but with this skin, a knife might find itself "
"broken in the beauty layer."
msgstr "说它美貌过于肤浅，但有了这层皮肤，一把刀可能在美貌层就已经被折断。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "patchwork armor"
msgid_plural "patchwork armor"
msgstr[0] "斑驳护甲"

#. ~ Description of "patchwork armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Folks that can't catch bullets with their skin insist that it's what's on "
"the inside that counts.  Those folks don't know anything."
msgstr "那些不能用皮肤挡住子弹的人坚持认为，重要的是内在美。那些人什么都不懂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "mandibles"
msgid_plural "mandibles"
msgstr[0] "虫颚"

#. ~ Description of "mandibles"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "These are much better than puny human mouthparts."
msgstr "这些比人类的小口器要强得多。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "folding fangs"
msgid_plural "folding fangs"
msgstr[0] "伸縮毒牙"

#. ~ Description of "folding fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your fangs have properly developed, and are prepared for the kill."
msgstr "毒牙已经伸出，做好了杀戮的准备。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "epicuticle"
msgid_plural "epicuticles"
msgstr[0] "上表皮层"

#. ~ Description of "epicuticle"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "This skin is much better.  You could get used to this one."
msgstr "这种皮肤要强大得多。你可以习惯这个。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "chitin carapace"
msgid_plural "chitin carapaces"
msgstr[0] "甲壳外壳"

#. ~ Description of "chitin carapace"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "The skin hardens, develops.  Good, it will be needed."
msgstr "皮肤变硬、发育。很好，这能派上用场。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sclerotin plate"
msgid_plural "sclerotin plate"
msgstr[0] "骨质铠甲"

#. ~ Description of "sclerotin plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"When the time comes to prey, this platemail will be ready for any "
"resistance."
msgstr "等到了捕猎的时候，这个骨甲将做好面对任何抵抗的准备。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sclerotin claws"
msgid_plural "sclerotin claws"
msgstr[0] "骨爪"

#. ~ Description of "sclerotin claws"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Useful for the hunt, suitable for maximum efficiency."
msgstr "适合猎杀，适合效率最大化。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "shell"
msgid_plural "shell"
msgstr[0] "龟壳"

#. ~ Description of "shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"You have a large, protective shell on your back, but unfortunately, it "
"doesn't have enough space to fit inside or store anything, makes wearing "
"anything on your torso impossible, and makes backpacks encumbering."
msgstr "你的背上有一个巨大的保护壳，但不幸的是，它没有足够的空间容纳或存放物品，而且它让你无法在躯干上穿任何东西，并使得背包变得更累赘了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "roomy shell"
msgid_plural "roomy shell"
msgstr[0] "大龟壳"

#. ~ Description of "roomy shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your shell has grown larger and thicker.  You can hide yourself in it, as "
"well as use it as a backpack, but torso armor is still off limits."
msgstr "你的壳变得更大更厚。你可以将自己隐藏在其中，也可以将其用作背包，但显然没法带着这东西穿上躯干护甲。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "nacreous shell"
msgid_plural "nacreous shell"
msgstr[0] "珠质外壳"

#. ~ Description of "nacreous shell"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Your shell has grown larger and even thicker, and has a pearly sheen to it."
"  You can hide yourself in it, as well as use it as a backpack, but torso "
"armor is still off limits."
msgstr "你的贝壳变得甚至比先前更大，更厚，并且有珍珠般的光泽。你可以将自己隐藏在其中，也可以将其用作背包，但还是没法带着这东西穿上躯干护甲。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sparse scales"
msgid_plural "sparse scales"
msgstr[0] "稀疏鳞甲"

#. ~ Description of "sparse scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your dermis has toughened and started to grow scales in places."
msgstr "你的真皮层已经变硬，并开始在一些地方长出鳞片。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "sleek scales"
msgid_plural "sleek scales"
msgstr[0] "光滑鳞甲"

#. ~ Description of "sleek scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "Your skin has become a smooth and elegant mesh of interlocking scales."
msgstr "你的皮肤已经变成了一层光滑而优雅，网状交错着的鳞片。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "thick scales"
msgid_plural "thick scales"
msgstr[0] "厚重鳞甲"

#. ~ Description of "thick scales"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Leathery and heavily armored, your lamellar skin has toughened for the "
"fiercest battles ahead."
msgstr "鳞片覆盖了你像革一样坚韧的皮肤，并为将来最激烈的战斗变得又厚又硬。"

#. ~ These do not preclude wearing glasses, but you'll get double-up
#. penalties.  If you really needed to you could likely still situate the
#. lenses in front of them.  You should probably just augment your eyes
#. though.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "protective lenses"
msgid_plural "protective lenses"
msgstr[0] "防护镜片"

#. ~ These do not preclude wearing glasses, but you'll get double-up
#. penalties.  If you really needed to you could likely still situate the
#. lenses in front of them.  You should probably just augment your eyes
#. though.
#. ~ Description of "protective lenses"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"Highly protective lenses which seal off your eyes from danger, routing your "
"tear ducts to your mouth."
msgstr "高性能的防护镜片，可保护你的眼睛免受伤害，并且将你的泪管引导至口中。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid "subdermal carbon filament"
msgid_plural "subdermal carbon filament"
msgstr[0] "皮下碳纤维层"

#. ~ Description of "subdermal carbon filament"
#: data/json/items/armor/integrated.json
msgid ""
"A layer of thin carbon nanotubes implanted in your skin.  Helps protect your"
" vitals from laceration."
msgstr "一层薄薄的碳纳米管植入你的皮肤，保护你的关键身体部位免受撕裂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "beaded bracelet"
msgid_plural "beaded bracelets"
msgstr[0] "串珠手镯"

#. ~ Description of "beaded bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A simple bracelet of string and wooden beads.  Also doubles as a set of "
"prayer beads, if you're so inclined."
msgstr "一根由线和木头珠子制成的简单手链。也可当做念珠使用，如果你想的话。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "pair of beaded earrings"
msgid_plural "pairs of beaded earrings"
msgstr[0] "串珠耳环"

#. ~ Description of "pair of beaded earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple pair of earrings made of string and wooden beads."
msgstr "一对由线和木头珠子制成的简单耳环。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "beaded necklace"
msgid_plural "beaded necklaces"
msgstr[0] "串珠项链"

#. ~ Description of "beaded necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A simple necklace made of string and wooden beads.  Also doubles as a set of"
" prayer beads, if you're so inclined."
msgstr "一根由线和木头珠子制成的简单项链。也可以当做念珠使用，如果你想的话。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "friendship bracelet"
msgid_plural "friendship bracelets"
msgstr[0] "友谊手链"

#. ~ Description of "friendship bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A homemade bracelet crafted from colorful knickknacks.  It's not very "
"expensive, but it's the effort that makes it special."
msgstr "一根用五颜六色的小装饰品制成的自制手链。不是很值钱，但是礼轻情义重。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "bronze medal"
msgid_plural "bronze medals"
msgstr[0] "铜奖牌"

#. ~ Description of "bronze medal"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A medal awarded for achieving third place in some event.  It might be worth "
"something if it was made of bronze; this one is made from iron."
msgstr "一块授予某个赛事第三名的奖牌。如果真是铜制的还能值些钱，但是这个是用铁做的。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "diamond dental grill"
msgid_plural "diamond dental grills"
msgstr[0] "钻石假牙"

#. ~ Description of "diamond dental grill"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Fake teeth inlaid with diamonds, worn over the teeth.  Fits horribly, but "
"looks very shiny.  For that high-class gangsta rap look."
msgstr ""
"一颗镶有钻石的假牙，套在牙齿上。带上很不舒服，但是异常的闪亮耀眼。穿上后很有高级帮派说唱歌手的风格。\n"
"\"嘻哈音乐在本世纪三十年代已经被灭绝。\""

