msgid "diamond and gold ring"
msgid_plural "diamond and gold rings"
msgstr[0] "钻石金戒指"

#. ~ Description of "diamond and gold ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A gold ring with a sparkling diamond mounted on top of it.  Back in the old "
"days, this could have been worth a fortune."
msgstr "一个金戒指，顶部有一颗闪光的钻石，在大灾变之前可以值很大一笔钱。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "diver's watch"
msgid_plural "diver's watches"
msgstr[0] "潜水表"

#. ~ Description of "diver's watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A waterproof, self-winding watch on a stainless steel watchband.  Tells the "
"time and current temperature.  Activate to check the digital thermometer."
msgstr "一块防水的自动发条手表，不锈钢表带。在水中也可以查看时间和温度。使用它来查看数字温度计。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "collar pin"
msgid_plural "collar pins"
msgstr[0] "领针"

#. ~ Description of "collar pin"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A staple accessory for gentlemen.  Keeps your shirt collar in place and "
"provides a more aesthetically pleasing arc to your necktie."
msgstr "一件绅士的小配件。用于固定领带在衬衫上的位置，使你的领带有更优雅的弧线。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "copper bracelet"
msgid_plural "copper bracelets"
msgstr[0] "铜手镯"

#. ~ Description of "copper bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "An old-fashioned copper bracelet."
msgstr "一个样式过时的铜制手镯。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "pair of copper earrings"
msgid_plural "pairs of copper earrings"
msgstr[0] "铜耳环"

#. ~ Description of "pair of copper earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A pair of copper earrings.  They're pretty heavy."
msgstr "一对挺沉的铜耳环。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "copper hairpin"
msgid_plural "copper hairpins"
msgstr[0] "铜发夹"

#. ~ Description of "copper hairpin"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A hairpin made from copper."
msgstr "一只铜制的发夹。"

#. ~ Item name
