"An expensive pair of silver cufflinks, stylized with detailed overlays of "
"gold gears and fractal patterns."
msgstr "一对昂贵的银制袖扣，上面刻着齿轮和分形的精细艺术图案。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
