#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "gold bracelet"
msgid_plural "gold bracelets"
msgstr[0] "金手镯"

#. ~ Description of "gold bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A fancy golden bracelet."
msgstr "一个时髦的金手镯。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "gold dental grill"
msgid_plural "gold dental grills"
msgstr[0] "金假牙"

#. ~ Description of "gold dental grill"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Fake golden teeth, worn over the teeth.  Fits horribly, but looks very "
"shiny."
msgstr "一颗金色假牙，套在牙齿上。带上很不舒服，但是异常的闪亮耀眼。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "pair of gold earrings"
msgid_plural "pairs of gold earrings"
msgstr[0] "金耳环"

#. ~ Description of "pair of gold earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A pair of shiny gold earrings."
msgstr "一对闪亮的金耳环。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "gold hairpin"
msgid_plural "gold hairpins"
msgstr[0] "金发夹"

#. ~ Description of "gold hairpin"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A gold hairpin, designed by the rich, for the rich."
msgstr "一根纯金发夹，专为富人设计的奢侈品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "gold locket"
msgid_plural "gold lockets"
msgstr[0] "金质盒式吊坠"

#. ~ Description of "gold locket"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A heart-shaped gold locket with a frame inside to store photographs or small"
" objects."
msgstr "一条心形的金质盒式小吊坠，有一个可以存放照片或其他小物件的夹层。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "gold medal"
msgid_plural "gold medals"
msgstr[0] "金质奖章"

#. ~ Description of "gold medal"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A medal awarded for achieving first place in some event.  Before everything "
"fell apart, this was likely a source of great pride for its owner.  Now it's"
" just another shiny bauble."
msgstr "一块某个活动的冠军奖章。在过去的一切分崩离析之前，它是它主人自傲的本钱，然而现在它只是一个闪闪发光的小玩意。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "service medal"
msgid_plural "service medals"
msgstr[0] "服役勋章"

#. ~ Description of "service medal"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A medal awarded to military personnel for heroism, wounds suffered in "
"combat, or distinguished service."
msgstr "授予英雄主义、战中负伤或功绩杰出军人的勋章。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "gold necklace"
msgid_plural "gold necklaces"
msgstr[0] "金项链"

#. ~ Description of "gold necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A shiny, unadorned gold necklace."
msgstr "一串闪亮的纯金项链。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "gold ring"
msgid_plural "gold rings"
msgstr[0] "金戒指"

#. ~ Description of "gold ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A flashy gold ring."
msgstr "一个华丽的金戒指。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "gold watch"
msgid_plural "gold watches"
msgstr[0] "金表"

#. ~ Description of "gold watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A gold-plated steel self-winding wristwatch, suitable for a retirement "
"present.  Tells the time and looks good."
msgstr "一块镀金的自动发条手表，适合作为退休礼物送人。能够看时间并且很美观。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "tie clip"
msgid_plural "tie clips"
msgstr[0] "领带夹"

#. ~ Description of "tie clip"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A fancy silver tie clip, a great match for a necktie."
msgstr "一枚样式时髦的银色领带夹，看上去和你的窄领带很配。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "silver watch"
msgid_plural "silver watches"
msgstr[0] "银表"

#. ~ Description of "silver watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"An elegant silver watch, crafted from silver-plated stainless steel.  It's "
"much cheaper than other metal watches, but more classy than an ordinary "
"wristwatch."
msgstr "一只优美的银表，由镀银的不锈钢制成。比其它金属表便宜，但是比普通腕表更有逼格。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "silver bracelet"
msgid_plural "silver bracelets"
msgstr[0] "银手镯"

#. ~ Description of "silver bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A nice silver bracelet."
msgstr "一个漂亮的银手镯。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "pair of silver earrings"
msgid_plural "pairs of silver earrings"
msgstr[0] "银耳环"

#. ~ Description of "pair of silver earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A pair of beautiful silver earrings."
msgstr "一对漂亮的银耳环。"

#. ~ That's about the midpoint for a rolex.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "fancy watch"
msgid_plural "fancy watches"
msgstr[0] "名贵手表"

#. ~ That's about the midpoint for a rolex.
#. ~ Description of "fancy watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A rather large and expensively-made wristwatch.  Tells the time in elegantly"
" wrought gold with silver detailing.  It's really the only timepiece "
"suitable for someone of your exquisitely discerning tastes."
msgstr ""
"一块奢华、高档的腕表。上面采用优雅精致的金银装饰告诉你当前的时间。适合拥有极度挑剔品味的成功人士。\n"
"\"曾经犹豫过很久也没买的手表，如今就这样免费得到了，事实证明我是一个极富远见的成功人士。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "small relic"
msgid_plural "small relics"
msgstr[0] "小巧圣物"

#. ~ Description of "small relic"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A small relic from a forgotten saint.  As extraordinary as the world has "
"become, it may have some power yet."
msgstr "一件发掘自被遗忘的某圣地的小巧圣物。既然世界已经发生了如此巨变，也许它也蕴藏着某种不同寻常的力量。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "holy symbol"
msgid_plural "holy symbols"
msgstr[0] "圣徽项链"

#. ~ Description of "holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A necklace made of fine gold chain, bearing the symbol of a forgotten faith."
msgstr "一条用细密金链打造的金项链，有着一个被遗忘的信仰的徽记。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "handmade holy symbol"
msgid_plural "handmade holy symbols"
msgstr[0] "自制圣徽项链"

#. ~ Description of "handmade holy symbol"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple necklace representing a religious faith."
msgstr "一个简单朴素的木制项链，有着一个被遗忘的信仰的徽记。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "jade brooch"
msgid_plural "jade brooches"
msgstr[0] "翡翠胸针"

#. ~ Description of "jade brooch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A hand-crafted jade brooch of Oriental origin."
msgstr "一个手工制作的远东风格的翡翠胸针。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "pearl collar"
msgid_plural "pearl collars"
msgstr[0] "珍珠项链"

#. ~ Description of "pearl collar"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A collar made from round and lustrous pearls, its former owner must have "
"been a wealthy individual."
msgstr "一条由光彩迷人的浑圆珍珠制成的项链，它的前主人一定是个有钱人吧。"

#. ~ far more expensive than gold watches, around $100,000 for most platinum
#. watches
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "platinum watch"
msgid_plural "platinum watches"
msgstr[0] "铂金表"

#. ~ far more expensive than gold watches, around $100,000 for most platinum
#. watches
#. ~ Description of "platinum watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Flex on those gold-watch wearers with this rare, expensive, and superior "
"platinum watch.  This one is made from solid platinum."
msgstr "戴上这只昂贵罕见的铂金手表，那些戴金表的人只会相形见绌。这可是纯铂金的！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
msgid "platinum bracelet"
msgid_plural "platinum bracelets"
msgstr[0] "铂金手镯"

#. ~ Description of "platinum bracelet"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A flawless platinum bracelet."
msgstr "一只完美无瑕的铂金手镯。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "platinum dental grill"
msgid_plural "platinum dental grills"
msgstr[0] "铂金假牙"

#. ~ Description of "platinum dental grill"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Fake platinum-and-silver teeth.  They may be cheaper than fake gold teeth, "
"but they're much more rare.  Fits horribly, but looks very shiny."
msgstr "一颗铂金假牙。比金牙便宜，但是更加罕有。戴上很不舒服，但是非常闪亮耀眼。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "pair of platinum earrings"
msgid_plural "pairs of platinum earrings"
msgstr[0] "铂金耳环"

#. ~ Description of "pair of platinum earrings"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A pair of plain platinum earrings - if gold is getting boring, just use "
"another rare metal."
msgstr "一对纯铂金耳环——如果纯金的看起来太俗，就换一种贵重金属。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "platinum hairpin"
msgid_plural "platinum hairpins"
msgstr[0] "铂金发夹"

#. ~ Description of "platinum hairpin"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"The ultimate in esoteric, metal hair accessories, this hairpin is made from "
"pure platinum."
msgstr "一根由纯铂金制成的发夹，金属头饰中常人难懂的品味极致。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "platinum locket"
msgid_plural "platinum lockets"
msgstr[0] "铂金质盒式吊坠"

#. ~ Description of "platinum locket"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A small, platinum locket for storing photographs or other small objects."
msgstr "一条铂金的盒式小吊坠，用于存放照片或其它小物件。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "platinum necklace"
msgid_plural "platinum necklaces"
msgstr[0] "铂金项链"

#. ~ Description of "platinum necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A platinum necklace, with a small, empty heart-shaped frame hanging from a "
"chain."
msgstr "一串铂金项链，上面用一根链条挂着一个心形的小盒子。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "platinum ring"
msgid_plural "platinum rings"
msgstr[0] "铂金戒指"

#. ~ Description of "platinum ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A platinum ring, engraved with all manner of swirls and spirals."
msgstr "一只铂金戒指，上面刻着各种漩涡和螺旋花纹。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "engagement ring"
msgid_plural "engagement rings"
msgstr[0] "订婚戒指"

#. ~ Description of "engagement ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"This ring is an intricate gold band with a small cluster of diamonds set in "
"the center.  Before the world broke down, this ring would've cost a small "
"fortune."
msgstr "这枚戒指由一条复杂的金带扭成，中间镶嵌了一小簇钻石。在旧世界坍塌之前，你要花上不小的一笔财富才能买到它。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "purity ring"
msgid_plural "purity rings"
msgstr[0] "贞洁戒指"

#. ~ Description of "purity ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Also known as a promise ring, this ring is worn as a sign of chastity.  This"
" one bears the inscription, \"Love is patient.\""
msgstr ""
"也被称作承诺戒指或恋爱戒指，情侣通常戴上它来表明自己的洁身自好。\n"
"这枚戒指上镌刻着铭文：“爱是恒久忍耐。（注：《新约圣经》林前 13:4--8）”"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "signet ring"
msgid_plural "signet rings"
msgstr[0] "图章戒指"

#. ~ Description of "signet ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A gold and silver ring with a wide stamp attached to the band.  A long time "
"ago, the stamp was legible, but now the pattern is too worn to discern its "
"former use."
msgstr "一枚金银制成的戒指，上面连接着一个宽大的印章。印章很久以前曾经清晰可辨，但是现在已经磨损严重，看不出过去的用途了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "wedding ring"
msgid_plural "wedding rings"
msgstr[0] "结婚戒指"

#. ~ Description of "wedding ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A flawless ring, ensnaring a diamond with twists of pure gold.  It's a "
"constant reminder that the wearer is married."
msgstr "一枚无瑕的戒指，中间用缠结的纯金线嵌住一颗钻石。这是它的佩戴者已经结婚成家的长久证明。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "silver necklace"
msgid_plural "silver necklaces"
msgstr[0] "银项链"

#. ~ Description of "silver necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A nice silver necklace."
msgstr "一条漂亮的银项链。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "silver hairpin"
msgid_plural "silver hairpins"
msgstr[0] "银发夹"

#. ~ Description of "silver hairpin"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A shiny silver hairpin with a tiny bee engraved onto it."
msgstr "一只闪耀的银发夹，上面刻着一只小蜜蜂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "silver locket"
msgid_plural "silver lockets"
msgstr[0] "银质盒式吊坠"

#. ~ Description of "silver locket"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A small silver locket with a frame inside to store photographs or small "
"objects."
msgstr "一条银质的盒式小吊坠，有一个可以存放照片或其他小物件的夹层。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "silver medal"
msgid_plural "silver medals"
msgstr[0] "银奖牌"

#. ~ Description of "silver medal"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A medal awarded for achieving second place in some event.  Before everything"
" fell apart, this was likely a source of pride for its owner.  Now it's just"
" another shiny bauble."
msgstr "一块授予某个赛事第二名的奖牌。在世界末日前这会是它主人的骄傲，事到如今它只是一个闪光的装饰品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "silver ring"
msgid_plural "silver rings"
msgstr[0] "银戒指"

#. ~ Description of "silver ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A simple, silver ring."
msgstr "一只简单的银戒指。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "leather collar"
msgid_plural "leather collars"
msgstr[0] "皮项圈"

#. ~ Description of "leather collar"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A black leather 'collar' with a bell dangling from the front.  Don't worry, "
"the bell is silent."
msgstr "一个黑色皮革的项圈，前面挂了一个不会发出声音的装饰铃铛，非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "wrist watch"
msgid_plural "wrist watches"
msgstr[0] "腕表"

#. ~ Description of "wrist watch"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A simple wristwatch on a plastic band.  Tells the time and has an alarm "
"clock feature."
msgstr ""
"一个款式简约的腕表，表带是塑料材质。可以计时，还有闹钟功能。\n"
"\"即便灾变后的世界只有无尽黑夜（Dark days Ahead），但有一个手表还能提醒你黎明还有多远。\""

#. ~ These seem to be sold via subscription; makes a certain amount of sense,
#. but low-bid seems a Bad Idea.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "radiation badge"
msgid_plural "radiation badges"
msgstr[0] "辐射侦测徽章"

#. ~ These seem to be sold via subscription; makes a certain amount of sense,
#. but low-bid seems a Bad Idea.
#. ~ Description of "radiation badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A plastic badge with an embedded filmstrip.  The filmstrip changes color as "
"it is exposed to radiation.  Wear on your lapel so you can notice if it "
"changes."
msgstr "一块佩戴在胸前、嵌入了检测辐射剂量的色条的徽章，如果有辐射就会通过变色来提醒你。将它穿在身上就能看到它的颜色是否变化。"

#. ~ should cover TORSO but give no encumbrance penalties
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "badge template"
msgid_plural "badge templates"
msgstr[0] "徽章模板"

#. ~ should cover TORSO but give no encumbrance penalties
#. ~ Description of "badge template"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"This is a template for police/medical badges.  If found in a game, it is a "
"bug."
msgstr "这是警察/医疗徽章的模板。在游戏中找到它说明bug了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "cybercop badge"
msgid_plural "cybercop badges"
msgstr[0] "生化警官徽章"

#. ~ Description of "cybercop badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A chromed silver shield identifies the wearer as an authority even the cop-"
"killers couldn't kill."
msgstr "一个镀铬的银制盾形徽记，标志着佩戴者是个警察杀手都动不了的警界威权人士。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "deputy badge"
msgid_plural "deputy badges"
msgstr[0] "副官勋章"

#. ~ Description of "deputy badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A tarnished silver star gives an air of authority to the wearer."
msgstr "一只失去光泽的银色星形徽章，标志着佩戴者是名维护法律与治安的警员。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "detective badge"
msgid_plural "detective badges"
msgstr[0] "警探徽章"

#. ~ Description of "detective badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A tarnished golden shield gives an air of authority to the wearer."
msgstr "一只失去光泽的金色盾形徽章，标志着佩戴者是名刑侦警探。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "marshal badge"
msgid_plural "marshal badges"
msgstr[0] "执法官徽章"

#. ~ Description of "marshal badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "A bright silver star strikes fear into the eyes of ne'er-do-wells."
msgstr ""
"一只闪亮的星形徽章，标志着佩戴者是名执法官。\n"
"\"耀眼的光芒直刺恶徒恐惧的双眼。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "SWAT badge"
msgid_plural "SWAT badges"
msgstr[0] "SWAT徽章"

#. ~ Description of "SWAT badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A matte-finish silver shield identifies the wearer as an authority who goes "
"in when the bots just aren't enough."
msgstr "一个亚光处理的银制盾牌状徽记，标志着佩戴者是名在情况恶化到机器人警察都无法应对时出现的S.W.A.T单位成员。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "doctor badge"
msgid_plural "doctor badges"
msgstr[0] "医生徽章"

#. ~ Description of "doctor badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A plastic name tag marking the wearer as a real doctor of the medical kind."
msgstr "一种塑料名牌，标明佩戴者是真正的医生。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "Foodkid badge"
msgid_plural "Foodkid badges"
msgstr[0] "美食小子徽章"

#. ~ Description of "Foodkid badge"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A star-shaped plastic badge.  \"Foodkid\" is printed on it in bold letters."
"  This badge marks its wearer as Foodperson's trusty sidekick, and comes "
"included with every kid's meal at Foodplace."
msgstr "一个星形的塑料徽章，上面用粗体字写着“美食小子”。这是深受美食侠™信赖的模范助手所佩戴的徽章，并且包含在每份美食广场™的儿童套餐之中。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid "pair of fuzzy cat ears"
msgid_plural "pairs of fuzzy cat ears"
msgstr[0] "毛绒猫耳"

#. ~ Description of "pair of fuzzy cat ears"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"A fuzzy pair of brownish cat ears on a headband.  It does nothing, but "
"there's no reason not to look good even if no one's looking."
msgstr "一对毛茸茸的褐色猫耳头带，非常可爱，引\"人\"注目。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
