msgstr "一件白色的日式短裤，一般为习武者穿戴。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "hiking pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of hiking pants"
msgstr[0] "登山裤"

#. ~ Description of "hiking pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A water-resistant pair of lightweight, flexible hiking pants with a good "
"number of pockets."
msgstr "一条防水的轻便灵活的登山裤，口袋数量不少。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "balaclava"
msgid_plural "balaclavas"
msgstr[0] "面罩"

#. ~ Description of "balaclava"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A warm covering that protects the head and face from the cold."
msgstr ""
"一个只露出眼睛与嘴部、非常暖和的棉制头部面罩。\n"
"\"严肃点，严肃点。不许笑，我们这打劫呢！\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "skull balaclava"
msgid_plural "skull balaclavas"
msgstr[0] "骷髅面罩"

#. ~ Description of "skull balaclava"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A skull-print balaclava covering the head and face, commonly used by "
"motorcycle riders and as part of a costume."
msgstr "一条覆盖头部和面部的骷髅头骨图案的面罩，通常用于摩托车骑手，或是COS服装的一部分。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "cut-resistant balaclava"
msgid_plural "cut-resistant balaclavas"
msgstr[0] "防切割面罩"

#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant balaclava"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
