msgstr[0] "骨钉皮革牛铠"

#. ~ Description of "boiled leather cow barding with bones"
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_cow_armor.json
msgid ""
"Decorative bones affixed to leather cow barding to invoke fear in bandits "
