"A type of headdress traditionally used in the Middle East.  It can be used "
"in different ways to protect the head and mouth from the elements."
msgstr "一条阿拉伯国家男子普遍穿戴的头巾，沙漠坏境产物，夏季遮阳防晒，冬天御寒保暖，有着多种戴法。"

