msgid_plural "simple patchwork scarves"
msgstr[0] "布块围巾"

#. ~ Description of "simple patchwork scarf"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid ""
"A simple and light cloth scarf, worn over the mouth for warmth.  Use it to "
"loosen it if you get too warm."
msgstr "简单轻便的布围巾，围在嘴上提供保暖。如果太热了，使用它来绑松些吧。"

