msgstr[0] "锁环甲（回火碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "tempered steel chainmail armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A fully customized tempered steel chainmail suit.  Combine with a gambeson "
"or other padded layer for optimal protection."
msgstr "一套自制的完整回火碳钢链甲套装。与软铠或其他内衬一同穿着，能够提供最佳保护。"

