msgstr[0] "豪华圣诞连衣裙"

#. ~ Description of "luxury santa dress"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A long red dress with full sleeves and white faux fur trim.  A very fancy "
"dress for a queen of the north pole."
msgstr "一条装饰着白色人造毛皮的红色长袖连衣裙。这是适合北极女王的更时髦的版型。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "short santa dress"
msgid_plural "short santa dresses"
msgstr[0] "圣诞短裙"

#. ~ Description of "short santa dress"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short red dress with white faux fur trim.  Looks like something Mrs. Claus"
" might wear on Christmas night."
msgstr "一件装饰着白色人造毛皮的红色短裙。看起来像是圣诞夫人会在圣诞夜穿的衣服。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "sheriff's shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "sheriff's shirt"
msgid_plural "sheriff's shirts"
msgstr[0] "警长衬衫"

#. ~ Description of "sheriff's shirt"
#. ~ Description of variant "sheriff's shirt" of item "sheriff's shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A tan button-down shirt with long sleeves."
msgstr "一件常见于郡县治安官们的棕褐色长袖纽扣衬衫，上面印有当地治安部门的标志。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "sheriff's shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "SWAT shirt"
msgid_plural "SWAT shirts"
msgstr[0] "SWAT衬衫"

#. ~ Description of variant "SWAT shirt" of item "sheriff's shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A charcoal button-down shirt with long sleeves.  Has a patch with the word "
"\"SWAT\" affixed on one shoulder."
msgstr "一件炭黑色长袖纽扣领衬衫。肩上贴着一块补丁，上面写着“SWAT”。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "grass shirt"
msgid_plural "grass shirts"
msgstr[0] "草衣"

#. ~ Description of "grass shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A crude and bulky short-sleeved shirt woven from grass.  Definitely not the "
"most comfortable thing to wear."
msgstr "一件粗糙而笨重的短袖衬衫，由草编织而成。绝对不是最舒服的衣服。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "sinister dress"
msgid_plural "sinister dresses"
msgstr[0] "邪恶连衣裙"

#. ~ Description of "sinister dress"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A long black and red dress with full sleeves, a collar, and embroidery "
"reminiscent of a vampire duchess."
msgstr "一件黑色和红色长袖连衣裙，领子和刺绣图案让人想起吸血鬼公爵夫人。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "short sinister dress"
msgid_plural "short sinister dresses"
msgstr[0] "邪恶短连衣裙"

#. ~ Description of "short sinister dress"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A short red dress made in gothic lolita fashion."
msgstr "一件哥特洛丽塔风格的红色短连衣裙。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "sinister gown"
msgid_plural "sinister gowns"
msgstr[0] "邪恶礼服"

#. ~ Description of "sinister gown"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A red and black gown with full sleeves.  It has a gothic style and looks "
"pretty luxurious."
msgstr "一件红黑色长袖礼服。哥特风，看起来很奢华。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "striped shirt"
msgid_plural "striped shirts"
msgstr[0] "条纹衬衫"

#. ~ Description of "striped shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A long-sleeved shirt with horizontal black and white stripes."
msgstr "一件带有水平黑白相间条纹的长袖衬衫。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "sundress"
msgid_plural "sundresses"
msgstr[0] "吊带裙"

#. ~ Description of "sundress"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A light and breezy cotton dress."
msgstr "一件轻便清凉的棉质吊带裙。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "sweater"
msgid_plural "sweaters"
msgstr[0] "羊毛衫"

#. ~ Description of "sweater"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A warm wool sweater."
msgstr "一件十分保暖的羊毛衫。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "sweatshirt"
msgid_plural "sweatshirts"
msgstr[0] "运动衫"

#. ~ Description of "sweatshirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A thick cotton shirt."
msgstr "一件厚棉衫。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "work t-shirt"
msgid_plural "work t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "工作T恤"

#. ~ Description of "work t-shirt"
#. ~ Snippet of item "work t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A gray work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "一件灰色的T恤，前面还有个小口袋。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "work t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A blue work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "一件蓝色的T恤，前面还有个小口袋。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "work t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A light-blue work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "一件浅蓝色的T恤，前面还有个小口袋。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "t-shirt"
msgid_plural "t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤衫"

#. ~ Description of "t-shirt"
#. ~ Description of variant "t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#. ~ Description of "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A short-sleeved cotton shirt."
msgstr "一件短袖的全棉衬衫。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "political meme t-shirt"
msgid_plural "political meme t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（政治梗）"

#. ~ Description of variant "political meme t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A dark blue t-shirt with a circle of stars.  Inside the circle is a blue and"
" yellow skeleton with his arms raised and mouth open.  Above the skeleton "
"are the words 'Make Eternia' and below him, 'Great Again'."
msgstr "一件印着一圈星星的深蓝色T恤衫，星星中间是一个蓝黄相间的骷髅，手臂抬起，嘴巴张开。骷髅上方印着“让埃坦尼亚”，下方印着“再次伟大”。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "My Little Nazgûl t-shirt"
msgid_plural "My Little Nazgûl t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（我的小戒灵）"

#. ~ Description of variant "My Little Nazgûl t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A light gray t-shirt with a drawing of a Nazgûl riding a black horse.  The "
"drawing is in the style of old My Little Pony cartoons."
msgstr "一件浅灰色T恤，上面画着一个骑着黑马的魔戒戒灵。所有图案都是用经典《彩虹小马》卡通所用笔法画的。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "Matt Berry t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Matt Berry t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（马特·贝里）"

#. ~ Description of variant "Matt Berry t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt printed with a design of Matt Berry in a rugby shirt, a fist "
"raised to the sky, mouth agape, shouting 'Faaather'!"
msgstr "马特·贝里穿着橄榄球衫，一只拳头举向天空，嘴巴张开喊道：“Faaather”！"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "doom song t-shirt"
msgid_plural "doom song t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（毁灭之歌）"

#. ~ Description of variant "doom song t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A black shirt with a green robot poorly disguised as a dog.  Words printed "
"on it read: \"It's time for the DOOM song.  Doom, doom, doom, dooooom!!\""
msgstr "一件黑色T恤衫，上面印着一个伪装成狗的绿色机器人。图案上方的文字：”是唱毁灭之歌的时候了。毁灭，毁灭，毁灭，毁灭！！”"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "Boba Fetch t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Boba Fetch t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（波巴·费彻）"

#. ~ Description of variant "Boba Fetch t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A black shirt displaying a dog wearing the uniform of a well known galactic "
"bounty hunter.  In place of a wrist rocket, it fires a tennis ball on a "
"string."
msgstr "一件黑色T恤衫，上面印着一条狗，穿着著名的《星球大战》中银河赏金猎人波巴·费特的服装。手腕火箭已经发射，是个挂在绳子上的网球。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "mouse portal t-shirt"
msgid_plural "mouse portal t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（老鼠传送门）"

#. ~ Description of variant "mouse portal t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"The front of this shirt displays a blue portal with a mouse's head sticking "
"out.  The mouse is pointing some kind of gun-like device towards a cube made"
" of Swiss cheese.  The back of the shirt has an orange portal, with the back"
" half of the mouse entering the portal."
msgstr ""
"一个细长的蓝色传送门，一只老鼠从中伸出头来。老鼠手中正拿着某种类似枪的装置指着一个白色立方体。印着“这个立方体是奶酪做的吗？”的文字。T恤背面画着一个黄色传送门，老鼠的后半部分正进入传送门之中。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "Ceiling Cthulhu t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Ceiling Cthulhu t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（天花板克苏鲁）"

#. ~ Description of variant "Ceiling Cthulhu t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"This shirt displays a drawing of a ceiling with a round hole in it.  A "
"quizzical-looking Cthulhu pokes its head down through the hole."
msgstr "这件T恤衫上印着一个天花板，上面有个圆孔。看起来有些诧异的克苏鲁正从洞里探出头来。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "pumpkin time t-shirt"
msgid_plural "pumpkin time t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（南瓜时间）"

#. ~ Description of variant "pumpkin time t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"This shirt displays a picture of a jack o'lantern with a tiny smiling black "
"bat popping out of the top."
msgstr "这件T恤衫上印着一张南瓜灯的图案，一只微笑的小黑蝙蝠从顶上蹦出来。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "portal to the cat dimension t-shirt"
msgid_plural "portal to the cat dimension t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（猫之维度传送门）"

#. ~ Description of variant "portal to the cat dimension t-shirt" of item
#. "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A black t-shirt with a picture of a woman standing in front of a yawning "
"portal, with numerous cats exiting the portal and surrounding her."
msgstr "一件黑色T恤，上面画着一名女子站在一个张大的传送门前，许多猫围着她，另外还有更多正准备从传送门走出。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "forbidden robot t-shirt"
msgid_plural "forbidden robot t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（禁断机器人）"

#. ~ Description of variant "forbidden robot t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"This shirt displays a picture of a giant blocky robot with a cone-shaped "
"head.  It holds both arms out, carrying a cyclops woman with purple hair."
msgstr "一个巨大的圆锥头方块身机器人伸出双臂，抱着一位紫色头发的独眼女巨人。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "Down with Swordocracy t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Down with Swordocracy t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（打倒剑权）"

#. ~ Description of variant "Down with Swordocracy t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with a picture of a peasant with a fist raised, eyes alight with "
"the fire of freedom, proclaiming, 'Down with sword-based goverments!'"
msgstr "一件T恤衫，画着一个农民举起一只胳膊，眼中闪耀着自由之火，上面写着：“打倒以剑为基础的政府！”"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "Black Phillip t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Black Phillip t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（黑色菲利普）"

#. ~ Description of variant "Black Phillip t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A black t-shirt with a picture of an old-fashioned cartoon black goat on the"
" front, above the goat it says 'Black Phillip' and below are the words 'Live"
" Deliciously'."
msgstr "一件黑色t恤，正面印着一只经典卡通样式的黑色山羊，山羊上方印着“黑色菲利普”，下方印着“美美地活着”。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "theme park parody t-shirt"
msgid_plural "theme park parody t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（主题公园）"

#. ~ Description of variant "theme park parody t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A black t-shirt with a picture of a stylized castle with five spires.  Each "
"spire has a purple-gray flame at the top.  At the bottom of the castle it "
"says 'Menzoberranzan'"
msgstr "一件黑色T恤，上面印着卡通风格的五个尖顶的公主城堡。每个尖塔顶部都有一道紫灰色的火焰。城堡图案底部印着“魔索布莱城”。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "activities for children t-shirt"
msgid_plural "activities for children t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（儿童权益）"

#. ~ Description of variant "activities for children t-shirt" of item
#. "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"This t-shirt displays a picture of a hooded child standing behind a lectern,"
" his mouth open and his arms held high.  A pentagram has been carved into "
"the lectern and stuffed animals are arranged in a semicircle facing the "
"child.  On the left of the child are the words 'Let's Start A Cult', while "
"below it reads 'Activities for Children'."
msgstr ""
"这件T恤展示了一张照片。一个戴着兜帽的孩子站在讲台后面，张着嘴，双臂高举。讲台上刻着一个五芒星，毛绒动物玩具摆成半圆形，朝向孩子。孩子的左侧印着“让我们建个邪教”，下面却印着“为了儿童权益”。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "baseball t-shirt"
msgid_plural "baseball t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（棒球）"

#. ~ Description of variant "baseball t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with the logo of a local baseball team printed "
"on its front and back."
msgstr "一件棉制的短袖衬衫，正反面都印着当地棒球队的队标。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "football t-shirt"
msgid_plural "football t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（橄榄球）"

#. ~ Description of variant "football t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with the logo of a local football team printed "
"on its front and back."
msgstr "一件棉制的短袖衬衫，正反面都印着当地橄榄球队的队标。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with the text \"chown -R us ~your/base\" "
"printed on the front."
msgstr "一件棉制的短袖衬衫，在正面印着：\"chown -R us ~your/base\"。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A light blue t-shirt with yellow block letters that say 'FDA Approved to "
"treat all diseases'."
msgstr "一件浅蓝色T恤，上面印着黄色方块字体：“FDA批准用于治疗所有疾病”。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A t-shirt with the text 'Anxiety is my super power'."
msgstr "一件T恤，上面印着：“焦虑是我的超能力”。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A t-shirt with the text 'Greetings from R'YLEH home of Cthulhu'."
msgstr "一件T恤，上面印着：“来自克苏鲁家园拉莱耶的问候”。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A t-shirt with the text 'Play robotfindskitten today'."
msgstr "一件T恤，上面印着：“今天就玩机器人找小猫游戏”。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the text 'I survived the apocalypse and all I got was this "
"lousy T-shirt?'"
msgstr "一件T恤，上面印着：“我在世界末日中幸存了下来，得到的只是这件糟糕的T恤？”。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the text 'Zombies don't care whether or not you believe.'"
msgstr "一件T恤，上面印着：“丧尸不在乎你是否相信它”。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the text 'Cthulhu for President: Why vote for the lesser "
"evil'."
msgstr "一件T恤，上面印着：“投给克苏鲁总统：为什么两害取其轻”。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the text 'Cthulhu for President: This time the stars are "
"right'."
msgstr "一件T恤，上面印着：“投给克苏鲁总统：这次星星是对的”。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "tour t-shirt"
msgid_plural "tour t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "T恤（旅行）"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a death metal band's spidery, "
"indecipherable logo printed on the front."
msgstr "一件棉制的短袖衬衫，上面印有细长的死亡金属风格图案。图案无法辨认。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a muscle-bound, long-haired man printed on"
" the front.  He is riding a red dragon and wielding a flaming sword with "
"malicious glee."
msgstr "一件棉制的短袖衬衫，正面印有一位肌肉发达的长发男子。他骑着一条红龙，怀着恶意的喜悦挥舞着燃烧的剑。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a gore-spattered, guitar-playing zombie "
"printed on the front.  It's rather tasteless in light of current events."
msgstr "一件棉制的短袖衬衫，上面印着浑身鲜血弹吉他的丧尸。考虑到当前的情况，这是相当无趣的。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a pattern of complex geometric shapes and "
"transcendental imagery printed on the front."
msgstr "一件棉制的短袖衬衫，上面印有复杂的几何形状和超现实的图案。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with an image of a woman's face in portrait "
"printed on the front.  She is wearing a large blue mohawk, her face is set "
"in a snarl."
msgstr "一种短袖棉布衬衫，正面印有一幅女性肖像。她的大莫西干头被染成了蓝色，一脸怒容。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved black cotton shirt with a stylized representation of a radio"
" wave printed on the front."
msgstr "一件黑色短袖棉衬衫，正面印着电磁波的艺术图案。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt, its front showing an image of an upside-down "
"American flag covered in anarchist graffiti, its edges frayed and burned."
msgstr "一件棉制的短袖衬衫，它的正面是一幅倒置的美国国旗的图像，上面覆盖着无政府主义者的涂鸦，边缘被磨损和烧毁。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with an AK-47 on the front.  It is held up by a"
" clenched fist around its forestock, the fingers covered in crude looking "
"tattoos."
msgstr "一件短袖棉衬衫。上面印着一把AK-47，它被一只手紧握着，手指上布满了粗糙的纹身。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with an interstellar bounty hunter on the "
"front.  'My backpack's got jets'."
msgstr "一件短袖棉布衬衫，正面印着一个星际赏金猎人和一句话：“我的背包能喷气”。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved white cotton shirt with the words 'THE DARKEST OF THE "
"HILLSIDE THICKETS' with a picture of giant fantastical creatures dancing in "
"a line.  Below the picture read the words 'Where the Great Old Ones Are'."
msgstr "一件短袖白色棉衬衫，上方印着一句“山坡上最黑暗的灌木丛”，中间是各类巨大的奇幻生物排成行在跳舞。图案下方印着“伟大的古神们在哪里”。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved black cotton shirt with the words 'THE DARKEST OF THE "
"HILLSIDE THICKETS' below a picture of a roofless green Dodge Charger with "
"five robed men in it.  The driver is throwing back a drink from a goblet, "
"the first passenger is chanting from a book, the other three passengers are "
"firing various guns at a blue flying eye with tentacles and a snail shell.  "
"Red letters read 'THE DUKES OF ALHAZRED'."
msgstr ""
"一件短袖黑色棉衬衫，上方印着一句“山坡上最黑暗的灌木丛”，下面是一张绿色敞篷道奇战马跑车的照片，里面坐着五个穿着长袍的男人。司机从高脚杯里倒出一杯饮料，副驾坐着的乘客念着一本书，其他三名乘客用各种枪械向一只长着触手和蜗牛壳的蓝色飞行眼球开火射击。底下红色字母印着“赫扎德的杜克斯（注：《正义前锋》，1979）”。"

#. ~ Item name
