msgid ""
"A snug, black leather corset.  Has no pockets, but its thick material "
"provides good protection from harm.  Use it to loosen it if you want to wear"
" it over normal clothing."
msgstr "一件紧身的黑色皮衣，无袖、无口袋，但是非常结实耐用。使用它可以放松些，以便穿着在其他衣物上。"

