msgstr "一本先进的大学级教科书，教你如何电路理论和设计与制造。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "Robots for Fun & Profit"
msgid_plural "copies of Robots for Fun & Profit"
msgstr[0] "机器人简单造"

#. ~ Description of "Robots for Fun & Profit"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A rare book on the design of robots, with lots of helpful step-by-step "
"guides."
msgstr "一本少见的关于机器人制造的书，内容包含各种有用的循序渐进的教程。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "trifacet handling procedures"
msgid_plural "trifacet handling procedures"
msgstr[0] "“三琢面”操作手册"

#. ~ Description of "trifacet handling procedures"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A heavy and disparate binder detailing the deactivation, storage and "
"transport procedures for a so called \"Trifacet\" UGV.  The pages and "
"schematics within have been compiled from the internal reports of a vast "
"array of governmental agencies, many of which you had never heard of before."
msgstr ""
"一叠沉重且夹杂着各种纸张的手册，用活页夹固定，详细说明了如何关闭、储存及运输所谓的“三琢面”无人车的步骤。其中的书页和原理图是根据大量政府机构的内部报告汇编而成，许多机构名称你以前从未听说过。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid "CBM interface wiring reference"
msgid_plural "CBM interface wiring reference"
msgstr[0] "CBM接口布线参考资料"

#. ~ Description of "CBM interface wiring reference"
#: data/json/items/book/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A printed technical reference for the Exodii's CBM interface wire kit using "
"numerous alien symbols along with Anglic terminology.  Thankfully someone's "
"hand-written a legend for those symbols and terms along the margins, but "
"it'll still take significant electronics knowledge to decipher this "
"document."
msgstr ""
"一本印刷的流亡族的CBM接口布线组参考资料，使用许多外星符号和古英语术语。谢天谢地，有人在页边空白处为这些符号和术语手写了一个图例，但仍然需要大量的电子知识来破译这份文件。"

