#. ~ Description of "reptile egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "An egg laid by one of reptile species found in New England."
msgstr "一枚由某种新英格兰地区发现的爬行动物下的蛋。"

#. ~ 5x the weight and 3x the nutrition of real chicken eggs, toxins equal to
#. 296g mutant meat
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "insect egg"
