#. ~ they bring the boys to the yard
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "milkshake"
msgid_plural "milkshakes"
msgstr[0] "奶昔"

#. ~ they bring the boys to the yard
#. ~ Description of "milkshake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"An all-natural cold beverage made with milk and sweeteners.  Tastes great "
"when frozen."
msgstr "一种用牛奶和甜味剂制成的全天然冷饮。冷冻后味道更好。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "fast food milkshake"
msgid_plural "fast food milkshakes"
msgstr[0] "快餐奶昔"

#. ~ Description of "fast food milkshake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "A milkshake made by freezing a premade mix.  Incredibly sweet."
msgstr "通过冷冻预先混合好的材料制成的奶昔。难以置信地甜蜜。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "chocolate milkshake"
msgid_plural "chocolate milkshakes"
msgstr[0] "巧克力奶昔"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate milkshake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"An all-natural cold beverage made with chocolate milk and sweeteners.  "
"Tastes great when frozen."
msgstr "一种用巧克力乳和甜味剂制成的全天然冷饮。冷冻后味道更好。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "deluxe milkshake"
msgid_plural "deluxe milkshakes"
msgstr[0] "特级奶昔"

#. ~ Description of "deluxe milkshake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "This milkshake has been enhanced with the addition of candy or fruit."
msgstr "添加了糖果或水果的奶昔，更强，更高端。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "deluxe chocolate milkshake"
msgid_plural "deluxe chocolate milkshakes"
msgstr[0] "特级巧克力奶昔"

#. ~ Description of "deluxe chocolate milkshake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"This chocolate milkshake has been enhanced with the addition of candy or "
"fruit."
msgstr "添加了糖果或水果的巧克力奶昔，更强，更高端。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "frozen lemonade"
msgid_plural "frozen lemonades"
msgstr[0] "柠檬冰沙"

#. ~ Description of "frozen lemonade"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"An all-natural cold beverage made with lemonade and sweeteners.  Tastes "
"great when frozen."
msgstr "一款全天然的冷饮，由柠檬水和甜味剂制成。冰冻后味道更好。"

#. ~ not technically a drink, but is quasi-liquid enough that it'd get all
#. over everything if you carried it
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "ice cream"
msgid_plural "ice cream scoops"
msgstr[0] "冰淇淋"

#. ~ not technically a drink, but is quasi-liquid enough that it'd get all
#. over everything if you carried it
#. ~ Description of "ice cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "A sweet, frozen food made with milk and liberal amounts of sugar."
msgstr "一种用牛奶和大量糖制成的冰镇甜品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "dairy dessert"
msgid_plural "dairy dessert scoops"
msgstr[0] "含乳甜点"

#. ~ Description of "dairy dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"Government regulations dictate that since this isn't *technically* ice "
"cream, it can be called a dairy dessert instead.  You can't really taste the"
" difference."
msgstr "根据相关政府法规，这份甜点的成分使其不足以被称为\"冰淇淋\"，最多只能被称为\"含乳甜点\"。你实在是尝不出来有什么区别。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "chocolate ice cream"
msgid_plural "chocolate ice cream scoops"
msgstr[0] "巧克力冰淇淋"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate ice cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"A sweet, frozen food made with chocolate milk and liberal amounts of sugar."
msgstr "一种用巧克力乳和大量糖制成的冰镇甜品。"

#. ~ based on hoodsie cups, a popular brand in new england
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "sundae cup"
msgid_plural "sundae cups"
msgstr[0] "圣代杯"

#. ~ based on hoodsie cups, a popular brand in new england
#. ~ Description of "sundae cup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"A small cup of frozen dairy dessert that is half chocolate, half vanilla, "
"and all delicious."
msgstr "一小杯冷冻奶制甜点，一半是巧克力，一半是香草，非常美味。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "candy ice cream"
msgid_plural "candy ice cream scoops"
msgstr[0] "糖果冰淇淋"

#. ~ Description of "candy ice cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"Ice cream with bits of chocolate, caramel, or other sweet candy mixed in."
msgstr "一份混入了一点巧克力、焦糖或是其他糖果的冰淇淋。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "fruity ice cream"
msgid_plural "fruity ice cream scoops"
msgstr[0] "水果冰淇淋"

#. ~ Description of "fruity ice cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "Small bits of sweet fruit have been tossed into this ice cream."
msgstr "一份混入了许多水果块的冰淇淋。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "frozen custard"
msgid_plural "frozen custard scoops"
msgstr[0] "冰镇蛋奶冻"

#. ~ Description of "frozen custard"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"A treat made famous on Coney Island, made like ice cream but with egg yolk "
"added in.  Its storing temperature is warmer, and it lasts a little longer "
"than regular ice cream."
msgstr "康尼岛著名的冰镇甜品，与冰淇淋很相似，但除了奶油和糖之外还加入了蛋黄。它的储存温度略高，保质期也长一些。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "frozen yogurt"
msgid_plural "frozen yogurt scoops"
msgstr[0] "冰镇酸奶冻"

#. ~ Description of "frozen yogurt"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"Tarter than ice cream, this is made with yogurt and other dairy products, "
"and is generally lower-fat compared to ice cream."
msgstr "略酸的冰淇淋，由酸奶与其他乳制品制成，与普通冰淇淋相比，脂肪含量更低。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "sorbet"
msgid_plural "sorbet scoops"
msgstr[0] "冰沙"

#. ~ Description of "sorbet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "A simple frozen dessert made from water and fruit juice."
msgstr "一种简单的冰镇甜点，由水和果汁制成。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid "gelato"
msgid_plural "gelato scoops"
msgstr[0] "意式冰淇淋"

#. ~ Description of "gelato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/frozen.json
msgid ""
"Italian-style ice cream.  It is denser and less airy, giving it a richer "
"flavor and texture."
msgstr "意大利式冰淇淋，与一般冰淇淋相比，它的空气含量更少，这带来了更致密的口感，更浓郁的味道。"

#. ~ Cheap for three liters of spread!
