" agar instead of animal gelatin.  They have kind of a strange texture, but "
"they're still tasty."
msgstr "一把五颜六色的水果味和苏打味的琼脂软糖，使用植物制成，而不是动物明胶。它们有一种奇怪的质感，但仍然很好吃。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid "chewy reptilian candy"
msgid_plural "chewy reptilian candies"
msgstr[0] "两栖类软糖"

#. ~ Description of "chewy reptilian candy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A handful of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candies shaped in a reptilian "
"fashion.  Made by SugarRush."
msgstr "一把五颜六色的果味软糖，做成了两栖类动物的外形。SugarRush出品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid "candy cattle"
msgid_plural "candy cattles"
msgstr[0] "小牛糖果"

#. ~ Description of "candy cattle"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of chocolate candies shaped like cows."
msgstr "一把奶牛形状的巧克力糖果。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid "licorice"
msgid_plural "licorices"
msgstr[0] "甘草糖"

#. ~ Description of "licorice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A swirly confectionary treat in strings of sweet-tasting candy."
msgstr "一个由甘甜美味的长条形糖果卷成的漩涡状糖果。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "powder candy sticks"
msgid_plural "powder candy sticks"
msgstr[0] "粉末糖果棒"

#. ~ Description of "powder candy sticks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Thin paper tubes of sweet & sour candy powder.  Who thinks of this stuff?"
msgstr ""
"一根小纸管里装满了酸酸甜甜的糖粉。\n"
"\"是谁发明出这玩意的？\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "candy bracelet"
msgid_plural "candy bracelet"
msgstr[0] "糖果手链"

#. ~ Description of "candy bracelet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A candy bracelet made by stringing candies onto a thread.  In theory, you "
"could both wear and eat the bracelet."
msgstr "将糖果串在一根线上制成的糖果手链。理论上，你可以一边戴一边吃。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "maple syrup candy"
msgid_plural "maple syrup candies"
msgstr[0] "枫叶糖"

#. ~ Description of "maple syrup candy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A handful of golden, translucent leaf candies made with pure maple syrup.  "
"They melt slowly in your mouth as you savor the taste of real maple."
msgstr "一把用纯枫树糖浆制成的金色半透明叶状糖果。当你品尝正宗枫树的味道时，它们会在你的嘴里慢慢融化。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid "graham cracker"
msgid_plural "graham crackers"
msgstr[0] "全麦饼干"

#. ~ Description of "graham cracker"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"These dry, sugary crackers will leave you thirsty, but they go well with "
"some chocolate and marshmallows."
msgstr "这些又干又甜的饼干会让你口渴，但与一些巧克力和棉花糖很相配。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "graham cracker chunk"
msgid_plural "graham cracker chunks"
msgstr[0] "全麦饼干块"

#. ~ Description of "graham cracker chunk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"These dry, sugary cracker pellets will leave you thirsty, and they're not "
"the right size to make s'mores with.  Made by SugarRush!"
msgstr "这些又干又甜的小饼干会让你口渴，而且它们的大小不适合用来制作果塔饼干。由 SugarRush 出品！"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "cookie"
msgid_plural "cookies"
msgstr[0] "曲奇饼"

#. ~ Description of "cookie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A sweet, delicious cookie, just like grandma used to bake."
msgstr "香甜可口的饼干，就像奶奶烤的一样。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid "cookie egg"
msgid_plural "cookie eggs"
msgstr[0] "曲奇蛋"

#. ~ Description of "cookie egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A sweet, delicious cookie, shaped like an egg.  Made by SugarRush!"
msgstr "香甜可口的饼干，形状像蛋一样。SugarRush出品！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "maple syrup"
msgid_plural "maple syrup"
msgstr[0] "枫树糖浆"

#. ~ Description of "maple syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Boiling the sap of a maple tree has concentrated it into this sweet, "
"delicious maple syrup."
msgstr "通过把枫树的汁液煮沸，浓缩而成的香甜可口的枫糖浆。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "sugar beet syrup"
msgid_plural "sugar beet syrup"
msgstr[0] "甜菜糖浆"

#. ~ Description of "sugar beet syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A thick syrup produced from shredded sugar beets.  Useful in cooking as a "
"sweetener."
msgstr "切碎的甜菜所熬制生产的糖浆。用于烹饪时作为甜味剂。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "cake"
msgid_plural "cakes"
msgstr[0] "蛋糕"

#. ~ Description of "cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Delicious sponge cake with buttercream icing.  Happy Birthday is written on "
"top in frosting."
msgstr ""
"一份裹上了香浓糖衣的新鲜蛋糕，里面还有满满的奶油。糖霜顶上还写着“生日快乐”。\n"
"“或许现在应该改名叫末日快乐了。”"

#. ~ Description of "cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Delicious chocolate cake.  It has all the icing.  All of it."
msgstr "一块美味的巧克力蛋糕，糖霜都在，应有尽有。"

#. ~ Description of "cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A cake coated in the thickest icing you've ever seen.  Someone has written "
"guff in quotation marks on it…"
msgstr "这个蛋糕上的糖霜厚得让你看一眼就恶心。有人在上面写了些什么，看起来像是在胡说八道……"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "chocolate-covered coffee bean"
msgid_plural "chocolate-covered coffee beans"
msgstr[0] "巧克力咖啡豆"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate-covered coffee bean"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Roasted coffee beans coated with dark chocolate, a natural source of "
"concentrated caffeine."
msgstr "一些黑巧克力咖啡豆，来自自然的满满的咖啡因享受。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "fast-food French fries"
msgid_plural "fast-food French fries"
msgstr[0] "快餐法式炸薯条"

#. ~ Description of "fast-food French fries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Salty, deep-fried potatoes from a fast food restaurant."
msgstr "来自快餐店的咸味炸土豆。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "French fries"
msgid_plural "French fries"
msgstr[0] "法式炸薯条"

#. ~ Description of "French fries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Homemade deep-fried potatoes or other tubers, with a touch of salt.  Crunchy"
" and delicious."
msgstr "一些加有少许盐的自制油炸马铃薯（或者其它块茎作物），酥脆美味。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "French fries" when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. groundnut_prepared
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "ground nut fries"
msgid_plural "ground nut fries"
msgstr[0] "油炸美洲花生"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "peppermint patty"
msgid_plural "peppermint patties"
msgstr[0] "薄荷饼"

#. ~ Description of "peppermint patty"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of soft, chocolate-covered peppermint patties… yum!"
msgstr "一把被软巧克力包裹着的薄荷馅饼，味道好极了！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Necco wafers"
msgid_plural "Necco wafers"
msgstr[0] "彩虹糖"

#. ~ Description of "Necco wafers"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A handful of candy wafers in assorted flavors: orange, lemon, lime, clove, "
"chocolate, wintergreen, cinnamon, and licorice.  Yum!"
msgstr ""
"一大包糖果，什锦口味：橙，柠檬，青柠，丁香，巧克力，冬青，桂皮，甘草，非常美味。\n"
"\"看到彩虹，吃定彩虹~！\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "candy cigarette"
msgid_plural "candy cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "香烟糖"

#. ~ Description of "candy cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Flavored sugar sticks designed to look like cigarettes.  Anti-smoking "
"reports from the Surgeon General have caused a pretty big drop in their "
"popularity since the 1960s."
msgstr "设计成香烟形状的风味糖棒。自1960年代以来，外科医生的反吸烟报告导致其流行程度大幅下降。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mapgen/sweet_terrain.json
msgid "caramel"
msgid_plural "caramel"
msgstr[0] "焦糖"

#. ~ Description of "caramel"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Some caramel.  Sticky and sweet, but not very exciting by itself."
msgstr "一些焦糖。粘稠而甜美，但它本身并不是很令人兴奋。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "caramel apple"
msgid_plural "caramel apple"
msgstr[0] "焦糖苹果"

#. ~ Description of "caramel apple"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A caramel-covered apple.  Best served on an autumn day, at a harvest fair, "
"on a stick - but those days are long gone."
msgstr "焦糖覆盖的苹果。最好是在某个秋日，在丰收博览会上，串在棍子上吃——但那些日子早已一去不复返了。"

#. ~ Description of "potato chips"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Betcha can't eat just one."
msgstr "一份油炸的、一片接着一片的马铃薯片。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "tortilla chips"
msgid_plural "tortilla chips"
msgstr[0] "墨西哥玉米片"

#. ~ Description of "tortilla chips"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas.  They're not bad on their own, but "
"they could really use some cheese, maybe some meat."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片。单独吃起来也不错，不过再来点奶酪，或者是加点肉就更棒了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "cheese nachos"
msgid_plural "cheese nachos"
msgstr[0] "奶酪辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Description of "cheese nachos"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, with cheese melted on top.  Could "
"stand to have some meat."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，一层奶酪熔化在上面。再来点肉就更棒了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "meat nachos"
msgid_plural "meat nachos"
msgstr[0] "加肉辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Description of "meat nachos"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, with ground meat on top.  Could "
"probably use some cheese, though."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，上面有碎肉。再来点奶酪就更棒了。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos" when FLAG matches CANNIBALISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "niño nachos"
msgid_plural "niño nachos"
msgstr[0] "加人肉辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos" when FLAG matches
#. STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "nibelung nachos"
msgid_plural "nibelung nachos"
msgstr[0] "加亚人肉辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos" when COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches
#. mutant
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "nachos con chupacabra"
msgid_plural "nachos con chupacabra"
msgstr[0] "变异肉辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "meat nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "meat nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "加肉奶酪辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Description of "meat nachos with cheese"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas smothered in cheese and ground meat.  "
"Delicious."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，裹着奶酪和碎肉。十分可口。"

#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos with cheese" when FLAG matches
#. CANNIBALISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "niño nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "niño nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "加人肉奶酪辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos with cheese" when FLAG matches
#. STRICT_HUMANITARIANISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "nibelung nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "nibelung nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "加亚人肉奶酪辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Conditional name for "meat nachos with cheese" when
#. COMPONENT_ID_SUBSTRING matches mutant
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "cheese and chupacabra nachos"
msgid_plural "cheese and chupacabra nachos"
msgstr[0] "变异肉奶酪辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "vegetarian nachos"
msgid_plural "vegetarian nachos"
msgstr[0] "素食辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Description of "vegetarian nachos"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, with beans on top.  Could probably "
"use some cheese, though."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，上面加有豆子。再来点奶酪就更棒了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "vegetarian nachos with cheese"
msgid_plural "vegetarian nachos with cheese"
msgstr[0] "素食奶酪辣味玉米片"

#. ~ Description of "vegetarian nachos with cheese"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, smothered in cheese and beans.  "
"Delicious, even if you're not a vegetarian."
msgstr "墨西哥式调味玉米片，裹着奶酪和豆子。即使你不是素食主义者，它也十分美味。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "pork stick"
msgid_plural "pork sticks"
msgstr[0] "猪肉脯"

#. ~ Description of "pork stick"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Salty dried pork.  Tastes good, but it will make you thirsty."
msgstr "一份咸猪肉干，略咸，口感不错，可以保存很久。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "microwave burrito"
msgid_plural "microwave burritos"
msgstr[0] "微波玉米卷饼"

#. ~ Description of "microwave burrito"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A small, microwavable steak & cheese burrito, like those found at gas "
"stations."
msgstr "微波食品的一种——小分量的牛排、奶酪与玉米煎饼装在一个盒子里，大多数加油站有售。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "uncooked TV dinner"
msgid_plural "uncooked TV dinners"
msgstr[0] "生速冻快餐"

#. ~ Description of "uncooked TV dinner"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Not as appetizing as it "
"would be if heated up."
msgstr "一磅的肉类加上一磅的碳水化合物，看起来并不是那么可口的样子，如果能加热一下就好了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "cooked TV dinner"
msgid_plural "cooked TV dinners"
msgstr[0] "熟速冻快餐"

#. ~ Description of "cooked TV dinner"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Now that it's been "
"heated up, it's much tastier but will also spoil more quickly."
msgstr "一磅多汁的肉类加上一磅香喷喷的碳水化合物！新鲜出炉，风味更佳，但也会更快变质。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "deep-fried chicken"
msgid_plural "deep-fried chickens"
msgstr[0] "炸鸡"

#. ~ Description of "deep-fried chicken"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Fast-food chicken, deep-fried in oil.  It's greasy and delicious."
msgstr "将鸡肉完全浸泡在油中炸熟而成的快餐食品。油腻但可口。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "chili dog"
msgid_plural "chili dogs"
msgstr[0] "辣椒热狗"

#. ~ Description of "chili dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A hot dog with chili con carne on top.  Yum!"
msgstr "一根盖有辣肉酱的热狗，香辣可口。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "wheat-free chili dog"
msgid_plural "wheat-free chili dogs"
msgstr[0] "无麸质辣椒热狗"

#. ~ Description of "wheat-free chili dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A hot dog on a wheat-free bun, with chili con carne on top.  Yum!"
msgstr "一根包裹在无麸质面包里的热狗，浇上辣肉酱，香辣可口。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "uncooked corn dog"
msgid_plural "uncooked corn dogs"
msgstr[0] "生玉米热狗"

#. ~ Description of "uncooked corn dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, dipped in batter and deep-fried.  It would "
"taste much better cooked."
msgstr "一份经过深加工的香肠，裹在面糊里炸熟的生热狗，可以直接食用，但加热一下会更好。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "cooked corn dog"
msgid_plural "cooked corn dogs"
msgstr[0] "熟玉米热狗"

#. ~ Description of "cooked corn dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, dipped in batter and deep-fried.  Now that it's"
" been cooked, this corn dog tastes much better, but will spoil faster."
msgstr "一份经过深加工的香肠，裹在面糊里炸熟的热狗，比起生的尝起来更棒。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "homemade corn dog"
msgid_plural "homemade corn dogs"
msgstr[0] "自制玉米热狗"

#. ~ Description of "homemade corn dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A homemade sausage, dipped in batter and deep fried."
msgstr "一根蘸上面糊油炸而成的自制香肠。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "chocolate pancake"
msgid_plural "chocolate pancakes"
msgstr[0] "巧克力薄饼"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate pancake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy and delicious pancakes with real maple syrup, with delicious "
"chocolate baked right in."
msgstr "松软的美味烤饼浇上货真价实的枫糖浆，更不用提那饼皮下香气扑鼻的巧克力。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "chocolate waffle"
msgid_plural "chocolate waffles"
msgstr[0] "巧克力华夫饼"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate waffle"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Crunchy and delicious waffles with real maple syrup, with delicious "
"chocolate baked right in."
msgstr "嘎嘣脆的美味华夫饼浇上枫糖浆，配上巧克力使它更甜、更不健康。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "cheese spread"
msgid_plural "cheese spreads"
