msgstr[0] "去壳山核桃"

#. ~ Description of "shelled hickory nuts"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"A handful of raw, hard nuts from a hickory tree, with the shells removed."
msgstr "一把从山核桃树摘下来的生硬坚果，已经去掉了壳。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "roasted hickory nuts"
