#. ~ Description of "wheat-free blodplättar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Blodplättar is not your average pancake.  It does not taste of blood at all "
"and it tastes like a crispier black pudding.  Made with wheat-free flour."
msgstr "血煎饼不是一般的煎饼。它一点血的味道也没有，尝起来像一个更脆的黑布丁。用无麸质面粉制成。"

#. ~ Item name
