#. ~ Description of "orange"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A sweet citrus fruit.  Also comes in juice form.  In case you were "
"wondering, the color is named after the fruit, not the other way around."
msgstr "一种甜柑橘类水果。可以榨成果汁。以免你真的会好奇为什么橙子是橙色：“橙”色是从水果得来的，而不是反过来。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "lemon vine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "lemon"
msgid_plural "lemons"
msgstr[0] "柠檬"

#. ~ Description of "lemon"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A very sour citrus fruit.  Can be eaten if you're desperate, but you should "
"probably look for some other cooking application for this."
msgstr "一种非常酸的柑橘类水果。如果你真的很想直接吃，也不是不行，但你或许应该为它寻找一些别的料理用途。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "blueberries"
msgid_plural "blueberries"
msgstr[0] "蓝莓"

#. ~ Description of "blueberries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A handful of tasty sweet-tart berries.  They're blue, but that doesn't mean "
"they're sad."
msgstr "一把美味的酸甜浆果。它们是蓝色的，但这并不意味着它们很伤心（blue）。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "strawberries"
msgid_plural "strawberries"
msgstr[0] "草莓"

#. ~ Description of "strawberries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A handful of tasty, juicy red berries with visible seeds on the outside of "
"the skin.  Often found growing wild in fields."
msgstr "一把美味多汁的红色浆果，果皮外面有可见的种子。经常可以在田野中找到野生的。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "cranberries"
msgid_plural "cranberries"
msgstr[0] "蔓越莓"

#. ~ Description of "cranberries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
