"Good for urinary tract health."
msgstr "一把红色的酸浆果，主要在马萨诸塞州当地生长。有益于泌尿道健康。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "raspberries"
msgid_plural "raspberries"
msgstr[0] "树莓"

#. ~ Description of "raspberries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A handful of sweet red berries, each with a hollow core."
msgstr "一把红色甜浆果，每颗都有一个空的果核。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "huckleberries"
msgid_plural "huckleberries"
msgstr[0] "越橘"

#. ~ Description of "huckleberries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A handful of huckleberries, often times confused for blueberries."
msgstr "一把美洲越橘，经常会和蓝莓混淆。"

#. ~ abbreviated latin name because the id would get too long otherwise
#. ~ Item name
