"A handful of deep red berries with a pleasant bittersweet flavor.  Can have "
"a laxative effect if eaten in large quantities."
msgstr "一把深红色的浆果，有股令人愉悦的甘苦回甜的味道。如果大量食用，可以起到通便作用。"

