#. would be a waste of time and resources.
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "mayapple seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "mayapple"
msgid_plural "mayapples"
msgstr[0] "鬼臼果"

#. ~ entire plant contains poison interacting with the central nervous system,
#. but the fruit is edible in small quantities. the effect of the poison is
#. very similar to our mutant_toxin excess, a dedicated toxin just for this
#. would be a waste of time and resources.
#. ~ Description of "mayapple"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
