msgstr ""
"一些被炒熟的南瓜籽，葵花籽，或是其他植物的种子，营养且美味。\n"
"\"俄罗斯人瓜子不离手，因此也被称为'毛嗑'。\""

#. ~ USDA states that the pods of the Kentucky coffeetree contain a toxic
#. alkaloid broken down in the roasting process, so they're poisonous
#. ~ Item name
