msgstr[0] "爆炒豆腐"

#. ~ Description of "tofu stirfry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A tofu stirfry with rice and a sweet, bold flavor sure to stay on your mind "
"through these dark days."
msgstr "爆炒豆腐拌饭的甘美滋味伴随着你度过这些黑暗的日子。"

#. ~ real world measurements: 250 mL of cooked beans is 240g w 316 calories,
#. 250ml cooked rice is 200g w 260 calories, and 250mL of veggies is ~100g w
#. ~100 calories
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
msgid_plural "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
msgstr[0] "特级素豆饭"

#. ~ real world measurements: 250 mL of cooked beans is 240g w 316 calories,
#. 250ml cooked rice is 200g w 260 calories, and 250mL of veggies is ~100g w
#. ~100 calories
#. ~ Description of "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Slow-cooked beans and rice with vegetables and seasonings.  Tasty and very "
"filling."
msgstr "将慢火烹制的豆子与米饭一起烹调，配上蔬菜和调料。美味又管饱。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "baked potato"
msgid_plural "baked potatoes"
msgstr[0] "烤马铃薯"

#. ~ Description of "baked potato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious baked potato or other tuber.  Got any sour cream?"
msgstr ""
"一个香气喷鼻的烤马铃薯（或者其它块茎作物）。\n"
"\"能淋上点酸奶油就好了。\""

