"A solid metal ammo box with a small handle on top and shabby yellow text "
"printed on the side."
msgstr "一个坚固的金属弹药箱，顶部有个小把手，侧面印着粗糙的黄色文字。"

#. ~ <https://www.cleanammocans.com/new-50-cal-m2a1-usgi-ammo-can.html>
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
msgid "M2A2 ammo can"
msgid_plural "M2A2 ammo cans"
msgstr[0] "M2A2 弹药箱"

