#. ~ Firing mode of gun "G36 assault rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M249S"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M4 carbine"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M16 burst rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M16 auto rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "SIG assault rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "AUG assault rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "Browning Automatic Rifle"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "Remington ACR .300BLK"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "SIG MCX Rattler SBR"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "FN FAL"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "H&K G3"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M14 EBR-RI"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M60 Semi Auto"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "HK417 A2"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "M2 carbine"
#. ~ Firing mode of gun "Škorpion vz. 61"
