msgid "semi-auto"
msgstr "半自动"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "Colt Delta Elite pistol"
msgid_plural "Colt Delta Elite pistols"
msgstr[0] "柯尔特 \"三角精英\"手枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "Colt Delta Elite pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm.  It accepts Colt Delta Elite "
"magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动手枪，可使用柯尔特\"三角精英\"手枪弹匣。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Colt Delta Elite pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "Colt Delta Elite"
msgid_plural "Colt Delta Elites"
msgstr[0] "柯尔特 \"三角精英\"手枪"

#. ~ Description of variant "Colt Delta Elite pistol" of gun "Colt Delta
#. Elite"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A modernized, match-grade variant of the venerable M1911 chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  Early variants were known to crack frames; modern 1911s,"
" like this one, are slotted to prevent such crack formation."
msgstr ""
"一把基于著名的 M1911 手枪设计，经现代化改造后的竞赛级衍生型手枪，采用威力强大的 10mm Auto 弹。早期的 M1911 "
"型号枪身容易破损；现代改造后的 M1911 手枪，像这把，增加了加固槽，以防止枪身裂开。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "EAA Witness pistol"
msgid_plural "EAA Witness pistols"
msgstr[0] "EAA \"证人\"手枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "EAA Witness pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm and accepting EAA Witness "
"magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动手枪，可使用 EAA \"证人\"手枪弹匣。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "EAA Witness pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "EAA Witness 10mm"
msgid_plural "EAA Witness 10mms"
msgstr[0] "EAA \"证人\" 10mm 手枪"

#. ~ Description of variant "EAA Witness pistol" of gun "EAA Witness 10mm"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"The EAA Witness is a modified variant of the CZ-75, produced in Italy by "
"Tanfoglio.  This is the standard steel framed version chambered in 10mm "
"Auto."
msgstr ""
"EAA \"证人\" 手枪是 CZ-75 手枪的改进型号，由意大利 Tanfoglio 公司制造。这把是标准的钢制枪身版，口径为 10mm Auto。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "SIG pistol"
msgid_plural "SIG pistols"
msgstr[0] "SIG 手枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "SIG pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mmm and accepting SIG magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动手枪，可使用 SIG 弹匣。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "SIG pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "SIG P220 10mm"
msgid_plural "SIG P220 10mms"
msgstr[0] "西格&绍尔 P220 10mm 手枪"

#. ~ Description of variant "SIG pistol" of gun "SIG P220 10mm"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"The SIG Sauer P220 was developed for the Swiss military in 1975, and its "
"simplified action was later used in most other SIG Sauer designs, including "
"the P226.  The all-steel construction adds heft to this model, which is "
"chambered in hard-hitting 10mm Auto."
msgstr ""
"西格&绍尔 P220 手枪是于1975年为瑞士军方开发的，它所使用的简化版枪机后来被大多数其他西格&绍尔枪械采用，包括 P226 "
"手枪。全钢结构增加了这一型号的重量，但也使其能使用威力强大的 10mm Auto 弹。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "XD-M pistol"
msgid_plural "XD-M pistols"
msgstr[0] "XD-M 手枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "XD-M pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm and accepting XD-M magazines"
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的半自动手枪，可使用 XD-M 弹匣。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "XD-M pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "XD-M Competition 10mm"
msgid_plural "XD-M Competition 10mms"
msgstr[0] "XD-M 竞赛型 10mm 手枪"

#. ~ Description of variant "XD-M pistol" of gun "XD-M Competition 10mm"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"Designed by HS Produkt in Croatia, the HS2000 has become a commercial "
"success for Springfield Armory, who imports and markets it as the eXtreme "
"Duty.  The XD has since been offered in a variety of chamberings and sizes, "
"including this full-sized match grade variant in 10mm Auto."
msgstr ""
"HS2000 手枪由克罗地亚的 HS Produkt 公司设计，已经成为春田武器公司的一款成功进口产品，按eXtreme "
"Duty商标进口并在北美销售。XD 系列手枪已经覆盖了各种口径和尺寸，包括这把使用 10mm Auto 弹的全尺寸竞赛型号。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid "Glock SMG"
msgid_plural "Glock SMGs"
msgstr[0] "格洛克冲锋枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A submachine gun chambered in 10mm, accepting Glock magazines."
msgstr "一把 10mm 口径的冲锋枪，可使用格洛克弹匣。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Glock SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "Vector SDP 10mm"
msgid_plural "Vector SDP 10mms"
msgstr[0] "维克托 SDP 10mm 手枪"

#. ~ Description of variant "Glock SMG" of gun "Vector SDP 10mm"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"The Vector SDP is a delayed blowback \"pistol\" with a unique, downward "
"reciprocating bolt that helps combat muzzle climb.  This one is chambered in"
" 10mm Auto."
msgstr "维克托 SDP 手枪是一把延迟反冲式“手枪”，有个设计独特的向下往复枪栓，有助于补偿枪口上跳后坐力。这把手枪使用 10mm Auto 弹。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/12mm.json
msgid "H&K G80 railgun"
msgid_plural "H&K G80 railguns"
msgstr[0] "黑克勒-科赫 G80 磁轨步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "H&K G80 railgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/12mm.json
msgid ""
"Developed by Heckler & Koch, this railgun magnetically propels a "
"ferromagnetic projectile using an alternating current.  Powered by UPS."
msgstr "黑克勒-科赫公司研发的磁轨步枪，这把使用交流电驱动的武器利用磁力发射12mm铁磁弹。采用UPS供电。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid "RM120c shotgun"
msgid_plural "RM120c shotguns"
msgstr[0] "RM120c 霰弹枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "RM120c shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid ""
"Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM120c caseless pump-"
"action shotgun was designed for hunting big game, with durability and ease "
"of use as priorities."
msgstr "采用了强力而又特殊的口径，Rivtech RM120c泵动式霰弹枪被设计用来猎杀大型动物，操作简单，火力强劲。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid "RM20 autoshotgun"
msgid_plural "RM20 autoshotguns"
msgstr[0] "RM20 自动霰弹枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "RM20 autoshotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/20x66mm.json
msgid ""
"Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM20 caseless "
"automatic combat shotgun was designed with durability and overwhelming power"
" in mind."
msgstr "采用了强力而又特殊的口径，Rivtech RM20 自动战斗霰弹枪的设计思路是持续性和压倒性的火力。"

