#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "hm12 dazzle rifle"
msgid_plural "hm12 dazzle rifles"
msgstr[0] "HM12 眩晕步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "hm12 dazzle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"This prototype 'energy weapon' was apparently manufactured by Hub 01.  It "
"somewhat resembles an oversize radar gun, mounted on a rectangular frame of "
"white sheet metal.  It will temporarily stun robots, if you manage to hit "
"their sensors with a clean shot."
msgstr ""
"这把原型“能量武器”显然是由Hub "
"01制造的。它看上去像是一把由装在白色方形金属框架上的超大号雷达构成的枪械。如果你能用它精确击中机器人的传感器的话，就能暂时击晕机器人。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "V29 laser pistol"
msgid_plural "V29 laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "V29 激光手枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "V29 laser pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"The V29 laser pistol was one of the first handheld laser weapons.  It is "
"larger than most traditional handguns, but has no recoil whatsoever."
msgstr "V29激光手枪是全球首款手持激光武器之一。它的外型比普通手枪要大一些，但射击时感受不到一点后坐力。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
msgid_plural "salvaged CMES laser cannons"
msgstr[0] "回收的CMES激光炮"

#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"This gatling-laser has been stripped from its CMES mech-suit and is far too "
"heavy to use on its own.  You will need to deploy it or mount it to a "
"vehicle, but it could be devastating if you have deep battery reserves."
msgstr ""
"这架加特林激光炮已经从CMES外骨骼机甲上拆下来了，它太重了，无法直接使用。你需要将其部署或安装到载具上，但只要你供电充足，它就能够轻而易举地为目标带来死亡。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
msgid_plural "salvaged RMES marksman lasers"
msgstr[0] "回收的RMES狙击系统"

#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"Formerly belonging to an RMES mech-suit, this powerful long-range laser "
"rifle was never designed for human hands.  You might be able to make it work"
" if you deployed it or mounted it to a vehicle, though, and its long range "
"and potency could be pretty handy if you can keep it powered."
msgstr ""
"这架威力强大的远程激光步枪曾经属于某套RMES外骨骼机甲，从不是为供人手持使用而设计的。你需要将其部署或安装到载具上，才能使它工作，只要你能为其提供动力，它的射程和威力可能会很有用。"

