#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "ported barrel"
msgid_plural "ported barrels"
msgstr[0] "排气门枪管"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "ported barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"A ported barrel redirects exhaust gases to compensate for muzzle climb, "
"improving recoil but increasing noise and reducing accuracy slightly."
msgstr "装有气门的枪管，通过改变排放气体的方向来降低枪口上扬的幅度，降低了后座力，但增大了噪音，并且轻微地降低了精度。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "shortened barrel"
msgid_plural "shortened barrels"
msgstr[0] "锯短枪管"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "shortened barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"A shortened barrel results in markedly reduced accuracy and a minor increase"
" in noise, but also greatly improves the ease with which the weapon can be "
"carried and wielded."
msgstr "锯短枪管会导致射击精度明显降低，并略微增加噪声，但也能使武器便于携带和手持。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid "upstest"
msgid_plural "upstests"
msgstr[0] "UPS测试"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "upstest"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"Test mod for UPS drain on mods, this should never spawn, if you see this, "
"it's a bug.  50x more UPS drain."
msgstr "用来测试 UPS 消耗的枪械模组，它不应该出现在游戏中。增加 50 倍 UPS 消耗。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/bionicmods.json
msgid "Power shot"
msgid_plural "Power shots"
msgstr[0] "强力射击"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Power shot"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/bionicmods.json
msgid ""
"This is a pseudo item -- the builtin part of a fusion blaster for the "
"maximum power firing mode."
msgstr "这是一个虚拟物品——核聚变爆破器的内置部分，用于最大功率的发射模式。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "brass catcher"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/brass_catcher.json
msgid ""
"A bag that hangs off the side of your gun and catches ejected casings so you"
" don't have to pick them up."
msgstr "一个可以装在退弹口上的袋子，这样你就不必弯腰去捡弹壳了。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ".300 AAC Blackout AR-15 conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".300 AAC Blackout AR-15 conversion kits"
msgstr[0] ".300 BLK 口径 AR-15 改装件"

#. ~ Description of gun mod ".300 AAC Blackout AR-15 conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "A complete AR-15 upper assembly with a .300 AAC Blackout barrel."
msgstr "一整套 AR-15 改装件，包括一个 .300 BLK 枪管。"

