#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid "grenade cradle for staff sling"
msgid_plural "grenade cradles for staff slings"
msgstr[0] "投石杖手雷投射器"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "grenade cradle for staff sling"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"A larger cradle with a longer sling for fitting to a staff sling to enable "
"it to throw grenades."
msgstr "一个更大的托架，带着一根更长的吊索，用于安装在投石杖上，使其能够投掷手雷。"

#. ~ Target of gun mod "grenade cradle for staff sling"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "staff_sling"
msgstr "staff_sling"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/grip.json
msgid "lightweight replacement furniture"
msgid_plural "lightweight replacement furnitures"
msgstr[0] "轻量化枪械结构化替换模组"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "lightweight replacement furniture"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/grip.json
msgid ""
"A set of lightweight composite grips and furniture that reduces a firearm's "
"weight, and as a consequence, its handling and melee damage."
msgstr "一组用于轻量化枪械握把和其他结构的结构化替换模组，它可以用来减少枪械的重量，因此会提高后坐力，降低近战伤害。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/grip.json
msgid "ergonomic grip"
msgid_plural "ergonomic grips"
msgstr[0] "人体工程握把"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "ergonomic grip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/grip.json
msgid ""
"A set of ergonomic replacement furniture for a firearm improving handling."
msgstr "一套符合人体工学的手枪配件，可以改善后坐力。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/grip.json
msgid "breacher grip"
msgid_plural "breacher grips"
msgstr[0] "破门握把"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "breacher grip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/grip.json
msgid ""
"A very uncomfortable straight grip.  Clearly not intended for regular use."
msgstr "非常不舒服的直握把。显然不是为了日常使用设计的。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
msgid "beam scatterer"
msgid_plural "beam scatterers"
msgstr[0] "激光散射器"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "beam scatterer"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of optics made to fit on laser weapons, which will diffract the laser "
"beam into several lower powered beams.  This increases point-blank damage, "
"but greatly reduces range."
msgstr "一套适用于激光武器的光学器件，可将激光束分解成许多低能激光。增加近身伤害，但大大减少射程。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
msgid "focusing lens"
msgid_plural "focusing lenses"
msgstr[0] "聚焦透镜"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "focusing lens"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of optics to concentrate the laser beam on a smaller focus point.  "
"This increases range and damage output, but complicates targeting."
msgstr "一套光学透镜，用于将激光束聚焦成更小的点。这增加了射程和伤害，但是使瞄准更加复杂。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
msgid "electrolaser conversion"
msgid_plural "electrolaser conversions"
msgstr[0] "电子激光束改装件"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "electrolaser conversion"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of high-tech electronics and optics.  Converts a laser pistol into a "
"less-lethal electrolaser capable of stunning targets, at the cost of a "
"decreased damage output and increased power consumption."
msgstr ""
"一套高科技电路及光学器件。这个改装模组可将激光手枪改装成发射能够击晕目标的非致命电子束激光，但相应的会减少伤害输出，并增加射击时的能量消耗。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
msgid "effective emitter"
msgid_plural "effective emitters"
msgstr[0] "高效发射器"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "effective emitter"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of electronics to optimize emitter workcycle and increase overall "
"energy efficiency.  Decreases power consumption."
msgstr "一套用于优化发射器工作循环的电子设备，能增加整体能量效率并降低能量消耗。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
msgid "high density capacitor"
msgid_plural "high density capacitors"
msgstr[0] "高密度电容"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "high density capacitor"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/laser_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A capacitor with a higher energy density.  Increases range and damage at the"
" cost of markedly increased power consumption."
msgstr "一个使用了高能量密度材质制成的电容器，能够增加激光武器的射程和伤害，但同时也极大的增加了射击时的能量消耗。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/loading_port.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/gunmods/gunmods.json
msgid "speedloader chute"
msgid_plural "speedloader chutes"
msgstr[0] "快速装弹器滑槽"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "speedloader chute"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/loading_port.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/gunmods/gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A metal ramp that is installed near a shotgun's feeding port to index "
"speedloader tubes."
msgstr "一条金属斜坡，安装在霰弹枪的装弹口附近，用来引导快速装弹器。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "match trigger"
msgid_plural "match triggers"
msgstr[0] "配重扳机"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "match trigger"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A precision weighted trigger assembly that slightly improves a firearm's "
"accuracy."
msgstr "这种精密的配重扳机组件可以略为提升枪械命中率。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "drop-in auto sear"
msgid_plural "drop-in auto sears"
msgstr[0] "插入式自动阻铁"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "drop-in auto sear"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A vaguely 'U'-shaped piece of metal with a vaguely 'T'-shaped flapper on a "
"pin.  Once tucked into an AR-15's lower receiver, the rifle will become "
"selective fire-capable.  The handcrafted-sear surface isn't as good as "
"actual full-auto parts, so precision and reliability suffer slightly."
msgstr ""
"一个U形金属片和一个T形活动挡板通过转轴组装在一起。把它塞进AR-15步枪的下机匣里，能够改变射击模式。由于自制挡板的表面不如实际的全自动阻铁好，所以精度和可靠性略有下降。"

#. ~ Target of gun mod "drop-in auto sear"
#. ~ Target of gun mod "lightning link"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "ar15_retool_300blk"
msgstr "ar15_retool_300blk"

