#. ~ Target of gun mod "lightning link"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "oa93"
msgstr "oa93"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "lightning link"
msgid_plural "lightning links"
msgstr[0] "“闪电链”扳机"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "lightning link"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"Originally designed for the Colt SP-1, this 'reproduction' is intended to "
"convert an AR-15 into a full-auto only rifle.  Once the necessary "
"modifications are made and the link is in place, semi-auto is disabled and "
"full-auto is enabled.  Reliability and precision suffer greatly due to "
"questionable craftsmanship and lack of unobtainium SP-1 parts."
msgstr ""
"最初为柯尔特SP-1步枪设计，这个“复刻品”可将一把 AR-15 "
"步枪变成一把全自动步枪。当所需的修改到位并安装上“闪电链”扳机之后，将不再使用半自动模式，而是使用全自动模式发射。由于制造工艺有问题，以及难以获得的 "
"SP-1 原装件，改装后的枪械可靠性和精度受到很大影响。"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid "Glock auto sear plate"
msgid_plural "Glock auto sear plates"
msgstr[0] "格洛克自动卡扣"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Glock auto sear plate"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A relatively simple switch or button mechanism that replaces the back plate "
"of a Glock slide, allowing it to function as a select-fire machine pistol.  "
"A highly illegal modification, but the feds are zombie food anyway.  This "
"will fit any standard Glock pistol in 9mm, .40, .45, 10mm, or .357 caliber."
msgstr ""
"一个结构还算简单的扳机或按钮模组，取代了格洛克手枪滑槽的背板，将其改造成一把可选射击模式的自动手枪。这算是极度违法的改装，但反正联邦调查局都已经成为丧尸们的大餐了。该模组适用于任何9mm、.40口径、.45口径、10mm或.357口径标准的格洛克手枪。"

