"这把由高碳钢制成，带有坚固的握把，感觉是一把合适的武器。平衡性很好，刀刃也相当锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened arming sword"
msgid_plural "hardened arming swords"
msgstr[0] "骑士剑（表面硬化碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "hardened arming sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"一把经典的中世纪剑，大小正好可以单手使用。\n"
"\n"
