#. ~ Description of "arming sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a classic medieval sword, just the right "
"size to use one-handed."
msgstr "一把经典的中世纪剑，适合单手使用。这把是廉价且笨拙的仿制品。"

#. ~ Description of "arming sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed.  This one "
"doesn't seem to have been made right."
msgstr "一把经典的中世纪剑，刚好适合单手使用。不过，这把似乎做得不太合格。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/MMA/exemplar_weapons.json
msgid "xiphos"
msgid_plural "xiphe"
msgstr[0] "西福斯短剑"

#. ~ Description of "xiphos"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A bronze sword of ancient Greek origin, wielded as a sidearm to the dory "
"spear."
msgstr "一把源自古希腊的青铜剑，希腊长枪以外的副武器。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "khopesh"
msgid_plural "khopeshes"
msgstr[0] "古埃及镰状剑"

#. ~ Description of "khopesh"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This ancient bronze weapon features a curved, sickle-like blade sharpened on"
" the outside edge.  Associated with the New Kingdom period of Ancient Egypt,"
" it was designed mainly to hack through the light armor common to the "
"region."
msgstr "这把古老的青铜兵器有一个弯曲、镰刀状的锋利外刃。发源于古埃及新王国时期，它的主要目的是砍开当地盛行的轻装甲。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "dao"
msgid_plural "dao"
msgstr[0] "中式刀"

#. ~ Description of "dao"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese sword consisting of a curved blade and a guard with a "
"cupped design.  Existing since the Shang dynasty, this one is made of "
"bronze.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, alongside the jian "
"sword, qiang spear, and gun staff."
msgstr "一把古中国刀，由青铜制成，刀身微曲，配以杯形护手。源自商代的设计。民间传说中四大武器之一，其余三个是：剑、枪和棍。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "bronze sword"
msgid_plural "bronze swords"
msgstr[0] "青铜剑"

#. ~ Description of "bronze sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An imitation of a sword made from bronze.  It is a capable weapon, but it "
"cannot compare to actual swords."
msgstr "一把青铜剑的仿制品。它是把还可以的武器，但无法与真正的剑相比。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "combat machete"
msgid_plural "combat machetes"
msgstr[0] "战斗砍刀"

#. ~ Description of "combat machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This common gardening tool has been customized and rebalanced to improve its"
