msgstr "一柄安装在枪械或弩前端的大型斩击武器。可以让你的武器变成近战长矛。这把刺刀经过了改装，可以装在除了手枪和冲锋枪之外的几乎任何武器上。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tanto"
msgid_plural "tanto"
msgstr[0] "日式短刀"

#. ~ Description of "tanto"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"Long Japanese knives like this more-modern remake were the samurai's backup "
"weapon, before the advent of the larger wakizashi.  It's still a deadly "
"blade, even if it's smaller than its more famous relatives."
msgstr ""
"一把日式短刀，在胁差发明之前曾经是武士的备用武器。虽然比更有名的日本刀小，但仍然是把致命的武器。\n"
"\"在末世的绝望中可以赋予你更具意义的自尽方式。\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "wakizashi"
msgid_plural "wakizashi"
msgstr[0] "胁差"

#. ~ Description of "wakizashi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A comparatively-common Japanese short sword.  Smaller and lighter than a "
"katana, but still effective in combat."
msgstr "一柄短刀，日本武士用于室内及其他狭小空间贴身战斗，通常随身携带，遭遇袭击时，在打刀、太刀不利于使用的情况下自卫。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel wakizashi"
msgid_plural "mild steel wakizashi"
msgstr[0] "胁差（低碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel wakizashi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a comparatively-common Japanese short sword.  Smaller and lighter than a katana, but still effective in combat.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一柄短刀，日本武士用于室内及其他狭小空间贴身战斗，通常随身携带，遭遇袭击时，在打刀、太刀不利于使用的情况下自卫。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#. ~ Item name
