"Made with mild carbon steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于日本镰仓时代后的野太刀，多用于武士骑马作战，亦是一种勇武的象征，刀身并不宽阔但极为锋利，相比于其尺寸来说意外轻便，极具致命性。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel nodachi"
msgid_plural "medium steel nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀（中碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for its size.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于日本镰仓时代后的野太刀，多用于武士骑马作战，亦是一种勇武的象征，刀身并不宽阔但极为锋利，相比于其尺寸来说意外轻便，极具致命性。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel nodachi"
msgid_plural "high steel nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀（高碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "high steel nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for its size.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high carbon steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于日本镰仓时代后的野太刀，多用于武士骑马作战，亦是一种勇武的象征，刀身并不宽阔但极为锋利，相比于其尺寸来说意外轻便，极具致命性。\n"
"\n"
"这把由高碳钢制成，带有坚固的握把，感觉是一把合适的武器。平衡性很好，刀刃也相当锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened nodachi"
msgid_plural "hardened nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀（表面硬化碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "hardened nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for its size.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于日本镰仓时代后的野太刀，多用于武士骑马作战，亦是一种勇武的象征，刀身并不宽阔但极为锋利，相比于其尺寸来说意外轻便，极具致命性。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢经过表面硬化制成，带有一个与你的手完美贴合的模制握把，看起来和能在博物馆里找到的任何武器一样好。平衡性很完美，边缘像剃刀一样锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered nodachi"
msgid_plural "tempered nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀（回火碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "tempered nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for its size.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"一柄起源于日本镰仓时代后的野太刀，多用于武士骑马作战，亦是一种勇武的象征，刀身并不宽阔但极为锋利，相比于其尺寸来说意外轻便，极具致命性。\n"
"\n"
"这把由中碳钢经过回火处理制成，堪称为杰作：握柄、平衡、剑刃，都无比完美，剑匠工艺的巅峰。"

#. ~ Description of "nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan."
"  It is surprisingly light for its size."
msgstr "一柄日本武士骑马作战时所用的野太刀，亦称“大太刀”。此款外观、造型和材料与正品有差异，为廉价复制品。"

#. ~ Description of "nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly light for "
"its size, but also much bendier than a sword should be."
msgstr "一柄日式弯刃双手大刀，相比于其尺寸来说轻得有点过头了，比起真刀来容易弯折。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "fencing foil"
msgid_plural "fencing foils"
msgstr[0] "击剑花剑"

#. ~ Description of "fencing foil"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  Unfortunately, a "
"fencing foil is rather useless as a weapon due to its flexible shaft and "
"dull tip."
msgstr "一把武器，用于最高贵的击剑运动。但是在大灾变后，这把剑身软又钝的剑没什么用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "fencing épée"
msgid_plural "fencing épées"
msgstr[0] "击剑重剑"

#. ~ Description of "fencing épée"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  The épée is the "
"heaviest and stiffest of the fencing weapons, and therefore perhaps the most"
" useful in your situation."
msgstr "击剑运动用的武器，很高级。这种剑是各种比赛用剑中最为沉重和坚固的一种，因此在实战中可能最为有用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "fencing saber"
msgid_plural "fencing sabers"
msgstr[0] "击剑佩剑"

#. ~ Description of "fencing saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  The fencing saber "
"is marginally shorter than the foil and épée, but no less effective."
msgstr "击剑运动用的武器，很高级。这把有开锋的佩剑比重剑和花剑要稍微短一些，但是威力不减。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "sharpened foil"
msgid_plural "sharpened foils"
msgstr[0] "磨尖花剑"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened foil"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing foil has had its electrical plunger "
"assembly removed and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still"
" lacks a cutting edge, it is now somewhat more lethal, yet still familiar to"
" the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"这把曾经人畜无害的花剑的压力感应器已经被移除，末端被粗糙地磨尖。虽然它还是没有剑刃，但磨尖的末端已经使它带有一定程度的致命性，对于熟悉击剑的人来说还是比较有用的。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "sharpened épée"
msgid_plural "sharpened épées"
msgstr[0] "磨尖重剑"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened épée"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing épée has had its electrical plunger "
"assembly removed and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still"
" lacks a cutting edge, it is now considerably more lethal, yet still "
"familiar to the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"这把曾经人畜无害的重剑的压力感应器已经被移除，末端被粗糙地磨尖。虽然它还是没有剑刃，但磨尖的末端已经使它带有相当程度的致命性，对于熟悉击剑的人来说还是比较有用的。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "sharpened saber"
msgid_plural "sharpened sabers"
msgstr[0] "磨尖佩剑"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing saber has had its rounded tip "
"snapped off and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still "
"lacks a cutting edge, it is now considerably more lethal, yet still familiar"
" to the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"这把曾经人畜无害的佩剑的钝尖已经被折断，末端被粗糙地磨尖。虽然它还是没有剑刃，但磨尖的剑尖已经使它带有相当程度的致命性，对于熟悉击剑的人来说还是比较有用的。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "electrified foil"
msgid_plural "electrified foils"
msgstr[0] "电击花剑"

#. ~ Description of "electrified foil"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing foil may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been "
"made to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to "
"the guard, wired through the electronic scoring circuit to the tip.  "
"Thrusting the sharpened tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch "
"will deliver a painful electric shock."
msgstr ""
"这把花剑的改装可以说毫无体育精神，但是能够给你在这场末日比赛中带来一点优势。这把花剑的把手经过了充分绝缘改装，剑格上接上了一把高压电击枪，并通过电子计分器的电路连到了花剑末端。如果你在击打敌人时按下电击开关，就可以释放出一道强烈的电击。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "electrified épée"
msgid_plural "electrified épées"
msgstr[0] "电击重剑"

#. ~ Description of "electrified épée"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing épée may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been "
"made to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to "
"the guard, wired through the electronic scoring circuit to the tip.  "
"Thrusting the sharpened tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch "
"will deliver a painful electric shock."
msgstr ""
"这把重剑的改装可以说毫无体育精神，但是能够给你在这场末日比赛中带来一点优势。这把重剑的把手经过了充分绝缘改装，剑格上接上了一把高压电击枪，并通过电子计分器的电路连到了重剑末端。如果你在击打敌人时按下电击开关，就可以释放出一道强烈的电击。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "electrified saber"
msgid_plural "electrified sabers"
msgstr[0] "电击佩剑"

#. ~ Description of "electrified saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing saber may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been "
"made to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to "
"the guard, wired to the tip along the saber's groove.  Thrusting the "
"sharpened tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch will deliver a "
"painful electric shock."
msgstr ""
"这把佩剑的改装可以说毫无体育精神，但是能够给你在这场末日比赛中带来一点优势。这把佩剑的把手经过了充分绝缘改装，剑格上接上了一把高压电击枪，并沿着佩剑的血槽连到了剑的末端。如果你在击打敌人时按下电击开关，就可以释放出一道强烈的电击。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hollow cane"
msgid_plural "hollow canes"
msgstr[0] "空心手杖"

#. ~ Description of "hollow cane"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A cane designed to conceal a blade.  This was a popular fashion accessory "
"for the wealthy during the 18th and 19th centuries."
msgstr "藏了一把剑的手杖。这在18至19世纪的欧洲是富人之间流行的时尚装备。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "sword cane"
msgid_plural "sword canes"
msgstr[0] "手杖剑"

#. ~ Description of "sword cane"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "A sword with a thin blade designed to be hidden inside a hollow cane."
msgstr "一把薄刃的短剑，能藏在空心手杖里面。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "broadsword"
msgid_plural "broadswords"
msgstr[0] "阔剑"

#. ~ Description of "broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An Early Modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  "
"Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers."
msgstr "一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel broadsword"
msgid_plural "mild steel broadswords"
msgstr[0] "阔剑（低碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is an early modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel broadsword"
msgid_plural "medium steel broadswords"
msgstr[0] "阔剑（中碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is an early modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel broadsword"
msgid_plural "high steel broadswords"
msgstr[0] "阔剑（高碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "high steel broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is an early modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high carbon steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。\n"
"\n"
"这把由高碳钢制成，带有坚固的握把，感觉是一把合适的武器。平衡性很好，刀刃也相当锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened broadsword"
msgid_plural "hardened broadswords"
msgstr[0] "阔剑（表面硬化碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "hardened broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is an early modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢经过表面硬化制成，带有一个与你的手完美贴合的模制握把，看起来和能在博物馆里找到的任何武器一样好。平衡性很完美，边缘像剃刀一样锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered broadsword"
msgid_plural "tempered broadswords"
msgstr[0] "阔剑（回火碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "tempered broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is an early modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。\n"
"\n"
"这把由中碳钢经过回火处理制成，堪称为杰作：握柄、平衡、剑刃，都无比完美，剑匠工艺的巅峰。"

#. ~ Description of "broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An Early Modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  "
"This sword appears to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a"
" few swings."
msgstr "一种早期的现代剑，在16到18世纪的西方被广泛使用。之所以命名为阔剑，是为了与细长的迅捷剑对比。这一把看上去很糟糕，但挥舞几次问题不大。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "cutlass"
msgid_plural "cutlasses"
msgstr[0] "短弯刀"

#. ~ Description of "cutlass"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a broad saber known for its use by sailors "
"and pirates."
msgstr "一把阔刃军刀的拙劣仿制品，因为普遍被水手与海盗使用而闻名。此款外观、造型和材料与正品有差异，为廉价复制品。"

#. ~ Description of "cutlass"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates.  This sword appears "
"to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a few swings."
msgstr "这种阔刃军刀因为普遍被水手与海盗使用而闻名。偏短的刀刃让它在近身时得心应手。这一把看上去很糟糕，但挥舞几次问题不大。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/MMA/exemplar_weapons.json
msgid "rapier"
msgid_plural "rapiers"
msgstr[0] "迅捷剑"

#. ~ Description of "rapier"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A thin sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the preferred weapon "
"of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes any battle a "
"stylish battle."
msgstr "很适合绅士与剑士使用的武器，轻盈而迅捷，可以适用于各种战斗。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel rapier"
msgid_plural "mild steel rapiers"
msgstr[0] "迅捷剑（低碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel rapier"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes any battle a stylish battle.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"很适合绅士与剑士使用的武器，轻盈而迅捷，可以适用于各种战斗。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel rapier"
msgid_plural "medium steel rapiers"
msgstr[0] "迅捷剑（中碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel rapier"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes any battle a stylish battle.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"很适合绅士与剑士使用的武器，轻盈而迅捷，可以适用于各种战斗。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel rapier"
msgid_plural "high steel rapiers"
msgstr[0] "迅捷剑（高碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "high steel rapier"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes any battle a stylish battle.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high carbon steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"很适合绅士与剑士使用的武器，轻盈而迅捷，可以适用于各种战斗。\n"
"\n"
"这把由高碳钢制成，带有坚固的握把，感觉是一把合适的武器。平衡性很好，刀刃也相当锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened rapier"
msgid_plural "hardened rapiers"
msgstr[0] "迅捷剑（表面硬化碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "hardened rapier"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes any battle a stylish battle.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"很适合绅士与剑士使用的武器，轻盈而迅捷，可以适用于各种战斗。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢经过表面硬化制成，带有一个与你的手完美贴合的模制握把，看起来和能在博物馆里找到的任何武器一样好。平衡性很完美，边缘像剃刀一样锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered rapier"
msgid_plural "tempered rapiers"
msgstr[0] "迅捷剑（回火碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "tempered rapier"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes any battle a stylish battle.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"很适合绅士与剑士使用的武器，轻盈而迅捷，可以适用于各种战斗。\n"
"\n"
"这把由中碳钢经过回火处理制成，堪称为杰作：握柄、平衡、剑刃，都无比完美，剑匠工艺的巅峰。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#: data/mods/MMA/exemplar_weapons.json
msgid "katana"
msgid_plural "katanas"
msgstr[0] "武士刀"

#. ~ Description of "katana"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A rare sword from Japan.  Deadly against unarmored targets, and still very "
"effective against armor."
msgstr "一柄来自日本的稀有武士刀，打刀款式，为日本武士步兵作战时使用。刀身中央略微弯曲，以利于迅速拔刀，刀刃锋利无比，对付无装甲目标十分致命。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel katana"
msgid_plural "mild steel katana"
msgstr[0] "武士刀（低碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel katana"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a rare sword from Japan.  Deadly against unarmored targets, and still very effective against armor.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一柄来自日本的稀有武士刀，打刀款式，为日本武士步兵作战时使用。刀身中央略微弯曲，以利于迅速拔刀，刀刃锋利无比，对付无装甲目标十分致命。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

