#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "hardened kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "德式战刀（表面硬化碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "hardened kriegsmesser"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A single-edged hand-and-a-half-sword of German design, with a long, curved blade.  It became popular across Europe due to it's low cost while maintaining strong cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"起源于德国的单刃手半剑，带有长而弯曲的刀片。与更复杂的长剑相比，它成本低廉，同时仍有强大的切割力，因此在欧洲广受欢迎。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢经过表面硬化制成，带有一个与你的手完美贴合的模制握把，看起来和能在博物馆里找到的任何武器一样好。平衡性很完美，边缘像剃刀一样锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "tempered kriegsmesser"
msgid_plural "tempered kriegsmessers"
msgstr[0] "德式战刀（回火碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "tempered kriegsmesser"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A single-edged hand-and-a-half-sword of German design, with a long, curved blade.  It became popular across Europe due to it's low cost while maintaining strong cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"起源于德国的单刃手半剑，带有长而弯曲的刀片。与更复杂的长剑相比，它成本低廉，同时仍有强大的切割力，因此在欧洲广受欢迎。\n"
"\n"
"这把由中碳钢经过回火处理制成，堪称为杰作：握柄、平衡、剑刃，都无比完美，剑匠工艺的巅峰。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "falx"
msgid_plural "falxes"
msgstr[0] "达西安镰刀"

#. ~ Description of "falx"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A distinct Dacian sword that curves forward, allowing you to bypass shields "
"or hook and pull enemies, while delivering decent chopping damage."
msgstr "一种曾经由达西安人使用的独特弯刀，让你可以绕过盾牌并钩拉敌人，同时提供不错的斩击伤害。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "mild steel falx"
msgid_plural "mild steel falxes"
msgstr[0] "达西安镰刀（低碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "mild steel falx"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A distinct Dacian sword that curves forward, allowing you to bypass shields or hook and pull enemies, while delivering decent chopping damage.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and lacking a proper grip, this is better than the sticks you swung around as a kid, but you know you can do better."
msgstr ""
"一种曾经由达西安人使用的独特弯刀，让你可以绕过盾牌并钩拉敌人，同时提供不错的斩击伤害。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，而且缺乏合适的握柄，虽然比你小时候挥舞的棍子好，但你知道你可以做得更好。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "medium steel falx"
msgid_plural "medium steel falxes"
msgstr[0] "达西安镰刀（中碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "medium steel falx"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A distinct Dacian sword that curves forward, allowing you to bypass shields or hook and pull enemies, while delivering decent chopping damage.\n"
"\n"
"Made with mild carbon steel and with a grip made of leather wrapped in steel wire, this weapon is comfortable in your hand, though the balance isn't perfect and the edge could be sharper."
msgstr ""
"一种曾经由达西安人使用的独特弯刀，让你可以绕过盾牌并钩拉敌人，同时提供不错的斩击伤害。\n"
"\n"
"这把由低碳钢制成，带有钢丝包裹着皮革的握柄，拿在手里很舒服，但平衡性并不完美，边缘也可以更锋利。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "high steel falx"
msgid_plural "high steel falxes"
msgstr[0] "达西安镰刀（高碳钢）"

#. ~ Description of "high steel falx"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A distinct Dacian sword that curves forward, allowing you to bypass shields or hook and pull enemies, while delivering decent chopping damage.\n"
"\n"
"Made with high carbon steel and featuring a sturdy grip, this feels like a proper weapon.  The balance feels right and the blade is quite sharp."
msgstr ""
"一种曾经由达西安人使用的独特弯刀，让你可以绕过盾牌并钩拉敌人，同时提供不错的斩击伤害。\n"
"\n"
"这把由高碳钢制成，带有坚固的握把，感觉是一把合适的武器。平衡性很好，刀刃也相当锋利。"

