msgid_plural "pairs of scrap knuckles"
msgstr[0] "废料指虎"

#. ~ Description of "pair of scrap knuckles"
#: data/json/items/melee/unarmed_weapons.json
msgid ""
"A mass of scrap metal crudely beat into shape, with folded rags underneath "
"to protect the wearer's knuckles.  A good, quick weapon - but you have to "
"get within punching range to use it."
msgstr "一块被粗鲁敲打成型的废金属，有几层布内衬来保护穿戴者的关节，一件不错的快速武器，不过你可能需要在很近的距离来用它。"

