msgid_plural "spikes"
msgstr[0] "钉刺"

#. ~ Description of "spike"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A large and slightly misshapen spike, could do some damage mounted on a "
"vehicle."
msgstr "一根大而稍有畸形的铁刺，可以安装在载具上，对撞击的敌人造成一些伤害。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
