msgstr "一种高密度但脆性较高的金属，常用作铅的替代品。"

#. ~ Density 19.32g/cm³ ~ 4.8kg/250ml @ stack 1000 = 5g/unit
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
