#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "This is a single, or twin, sized mattress."
msgstr "这是一张单人床的床垫。"

#. ~ Description of "down mattress"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "This is a single, or twin, sized down filled mattress."
msgstr "这是一张单人床的羽绒床垫。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "fuse"
msgid_plural "fuse"
msgstr[0] "引信"

#. ~ Description of "fuse"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A piece of fuse, long enough to give you enough time to get away from most "
"explosions."
msgstr "一小段导火索，长度足够让你有时间逃离爆炸。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "sharp rock"
msgid_plural "sharp rocks"
msgstr[0] "坚锐岩块"

#. ~ Description of "sharp rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A baseball-sized rock with a somewhat sharp edge that also chips in a semi-"
"predictable way if struck.  With the right skills, you could give it a "
"better edge."
msgstr "一个棒球大小的岩石，按照特殊方式敲碎时会破碎，留下锋利的边缘。当有足够技巧时，可以获得更锋利的边缘。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "rubber sole"
msgid_plural "rubber soles"
msgstr[0] "橡胶鞋底"

#. ~ Description of "rubber sole"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a sole made from rubber, usually found on the bottoms of boots.  Can"
" be used for making actual boots."
msgstr "一个由橡胶制成的鞋底，就是在靴子底部的那种。可以用来做一双真正的靴子。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "thick rubber chunk"
msgid_plural "thick rubber chunks"
msgstr[0] "厚橡胶块"

#. ~ Description of "thick rubber chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a chunk of thick, semi-rigid rubber, similar to what tires are made "
"from."
msgstr "一块厚厚的半硬质橡胶块，类似于轮胎所使用的材料。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "rubber tire strip"
msgid_plural "rubber tire strips"
msgstr[0] "橡胶轮胎条"

#. ~ Description of "rubber tire strip"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a long curled strip of thick, semi-rigid rubber cut from a tire."
msgstr "一块长而卷曲的半硬质橡胶轮胎条。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "ballistic shoulder protector"
msgid_plural "ballistic shoulder protectors"
msgstr[0] "防弹护肩"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic shoulder protector"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"Nylon armor with soft armor insert protecting the deltoid and upper arm.  "
"Designed to be attached to US military body armor."
msgstr "一件尼龙盔甲，插入了能防护三角肌和上臂的软装甲片。设计用于与美军防弹衣同时穿着。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "ballistic groin protector"
msgid_plural "ballistic groin protectors"
msgstr[0] "防弹护裆"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic groin protector"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"Front and back nylon armor with soft armor inserts for groin and butt "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to US military body armor."
msgstr "一件覆盖了正面和背面的尼龙盔甲，插入了能防护腹股沟和臀部的软装甲片。设计用于与美军防弹衣同时穿着。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "grenade launcher buttstock"
msgid_plural "grenade launcher buttstocks"
msgstr[0] "榴弹发射底座"

#. ~ Description of "grenade launcher buttstock"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collapsible buttstock designed for the M320 grenade launcher.  When "
"combined with this stock, the M320 can be used as a standalone weapon"
msgstr "一种为M320榴弹发射器设计的可折叠尾部托。M320装了这个枪托后可作为单兵武器使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "wasp sting"
msgid_plural "wasp stings"
msgstr[0] "黄蜂刺"

#. ~ Description of "wasp sting"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A six-inch stinger from a giant wasp.  Makes a poor melee weapon."
msgstr "一条巨型黄蜂身上的六英寸毒刺，可以勉强当成武器使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "cannonball"
msgid_plural "cannonballs"
msgstr[0] "炮弹弹丸"

#. ~ Description of "cannonball"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A 4 pound cannonball.  With some gunpowder, wadding, and a fuse, it could be"
" prepared to load into a cannon."
msgstr "一个4磅重的炮弹。加上一些火药、填塞物和导火索，它就可以装进大炮了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "RC car wheel set"
msgid_plural "RC car wheel sets"
msgstr[0] "遥控车轮组"

#. ~ Description of "RC car wheel set"
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"Small set of wheels for a radio controlled car.  Could be improvised with "
"caster wheels if given rubber treads for grip."
msgstr "一套小型遥控车车轮。可以用购物车脚轮加上防滑橡胶圈替代。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "thermoplastic resin chunk"
msgid_plural "thermoplastic resin chunks"
msgstr[0] "热塑树脂块"

#. ~ Description of "thermoplastic resin chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This piece of tough thermoplastic resin could allow you to fabricate, "
"repair, or reinforce items."
msgstr "这块坚硬的热塑树脂可以用来制造、修理或强化物品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "epoxy chunk"
msgid_plural "epoxy chunks"
msgstr[0] "环氧树脂块"

#. ~ Description of "epoxy chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This piece of epoxy is hardy and durable.  You could potentially craft items"
" with it."
msgstr "这块环氧树脂既坚韧又耐用。你可以用它来制作物品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "10L plastic block"
msgid_plural "10L plastic blocks"
msgstr[0] "塑料块（10L）"

#. ~ Description of "10L plastic block"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "A ten-liter block of solid plastic."
msgstr "一块体积十升的实心塑料。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "5L plastic block"
msgid_plural "5L plastic blocks"
msgstr[0] "塑料块（5L）"

#. ~ Description of "5L plastic block"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "A five-liter block of solid plastic."
msgstr "一块体积五升的实心塑料。"

#. ~ Based on a density around 1.05 grams/mL, like PLA and ABS, + 100% for
#. being rigid and probably oddly-shaped.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "plastic chunk"
msgid_plural "plastic chunks"
msgstr[0] "塑料片"

#. ~ Based on a density around 1.05 grams/mL, like PLA and ABS, + 100% for
#. being rigid and probably oddly-shaped.
#. ~ Description of "plastic chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a piece of plastic.  It could be used to fabricate, repair, or "
"reinforce plastic items."
msgstr "一块塑料。可以用来制造、修复或者强化塑料制品。"

#. ~ .5mm thick, 250GSM
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "synthetic fabric patch"
msgid_plural "synthetic fabric patches"
msgstr[0] "化纤布片"

#. ~ .5mm thick, 250GSM
#. ~ Description of "synthetic fabric patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This a 6 inch square patch of synthetic fabric.  Unlike you and other "
"natural materials, it won't degrade much with age.  Maybe that's less of a "
"bad thing now."
msgstr "一块6英寸见方的化纤织物。与你和其他天然材料不同，它不会随着年龄的增长而衰老退化。不过也许现在这不算什么坏事了。"

#. ~ 180GSM, .63mm thick
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "Lycra patch"
msgid_plural "Lycra patches"
msgstr[0] "氨纶布片"

#. ~ 180GSM, .63mm thick
#. ~ Description of "Lycra patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a 6 inch square patch of synthetic fabric blended with stretchy "
"Lycra fibers.  It could be used to make flexible yet strong clothing.  "
"Stylish, but bad for the environment; at least you're recycling it."
msgstr "一块6英寸见方的弹性氨纶化纤织物。可以用来制造具有弹性而坚韧的衣物。时尚，但不环保；但至少现在你会回收它了。"

#. ~ Roughly 1.6 square meters of 1 mil (0.0254 mm) thick HDPE plastic,
#. density 0.94 g/cm3, like a strong garbage bag is made of.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "large plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "large plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "大塑料膜"

#. ~ Roughly 1.6 square meters of 1 mil (0.0254 mm) thick HDPE plastic,
#. density 0.94 g/cm3, like a strong garbage bag is made of.
#. ~ Description of "large plastic sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a large sheet of flexible plastic, the sort that might have been "
"used for commercial wrapping or for weather-sealing a home."
msgstr "一张大型的柔性塑料薄膜，这种塑料可能用于商品包装或房屋防水处理。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "塑料薄膜"

#. ~ Description of "plastic sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a small sheet of flexible plastic, like a cut up garbage bag.  It "
"might be useful for waterproofing clothes."
msgstr "一张小型的柔性塑料薄膜，就像是被切开的垃圾袋一样。它可以用于防水衣物的制造。"

#. ~ Density of 1.2 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "polycarbonate sheet"
msgid_plural "polycarbonate sheets"
msgstr[0] "聚碳酸酯板"

#. ~ Density of 1.2 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "polycarbonate sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a stack of polycarbonate sheets that can be used for, among other "
"things, vacuum molding."
msgstr "一叠聚碳酸酯板，可用于真空吸塑成型等。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "rigid plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "rigid plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "硬塑料板"

#. ~ Description of "rigid plastic sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A large, rigid sheet of translucent plastic, useful for all manner of "
"things; from construction to art, or even junior snowboarding."
msgstr "一整片坚硬的半透明塑料，可用于各种用途；从搭建建筑到艺术作品，甚至还能当作入门级滑雪板使用。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "flaking rock"
msgid_plural "flaking rocks"
msgstr[0] "燧岩"

#. ~ Description of "flaking rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A rock the size of a baseball, which chips in a semi-predictable way if "
"struck, leaving a sharp edge.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is also good"
" for throwing at enemies."
msgstr "一个棒球大小的岩石，按照特殊方式敲碎时会破碎，留下锋利的边缘。可以当一个凑合的近战武器，也可以当作投掷武器。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "flint"
msgid_plural "flints"
msgstr[0] "燧石"

#. ~ Description of "flint"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of flint, the kind of rock that can make sparks if stuck against "
"high-carbon steel.  It also chips in a semi-predictable way if struck, "
"leaving a sharp edge."
msgstr "一块燧石，这种岩石在击打高碳钢时会产生火花。按照特殊方式敲碎时会破碎，留下锋利的边缘。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "large rock"
msgid_plural "large rocks"
msgstr[0] "大块岩石"

#. ~ Description of "large rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A heavy and large rock, big enough to be used as a primitive anvil, or "
"shaped into larger stone items."
msgstr "一块有铁砧大小的沉重石头，大到可以当作简易铁砧使用，或被制造成大型石制物品。"

#. ~ I am assuming this is made of rock wool, but it could also be fiberglass.
#. There is almost no practical difference for our purposes.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "fiber insulation batt"
msgid_plural "fiber insulation batts"
msgstr[0] "纤维绝缘垫"

#. ~ I am assuming this is made of rock wool, but it could also be fiberglass.
#. There is almost no practical difference for our purposes.
#. ~ Description of "fiber insulation batt"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A foil-wrapped batt of fibrous insulation: fire and moisture resistant, used"
" for hot appliances like dishwashers and ovens."
msgstr "一条覆盖着隔热玻璃纤维的垫子：防火防潮，用于洗碗机和烤箱等产热电器。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "grass yarn"
msgid_plural "grass yarns"
msgstr[0] "草线"

#. ~ Description of "grass yarn"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Some primitive yarn made from coarse plant fibers like straw or grass.  Too "
"thick to sew with, but could be woven into a crude sheet of fabric."
msgstr "一些用干草一类的粗糙植物纤维制作的简单丝线。太粗了，没法用来缝纫，但是可以编织成简易的织物。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "cotton scraps"
msgid_plural "cotton scraps"
msgstr[0] "棉布碎片"

#. ~ Description of "cotton scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of cotton, waste material from tailoring "
"projects.  Not useful for much and usually disposed of, but can be recycled "
"into some thread if you really want."
msgstr "形状奇特的小块棉布，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃，但如果你实在想的话，可以从其中回收些棉线。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "faux fur scraps"
msgid_plural "faux fur scraps"
msgstr[0] "人造毛皮碎片"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of faux fur, waste material from tailoring "
"projects.  Not useful for much and usually disposed of."
msgstr "形状奇特的小块人造毛皮，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "felt scraps"
msgid_plural "felt scraps"
msgstr[0] "毛毡碎片"

#. ~ Description of "felt scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of felt, waste material from tailoring projects."
"  Not useful for much and usually disposed of, but can be recycled into some"
" wool fiber if you really want."
msgstr "形状奇特的小块毛毡，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃，但如果你实在想的话，可以从其中回收些毛线。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "fur scraps"
msgid_plural "fur scraps"
msgstr[0] "毛皮碎片"

#. ~ Description of "fur scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of fur, waste material from tailoring projects.  "
"Not useful for much and usually disposed of."
msgstr "形状奇特的小块毛皮，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "Kevlar scraps"
msgid_plural "Kevlar scraps"
msgstr[0] "凯夫拉碎片"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of Kevlar fabric, waste material from tailoring "
"projects.  Normally it's disposed of, but since Kevlar would be very "
"difficult to make in a post-apocalyptic world, it might be worth recycling "
"it for Kevlar thread."
msgstr ""
"形状奇特的小块凯夫拉织物，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃，但由于凯夫拉材料在末日废土上很罕见，它还是值得你花些时间回收成凯夫拉纤维的。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "leather scraps"
msgid_plural "leather scraps"
msgstr[0] "皮革碎片"

#. ~ Description of "leather scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of leather, waste material from tailoring "
"projects.  Not useful for much and usually disposed of."
msgstr "形状奇特的小块皮革，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "Lycra scraps"
msgid_plural "Lycra scraps"
msgstr[0] "氨纶碎片"

#. ~ Description of "Lycra scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of Lycra, waste material from tailoring projects."
"  Not useful for much and usually disposed of."
msgstr "形状奇特的小块氨纶面料，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "neoprene scraps"
msgid_plural "neoprene scraps"
msgstr[0] "氯丁橡胶碎片"

#. ~ Description of "neoprene scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of neoprene, waste material from tailoring "
"projects.  Not useful for much and usually disposed of."
msgstr "形状奇特的小块氯丁橡胶，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "synthetic fabric scraps"
msgid_plural "synthetic fabric scraps"
msgstr[0] "化纤织物碎片"

#. ~ Description of "synthetic fabric scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of synthetic fabric, waste material from "
"tailoring projects.  Not useful for much and usually disposed of."
msgstr "形状奇特的小块化纤织物，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "Nomex scraps"
msgid_plural "Nomex scraps"
msgstr[0] "芳纶碎片"

#. ~ Description of "Nomex scraps"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of heat-resistant Nomex fabric, waste material "
"from tailoring projects.  Normally it's disposed of, but since Nomex would "
"be very difficult to make in a post-apocalyptic world, it might be worth "
"recycling it."
msgstr "形状奇特的小块耐热芳纶织物，某次裁剪产生的废料。没什么大用途，通常会被丢弃，但由于芳纶材料在末日废土上很罕见，它还是值得你花些时间回收的。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "fur patch"
msgid_plural "fur patches"
msgstr[0] "毛皮片"

#. ~ Description of "fur patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A small bolt of fur from an animal, roughly 6 inches square.  Can be made "
"into patchwork fur sheets or used to repair fur fabric."
msgstr "一块约6英寸见方的动物毛皮。可制成毛皮拼布或用于修补毛皮织物。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "faux fur patch"
msgid_plural "faux fur patches"
msgstr[0] "人造毛皮片"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A small bolt of garishly colored faux fur, roughly 6 inches square.  Can be "
"made into patchwork faux fur sheets or used to repair faux fur fabric."
msgstr "一块约6英寸见方的色彩艳丽的人造毛皮。可制成人造毛皮拼布或用于修补人造毛皮织物。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "leather patch"
msgid_plural "leather patches"
msgstr[0] "皮革片"

#. ~ Description of "leather patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A roughly 6 inch square patch of leather, could be used to repair clothing "
"and make smaller leather crafts."
msgstr "一块约6英寸见方的皮革片。可制成小型皮革制品或用于修补皮革物品。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "felt patch"
msgid_plural "felt patches"
msgstr[0] "毛毡片"

#. ~ Description of "felt patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "A small, 6 inch square patch of felt."
msgstr "一块6英寸见方的小毛毡片。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "Nomex patch"
msgid_plural "Nomex patches"
msgstr[0] "芳纶布片"

#. ~ Description of "Nomex patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "A 6 inch square patch of Nomex fire-resistant fabric."
msgstr "一块约6英寸见方的防火芳纶纤维布片。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "cured hide"
msgid_plural "cured hides"
msgstr[0] "硬皮"

#. ~ Description of "cured hide"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A rolled up animal hide which has been scraped of extraneous hair and flesh "
"and treated to prevent decay.  It still requires tanning to become usable "
"leather."
msgstr "一张卷起来的硬皮。相比生皮去除了多余的皮毛和残留肌肉脂肪组织，并且进行了防腐处理。依旧需要鞣制才能变成有用的皮革。"

