msgid ""
"A 12 inch by 24 inch sheet of Kevlar synthetic fabric, suitable for making "
"cut-resistant, durable clothing.  In this form, unlike rigid plates, it can "
"be stitched."
msgstr "一片凯夫拉化纤织物面料，长24英寸宽12英寸，可以用于制造防割耐用的护甲。这种形态和刚性装甲板不同，可以被用于缝制。"

#. ~ 180 GSM fabric
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
