msgid_plural "Lycra sheets"
msgstr[0] "氨纶面料"

#. ~ 180 GSM fabric
#. ~ Description of "Lycra sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of synthetic fabric blended with stretchy Lycra fibers, suitable for"
" making flexible yet strong clothing."
msgstr "一片掺入了弹性氨纶纤维的化纤织物面料。可以用来制造具有弹性而坚韧的衣物。"

#. ~ 12 inch by 24 inch sheets, 16 layers thick. Values actually nearly
#. identically matched panels available for purchase.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "layered Kevlar panel"
msgid_plural "layered Kevlar panels"
msgstr[0] "多层凯夫拉片"

#. ~ 12 inch by 24 inch sheets, 16 layers thick. Values actually nearly
#. identically matched panels available for purchase.
#. ~ Description of "layered Kevlar panel"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a small 16-layer thick Kevlar panel.  It could be used to craft or "
"repair armor made of Kevlar."
msgstr "一小块16层凯夫拉纤维片。可以制造物品或用来修复由凯夫拉制造的物品。"

#. ~ same as above but adding superglue. IRL this is how they are made, though
#. using 2 part resin instead.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "rigid Kevlar plate"
msgid_plural "rigid Kevlar plates"
msgstr[0] "硬凯夫拉片"

#. ~ same as above but adding superglue. IRL this is how they are made, though
#. using 2 part resin instead.
#. ~ Description of "rigid Kevlar plate"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a compressed panel of Kevlar treated with epoxy or other adhesive.  "
"It could be used to repair items made of Kevlar."
msgstr "用环氧树脂或其他粘合剂处理且压实的凯夫拉纤维片。可以用来修复由凯夫拉制造的物品。"

#. ~ 180GSM
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "patchwork Lycra sheet"
msgid_plural "patchwork Lycra sheets"
msgstr[0] "氨纶拼布面料"

#. ~ 180GSM
#. ~ Description of "patchwork Lycra sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of fabric, sewn together from Lycra patches in a patchwork fashion."
"  Suitable for making most clothing, though it's much less time-efficient "
"than if using proper material sheets."
msgstr "一些来自各种衣物的氨纶布片，用拼布工艺缝合在一起。可以用于制造衣物，但比起使用正规面料要麻烦得多。"

#. ~ 110GSM, 1mm thick neoprene
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "neoprene sheet"
msgid_plural "neoprene sheets"
msgstr[0] "氯丁橡胶面料"

#. ~ 110GSM, 1mm thick neoprene
#. ~ Description of "neoprene sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of neoprene, a synthetic rubber, suitable for making underwater "
"gear."
msgstr "一片氯丁橡胶（一种合成橡胶）面料。可以用来制造水下作业的衣物。"

#. ~ Density of 1.23 grams per mL
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "patchwork neoprene sheet"
msgid_plural "patchwork neoprene sheets"
msgstr[0] "氯丁橡胶拼布面料"

#. ~ Density of 1.23 grams per mL
#. ~ Description of "patchwork neoprene sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of fabric, sewn together from neoprene patches in a patchwork "
"fashion, with waterproofed seams.  Suitable for making most clothing, though"
" it's much less time-efficient than if using proper material sheets."
msgstr "一些来自各种衣物的氯丁橡胶片，用拼布工艺缝合在一起，接缝做好了防水处理。可以用于制造衣物，但比起使用正规面料要麻烦得多。"

#. ~ Taken from duponts chemical reference sheets. 170GSM
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
