#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "\"Hostile detected.\""
msgstr "\"检测到敌人。\""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "M202A1 autonomous TALON UGV"
msgid_plural "M202A1 autonomous TALON UGVs"
msgstr[0] "M202A1 “鹰爪”型无人车"

#. ~ Description of monster "M202A1 autonomous TALON UGV"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid ""
"A TALON unmanned ground vehicle equipped with an M202A1 FLASH.  It is a "
"small tracked UGV with an array of motors and sensors covering its weapon "
"mount."
msgstr "一台“鹰爪”型无人车，配有 M202A1 Flash 火箭筒。这是一种小型履带式无人车，其武器底座上装有一系列的电机和传感器。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "autonomous TALON UGV Liberty Edition"
msgid_plural "autonomous TALON UGV Liberty Editions"
msgstr[0] "自由号“鹰爪”无人车"

#. ~ Description of monster "autonomous TALON UGV Liberty Edition"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid ""
"A TALON unmanned ground vehicle equipped with a fireworks cannon in place of"
" its usual M16A4.  It is a small tracked UGV with an array of motors and "
"sensors covering its weapon mount.  This one has been plastered with an "
"american flag decal."
msgstr ""
"一架“鹰爪”型无人车，通常安装着 M16A4 "
"步枪的位置被一门烟花炮代替。这是一种小型履带式无人车，其武器底座上装有一系列的电机和传感器。这一台无人车上已经被贴上了美国国旗的贴纸。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "autonomous TALON UGV Liberty Edition"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
#, c-format
msgid "Loud rock music blares as the %s explodes!"
msgstr "随着 %s 爆炸，播放出震耳欲聋的摇滚乐！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "autonomous TALON UGV Liberty
#. Edition"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "Fireworks explode out of the turret!"
msgstr "无人车的炮塔射出了一枚烟花！"

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "autonomous TALON UGV
#. Liberty Edition"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "\"Proud to be an American.\""
msgstr "“身为美国人而骄傲。”"

#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "autonomous TALON UGV Liberty
#. Edition"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "an igniter clicks rapidly!"
msgstr "点火器发出连串咔嗒声！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "skitterbot"
msgid_plural "skitterbots"
msgstr[0] "掠行无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "skitterbot"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid ""
"An insectoid robot the size of a small dog, designed for home security.  "
"Armed with two close-range tazers, it can skate across the ground with great"
" speed."
msgstr "一只小狗大小的昆虫型无人机，专为家庭安保服务。装备了两把近距电击枪，可以在地上高速滑行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "experimental lab bot"
msgid_plural "experimental lab bots"
msgstr[0] "实验室原型无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "experimental lab bot"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid ""
"This robot looks like a large metal spider, a bit bigger than a person, with"
" its thorax covered in tiny holes.  An ominous buzzing emanates from it."
msgstr "这个无人机看起来像一个大金属蜘蛛，比成人大一点。它的胸部布满了小孔，正在发出一种不祥的嗡嗡声。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "prototype robot"
msgid_plural "prototype robots"
msgstr[0] "原型机器人"

#. ~ Description of monster "prototype robot"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid ""
"This robot's single, glowing eye surveys the landscape periodically as it "
"performs the endless slaughter dictated by a misinterpreted and cruel "
"routine.  Between half-built plates, you can see the machinery and cables "
"that animate it, and yet it moves deftly as it switches between one target "
"and the next."
msgstr ""
"这台机器人闪闪发光的独眼定期地扫视着周围，它正在错误地执行着一个本就残酷的程序指令，使得它进行无休止的杀戮。它的装甲还未彻底完工，你可以透过缝隙看到让它动起来的机构和线缆。尽管如此，它在一个又一个的目标间切换时仍然能够灵巧地移动。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "NR-031 Dispatch"
msgid_plural "NR-031 Dispatches"
msgstr[0] "NR-031 派遣者"

#. ~ Description of monster "NR-031 Dispatch"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid ""
"The Northrop Dispatch, designed for crowd control situations, carries and "
"deploys kamikaze drones of various types.  The bright green-and-yellow paint"
" marks a low-force variant - *comparatively* low-force, anyways - typically "
"deployed as guards after an area has been cleared."
msgstr ""
"诺斯罗普公司出品，该型号的派遣者是为控制大规模暴乱而设计的，它携带并部署各种类型的自爆无人机。明亮的绿色和黄色标记意味着这是一种低武装型号——*相对*低武装，通常在区域被清理后作为警卫部署。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid "NR-V05-M Dispatch"
msgid_plural "NR-V05-M Dispatches"
msgstr[0] "NR-V05-M 派遣者"

#. ~ Description of monster "NR-V05-M Dispatch"
#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
msgid ""
"The Northrop Dispatch, designed for crowd control situations, carries and "
"deploys kamikaze drones of various types.  The dark green paint job marks "
"the lethal and feared military variant, carrying extreme and deadly "
"firepower."
msgstr ""
"诺斯罗普公司出品，该型号的派遣者是为控制大规模暴乱而设计的，它携带并部署各种类型的自爆无人机。深绿色的标记意味着这是一台致命和令人恐惧的军用型号，拥有极端致命的火力。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "autonomous drone"
msgid_plural "autonomous drones"
msgstr[0] "全自动无人机"

#. ~ Death message of monster "autonomous drone"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's interior compartment sizzles with destructive energy."
msgstr "%s 的体内充满了滋滋作响的破坏性的能量。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "EMP hack"
msgid_plural "EMP hacks"
msgstr[0] "EMP无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "EMP hack"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have an "
"EMP grenade inside."
msgstr "一只自杀式攻击自动无人机，这台小型四轴无人机的身体内搭载了一枚EMP手雷。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "C-4 hack"
msgid_plural "C-4 hacks"
msgstr[0] "C4无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "C-4 hack"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have "
"some C-4 inside."
msgstr "一只自杀式攻击自动无人机，这台小型四轴无人机的身体内搭载了一些C4塑胶高爆炸药。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "flashbang hack"
msgid_plural "flashbang hacks"
msgstr[0] "闪光弹无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "flashbang hack"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have a "
"flashbang inside."
msgstr "一只自杀式攻击自动无人机，这台小型四轴无人机的身体内搭载了一枚闪光弹。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "tear gas hack"
msgid_plural "tear gas hacks"
msgstr[0] "催泪弹无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "tear gas hack"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have a "
"tear gas canister inside."
msgstr "一只自杀式攻击自动无人机，这台小型四轴无人机的身体内搭载了一枚催泪弹。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "grenade hack"
msgid_plural "grenade hacks"
msgstr[0] "榴弹无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "grenade hack"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have a "
"grenade inside."
msgstr "一只自杀式攻击自动无人机，这台小型四轴无人机的身体内搭载了一枚榴弹。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "manhack"
msgid_plural "manhacks"
msgstr[0] "飞锯无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "manhack"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid ""
"An automated anti-personnel drone, a small quadcopter robot surrounded by "
"whirring blades."
msgstr "一只自杀式攻击自动无人机，这台小型四轴无人机周身安装了旋转的刀片。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "mininuke hack"
msgid_plural "mininuke hacks"
msgstr[0] "微型核弹无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "mininuke hack"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid ""
"Many times as large as a normal manhack, this flying quadcopter drone "
"appears to have a mininuke inside.  If this is targeting you… run."
msgstr "一只体积数倍于普通型号的无人机，这台正在飞行的四轴无人机体内搭载了一枚微型核弹。如果它瞄准了你……快跑！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "balloon sniper-drone"
msgid_plural "balloon sniper-drones"
msgstr[0] "气球狙击无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "balloon sniper-drone"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid ""
"This unusual contraption looks like a combination of a weather balloon and a"
" quadcopter.  Beneath the crude box containing its components hangs a small "
"articulated rig wielding an integrated rifle.  Its propellers flicker to "
"life briefly, then shut down again, keeping it mostly stationary despite the"
" air currents.  It looks capable of hanging in the air for quite a long time"
" before running out of power."
msgstr ""
"这台不寻常的装置看起来像一个气象气球和一个四翼无人机的组合体。在装有部件的大箱子下面，悬挂着一个小型的铰接式装备，上面有把集成步枪。它的螺旋桨偶尔短暂地开启，而后再次关闭，使它不受气流影响，长时间保持静止。它看起来能够在空中悬浮很长一段时间才会耗尽电力。"

#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "balloon sniper-drone"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "tick!"
msgstr "滴答！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid "tazer hack"
msgid_plural "tazer hacks"
msgstr[0] "电击枪无人机"

#. ~ Description of monster "tazer hack"
#: data/json/monsters/drones.json
msgid ""
"An automated drone, this small quadcopter robot appears to have a tazer "
"strapped to the front.  While extremely fast, it is very fragile."
msgstr "一只全自动无人机，这台小型四轴无人机的身体内搭载了一把电击枪。虽然速度很快，但很脆弱。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral human"
msgid_plural "feral humans"
msgstr[0] "野性疯人"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral human"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Their pupils are dilated and what can be seen of the iris and sclera are "
"bloodshot.  This pipe-wielding maniac still breathes, but the zombies treat "
"them like one of their own."
msgstr "它的瞳孔扩大，眼中残存的虹膜和眼白已经充血变得鲜红。这个握着钢管的疯子还能呼吸，但丧尸们已经把它当成自己中的一员。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral human"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral human throws a rock!"
msgstr "野性疯人扔了一块石头！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "cunning feral"
msgid_plural "cunning ferals"
msgstr[0] "狡猾疯人"

#. ~ Description of monster "cunning feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This feral human's eyes look more focused, and its movements steadier, than "
"others of their kind.  They're carrying a crude spear, and have assembled "
"some basic armor from scavenged clothing and bits of riot armor, though you "
"can see several gaps.  Despite these signs of greater intelligence, this "
"creature is still only a few steps away from being a zombie themself."
msgstr ""
"与其同类相比，这个疯人眼中尚存有更多的灵智，动作也更稳定。它手持一把自制长矛，用捡来的衣物及少许防暴装备，勉强组装成简单的护甲，但你可以看到上面有好些缺口。尽管它呈现出拥有更高智能的迹象，但这只怪物距离成为丧尸只剩几步之遥了。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral troglobite"
msgid_plural "feral troglobites"
msgstr[0] "穴居疯人"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral troglobite"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This person is still alive but completely crazed, changed by something they "
"are exposed to down here.  Their face is dominated by unnaturally large, "
"faintly glowing eyes and needle-sharp teeth poking through their lips.  They"
" remind you of something out of a campy monster movie - and of the good "
"times when underground cannibals were less of a real concern."
msgstr ""
"这个人仍然活着，但完全疯了，被它在这里接触到某种物质改造了。它的脸上长着一双不自然的大眼睛，微微发光，尖利的牙齿从嘴里钻出来。它让你联想起了某部野营怪兽电影中的一些东西——以及那段地底食人族还不是你最担心的事情的美好时光。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Their pupils are dilated and what can be seen of the iris and sclera are "
"bloodshot.  This crowbar-wielding maniac still breathes, but the zombies "
"treat them like one of their own."
msgstr "它的瞳孔扩大，眼中残存的虹膜和眼白已经充血变得鲜红。这个握着撬棍的疯子还能呼吸，但丧尸们已经把它当成自己中的一员。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "deranged axeman"
msgid_plural "deranged axemen"
msgstr[0] "狂乱斧男"

#. ~ Description of monster "deranged axeman"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"They stumble along dragging a large bloodstained axe.  Their face is twisted"
" into a sadistic grin, and they walk among the dead as though already one of"
" them."
msgstr "它拖着血染的大斧步履蹒颠。脸上扭曲着嗜虐的笑颜，游走死者之间，仿佛已成了其中的一员。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral mechanic"
msgid_plural "feral mechanics"
msgstr[0] "疯人技工"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral mechanic"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This wild human-like creature was probably a mechanic before the Cataclysm."
"  You can see it by his worker uniform, or by his blood-covered hammer in "
"hand, or by his all-hating view."
msgstr "这个类似人类的疯狂生物可能是大灾变前的技工。你可以从他的工人制服，或手上沾满鲜血的锤子，或他充满仇恨的眼中看到这一点。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_pipe_fungal_corpse"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores covering this person's "
"body, and their facial expression is pure agony."
msgstr "无数纤细的菌柄从覆盖它全身的伤口中成排地萌发而出，而它的面部表情只剩下纯粹的痛苦。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar_fungal_corpse"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores on this person's arms, and "
"their facial expression is pure agony.  Their mouth opens and closes softly "
"in a silent moan."
msgstr "无数纤细的菌柄从覆盖它手臂的伤口中成排地萌发而出，而它的面部表情只剩下纯粹的痛苦。它的嘴伴随着无声的呻吟不断轻轻地开合着。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_axe_fungal_corpse"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores on this person's arms, and "
"their facial expression is pure agony."
msgstr "无数纤细的菌柄从覆盖它手臂的伤口中成排地萌发而出，而它的面部表情只剩下纯粹的痛苦。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "mad scientist"
msgid_plural "mad scientists"
msgstr[0] "疯狂科学家"

#. ~ Description of monster "mad scientist"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"A researcher who has stared too long into the abyss, and now shambles about "
"muttering nonsense under their breath.  For some reason, the zombies don't "
"seem to mind that this person is obviously still alive.  They're clutching a"
" tiny but razor-sharp blade in one shaky hand."
msgstr ""
"一个凝视了太久深渊的研究人员，现在不断低声咕哝着胡话。出于某种原因，丧尸们似乎并不介意这个显然还活着的人。它一只摇摇晃晃的手上抓着一把小而锋利的刀。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral security guard"
msgid_plural "feral security guards"
msgstr[0] "疯人警卫"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral security guard"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This security guard still breathes, but has been lost to some terrible "
"madness.  They move among the undead, handgun at the ready and saucer pupils"
" scanning for threats in a mockery of their former duty."
msgstr ""
"这个警卫仍在呼吸，但已经深陷于某种可怕的疯狂之中。它与它的不死族人一同行动，手中的手枪已经上膛，鲜红的瞳孔扫视着四周的威胁，仿佛是对它从前职责的无情嘲弄。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral security guard"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral security guard fires their Beretta M9A1!"
msgstr "疯人警卫击发了它的伯莱塔 M9A1 手枪！"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_labsecurity_flashlight"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"At first glance, this disheveled figure could almost pass for a survivor, "
"but the bloodshot eyes give them away as one of the humans who have gone "
"feral and joined the undead without dying.  Their uniform suggests that this"
" was at some point a security guard, and they still carry a stun gun and a "
"heavy-duty flashlight that looks like it could easily double as a club."
msgstr ""
"乍一看，这个衣冠不整的人几乎可以算是个幸存者，但充满血丝的瞳孔却表露出它其实已经成为疯人们中的一员，虽未死却已经加入不死一族。它身上的制服表明，它曾经在某种程度上是一名警卫，仍然携带着一把电击枪和一个重型手电筒，看起来能很容易当作棍棒使用。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral servant"
msgid_plural "feral servants"
msgstr[0] "疯人仆从"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a "
"broom in hand, searching for a victim to sweep off this mortal coil."
msgstr "这个疯子曾经是某个富裕家庭的高级仆人，手里拿着扫帚四处走动，寻找一个受害者，为其扫除人世牵挂。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a "
"candlestick in hand, ready to snuff out your life."
msgstr "这个疯子曾经是某个富裕家庭的高级仆人，手里拿着一个烛台四处走动，准备掐灭你的生命之火。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a "
"knife in hand, searching for some victims to butcher."
msgstr "这个疯子曾经是某个富裕家庭的高级仆人，手里拿着刀四处走动，寻找着一位受害者，成为待宰羔羊。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "well dressed feral"
msgid_plural "well dressed ferals"
msgstr[0] "盛装疯人"

#. ~ Description of monster "well dressed feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Wearing fancy clothes and with a rapier in hand, this maniac was once a "
"socialite.  They smile with madness and seem like they want to invite you to"
" dinner."
msgstr "穿着花哨的衣服，手里拿着剑，这个疯子曾经是个社交名流。它疯狂地笑着，似乎想邀请你吃饭。"

#. ~ Description of monster "well dressed feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Wearing fancy clothes and with a crossbow in hand, this maniac was once a "
"socialite.  Their hands caress the crossbow as if touching a loved one."
msgstr "穿着花哨的衣服，手里拿着弩，这个疯子曾经是个社交名流。它的手似乎抚摸着弩，好像抚摸着心爱的人。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "well dressed feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral human shoots its crossbow!"
msgstr "盛装疯人射出了弩箭！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "armored feral"
msgid_plural "armored ferals"
msgstr[0] "装甲疯人"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Clad in ancient armor and with a mace in hand, this maniac walks around in "
"search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over their"
" mace."
msgstr "穿着古老的盔甲，手持狼牙棒，这个疯子四处走动寻找下一个猎物。你可以在狼牙棒上看到干涸的血迹。"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Clad in ancient armor and with a battle axe in hand, this maniac walks "
"around in search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all "
"over their axe."
msgstr "穿着古老的盔甲，手持战斧，这个疯子四处走动寻找下一个猎物。你可以在战斧上看到干涸的血迹。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral prepper"
msgid_plural "feral preppers"
msgstr[0] "有备疯人"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral prepper"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"A quick glance at this person would suggest that they have prepared well "
"enough for the apocalypse.  Unfortunately, their bloodshot eyes, and the "
"excluding treatment by the undead, shows that they have turned feral.  One "
"of their hands clasps the handle of a makeshift weapon, while the other "
"grips a handgun."
msgstr ""
"一眼望去就能发现它早已为世界末日做好了充足的准备。不幸的是，它布满血丝的眼睛，以及不死族对它的特殊对待表明它已堕入疯人一族。它的一只手紧握着一把自制武器的握把，而另一只手紧握着一把手枪。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral prepper"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral prepper haphazardly fires their firearm!"
msgstr "有备疯人偶然击发了手中的枪械！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "crazed survivalist"
msgid_plural "crazed survivalists"
msgstr[0] "生存主义疯人"

#. ~ Description of monster "crazed survivalist"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Grasping a sharp bladed weapon, this feral prepper has an athletic physique,"
" a sign that they trained extensively before turning feral.  In addition to "
"remembering how to use a flashlight, their survival instincts seem to kick "
"in when critically harmed, causing them to act in self-preservation unlike "
"most of their fellows."
msgstr ""
"这个发疯的末日准备狂手持着一把锋利的武器，看起来拥有运动员的体格，这是它在发疯之前接受过长期训练的标志。除了记住使用手电筒之外，它似乎在受到重伤时会触发其残余生存本能，使其寻求自我保护，而与其它同类不同。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "mad militia"
msgid_plural "mad militias"
msgstr[0] "疯狂民兵"

#. ~ Description of monster "mad militia"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Wearing a tactical camo uniform with a Kevlar vest, this person seems to "
"have been a militia member, now turned feral.  Their hands grip unto a semi-"
"automatic rifle as their bloodshot eyes scan for threats; a flashlight "
"strapped to their forehead illuminates their presence and surroundings."
msgstr ""
"这个身穿凯夫拉背心及迷彩服的疯子似乎是当地民兵，但已经发疯了。它的双手紧握着一把半自动步枪，眼睛布满血丝，四处寻找着威胁；绑在它额头上的手电筒照亮了它的存在和周围的环境。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "mad militia"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The mad militiaman fires their rifle!"
msgstr "疯狂民兵击发了它的步枪！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral soldier"
msgid_plural "feral soldiers"
msgstr[0] "疯人士兵"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral soldier"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Wearing a military uniform with an armored vest, this person seems to be a "
"highly trained military professional, now turned feral.  Tense, dirty hands "
"grip a combat knife as their bloodshot eyes scan for threats."
msgstr ""
"这位身穿防弹背心及军装的人似乎曾经是一名训练有素的军人，现在早已发疯。它紧绷、肮脏的双手握着一把战术匕首，布满血丝的眼睛不断扫视着四周的威胁。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral biker"
msgid_plural "feral bikers"
msgstr[0] "疯人车手"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral biker"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"A rough-looking feral human, clad in black leather and wielding a pump-"
"action shotgun.  It seems body-armor wasn't one of their priorities however."
msgstr "一个外表粗鲁的疯子，身穿黑色皮衣，手持一把泵动式霰弹枪。然而，防弹衣似乎并非它们的首选装备。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral biker"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral biker fires their shotgun!"
msgstr "疯人车手击发了它的霰弹枪！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral swimmer"
msgid_plural "feral swimmers"
msgstr[0] "泳装疯人"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral swimmer"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Clad in swimwear and with a swimming kickboard in hand, this once normal "
"person is now a bloodthirsty maniac, capable of swimming behind its victims "
"and drown them with a smile on its face."
msgstr "身穿泳衣，手里拿着一块游泳打腿板，这个曾经正常的人现在变成了嗜血狂魔，能游在受害者身后，面带微笑地淹死他们。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral diver"
msgid_plural "feral divers"
msgstr[0] "疯人潜水员"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral diver"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Once an avid diver, this masked maniac now follows its prey until the "
"deepest of the oceans, wielding a dive knife with which to murder them."
msgstr "这个蒙面疯子曾经是一名狂热的潜水员，而如今它会跟随猎物，直至海洋最深处，挥舞着潜水小刀将其杀害。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral crewman"
msgid_plural "feral crewmen"
msgstr[0] "疯人海员"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral crewman"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Clad in a grimy and tattered naval uniform, this former sailor clutches a "
"massive wrench as some form of makeshift weapon.  At a distance, you could "
"mistake them as being another survivor.  However, upon closer inspection you"
" make note of how their veins are visibly bulging, their wide open eyes have"
" a primal, animalistic quality to their gaze, and their breaths come in "
"ragged, wheezing pants.  Whatever the Cataclysm has done to the military "
"crewman that this twitching shell of their former self once was, you’re "
"certain that they're not fully human anymore."
msgstr ""
"这个曾经的海员身穿肮脏破烂的海军制服，手里拿着一把巨大的扳手作为某种形式的临时武器。在远处，你可能会误认为它是另一个幸存者。然而，仔细观察，你会注意到它的血管已经明显隆起，睁大的眼睛凝视你时具有某种原始的、野性的特征，它的呼吸中夹杂着不规则的、气喘吁吁的喘息声。无论这场大灾变对这个海员曾经与你相同但不停抽搐的躯壳造成了什么样的影响，你可以肯定，它已经不再是完全的人类了。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_axe"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Spattered from head to toe in large swaths of dried viscera, the deep blue "
"of this person’s tattered naval uniform has been stained the color of rust."
"  Having seemingly had enough presence of mind to consider arming itself, "
"this former crewman carries a crash axe in its shaking hands.  The veins on "
"the back of their neck are visibly bulging, their eyes bloodshot, and a mass"
" of crisscrossing blackened veins stand out against the pale skin of their "
"face as they regard the area around them for perceived threats."
msgstr ""
"从头到脚溅满了大块已经干燥的内脏，把破烂海军制服的深蓝色部分染成了铁锈色。这个曾经的海员似乎有足够的头脑来考虑武装自己，它不停颤抖的手中握着一把斧头。脖子后面的血管已经明显隆起，眼中充满血丝，当它不停搜寻周围区域所存在明显的威胁时，大量纵横交错的发黑血管与苍白的皮肤形成鲜明对比。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_mop"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Clutching a stout mop in their quivering hands, this crewman was presumably "
"assigned to basic deck sweeping in their final moments, before the Cataclysm"
" struck and stripped them of their humanity.  Dressed in basic naval "
"fatigues, you’d be forgiven for believing them to be another survivor.  "
"However, their bloodshot eyes, blackened veins, and spastic twitching tell a"
" far different story."
msgstr ""
"这名曾经的船员不停颤抖着，手中握着一把结实的拖把，大概是在最后的时刻被指派进行基本的甲板清扫，随后大灾变发生并夺走了它的人性。它身穿最简单的海军服，难怪你会把它误认为是另一个幸存者。然而，它充血的眼睛、发黑的血管和痉挛抽搐讲述了一个截然不同的故事。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_lug_wrench"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Still dressed in a grease spattered uniform, this crewman appears to have "
"once been a naval engineer.  With tangled hair, oil stained working attire, "
"and a lug wrench clenched in their fist, you assume that they were either "
"assigned to shipside maintenance or responsible for servicing onboard "
"aircraft.  Now all that’s left of the crewman that this person once was is a"
" madly twitching, psychopathic monster."
msgstr ""
"这名船员仍然穿着沾满油污的海军服，似乎曾经是一名海军工程师。头发乱糟糟的，机油粘在工作服上，手中握着一把吊耳扳手，你可以猜测它要么曾负责码头维修，要么负责飞机维修。现在，这个曾经的船员只剩下一个疯狂抽搐的精神变态怪物。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral marine"
msgid_plural "feral marines"
msgstr[0] "疯人马润"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral marine"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This twitching, bloodied person is still clad in a ragged naval uniform, the"
" insignia of the marines visible on their coat and a corresponding tattoo on"
" their forearm.  Clutching a rifle in their quivering hands, you see them "
"repeatedly pull the weapon’s trigger, constantly muttering incoherently and "
"yanking back on the gun’s charging handle every time the rifle fails to "
"fire.  Seemingly having lost the capability to comprehend that their weapon "
"is empty, you’d feel relatively safe were it not for the gleaming bayonet "
"still attached to the end of their firearm."
msgstr ""
"这个浑身抽搐、血迹斑斑的人仍然穿着破旧的海军制服，外套上印着海军陆战队的徽章，前臂上也有相应的纹身。颤抖的手中握着一支步枪，你可以看到它反复扣动武器的扳机，不停地语无伦次地咕哝着，每当步枪不开火时，它就会拉一下步枪的上膛拉柄。似乎已经没法理解手中的武器已经打光了弹药，如果不是因为枪口上还挂着闪闪发光的刺刀，你也许会觉得相对还算安全。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "feral officer"
msgid_plural "feral officers"
msgstr[0] "疯人海军军官"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral officer"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This person, clad in the tattered uniform of a naval officer, twitches "
"erratically as their bloodshot eyes dart about and their breaths come in "
"ragged pants.  The Cataclysm has clearly done something horrible to this "
"military professional, inaudible mutterings emanating from their lips as "
"they creep about like a skittish animal.  In their quivering hands they "
"clutch a service pistol, the officer’s fingers nervously fidgeting with the "
"weapon.  They may not be an undead corpse, but you doubt that they’re any "
"more rational than the zombies which now infest the world."
msgstr ""
"这位身穿海军军官破烂制服的人，眼睛布满血丝，呼吸时时不时地喘息，身体不规则地抽搐着。大灾变显然对这位军事专业人员造成了可怕的影响，使得它像一只神经过敏的动物一样爬行，嘴里不停发出听不见的咕哝声。它用颤抖的双手握着一把手枪，军官的手指紧张地摆弄着武器。也许它还算不上是不死丧尸，但你怀疑它是否比现在已经遍布世界的丧尸更有理性。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral officer"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral officer fires their M18!"
msgstr "疯人海军军官击发了它的 M18 手枪！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "alpha razorclaw"
msgid_plural "alpha razorclaws"
msgstr[0] "利爪怪首领"

#. ~ Description of monster "alpha razorclaw"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A blood-red, gigantic razorclaw.  With its sword-like pincers, it serves as "
"a protector of the nest."
msgstr "一只浑身血红色，体型巨大的利爪怪。它用那剑一般的钳子来守护自己的巢穴。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "tiny fish"
msgid_plural "tiny fish"
msgstr[0] "微型鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "tiny fish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A tiny fish."
msgstr "一条微型鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "small fish"
msgid_plural "small fish"
msgstr[0] "小型鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "small fish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A small fish."
msgstr "一条小型鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "medium fish"
msgid_plural "medium fish"
msgstr[0] "中型鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "medium fish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A medium fish."
msgstr "一条中型鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "large fish"
msgid_plural "large fish"
msgstr[0] "大型鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "large fish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A large fish."
msgstr "一条大型鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "huge fish"
msgid_plural "huge fish"
msgstr[0] "巨型鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "huge fish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A huge fish."
msgstr "一条巨型鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "fish fry"
msgid_plural "fish fry"
msgstr[0] "鱼苗"

#. ~ Description of monster "fish fry"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A minuscule half-translucent fish larva.  Impossible to identify which "
"species it belongs to."
msgstr "一条微小的半透明幼鱼。无法确定它属于哪个物种。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "fish fry"
#. ~ Death message of monster "stingray fry"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is smashed to non-recognizable pieces."
msgstr "%s 被碾碎成了无法辨别的碎肉。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "brown trout"
msgid_plural "brown trouts"
msgstr[0] "褐鳟"

#. ~ Description of monster "brown trout"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A brown trout.  A fish made popular by father-son fishing trips, except for "
"the part where you have to gut it."
msgstr "一条褐鳟。因为\"父子垂钓之旅\"节目而家喻户晓，嗯，只要吃的时候尽量别去想挖内脏的过程就行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json data/json/monsters/obsolete.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid "fry"
msgid_plural "fry"
msgstr[0] "鱼苗"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "brook trout"
msgid_plural "brook trouts"
msgstr[0] "溪鳟"

#. ~ Description of monster "brook trout"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A brook trout.  A fish made popular by father-son fishing trips, except for "
"the part where you have to gut it."
msgstr "一条溪鳟。因为\"父子垂钓之旅\"节目而家喻户晓，嗯，只要吃的时候尽量别去想挖内脏的过程就行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "lake trout"
msgid_plural "lake trouts"
msgstr[0] "湖鳟"

#. ~ Description of monster "lake trout"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A lake trout.  A fish made popular by father-son fishing trips, except for "
"the part where you have to gut it."
msgstr "一条湖鳟。因为\"父子垂钓之旅\"节目而家喻户晓，嗯，只要吃的时候尽量别去想挖内脏的过程就行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "rainbow trout"
msgid_plural "rainbow trouts"
msgstr[0] "虹鳟"

#. ~ Description of monster "rainbow trout"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A rainbow trout.  A fish made popular by father-son fishing trips, except "
"for the part where you have to gut it."
msgstr "一条虹鳟。因为\"父子垂钓之旅\"节目而家喻户晓，嗯，只要吃的时候尽量别去想挖内脏的过程就行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "atlantic salmon"
msgid_plural "atlantic salmon"
msgstr[0] "大西洋鲑"

#. ~ Description of monster "atlantic salmon"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"An Atlantic salmon.  A very fatty, nutritious fish.  Tastes great smoked."
msgstr "一条大西洋鲑。非常肥美并且营养丰富。烟熏后味道好极了。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "kokanee salmon"
msgid_plural "kokanee salmon"
msgstr[0] "内陆红鲑"

#. ~ Description of monster "kokanee salmon"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A Kokanee salmon.  A very fatty, nutritious fish.  Tastes great smoked."
msgstr "一条内陆红鲑。非常肥美并且营养丰富。烟熏后味道好极了。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "lake whitefish"
msgid_plural "lake whitefish"
msgstr[0] "湖白鲑"

#. ~ Description of monster "lake whitefish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A lake whitefish, closely related to salmon.  One can assume they taste just"
" as nice when smoked."
msgstr "一条湖白鲑（鲱形白鲑），在北美水域广泛分布，栖息地延伸至北极圈。因为是鲑鱼的近亲，你可以认为它们烟熏了之后也一样好吃。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "largemouth bass"
msgid_plural "largemouth bass"
msgstr[0] "大嘴鲈"

#. ~ Description of monster "largemouth bass"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A largemouth bass.  Very popular with sport fishermen."
msgstr "一条大嘴鲈。很受钓鱼爱好者的喜爱。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "smallmouth bass"
msgid_plural "smallmouth bass"
msgstr[0] "小嘴鲈"

#. ~ Description of monster "smallmouth bass"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A smallmouth bass.  Infamously intolerant to pollution, the presence of "
"smallmouth bass is a good indicator of how clean a body of water is."
msgstr "一条小口黑鲈。由于无法忍受水污染，小口黑鲈的存在是衡量水质清洁与否的好指标。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "striped bass"
msgid_plural "striped bass"
msgstr[0] "条纹鲈"

#. ~ Description of monster "striped bass"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A striped bass.  Mostly a saltwater fish, they migrate to fresher water to "
"spawn."
msgstr "一只条纹鲈。一般生活在咸水里，但在产卵期会游到淡水中。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "yellow perch"
msgid_plural "yellow perches"
msgstr[0] "黄鲈"

#. ~ Description of monster "yellow perch"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A small, sprightly perch.  It is a very bony fish, still has some tasty meat"
" on it though."
msgstr "一条活蹦乱跳的小鲈鱼。刺特别多，但肉也还挺好吃的。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "walleye"
msgid_plural "walleyes"
msgstr[0] "碧古鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "walleye"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A walleye.  A green-brown medium-sized fish with a white belly."
msgstr "一条碧古鱼。一种绿褐身体、白色肚腩的中型鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "banded sunfish"
msgid_plural "banded sunfish"
msgstr[0] "暗色九棘日鲈"

#. ~ Description of monster "banded sunfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A banded sunfish.  A small fish related to bass and bluegill."
msgstr "一条暗色九棘日鲈。与鲈鱼和蓝鳃太阳鱼是近亲。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "pumpkinseed"
msgid_plural "pumpkinseeds"
msgstr[0] "驼背太阳鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "pumpkinseed"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A pumpkinseed sunfish.  A small fish related to bass and bluegill."
msgstr "一条驼背太阳鱼。一种跟鲈鱼及蓝鳃太阳鱼关系较近的小鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "bluegill"
msgid_plural "bluegills"
msgstr[0] "蓝鳃太阳鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "bluegill"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A bluegill, an invasive species in Japan.  Commonly gutted and cooked whole."
msgstr "一条蓝鳃太阳鱼，被引进日本后成为当地危险的入侵物种。一般把内脏去掉整条鱼烧了吃。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "redbreast sunfish"
msgid_plural "redbreast sunfish"
msgstr[0] "红胸太阳鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "redbreast sunfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A redbreast sunfish.  A small fish related to bass and bluegill."
msgstr "一条红胸太阳鱼。一种跟鲈鱼及蓝鳃太阳鱼关系较近的小鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "green sunfish"
msgid_plural "green sunfish"
msgstr[0] "蓝太阳鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "green sunfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A green sunfish.  A small fish related to bass and bluegill."
msgstr "一条蓝太阳鱼。一种跟鲈鱼及蓝鳃太阳鱼关系较近的小鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "rock bass"
msgid_plural "rock bass"
msgstr[0] "岩钝鲈"

#. ~ Description of monster "rock bass"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A rock bass.  Related to sunfish, this tiny fish has a camouflage-like "
"patterning and red eyes."
msgstr "一条岩钝鲈。这种形似太阳鱼的小鱼，有着迷彩状的伪装和红色的眼睛。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "black crappie"
msgid_plural "black crappie"
msgstr[0] "黑莓鲈"

#. ~ Description of monster "black crappie"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A black crappie.  A medium-sized fish also known as a 'calico bass'."
msgstr "一条黑莓鲈（黑斑刺盖太阳鱼），体型中等，经常被与大口副鲈（calico bass）混淆。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "warmouth"
msgid_plural "warmouths"
msgstr[0] "大口突鳃太阳鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "warmouth"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A warmouth, similar to a rock bass.  This small fish is related to the "
"sunfish."
msgstr "一条大口突鳃太阳鱼，类似于岩钝鲈，这种小鱼属于太阳鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "brown bullhead"
msgid_plural "brown bullheads"
msgstr[0] "云斑鮰"

#. ~ Description of monster "brown bullhead"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A brown bullhead, a type of catfish.  Delicious when battered and fried."
msgstr "一条云斑鮰，又名褐首鲇，属于鲇形目。裹浆油炸后很美味。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "channel catfish"
msgid_plural "channel catfish"
msgstr[0] "斑点叉尾鮰"

#. ~ Description of monster "channel catfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A channel catfish.  It has a forked tail and long whiskers."
msgstr "一条斑点叉尾鮰。它长着分叉的尾巴和长长的胡须。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "white catfish"
msgid_plural "white catfish"
msgstr[0] "白叉尾鮰"

#. ~ Description of monster "white catfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A white catfish.  A small whiskered fish with a broad head."
msgstr "一条白叉尾鮰。一种长着细长胡须的宽头鱼类。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgctxt "fish"
msgid "northern pike"
msgid_plural "northern pikes"
msgstr[0] "链纹狗鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "northern pike"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A northern pike.  Pike can be pretty aggressive fish, careful around those "
"teeth."
msgstr "一条北美梭鱼。梭鱼是一种攻击性很强的鱼，当心它们的牙齿。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "pickerel"
msgid_plural "pickerels"
msgstr[0] "小梭鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "pickerel"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A pickerel.  It looks like a pike, but slightly smaller."
msgstr "一条暗色狗鱼（链纹狗鱼），看起来和白斑狗鱼（北方狗鱼）很像，但体型较小，体表也覆盖有一层黏液。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "muskellunge"
msgid_plural "muskellunges"
msgstr[0] "北美狗鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "muskellunge"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A muskellunge.  Closely related to pike but even larger, it shares the same "
"aggression and sharp teeth."
msgstr "一条北美狗鱼，与白斑狗鱼是近亲，但生活在纬度更低的地方。它的体型更大，而且同样有尖锐的牙齿和强烈的攻击性。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "white sucker"
msgid_plural "white suckers"
msgstr[0] "白亚口鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "white sucker"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A white sucker.  It has a streamlined body with a round mouth."
msgstr "一条白亚口鱼，有着流线型的身体和一张圆嘴巴。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "European carp"
msgid_plural "European carp"
msgstr[0] "欧洲鲤"

#. ~ Description of monster "European carp"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A golden-yellow common carp.  Some people think they don't taste great, but "
"you can't afford to be choosy in the Cataclysm."
msgstr "一条金黄色的普通鲤鱼。有人觉得它们不好吃，但是你在大灾变的时候实在没有太多选择。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "grass carp"
msgid_plural "grass carps"
msgstr[0] "草鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "grass carp"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A huge grass carp.  A golden, herbivorous fish."
msgstr "一条大草鱼。一种金色的食草鱼类。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "bowfin"
msgid_plural "bowfins"
msgstr[0] "弓鳍鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "bowfin"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A bowfin.  These fish are related to gar but without the huge teeth, skin-"
"rending scales, and aggression."
msgstr "一条弓鳍鱼。这些鱼和颌针鱼有亲缘关系，但是没有大尖齿、能切破皮的鳞片和凶暴的天性。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "fallfish"
msgid_plural "fallfish"
msgstr[0] "小眼须雅罗鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "fallfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A fallfish.  These fish are small cyprinids, related to carp."
msgstr "一条小眼须雅罗鱼，与鲤鱼同属鲤科，但体型更小。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "lobster"
msgid_plural "lobsters"
msgstr[0] "龙虾"

#. ~ Description of monster "lobster"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A dark greenish crustacean in its natural habitat.  These were once "
"considered pests barely worth eating, then some marketing genius started "
"selling them to people as a delicacy and they took off in popularity… and "
"price."
msgstr ""
"一只暗绿色甲壳动物，生活在其自然栖息地之中。它们曾被认为是不堪食用的害虫，直到某些营销天才把它们当作美食来宣传，从此这玩意儿的知名度……还有价格……开始蹭蹭地飞涨。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "crayfish"
msgid_plural "crayfish"
msgstr[0] "螯虾"

#. ~ Description of monster "crayfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"This crustacean looks like a tiny lobster, but is actually a completely "
"different species.  If you could get ahold of a bunch more of these, a hefty"
" pot of boiling water, and some spicy seasonings…"
msgstr "这种甲壳动物看起来像一只小号的龙虾，但实际上两者是完全不同的物种。要是你能找到一大堆这玩意，烧一大锅开水，再加一些足够辣的调味品……"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "crustacean larva"
msgid_plural "crustacean larvae"
msgstr[0] "甲壳幼虫"

#. ~ Description of monster "crustacean larva"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A minuscule half-translucent crustacean larva.  Impossible to identify which"
" species it belongs to."
msgstr "一种微小的半透明甲壳类动物幼虫。无法确定它属于哪个物种。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "Blinky"
msgid_plural "Blinkies"
msgstr[0] "布林吉鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "Blinky"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "A strange three-eyed fish."
msgstr "一种奇怪的鱼类，有三只眼睛。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "American eel"
msgid_plural "American eels"
msgstr[0] "美洲鳗鲡"

#. ~ Description of monster "American eel"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"An American eel.  They used to be quite common in these parts until the dams"
" were built.  They'll get a second chance now that those aren't running."
msgstr "一条美洲鳗鲡。它们在水坝修成之前还是挺常见的。现在大坝不再运作了，也许它们能有二次繁衍的机会。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "oversized crayfish"
msgid_plural "oversized crayfish"
msgstr[0] "巨型鳌虾"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized crayfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A mutant crayfish the size of a dog, with a brown carapace, claws, and long "
"antennae."
msgstr "一只体型和狗一般大小的变异鳌虾，长着棕色的躯壳、爪子和长长的触须。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/fish.json
msgid "giant crayfish"
msgid_plural "giant crayfish"
msgstr[0] "巨型螯虾"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant crayfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A mutant, terrestrial variety of crayfish, this massive crustacean resembles"
" a humongous lobster."
msgstr "一种变异的陆生鳌虾，这只巨大的甲壳类动物有点像超大号的龙虾。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/fish.json
msgid "colossal crayfish"
msgid_plural "colossal crayfish"
msgstr[0] "超巨型螯虾"

#. ~ Description of monster "colossal crayfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "An enormous mutated gray crayfish with pincer claws and long antennae."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的灰色变异鳌虾，长着大大的钳爪和长长的触须。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/fish.json
msgid "giant crayfish larva"
msgid_plural "giant crayfish larvae"
msgstr[0] "巨型鳌虾幼虫"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant crayfish larva"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A large crayfish larva already larger than non-mutated adults of its kind."
msgstr "一只巨型鳌虾的幼虫，已经比没有变异过的成年人还要大了。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "razorclaw"
msgid_plural "razorclaws"
msgstr[0] "利爪怪"

#. ~ Description of monster "razorclaw"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A man-sized crustacean clad in iron-like chitin, capable of emitting "
"horrible shrieking noises.  Often spotted near shipwrecks or other dark, "
"damp places, which it uses as nesting grounds."
msgstr "一只人型大小的甲壳类生物，浑身覆盖着铁一样甲壳，能发恐怖的尖叫声。经常在它用作筑巢地点沉船或其他黑暗潮湿的地方附近被发现。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "giant carp"
msgid_plural "giant carps"
msgstr[0] "巨鲤鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant carp"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"This thing looks like a carp, but huge and very, very angry.  Death is the "
"gift of the carp god."
msgstr "这只怪物看起来很像是鲤鱼，只是体型十分巨大，而且非常暴躁。死亡是鲤鱼王送给你的礼物。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "giant salmon"
msgid_plural "giant salmons"
msgstr[0] "巨鲑鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant salmon"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A mutated salmon, the size of a large dog and quite dangerous to the "
"inexperienced angler."
msgstr "一条体型和大型犬类一般大小的变异鲑鱼，对于经验不足的渔夫来说非常危险。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "seweranha"
msgid_plural "seweranhas"
msgstr[0] "下水道鱼王"

#. ~ Description of monster "seweranha"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A large, mutant variety of carp.  It has shimmering green scales and a mouth"
" lined with three jagged rows of razor-sharp teeth."
msgstr "一只巨大的变异鲤鱼，它身上长满了闪闪发光的绿色鳞片，三瓣嘴充满了锯齿状的牙齿。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "fungal blossom"
msgid_plural "fungal blossoms"
msgstr[0] "真菌孢子花"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal blossom"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"A broad fungus, looking much like a glowing blue sunflower.  It appears to "
"emit finer spores than the typical fungal emission."
msgstr "一株又大又扁的真菌植株，外观像是闪烁着蓝光的向日葵，看起来它比普通的真菌喷射能散播更小的孢子。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "fungal hedgerow"
msgid_plural "fungal hedgerows"
msgstr[0] "真菌篱"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal hedgerow"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"Looking at first glance like a dull gray privet, this \"hedge\" is really a "
"mass of barbed fungal tendrils, defending the fungal tower."
msgstr "第一眼看上去像是暗灰色的女贞树，但这圈\"篱笆\"其实是粗大的带倒刺的真菌触须簇，保护着真菌塔。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "fungal hedgerow"
#. ~ Death message of monster "fungal wall"
#. ~ Death message of monster "spore cloud"
#. ~ Death message of monster "ancient red dragon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "germinating crystal mass"
#. ~ Death message of monster "sprouting crystal mass"
#. ~ Death message of monster "resonant crystal mass"
#. ~ Death message of monster "flailing crystal mass"
#. ~ Death message of monster "energized crystal mass"
#. ~ Death message of monster "crystal mass wall"
#. ~ Death message of monster "crystal seed"
#. ~ Death message of monster "vengeance spirit"
#. ~ Death message of monster "will-o-wisp"
#. ~ Death message of monster "flying shark"
#. ~ Death message of monster "endless snake"
#. ~ Death message of monster "swarm of teeth"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json data/json/monsters/misc.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/forgedwellers.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s disintegrates!"
msgstr "%s 解体了！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "fungal tendril"
msgid_plural "fungal tendrils"
msgstr[0] "真菌须"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal tendril"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "A long and delicate-looking tendril with a sharp tip."
msgstr "一条很长的，外观很精致但又有着锋利边缘的真菌触须。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wall"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"A veritable wall of fungus, grown as a natural defense by the fungal spire."
"  New spores erupt from the surface every few seconds, and tendrils "
"constrict around it, pulling new mass into its shape.  They move with an "
"inexorable strength that could snap limbs."
msgstr ""
"一个名副其实的真菌墙，由真菌尖塔作为自然防御生长而成。其表面每隔数秒就会喷出新孢子，真菌卷须在它四周伸缩，不断将周围物质改造成同样的形态。它们以一种可以折断你四肢的无法阻挡的力量向前移动。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "fungaloid"
msgid_plural "fungaloids"
msgstr[0] "真菌体"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungaloid"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"A pale white fungus, one meaty gray stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  "
"Spores are periodically expelled from its gills, and a few tendrils extend "
"from the base, allowing mobility and some basic means of defense."
msgstr "一个淡白色的真菌，在一个多肉的灰色菌柄顶部有一朵绽放的菌花。菌褶周期性地喷出孢子，从基座伸出的触须帮助菌体移动和进行一些基本的攻击。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "fungaloid shambler"
msgid_plural "fungaloid shamblers"
msgstr[0] "真菌蹒跚者"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungaloid shambler"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"A large white fungus, a bulging gray stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  "
"Spores float from its gills and tendrils extend from the base.  Chunks of "
"rock, metal, bone, and wood are held by tendrils as a kind of armor."
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的白色真菌，在一个凸起的灰色菌柄顶部有一朵绽放的菌花。菌褶周期性地喷出孢子，从基座伸出了许多触须。大块岩石、金属、骨头和木头被触须固定，像是盔甲一般。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "fungaloid shambler"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "The fungaloid shambler throws a rock!"
msgstr "真菌蹒跚者扔了一块石头！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "fungal spire"
msgid_plural "fungal spires"
msgstr[0] "真菌尖塔"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal spire"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"An enormous fungal spire, towering over the ground.  It pulsates slowly, "
"continuously growing new defenses."
msgstr "高达30英尺的庞大真菌尖塔拔地而起，它缓慢而又规律的不断悸动着，并生成新的防御组织。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "giant fungal blossom"
msgid_plural "giant fungal blossoms"
msgstr[0] "巨型真菌孢子花"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant fungal blossom"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"An immense fungal blossom, towering over its surroundings.  It pulses with a"
" soft blue glow, continuously pumping its spores into the air."
msgstr "一个巨大的真菌植株，高耸于地上。它不断地闪烁着柔和的蓝光，并且让它的孢子飘散到空气中。"

#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_terrain/overmap_terrain_fungal.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/overmap_terrain.json
#: data/mods/alt_map_key/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "fungal tower"
msgid_plural "fungal towers"
msgstr[0] "真菌塔"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal tower"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"An enormous fungal tower.  On closer inspection, its cap is supported by "
"LOTS of fungal tendrils of various thicknesses, emerging from yet more "
"bristling tendrils at ground level.  Between this redundancy and their "
"noticeable movement creating frequent gaps, it's tough to get a solid shot "
"on the thing."
msgstr ""
"一座无比庞大的真菌塔。仔细观察，你会发现它的菌盖是由不同厚度的菌须支撑起来的，而更多的卷须则矗立着垂到了地面上。这些卷须不仅浓密还在明显的蠕动，导致从蠕动的空档里很难结实地击中主体。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "fungal sporeling"
msgid_plural "fungal sporelings"
msgstr[0] "真菌孢苗"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal sporeling"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"A fungal stalk several feet in height.  Two vicious-looking tendrils extend "
"from its thorned and leathery exterior, and it moves about faster than the "
"larger fungaloids."
msgstr "一根近一人高的菌柄。两根可怕的触须从长满尖刺的皮质表皮生长出来，它移动起来比成熟真菌体快一些。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json data/mods/no_fungal_growth/modinfo.json
msgid "spore cloud"
msgid_plural "spore clouds"
msgstr[0] "孢子云"

#. ~ Description of monster "spore cloud"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "A mass of spores the size of a balled fist, wafting around in the air."
msgstr "一团约有拳头大小的孢子云，其中有无数纤细的孢子随风飘荡。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "fungal ant"
msgid_plural "fungal ants"
msgstr[0] "真菌蚁"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal ant"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"Pale, sickly gray in color, this giant ant's cracked exoskeleton is barely "
"held together by coils of fungus erupting from every joint in its body."
msgstr "苍白色的躯体充满了真菌的巨大蚂蚁，蓬发盘绕的真菌把身体勉强组合在一起不让其散架。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "fungal spider"
msgid_plural "fungal spiders"
msgstr[0] "真菌蜘蛛"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal spider"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"The abdomen of this sickly-looking giant spider is now home to many lumps of"
" blooming fungi.  It leaves behind a trail of tainted secretions as it "
"struggles to drag itself along the ground."
msgstr "这只恶心的巨型蜘蛛的腹部旺盛地生长着无数真菌。当这只蜘蛛挣扎着拖着真菌移动时，地上留下了一道感染分泌物。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "fungal zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Once alive, then undead, now something else entirely.  Fungal tendrils "
"sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, holding together a "
"shambling mass of mold-covered flesh."
msgstr "一具曾是人类的尸体，现在完全变成了怪物。真菌从它的口、眼、耳和其他孔洞处喷薄而出并互相连接起来，被霉菌覆盖的躯体还在蹒跚而行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "bloated fungal zombie"
msgid_plural "bloated fungal zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌胀气丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "bloated fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"With its swollen gray skin overgrown by thick layer of mold, this balloon-"
"like fungal zombie looks like it could violently burst into a cloud of "
"noxious spores at any moment."
msgstr "这只真菌丧尸肿胀的灰白皮肤上长满了厚厚的真菌，如同气球一般隆起，随时都有可能爆炸变成一团孢子云。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "pollinator zombie"
msgid_plural "pollinator zombies"
msgstr[0] "授粉丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "pollinator zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Every breath of this crooked, fungus-ridden zombie emits a fine dust of "
"spores, and it constantly looks like it's emerging from a cloud of mist."
msgstr "这只扭曲的布满真菌的丧尸的每一次呼吸都喷射出一片孢子尘，使它看起来就像是从迷雾中诞生一般。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "fungal skeletal zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal skeletal zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌骷髅丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal skeletal zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal skeletal brute"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Fungi bloom from the crevices in the twisted bone growths that cover this "
"creature.  Spores linger in the air around it."
msgstr "真菌从覆盖在这只怪物的扭曲的骨板缝隙中长出。它周围的空气中飘荡着孢子尘。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "fungal skeletal brute"
msgid_plural "fungal skeletal brutes"
msgstr[0] "真菌骸骨丧尸兽"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "fungal juggernaut"
msgid_plural "fungal juggernauts"
msgstr[0] "真菌巨兽"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal juggernaut"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Fungi bloom from the crevices in the ossified plates of this ponderous bone "
"titan, and it seems even its eyes are lost to it.  A dust of spores lands on"
" the ground with every sluggish stomp of its heavy legs."
msgstr "真菌从这只笨重的骷髅巨兽的骨板缝隙中长出，它的眼睛似乎已经被真菌破坏。它移动缓慢，而每一次踏步都使一片孢子尘飘落在地。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "fungal child"
msgid_plural "fungal children"
msgstr[0] "真菌儿童"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal child"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"It is hard to recognize a human child in this creature.  Disgusting-looking "
"mold covers most of its skin.  Many cracks perforate its body, with small "
"fungal stalks poking through."
msgstr "一只真菌生物，很难认出这曾经是一个人类儿童。霉菌几乎覆盖住了它全部的皮肤，身体遍布裂痕穿孔，无数细小的菌丝在其中穿插蠕动。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "fungal boomer"
msgid_plural "fungal boomers"
msgstr[0] "真菌爆汁丧尸"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"A rotund and bloated human body with pasty, fungus-ridden flesh.  Its mouth "
"drips with a frothing gray sludge."
msgstr "这具腐败的丧尸身上充满了浮肿的烂肉和发芽的真菌。更恐怖的是这货的嘴里流淌着污泥。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "fungal wretch"
msgid_plural "fungal wretches"
msgstr[0] "真菌可怜虫"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wretch"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Were it not for the head, its orifices sealed by clumps of fungal growth, "
"which limply crowns this massively swollen corpse, it’d be impossible to "
"tell that this was once a human, let alone a child or adolescent.  The "
"beast’s skin, stretched to paper-thin levels by what you can only assume to "
"be lighter than air decomposition caused gasses built up within it, has "
"turned into a spongy fungal covering with intermittent hair-line cracks "
"which let out spores.  Like a nightmarish balloon the abomination is "
"suspended off the floor with a faint glow emanating from within its guts, "
"more than likely a result of the burning putrid gasses which keep it afloat."
"  At irregular intervals, you can see its form bulge and shift, a hint of "
"something moving within its mass."
msgstr ""
"它浑身的孔洞都被一堆厚厚的菌毯封死，柔软地覆盖在这具巨大肿胀的尸体上，如果不是长着一个头，根本不可能分辨出它曾经是一个人，更不用说儿童还是少年了。这只怪物的皮肤，被拉伸到成了薄纸一样，你只能假设是由体内积聚的分解气体造成的，变成了海绵状的真菌，覆盖着发丝一样的裂缝，间歇地释放出孢子。就像一个噩梦般的气球，这只可憎的怪物被绑在地板上，内脏中透出微弱的光芒，很可能是使其漂浮腐烂气体燃烧的结果。时不时地，你能看到它体表有块鼓起膨胀的东西在移动，暗示着有什么东西在它体内移动。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "fungal wretch"
