#. ~ Death message of monster "zombie kinderling"
#. ~ Death message of monster "fiend"
#. ~ Death message of monster "scorched zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "swollen wretch"
#. ~ Death message of monster "boomer"
#. ~ Death message of monster "huge boomer"
#. ~ Death message of monster "gasoline zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "bloated zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "sleepwalker zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "swollen tearjerker"
#. ~ Death message of monster "boomer glutton"
#. ~ Death message of monster "trapped tendril"
