#. ~ Death message of monster "gangrenous crawler"
#. ~ Death message of monster "gangrenous impaler"
#. ~ Death message of monster "scissorlimbs"
#. ~ Death message of monster "hanging innards"
#. ~ Death message of monster "scorched dilophosaurus zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "scorched spinosaurus zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "scorched tyrannosaurus zombie"
