#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid "[!]RE: Important Status Update"
msgstr "[!]主题：重要情况更新"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid "RETURN TO MAIN PAGE"
msgstr "返回主页"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
"  TO: [Branch Managers], [Community Managers]\n"
"  RE: Important Status Update\n"
"\n"
" Everyone,\n"
" You are to follow your appropriate lockdown protocols at your discretion.  With the recent events as they are, we must do our utmost to ensure that our goals remain priority.\n"
"\n"
" Branch Managers - your deliveries will have an altered schedule.  I will send a separate email with details.  Ensure the hidden safe rooms are properly secured.\n"
" Community Managers - Lockdown the community appropriately.  Tell the residents that it is for their protection, but do not let them leave.  We need them for the Big Pappy project to be successful.  I am going to send you some contacts who can discreetly install a heavy security gate.\n"
"\n"
" You will continue to receive your bonus pay as agreed upon.  Do not lose sight of our important endgame."
msgstr ""
"&来自：克里斯蒂·戈迪，运营高级副总裁\n"
"发往：[分部经理]，[社区管理员]\n"
"主题：重要情况更新\n"
"\n"
"致所有人，\n"
"你们应自行决定遵循适当的锁定协议。鉴于最近发生的事件，我们必须尽最大努力确保我们的目标仍然是优先事项。\n"
"\n"
"分部经理 - 你的工作时间表有改变。我将单独发送一封包含详细信息的电子邮件。确保隐藏的安全房间得到妥善保护。\n"
"社区管理员 - 适时封闭社区。告诉居民这是为了保护他们，而且不要让他们离开，我们需要他们来让“大老爹”项目取得成功。我将向你发送一些可以安装可靠重型安全门的联系人。\n"
"\n"
"按照约定，你们将继续收到奖金。在最后的重要关头绝不能掉以轻心。"

