msgid "My stomach thanks you."
msgstr "我的胃谢谢你。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_food_thanks>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after eating food from a basecamp larder.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'm slightly fuller than I was before, nice."
msgstr "我比之前稍微饱了一点，不错。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_food_thanks>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after eating food from a basecamp larder.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"I just had some food, but I'm still peckish.  Would you mind if I ate more?"
msgstr "我刚吃了点东西，但还有点饿。不介意我多吃点吧？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_food_thanks>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after eating food from a basecamp larder.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Not quite restaurant quality but it'll do."
msgstr "比不上餐厅的热菜，但也还行。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_food_thanks>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after eating food from a basecamp larder.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I miss mom's cooking."
msgstr "我想念妈妈做的菜。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_food_thanks>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after eating food from a basecamp larder.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'll just pretend that was pizza."
msgstr "我就假装那是披萨了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hey, <name_g>, we're out of food."
msgstr "嗨，<name_g>，我们这里食物吃完了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hey, the larder is empty!  We're going to starve."
msgstr "嘿，储藏室空了！我们要饿死了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "There's no food in the larder!"
msgstr "储藏室里没有食物了！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "<name_g>, we're empty on chow."
msgstr "<name_g>，我们没有吃的了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Larder is a little bare.  Really bare in fact."
msgstr "食物储藏有点空。确切的说已经完全空了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Larder is empty, completely cleared out."
msgstr "食物储藏空了，完全空了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "We need more food in the basecamp larder; it's empty."
msgstr "我们需要把更多的食物放进营地储藏室；它已经空了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Uhm, <name_g>, I don't meant to criticize, but we should focus on "
"distributing some food into the basecamp larder."
msgstr "嗯，<name_g>，我不想抱怨太多，但我们应该优先把食物分发到营地的储藏室里。"

