#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Merchant"
msgstr "商人"

#. ~ Job description of "Merchant" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/classes.json
msgid "I sell things to make a living."
msgstr "我卖东西谋生。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
msgstr "收集一个基础实验室分析工具包"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a basic laboratory analysis kit for the chemist."
msgstr "为化学家寻找一个基础实验室分析工具包。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I need a basic laboratory analysis kit."
msgstr "我需要一个基础实验室分析工具包。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've checked the stock here at this house, and it turns out there's a few "
"pieces of equipment I need.  Firstly, I need a reliable way to take "
"measurements and verify results.  If you could get me a basic laboratory "
"analysis kit just to get started, I'd be grateful.  That's the first step "
"towards making everything I brought with me useful."
msgstr ""
"我检查了这所房子的库存，结果发现我依然缺少一些设备。首先，我需要一种可靠的方法来进行测量和验证结果。如果你能给我一个基础实验室分析工具包，我将不胜感激。这是让我随身携带的一切能派上用场的第一步。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 75 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder Wire"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "I'll be here when you get back.  Good luck!"
msgstr "我会在这里等你回来的。祝你好运！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
msgid "Well, someone's got to do it."
msgstr "嗯，总得有人去做这件事。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "One of those old labs might have one."
msgstr "那些旧世界的实验室之中可能有一个。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Do you have it?"
msgstr "弄到那东西了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Thank you!  I can't wait to get started!"
msgstr "谢谢！我等不及要开始了！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll have to find it myself."
msgstr "真不幸。我想我得自己去找。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgstr "收集 15 升盐酸"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 15 liters of hydrochloric acid for the chemist."
msgstr "为化学家准备 15 升盐酸。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I need 15 liters of hydrochloric acid."
msgstr "我需要 15 升盐酸。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"The last thing I really need to get going is hydrochloric acid.  It's one of"
" those chemicals that's just perfect for so many things.  An acidifying "
"reagent, and one of the best.  With a large supply of hydrochloric acid, you"
" and I are only a few steps removed from a stable source of antiseptic, "
"fungicide, and even some light explosives!  As the only apparent health "
"authority left, I do have to warn you not to get it on your skin, though.  "
"Find this for me and I'll sell you whatever I can make."
msgstr ""
"我真正需要做的最后一件事是盐酸。它是一种用途广泛的化学物质。一种酸化试剂，也是最好的试剂之一。有了大量的盐酸，你我距离稳定的防腐剂、抗真菌剂甚至一些轻炸药的来源只有几步之遥！不过，作为如今唯一明显的健康权威，我必须警告你不要把它弄到你的皮肤上。帮我找到这个，我会卖给你任何我能做出来的东西。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"You might find large quantities in a warehouse somewhere, but it often got "
"sold as a household cleaner, did you know that?"
msgstr "你可能会在某处的仓库中找到大量这种东西。但你要知道，它也经常作为家用清洁剂出售。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the hydrochloric acid?"
msgstr "弄到盐酸了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  I'm sure this will be quite helpful."
msgstr "太棒了！我相信这东西会非常有用。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Find Some Gasoline"
msgstr "收集 100 升汽油"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 liters of gasoline for the chemist."
msgstr "为化学家准备 100 升汽油。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "I need 100 liters of gas."
msgstr "我需要 100 升汽油。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm in a bit of a spot.  I keep a generator around here to power all my "
"scientific equipment.  It has a bit of gas in it, but I've burned through "
"that and I can't use most of my tools without power.  This may seem like a "
"lot, but if you could get me 100 liters of gas, I'll pay you back any way I "
"can."
msgstr ""
"我碰到了点麻烦。我在这里放了一台发电机，为我所有的科学设备供电。它里面本来有一点汽油，但我已经都烧掉了，我的大部分工具都不能在没有电源的情况下使用。这可能看起来很多，但如果你能给我"
" 100 升汽油，我会尽我所能回报你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"I bet the best place to find that much gas is still a gas station.  Bringing"
" it all here is another problem.  You might want one of those big steel "
"drums we used to use to haul off hazardous waste before <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr ""
"我敢打赌，找到这么多汽油的最佳地点仍然是加油站。但如何把它全部带到这里是另一个问题，你或许想要一个我们在<the_cataclysm>以前用来运走危险废物的大钢桶。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"Wonderful!  Thank you so much!  This will keep me running for a long, long "
"time."
msgstr "太棒了！太感谢了！这些汽油能让我维持研究很长很长时间。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks for trying…  I guess."
msgstr "感谢你的努力……我想是吧。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Establish A Trade Route"
msgstr "建立贸易路线"

#. ~ Description of mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"Establish trade relations between the chemist and a refugee center, and "
"bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr "建立化学家和难民中心之间的贸易关系，并带回一份协议书。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Go negotiate a trade agreement."
msgstr "去谈一份贸易协议。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid ""
"I was out scavenging recently, and I found one of those old evac shelters.  "
"Turns out the computer was still on and it had an address for a refugee "
"center.  I think my skills might be useful to them, for helping maintain "
"medical supplies and whatnot, so I want you to head over there and see if "
"they're interested.  I'd do it myself, but I need to look after this place."
msgstr ""
"我最近在外面捡拾东西，发现了一个旧的疏散避难所。原来电脑还开着，显示有一个难民中心的地址。我想我的技能可能对他们有用，帮助维持医疗用品供应之类的，所以我希望你去那里看看他们是否感兴趣。我本来打算自己去的，但我需要照顾这个地方。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Please?  This is really important to me."
msgstr "拜托了，这对我来说真的很重要。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid ""
"It should be pretty simple making the deal, but I'd recommend taking a car "
"over there myself."
msgstr "交易应该很简单，但我建议开辆车过去。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "What did they say about it?"
msgstr "他们怎么说？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
msgid "How does this help me?"
msgstr "这对我有什么好处？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll have to find other customers."
msgstr "真不幸，我想我得另找买家了。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "chemist"
msgstr "化学家"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "Chemist"
msgstr "化学家"

#. ~ Job description of "Chemist" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "I make and sell chemicals"
msgstr "我制造贩卖化学品。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Bye."
msgstr "再见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
msgid "So, what's up?"
msgstr "所以，有什么事吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "这是哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "I'd like to buy in bulk."
msgstr "我想买一批化学品。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_gode.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_leader.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_mechanic.json
msgid "Any jobs you need done?"
msgstr "你们这里缺人干活吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid ""
"I used to be a chemist.  Well, I am a chemist.  I've been living out here in"
" the wilderness for a little while now since <the_cataclysm>.  Even brought "
"some of my equipment, though unfortunately missing some of the more "
"sensitive and expensive stuff.  I found a couple useful things here in the "
"cupboards, but other than that, entirely empty.  So, I moved in."
msgstr ""
"我曾经是一名化学家。好吧，现在也是。自从<the_cataclysm>以后，我已经在荒野中生活了一段时间。甚至还带上了一些我的设备，但遗憾的是我没带上一些娇贵的东西。我在这里的橱柜里发现了一些能用的东西，但除此之外，完全被搬空了。所以，我搬进这里了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr "嗯。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid ""
"Not my place, just somewhere I ended up.  Some old shack, maybe a hunting "
"cabin or something more… criminal, at least judging by some of what I found "
"on the shelves.  You certainly wouldn't attract much attention synthesizing "
"illegal substances all the way out here, that's all I'm saying.  I found it "
"while I was trying to escape all the <zombies> in the city, and I decided to"
" stay."
msgstr ""
"这地方不属于我，只是我最终落脚的地方。几间旧棚屋，也许是狩猎小屋或其他更……更违法的东西，至少从我在架子上发现的一些东西分析如此。在这里合成非法物质肯定不会引起太多关注，我只能说这么多了。当我试图逃离城市中的<zombies>时，我发现了它，我决定留下来。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid ""
"I'm out of some things, <name_g>.  It takes a while to source the good stuff"
" - days usually - but I'm working hard to replace it.  What can I get you in"
" the meantime?"
msgstr "我有些原料缺了，<name_g>。收集好东西需要一段时间——通常是几天——但我正在努力用别的替代。在此期间我能给你什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid ""
"I'll see what I've got around here for you.  I've gotta warn you: it's gonna"
" be expensive.  Hard to stay supplied in the apocalypse, you know.  What do "
"you need?"
msgstr "我看看我在这里为你准备了什么……我丑话说在前头：价格会很贵。你要知道，这些东西在末日后很难维持稳定的供应。你需要点什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "[10$]  I'll buy some bandages."
msgstr "[10$]我要买些绷带。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "[40$]  I'll buy some aspirin."
msgstr "[40$]我要买些阿司匹林。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some sprayable fungicide."
msgstr "[50$]我要买些喷雾式抗真菌剂。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some powder fungicide."
msgstr "[50$]我要买些抗真菌剂粉末。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "[50$]  I'll buy some disinfectant."
msgstr "[50$]我要买些消毒剂。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "[120$]  I'll buy some antibiotics."
msgstr "[120$]我要买些抗生素。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
