#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Chris Isherwood"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2000 units of sand"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "谢谢你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Thanks, bye."
msgstr "谢了，再见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Are we there yet, <name_g>?  I can't wait to burn that building!"
msgstr "<name_g>，咱们到了吗？我等不及要烧光那个破地方了！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "We're here.  Let's do it!"
msgstr "我们到了。开干吧！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Be patient, <name_g>, we're getting there soon."
msgstr "耐心点，<name_g>，我们很快就到了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I guess it's just us."
msgstr "呵呵，我估计就我们两个活人了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "At least we've got shelter."
msgstr "好歹我们还有个避难所可以呆。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What should we do now?"
msgstr "[询问]我们现在该做什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Any tips?"
msgstr "[询问]有什么建议吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Want to travel with me?"
msgstr "[组队]与我同行吧，如何？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Want to share some useful items with me?"
msgstr "能和我分享一些有用的东西吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I don't know, look for supplies and other survivors I guess."
msgstr "不知道，或许我们应该寻找其他幸存者和补给。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Maybe we should start boarding up this place."
msgstr "也许我们该开始加固这个地方。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I suppose getting a car up and running should really be useful if we have to"
" disappear quickly from here."
msgstr "也许该弄好一辆车了，这对我们从这里迅速撤离是很有帮助的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We could look for one of those farms out here.  They can provide plenty of "
"food and aren't close to the cities."
msgstr "我知道周边有几个农场，我们可以去找一个落脚。它们可以提供充足的食物，而且也不用在城市里和那些家伙打照面。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We should probably stay away from those cities, even if there's plenty of "
"useful stuff there."
msgstr "也许我们应该远离那些城市，即便那里有不少有用的东西。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Hmm, okay."
msgstr "嗯嗯，好吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "谢谢啦！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Focus on the road, mate!"
msgstr "专心开车，兄弟！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I must focus on the road!"
msgstr "我在开车呢！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too thirsty, give me something to drink."
msgstr "我渴了，给我来点喝的吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too hungry, give me something to eat."
msgstr "我饿了，给我来点吃的吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "我累了，让我去睡一会吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Nothing comes to my mind now.  Ask me later perhaps?"
msgstr "我现在什么都想不到，下次再问我吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for not telling you."
msgstr "我不方便对你说。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Ah, okay."
msgstr "啊，好吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not until I get some antibiotics…"
msgstr "除非你给我一点抗生素……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You asked me recently; ask again later."
msgstr "你刚才问过我了，我仍在考虑中，一会再问我吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I travel with you?"
msgstr "为什么我应该跟你同行？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Understood.  I'll get those antibiotics."
msgstr "明白了，我会把抗生素拿给你的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right, right, I'll ask later."
msgstr "好吧，以后再问你吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can keep you safe."
msgstr "因为我有能力保护你啊。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You can keep me safe."
msgstr "因为你能保护我的安全。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll kill you if you don't."
msgstr "要是不答应我就杀了你。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You got it, I'm with you!"
msgstr "如你所愿，我和你一起走！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Awesome!"
msgstr "嗯，那太好了！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's go!"
msgstr "好的，我们出发吧！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Yeah… I don't think so."
msgstr "噢……我并不这么认为。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "干什么？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "How much further?"
msgstr "还有多远？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd like to lead for a while."
msgstr "让我来带路吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Step aside.  I'm leader now."
msgstr "一边去，现在我是领队！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright.  You can lead now."
msgstr "好吧，现在你说了算。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Good.  Something else…"
msgstr "好的。还有别的事……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's go."
msgstr "好的，出发吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "OK，OK。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, show me how it's done."
msgstr "好的，让我看看是怎么做的吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's begin."
msgstr "好的，我们开始吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay.  Lead the way."
msgstr "好的，你来带路吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, we'll be okay here."
msgstr "不要，在这挺好的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "On second thought, never mind."
msgstr "[取消]回头想一想，算了吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, who should participate?"
msgstr "好的，谁应该参加？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Let's see…"
msgstr "我想想看……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's begin."
msgstr "好吧，让我们开始吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "[确认]听起来不错，开始吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while you're operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "你开车的时候，我没法好好儿训练你！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "我开车的时候没法训练你！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it some time, I'll show you something new later…"
msgstr "给我点时间，我会给你看点新玩意……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for denying you training."
msgstr "我不教你是有原因的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We'll talk about a training seminar after you're done operating that "
"vehicle."
msgstr "在你开完车后，我们再讨论培训的事情。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't host a seminar while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "我开车的时候没法开展培训！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it some time, we'll talk about a training seminar later…"
msgstr "给我点时间，我们稍后再讨论培训的事……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason to refuse hosting a training seminar."
msgstr "我不开展培训是有原因的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not a bloody chance, I'm going to get left behind!"
msgstr "一点可能也没有。我要留下来！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "好吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm on watch."
msgstr "我在看管这里。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I need you to come with me."
msgstr "[归队]我需要你和我一起走。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I really don't feel comfortable doing so…"
msgstr "这么做让我很不爽啊……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give you some space."
msgstr "我会给你点空间。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd prefer to keep that to myself."
msgstr "我还是留着给自己吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I understand…"
msgstr "我明白……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You just asked me for stuff; ask later."
msgstr "你刚刚问我要过东西了，晚点再说吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I share my equipment with you?"
msgstr "为何我应该跟你分享自己的装备？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine."
msgstr "好的，算了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm holding a thermal detonator!"
msgstr "因为我手上捏这个危险的家伙！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm your friend!"
msgstr "因为我是你的朋友！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I am helping you out…"
msgstr "因为我正在帮你忙？……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give it back!"
msgstr "我会把这个还给你的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it to me, or else!"
msgstr "快点把你的东西给我！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Eh, never mind."
msgstr "[取消]嗯，不用了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Never mind, I'll do without.  Bye."
msgstr "[取消]没关系，再见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, here you go."
msgstr "好的，给你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks!  But can I have some more?"
msgstr "感谢！能否再给一些？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks, see you later!"
msgstr "谢了，请多保重！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You picked up something that does not belong to you…"
msgstr "你拾取了不属于你的东西……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, this is all a misunderstanding.  Sorry, I'll drop it now."
msgstr "好吧，好吧，这都是误会。对不起，我现在就把它放下。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, I'm keeping it.  Try and take it off me, I dare you."
msgstr "不，它是我的了。你敢把它从我身上拿下来试试。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Look, I really need this.  Please let me have it."
msgstr "听着，我急需这个。请把它给我吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What, this?  It's not the same one, you are mistaken."
msgstr "什么，这个？这不是同一个东西，你搞错了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  Look, I already dropped it, okay?"
msgstr "我很抱歉。看，我已经把它放下了，好吗？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Don't try and talk yourself out of this, drop it now."
msgstr "别说那么多，现在就放下它。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, I'm dropping it…"
msgstr "好吧，我现在就放下它……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Just this once, you can keep it.  Don't tell anyone else."
msgstr "下不为例，你可以留着它。别告诉别人。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_prototypes.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_gode.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_mechanic.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/TALK_valhallist_member.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "谢了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right… I don't want any trouble."
msgstr "好……我不想惹麻烦。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Smart choice."
msgstr "明智的选择。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "<no>, and if you ask again, <ill_kill_you>!"
msgstr "<no>，如果你敢再问，<ill_kill_you>！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "<no><punc> <fuck_you>!"
msgstr "<no><punc> <fuck_you>！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, sorry."
msgstr "好吧，我表示抱歉。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Seriously, give me more stuff!"
msgstr "真的，再谈一下如何？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine, bye."
msgstr "嗯嗯，那就这样，再会。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I'm willing to pay <topic_item_price> per batch for a total of "
"<topic_item_your_total_price>."
msgstr "每份我给你算 <topic_item_price>，一共 <topic_item_your_total_price>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr "挺好，我没意见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "Maybe later."
msgstr "下次再说吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Pleasure doing business!"
msgstr "交易愉快！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You might be seeing more of me…"
msgstr "我们还会再见的……"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk…"
msgstr "你是认真的吗？这里看上去可不是可以安全闲聊的地方……"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "It's fine, we've got a moment."
msgstr "没事的，我们能抽出点空来。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "Good point, let's find a more appropriate place."
msgstr "说的是，让我们去找个更合适点的地方吧。"

