msgstr "查看员工档案"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "RE: Do Your Job"
msgstr "主题：做好你的工作"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "RE: Connie Malackey"
msgstr "主题：康妮·马拉奇"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Do Your Job\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Do you not conduct thorough background checks and reviews on new hires?  Joe is related to the Mayor of Springfield.  His 90 day New Employee evaluation is coming up.  Do your job."
msgstr ""
"&来自：克里斯蒂·戈迪，运营高级副总裁\n"
"发往：布莱恩·鲁特斯，接待经理\n"
"主题：做好你的工作\n"
"\n"
"布莱恩，\n"
"你难道不对新员工进行彻底的背景调查吗？乔可是斯普林菲尔德市长的人。他的季度新员工绩效评估马上就到时间了。做好你的工作。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Performance Evaluation\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, I look forward to seeing you Tuesday for my evaluation.  I've been working really hard to show that I am Shady Hills material!"
msgstr ""
"&来自：乔·舍特，接待员\n"
"发往：布莱恩·鲁特斯，接待经理\n"
"主题：绩效评估\n"
"\n"
"嗨，鲁特斯先生，我很期待星期二和您进行绩效面谈。我一直在努力证明我是块 Shady Hills 的料！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Connie Malackey\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Connie has been asking a lot of weird questions about 'Ghosts' and other such nonsense.\n"
" This could look bad for us.  To make it worse, she is hanging out with Joe Shert a lot.\n"
" Shut it down."
msgstr ""
"&来自：克里斯蒂·戈迪，运营高级副总裁\n"
"发往：布莱恩·鲁斯特，接待经理\n"
"主题：康妮·马拉奇\n"
"\n"
"布莱恩，\n"
"康妮一直在问很多关于“幽灵”和诸如此类的奇怪问题。\n"
"这会让我们难堪的。更糟糕的是，她经常和乔·舍特呆在一起。\n"
"把这事压下来。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, with all due respect I feel that I may have been assigned more of these tasks than the other Receptionists.\n"
" Jim said he hasn't had to do any cleaning in two weeks, yet I have been on cleaning duty 3 times.\n"
" To be clear, I certainly do not mind the extra work!  I just want to ensure you're aware in case there is a computer glitch.\n"
" Thank you and have a great day!"
msgstr ""
"&来自：乔·舍特，接待员\n"
"发往：布莱恩·鲁斯特，接待经理\n"
"主题：家政\n"
"\n"
"嗨，鲁斯特先生，恕我直言，我觉得我可能被分配了比其他接待员更多的任务。\n"
"吉姆说他已经两个星期不用打扫了，但我已经当了三回班了。\n"
"先说清楚，我当然不介意加班工作！我只是想确保您知道，万一是有电脑故障呢。\n"
"谢谢，祝您有美好的一天！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Amanda Hugentskis, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Seriously?  This is ridiculous.  This place was a mess even with housekeeping personnel.\n"
" I quit."
msgstr ""
"&来自：阿曼达·胡根茨基，接待员\n"
"发往：布莱恩·鲁特斯，接待经理\n"
"主题：家政\n"
"\n"
"真的吗？这也太荒唐了。这个地方即使有家政人员也是一团糟。\n"
"我不干了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"WARNING!  ERROR A101; FAILURE DETECTED IN POWER SUPPLY.\n"
" RESERVE POWER ACTIVATED.  CONTACT INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY DEPARTMENT IMMEDIATELY!\n"
"\n"
" WARNING!  ERROR D809; UNABLE TO CONNECT TO DATABASE.\n"
" ERROR REFRESHING DATABASE.  NOT ALL RECORDS MAY BE DISPLAYED.\n"
" CONTACT INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY DEPARTMENT IMMEDIATELY!\n"
"\n"
" Please select an employee record below."
msgstr ""
"&警告！错误 A101；检测到电源故障。\n"
"备用电源已激活。请立即联系信息技术部！\n"
"\n"
"警告！错误 D809；无法连接到数据库。\n"
"刷新数据库时出错。可能无法显示所有记录。\n"
"请立即联系信息技术部！\n"
"\n"
"请在下面选择员工记录。"

