#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"PROJECT CODE NAME: 'Big Pappy'\n"
" PROJECT RESIDENT: Pablo Shepherds\n"
" PROJECT STATUS: Active\n"
" PROJECT START DATE: xx-xx-xxxx\n"
"\n"
" Entry Log 1: Started subject on assigned dosage.  Will monitor over 7 days.\n"
" Entry Log 2: Subject within expected parameters.  Subject will remain in general population.\n"
" Entry Log 3: Subject within expected parameters.  Subject will remain in general population.\n"
" Entry Log 4: Subject showing signs of severe dementia.  Unexpected result.  Following removal protocol.  Moving patient to Secure room for 2 day period.\n"
" Entry log 5: Subject stabilizing.  Attempting RA21E dosage.\n"
" Entry Log 6: Subject within expected parameters.  Returning to general population.\n"
" Entry Log 7: Subject within expected parameters.  Attempting Mutagenic Serum dose.  Following removal protocol.  Moving patient to Secure room for 2 day period.\n"
" Entry Log 8: Subject has shown tremendous increase in girth and power.  Reduction in cognitive decline.  Symptoms of dementia nearly eliminated.\n"
" Entry Log 9: Subject becoming belligerent.  Unknown cause.  Purifier Serum failing.  Initiated sedation protocol.  15mg Carfentanil required.  Initiating Failsafe protocol; subject cannot be returned to general population.\n"
" Entry Log 10: Subject remains sedated.  Maintaining Failsafe protocol.  Attempting purifier serum trial."
msgstr ""
"&项目代号：“大老爹”\n"
"项目住户：巴勃罗·谢菲尔德\n"
"项目状态：进行中\n"
"开始日期：xx-xx-xxxx\n"
"\n"
"条目日志 1：受试者开始按指定剂量服用。将继续监测至少 7 天。\n"
"条目日志 2：受试者表现符合预期。受试者将留在普通人群中。\n"
"条目日志 3：受试者表现符合预期。受试者将留在普通人群中。\n"
"条目日志 4：受试者表现出严重痴呆的迹象。结果出乎意料。遵循移除协议。将患者转移到安全房间，为期 2 天。\n"
"条目日志 5：受试者情况稳定。尝试 RA21E 剂量。\n"
"条目日志 6：受试者表现符合预期。回归普通人群。\n"
"条目日志 7：受试者表现符合预期。尝试诱变血清剂量。遵循移除协议。将患者转移到安全房间，为期 2 天。\n"
"条目日志 8：受试者的体型和力量显着增加。认知衰退减少。痴呆症状几乎消除。\n"
"条目日志 9：受试者攻击性增强。原因不明。净化血清失效。启动镇静程序。需要 15mg 卡芬太尼。启动意外处置方案；受试者不得回归普通人群。\n"
"条目日志 10：受试者保持镇静状态。维持意外处置方案。尝试净化血清试验。"

