#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/godco/classes.json
msgid "Member"
msgstr "教友"

#. ~ Job description of "Member" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Dorm leader" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Hunter" NPC class
