msgstr "<npcname> 不愿出售此物品"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/godco/classes.json
msgid "Clergyman"
msgstr "教士"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/godco/classes.json data/json/npcs/godco/npcs.json
msgid "joinee"
msgstr "入会者"

#. ~ Job description of "Member" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/godco/classes.json
msgid "I am a member of the group."
msgstr "我是社区的一份子。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Hello again.  What do you need?"
msgstr "欢迎回来。你需要什么？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "*waves you over.  \"Hey <name_g>.  How's it going for you?\""
msgstr "*向你挥手。“嘿，<name_g>。你过得怎么样？”"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you."
msgstr "你好，陌生人，我想我们以前没见过面。很高兴见到你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Who are you?  Where am I right now?"
msgstr "你是谁？我现在在哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Just passing through, don't mind me."
msgstr "只是个路过的，别在意。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "I wanted to talk."
msgstr "我想谈谈。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Could I have some food?"
msgstr "能给我点东西吃吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I heard the joinees could get some food here."
msgstr "我听说入会者可以在这里吃点东西。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Okay, shoot."
msgstr "好吧，说吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Sure, what's up?"
msgstr "当然，怎么了？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "ALright, lets chat."
msgstr "好吧，来聊天吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "How are you holding up?"
msgstr "你过得好吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Is there any way I could join the community?"
msgstr "我有什么办法加入这个社区吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I've changed my mind, forget about it."
msgstr "我改变主意了，忘掉它吧。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "On second thought, I gotta go.  See ya, <name_g>."
msgstr "转念一想，我得走了。再见，<name_g>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"This is the New England Community Church, I should say it's one of their old"
" retreats.  I'm Simon, the head chef around here."
msgstr "这是新英格兰教会社区，我应该说曾经是他们的旧避难所之一。我是西蒙，这里的主厨。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"I used to volunteer as a cook in a homeless shelter.  I met the church "
"through that job; their missionaries would come by every so often and hand "
"out essentials to people living there, then give a sermon in one of the back"
" rooms.  Katherine and I wound up going to one of their sermons, and we've "
"stayed connected since.  Working in that shelter taught me to cook on a "
"shoestring budget; that's really useful these days, ya know."
msgstr ""
"我曾经在一个流浪者收容所里做厨师。我通过那份工作认识了教会；他们的传教士会经常来，向住在那里的人分发必需品，然后在一个后屋里布道。凯瑟琳和我最终加入了他们的布道会，从那以后我们一直保持联系。在收容所的工作教我学会了如何用微薄的预算做饭；你知道，现在这技能真的很有用。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Where's your family now?"
msgstr "你的家人都在哪里？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_g>.  See you around."
msgstr "谢谢，<name_g>。我们回头见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Katherine's probably in the bunks right now, and Jeremiah's next door.  Feel"
" free to say hello sometime."
msgstr "凯瑟琳现在可能在宿舍里，耶利米大概在隔壁。有空打个招呼吧。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"It's been a while since anyone gave out meals.  We're low on supplies around"
" here, I can't spare any.  I'm sorry."
msgstr "有一段时间没有派餐了。我们这里的补给不足，我可分不出一份给你。我很抱歉。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Would you accept any money for it?"
msgstr "你愿意接受任何钱吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Please?  I need it for my family."
msgstr "求求了，我的家人需要食物。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"They can, but we're limited on the portions for now.  Hope you enjoy it, and"
" come back tomorrow for another."
msgstr "他们可以，但目前我们的份量有限。希望你喜欢，明天可以再来领一份。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "No, I wouldn't.  Like I said, we don't have any to spare."
msgstr "不行，我没有。就像我刚刚说的，我们这里分不出多余的给你。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "It was worth a shot, I guess."
msgstr "我想值得一试。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Look, I have a family too.  I know how hard it is for you, but I've already "
"told you, rules are rules."
msgstr "听着，我也有家人。我知道这对你来说很艰难，但我已经告诉过你了，规矩就是规矩。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "I guess I'll starve."
msgstr "我想我只能饿死了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"Could be better, could be worse, but I'm not complaining.  I have everything"
" I need here; my family, a nice job, and roof over my head.  I only wish God"
" was as forgiving to others as to me."
msgstr "可能更好，可能更糟，但我一点都不抱怨。我在这里有我所需要的一切；我的家庭，一份好工作而且头上有片瓦。我希望上帝能像对我一样宽恕别人。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid "Good to hear that."
msgstr "很高兴听到你这么说。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
msgid ""
"You'd have to talk to Gemma or Julian about that.  I'm sure there's a way, "
"though."
msgstr "你得去找杰玛或朱利安谈谈这件事。不过我肯定一切总会有解决办法。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Hey there."
msgstr "嗨，那边那位。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "You're back."
msgstr "你又来了啊。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "So…?"
msgstr "什么事……？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Hello.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr "你好。什么风把你吹来了？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Just stopping by for a moment.  See ya."
msgstr "只是在这里停留片刻。再见。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Who are you again?"
msgstr "你又是谁？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Could I borrow something from the stock?"
msgstr "我能从这里借点东西吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Has anyone stolen from here?"
msgstr "有人偷过这里的东西吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "How much food do you have?"
msgstr "你们这里有多少食物？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I'm a guard.  I'm making sure this stockpile is alright."
msgstr "我是一名守卫。我在确保库存一切正常。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Nope, you can't do that.  I'd like to help you, bit we've already got enough"
" mouths to feed."
msgstr "不，你不能那样做。我很想帮你，但我们已经有足够多的嘴了。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Could some money persuade you?"
msgstr "一些钱能说服你吗？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I can give these people one less mouth to feed, if you'd prefer that."
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，我可以让这些人少吃一口。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Alright.  See ya."
msgstr "好吧。再见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Nobody's tried to yet.  It can get a little boring sometimes, standing "
"around and doing nothing."
msgstr "还没有人尝试过。有时候，站着无所事事，会有点无聊。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I can understand that.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "我能理解。让我们谈谈其他事情。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I hope it isn't too boring.  See ya."
msgstr "我希望这不会太无聊。再见。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "That's private info, <name_g>."
msgstr "这是私人信息，<name_g>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Alright.  I gotta go."
msgstr "好吧，我该走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Nope, it couldn't.  Don't try and <swear> bribe me again, you <swear> "
"<name_b>."
msgstr "不，这不行。别再<swear>贿赂我了，你<swear><name_b>。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Geez, I'm leaving."
msgstr "天哪，我得走了。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid ""
"Alright, alright.  Here's some food and water, <name_b>.  Get out of my "
"<swear> sight."
msgstr "好吧，好吧。这是一些食物和水，<name_b>。快<swear>离开我的视线。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Keep that in mind."
msgstr "我会记着的。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "Okay, here's some food and water.  Don't tell anyone I gave you that."
msgstr "好的，这是一些食物和水。别告诉任何人我给你的。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
msgid "I won't.  Pleasure doin' business."
msgstr "我不会的。交易愉快。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Picky Meals"
msgstr "挑剔的一餐"

#. ~ Description of mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 20 pounds of salt."
msgstr "找到 20 磅的盐。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a supply of salt."
msgstr "我需要一些盐。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I know this doesn't sound important, but I am running low on salt.  We don't"
" just need it as a seasoning, it's also vital for food preservation.  Could "
"you find about 20 pounds of salt for me?"
msgstr ""
"我知道这也许听起来不那么重要，但是我手头已经快没盐了。这里不光要盐当调味料，而且它还是长期贮藏食品的关键原料。你能帮我找来大概20磅重的盐吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In the absence of life"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Don't forget to tell me when you have them."
msgstr "你找齐了记得回来告诉我啊。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "It's okay, I can do without them.  Just let me know if you reconsider."
msgstr "没关系，没那些我也能行。如果你改变心意了，告诉我就行。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There's a lot of places to look.  They are common in house kitchens, "
"restaurants or grocery stores."
msgstr "在很多地方都能找到，像是在普通住宅的厨房里，餐馆里，又或者是杂货店里。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "How is the search going?  Have you found 'em?"
msgstr "进展怎么样？东西找够了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I really appreciate your help.  Don't worry, you won't leave empty-handed."
msgstr "我真是太感谢你了。别担心，你不会空手而归的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Timber!"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Don't worry about it, it's not that important."
msgstr "别担心，这事其实也没那么重要。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Pickled Meals"
msgstr "腌制的一餐"

#. ~ Description of mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 5 glass jars."
msgstr "收集 5 个玻璃罐"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need several glass jars."
msgstr "我需要一些玻璃罐。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This task is bit more serious.  I don't have enough jars to preserve "
"perishables for the future, and we can't just store everything in salt.  We "
"could do our own canning if we had some more glass jars.  I could get by "
"with 5 for now."
msgstr ""
"这个任务比较重要。我这没有足够玻璃罐来做保存易腐食物的罐头了，总不能把什么东西都埋到盐里。如果这里再有多一些玻璃罐的话，我们就能自己做罐头了。我这现在有5个就勉强够用了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  It'll take a load off my shoulders.  I "
"finally won't have to worry about this problem anymore."
msgstr "多谢你接了这个活。真是让我轻松了不少。我终于不用再担心这个问题了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Just let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "如果你改变主意就和我说一声。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Glass jars are not that hard to find.  I'd look for them in residential "
"areas."
msgstr "玻璃罐不难找。多在居民区找找吧。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the jars?"
msgstr "你找到玻璃罐了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr "多谢帮忙，这是报酬。我还有一件事要请你帮忙。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Sweets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "It's not a big deal, it isn't that urgent."
msgstr "没什么大不了的，这件事没那么急。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Prickled Meals"
msgstr "刺痛的一餐"

#. ~ Description of mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find a butcher knife."
msgstr "找到一把屠宰刀。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need something sharper."
msgstr "我需要一把更锋利的刀。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I don't have any butcher knives in here.  It's difficult to cut anything "
"hard without it.  It's good to have one, even though I won't use it that "
"often.  Could you get me one?"
msgstr "我这连把屠宰刀都没，没了它只要是稍微硬点的东西都很难切。要是有一把就好了，虽然我平时也不会经常用。你能帮我找来一把吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I can't cut anything with this dull knife."
msgstr "你愿意接受这个任务，真是太谢谢了。我用这把钝刀切不了东西。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I guess I have to cut them with my steak knife."
msgstr "我想我只能用我自己的牛排刀来切了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Butcher knives are not that rare to find.  They are commonly found in "
"kitchens."
msgstr "屠宰刀并不少见。它们通常能在厨房里找到。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Do you have that knife now?"
msgstr "你找到了那把刀吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I am grateful for the help you've done."
msgstr "非常感谢你的帮助。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Busy While Working"
msgstr "忙里偷闲"

#. ~ Description of mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find 3 mystery novels."
msgstr "收集 3 本悬疑小说"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to read some mystery novels."
msgstr "我想读点悬疑小说。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Hmm, that would be great!  But if you do, please bring more than just one.  "
"I could read a single novel in a day.  Could you get me… 3 mystery novels?"
msgstr "嗯，那可太好了！如果你可以的话，请多找几本。我一天就能读完一本。你能帮我找来……3本悬疑小说吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just bring it to me when you have it."
msgstr "你找到后给我就行了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Nevermind then.  I hope you'll change your mind."
msgstr "没关系的，等你改变主意了再来找我。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd loot libraries and bookstores."
msgstr "要是换我会去图书馆或者书店里找找。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found the books?"
msgstr "那么，你找到书了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  This will keep me busy for a while.  Please take this as a token"
" of my gratitude."
msgstr "谢谢你。这些书够我读上一阵子的了。请收下这个，这是我的谢礼。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Could you give them to me?"
msgstr "那你能把它们给我吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Fine.  I can read something else."
msgstr "没事的。我还能读些其他的书。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a guitar string"
msgstr "找到吉他弦"

#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find a wire to be used as a guitar string."
msgstr "找一根能用作吉他弦的铁丝。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a new guitar string."
msgstr "我需要一根新的吉他弦。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"One of my guitar strings busted from where I smacked a zombie.  If you could"
" get me a wire, I can rig it to work as a substitute."
msgstr "我的一根吉他弦在我砸碎丧尸脑袋时断了。如果你能给我找来一根铁丝，我可以用它来代替。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'll give you a performance when you get back with it."
msgstr "谢谢。你回来后我会给你表演一场的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I guess I'll just skip that note."
msgstr "我想我只能不弹那个音了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Any old wire should do."
msgstr "任何旧铁丝都可以。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you so much!  This should last for a while."
msgstr "非常感谢！这应该够用一段时间了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Don't worry about it, I'll do it myself."
msgstr "别担心，我自己也能做。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well Construction"
msgstr "建造水井"

#. ~ Description of mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find eight pipes for Darryl Johnson."
msgstr "为达里尔·约翰逊找到八根钢管。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need eight pipes to start construction."
msgstr "我需要八根钢管才能开始施工。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that's some enthusiasm, pal.  Ever since our water supply shut off, "
"we've been using the nearby river for most of our water needs.  Who knows "
"how many bloated corpses have decayed in that.  I want to construct a well, "
"but I'm missing some building materials - eight pipes to be exact."
msgstr ""
"这份热情可不赖，伙计。自从我们的供水中断后，我们就一直使用附近的河流来满足我们的大部分用水需求。谁知道有多少臃肿的尸体在里面腐烂过了。我想造一口井，但我缺少一些建筑材料——准确地说缺八根钢管。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I wish you the best, pal.  I appreciate it."
msgstr "我祝你一切顺利，伙计。我感激不尽。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Come back when you get a chance."
msgstr "等你有机会再回来。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Try disassembling some lockers.  Just don't destroy our furniture, we'll be "
"needing it."
msgstr "试着拆几个锁柜。不要破坏我们的家具，我们还需要它。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well, do you have them?"
msgstr "嗯，东西都齐了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Great, I can finally start constructing this thing."
msgstr "太好了，我终于可以开始建造这家伙了。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Water Pump Construction"
msgstr "建造水泵"

#. ~ Description of mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find a mechanical pump for Darryl Johnson."
msgstr "为达里尔·约翰逊找到一台机械泵。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a mechanical pump to finish construction."
msgstr "我需要一台机械泵来完成建造。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"It's less like a well, and more like a covered pit currently.  I'll need you"
" to find a mechanical pump, one that will make this <swear> thing work."
msgstr "它不像是一口井，更像是一个有盖的坑。我需要你找来一台机械泵，一个能让这<swear>家伙运作起来的泵。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Take care of yourself out there."
msgstr "在外面照顾好自己。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 2 Stills"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 20 Yeast"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Sugar Beet Seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 60-Liter Metal Tanks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 200-Liter Drums"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cut 200 planks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Blankets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2500 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 300 Salt"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30 Liquid Fertilizer"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 Pipes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 150 Bleach"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 36 bandages"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 6 bottles of antiseptic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Arc Welders"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80 Sugar"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Simple Knife Spears"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Leather Body Armor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Come back when you get a chance.  We need skilled survivors."
msgstr "有空时记得回来，我们这需要技能熟练的幸存者。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Try disassembling another well."
msgstr "可以从另一口井拆下来。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to find that pump?"
msgstr "找到那个机械泵了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Much obliged, survivor.  Thanks to you, we don't need to worry about where "
"our water's gonna come from.  Here, take this as a token of our gratitude."
msgstr "非常感激，幸存者。多亏了你，我们不必再担心水从哪里来了。给你，这是我们的谢礼。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgstr "建造鸡舍"

#. ~ Description of mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get 150 nails for Darryl."
msgstr "为达里尔·约翰逊找到 150 根钉子。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need nails to build a chicken coop"
msgstr "我需要一些钉子来建造鸡舍。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we've got a steady supply of water, I've been thinking about "
"raising some livestock.  I'm starting with some chickens I found on a farm "
"the other day, but I don't have a coop for them.  If you can get me 150 "
"nails, I can start building one."
msgstr ""
"现在我们有了稳定的水源，我一直在考虑养些家禽。我们可以从前几天在农场找到的几只鸡开始，但我们缺少一间鸡舍。如果你能给我找来150根钉子，我可以开始造一个。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Its a simple job."
msgstr "这活很简单。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "You could take apart some furniture in town, or make them yourself."
msgstr "你可以去城里拆些家具，或者自己做。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Got the nails?"
msgstr "弄到钉子了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I should have some eggs in a week, once I finish the coop.  Come"
" back and buy some!"
msgstr "非常感谢。我这个星期内应该就能吃上鸡蛋了，等我把鸡舍造完。记得回来买点吧！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Trophy Hunt I"
msgstr "战利品狩猎I"

#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Help Russell Connelly expand his trophy collection by gathering three hunks "
"of slime glob."
msgstr "帮助拉塞尔·康纳利扩大他的战利品收藏，收集三大块变形怪糊。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need your help…"
msgstr "我需要你的帮助……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I have the location for an alien crash site.  I want you to investigate and "
"bring me anything you'd find interesting."
msgstr "我这里有个异界撞击点的位置。我想让你调查一下，把你找到的所有奇怪的东西带给我。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Good luck out there!"
msgstr "祝你好运！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "That's all right.  Not everyone is cut out for this."
msgstr "没关系，不是每个人都对此感兴趣。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Worst case scenario you'll be covered in slime.  There's nothing to fear, I "
"hope."
msgstr "最坏的情况是你身上会沾满粘液。我希望没什么好担心的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Any luck, survivor?"
msgstr "运气如何，幸存者？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Good one!  Survivor, you have just passed my test.  I knew you could do it."
"  Your work shall be rewarded!"
msgstr "非常不错！幸存者，你刚刚通过了我的测试。我知道你能做到。你的工作会得到回报的！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "You liar!"
msgstr "你这个骗子！"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Trophy Hunt II"
msgstr "战利品狩猎II"

#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Continue the quest for trophies by finding an unhatched spider egg."
msgstr "继续寻找战利品，收集一颗未孵化的蜘蛛卵。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"<the_cataclysm> didn't spare us humans.  Our former selves would look at us "
"in disgust at the things we do for survival.  At least, that's what I was "
"told.  I heard reports of arachnids deep in the woods.  I can't exactly "
"pinpoint where their webs are, but I'm sure you'll figure it out once you're"
" stuck in them.  I'd like me a spider egg!"
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>没有放过我们人类。我们以前的自己会厌恶我们为生存所做的一切。至少，这是他们告诉我的。我听到森林深处有巨型蜘蛛的报告。我无法确切地指出它们的网在哪里，但我相信一旦你陷入其中，你会知道的。我想要一颗巨型蛛卵！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks, make sure you're ready for whatever beast is waiting for you."
msgstr "谢谢，请确保你已经准备好对付那个不知道是什么东西的怪物。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Don't worry <name_g>, I wouldn't send you on a suicide mission, would I?"
msgstr "别担心，<name_g>，我不会派你去执行自杀任务，不是吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to succeed, survivor?"
msgstr "成功了吗，幸存者？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Nice catch!  Friend, you've proven yourself to be an extraordinary survivor."
"  Maybe there's still hope for humanity.  I'll take that egg, thank you very"
" much.  Here's your reward and some bullets for your effort."
msgstr "漂亮的收获！朋友，你已经证明自己是个非凡的幸存者。也许人类还有希望。请给我那颗卵，非常感谢。这是你的报酬和一些子弹作为奖励。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Trophy Hunt III"
msgstr "战利品狩猎III"

#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Bring one last trophy to Russell Connelly.  Harvest a sting from a bee."
msgstr "为拉塞尔·康纳利带来最后一件战利品。从巨型蜜蜂身上获得毒刺。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"It feels like I'm doing this for revenge.  I have one last mission for you."
"  Ever seen those ginormous bee hives?  Well, I can tell you where the "
"closest one is.  Just kill off one stray bee, harvest its stinger and bring "
"it to me."
msgstr ""
"感觉我这样做是为了复仇。我还有最后一个任务给你。见过那些巨大的蜂巢吗？好吧，我可以告诉你最近的一个在哪里。只需杀死一只走散的蜜蜂，收获它的毒刺，然后把它带回来给我。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I wish you the best of luck, may God guide your path."
msgstr "祝你好运，愿你信仰的那个上帝指引你前进的道路。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "This passion of mine may just be getting to me…"
msgstr "我的这份激情可能只有我来承担了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"If I were you, I'd bring a gun and a butcher knife.  I don't think bug spray"
" work anymore."
msgstr "如果我是你，我会带上一把枪和一把屠宰刀。我认为杀虫剂应该已经不起作用了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "How is the hunt going, survivor?  Any luck?"
msgstr "狩猎进行得怎么样，幸存者？运气好吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Well, partner, this might just be the end of the road.  I hope you enjoyed "
"it as much as I have.  In the meantime… here's your reward, a handful of "
"icons, that's all I have left.  Spend them all, I think you've deserved it."
msgstr "好吧，伙计，这条路应该已经走到头了。我希望你和我一样喜欢它。同时……这是你的奖励，一些圣像，我只剩这些了。花光它们，这是你应得的。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"You give up now?  This country fell apart because no one could find a good "
"man to rely on… might as well give up, I guess."
msgstr "你就这么放弃了？这个国家因为大家找不到一个可以依靠的好人而土崩瓦解……还不如放弃，我想也是。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "End The Nightmare"
msgstr "终结梦魇"

#. ~ Description of mission "End The Nightmare"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Kill whatever's keeping Zachary up at night."
msgstr "杀死那些让扎卡里晚上睡不着的东西。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Any luck with that horror?"
msgstr "干掉那些怪物了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Oh thank you!  Now I can finally get a nights sleep.  Here, I've got some "
"icons saved up, I want you to have them."
msgstr "哦，谢天谢地！现在我终于可以好好睡一晚了。给你，我存了一些圣像，我想它们都归你了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I can still hear it, crying out in the night."
msgstr "我还能听到它，在夜里哭泣。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm not gonna go and fix this <swear> mess."
msgstr "我不会去收拾这<swear>烂摊子的。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Fungus Among Us"
msgstr "我们之中的真菌"

#. ~ Description of mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Purge the cultists in exchange for <reward_count:icon> icons."
msgstr "清除邪教徒以换取 <reward_count:icon> 个圣像。"

