msgid "We need help…"
msgstr "帮帮我们……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There's a weird fungus that started to invade ever since <the_cataclysm>, "
"and several individuals in strange robes are cultivating it.  I've seen what"
" it can do, so I need you to execute them and destroy all traces of these "
"strange mushrooms."
msgstr ""
"自从<the_cataclysm>以后，有种奇怪的真菌开始入侵，几个穿着奇怪长袍的人正在培育它。我已经看到了它的作用，所以我需要你干掉它们，销毁这种奇怪蘑菇的所有痕迹。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "God bless you!"
msgstr "上帝保佑你！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "That fungus is going to kill us all if it isn't stopped."
msgstr "如果不加以阻止，那种真菌会杀死我们所有人。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Despite how fast it grows, it's highly vulnerable to fire."
msgstr "尽管它的生长速度很快，但它很怕火。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Caravan"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Blood Gulch"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/valhalla_cult/missions.json
msgid "Have you dealt with them?"
msgstr "你解决他们了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I don't like killing people, but this time we had too.  Here, "
"take this; its some of our internal money that we've started using.  You "
"know those religious pamphlets shaped like bills people would leave?  These "
"are some of those, couldn't stand 'em myself."
msgstr ""
"非常感谢。我不喜欢杀人，但这次我们别无选择。拿着这个；这是我们开始使用的一些内部货币。你知道那些形状像钞票的宗教宣传册吗？这些就是其中的一部分，我自己有时候都受不了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "We'll have to try again, I suppose."
msgstr "我想我们得再试一次。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Relic Recovery"
msgstr "回收圣物"

#. ~ Description of mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Retrieve a religious relic for Greenwood in exchange for <reward_count:icon>"
" icons."
msgstr "为格林伍德取回一件宗教遗物，以换取 <reward_count:icon> 个圣像。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've been looking to spruce up this place with some iconography, and a small"
" relic would do just that.  It'd help tremendously with morale around here, "
"so I need you to find one for me."
msgstr "我一直想用一些圣像画来装饰这个地方，一件小巧的圣物就能做到这一点。这将极大地提高这里的士气，所以我需要你为我找一个来。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Please bring it back as soon as possible."
msgstr "请尽快把它带回来。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "It'd really help us…"
msgstr "这真的帮我们大忙了……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I know most cathedrals keep small relics, that's a good place to look."
msgstr "我知道许多大教堂里都保存着小巧圣物，这应该是个不错的目标。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  Take these for your trouble."
msgstr "谢谢你，<name_g>。这些给你当作报酬。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to make my own, I guess…"
msgstr "我想我得自己去找了……"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Bible Belt"
msgstr "圣经带"

#. ~ Description of mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Find twenty King James Bibles for Greenwood in exchange for "
"<reward_count:icon> icons."
msgstr "为格林伍德寻找20本钦定版圣经，以换取 <reward_count:icon> 个圣像。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"When we skipped town during <the_cataclysm>, most of us left our possessions"
" behind.  We only have a few Bibles here for all of us, and they're starting"
" to fall apart.  If you could get 20 more, in the King James version, I'd "
"pay well for them."
msgstr ""
"当我们在<the_cataclysm>期间逃离城镇时，我们中的大多数人都把自己的财产留下了。我们这里只有几本《圣经》，而它们都快被翻散架了。如果你能再找来20本，就是那种钦定版的，我可以付一笔大价钱。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you."
msgstr "愿上帝保佑你。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "A book store should have enough, I'll mark one for you."
msgstr "书店里应该有不少，我这就给你标记一间。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you, <name_g>."
msgstr "愿上帝保佑你，<name_g>。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Remnants of Civilization"
msgstr "文明遗迹"

#. ~ Description of mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Find ten rolls of toilet paper for Julian Ray."
msgstr "为朱利安·雷找来10卷厕纸。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "I have a job for you…"
msgstr "我这里有份活给你……"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"As a matter of fact, yes you can.  You see, we're running low on toilet "
"paper.  It's not something we can't live without, but it's luxury we can "
"afford.  I can pay you handsomely if you find us ten rolls toilet paper."
msgstr ""
"事实上，是的，你可以。你看，我们的厕纸快用完了。这不是我们不能没有的东西，但这是我们可以负担得起的奢侈品。如果你给我们找来十卷厕纸，我可以付给你非常可观的报酬。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Well, that's great.  Good luck."
msgstr "那太好了。祝你好运。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Changed your mind already?"
msgstr "这就改变主意了？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "You remember what toilet paper is, right?"
msgstr "你还记得卫生纸长什么样，对吧？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "How's the search going?  Any luck?"
msgstr "进展怎么样？东西找够了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Maybe you people aren't so bad after all."
msgstr "非常感谢。也许你们毕竟没那么坏。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Could you give it to me then?"
msgstr "那你能把它们给我吗？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "The Honeymooners"
msgstr "蜜月伴侣"

#. ~ Description of mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get two wedding rings for Julian."
msgstr "为朱利安找来两枚结婚戒指。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Get two wedding rings."
msgstr "寻找两枚结婚戒指。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Olwen and I have been dating for a while now, and I was planning on asking "
"her to marry me.  I never got the chance to buy our rings before "
"<the_cataclysm>, but I think I'll surprise her with some in a few days.  If "
"you could get me two of them, I'll pay a fair price: $250 in icons."
msgstr ""
"奥尔文和我已经交往了一段时间，我正打算向她求婚。我在<the_cataclysm>以前从未有过买戒指的机会，但我想几天后我会给她一些惊喜。如果你能给我找来两枚戒指，我会给你一个公道价：价值250美元的圣像。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks <name_g>, I'm counting on you."
msgstr "谢谢你，<name_g>，我可都指望你了。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd mean so much to the both of us, and there's a lot of money involved."
msgstr "我想这对我们俩都很重要，而且涉及的钱不是一笔小数目。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"A jewelry store should have a pair.  If not, I'd check a wedding venue."
msgstr "珠宝店应该有成对的。如果没有，我会去婚礼会场附近找找。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Have you found the rings?"
msgstr "你找到戒指了吗？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
msgid "Here's the money, as per our terms.  I really do appreciate this."
msgstr "这是报酬，正如之前约定的。我真的很感激。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
