#. ~ Description of practice "athletics (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/athletics.json
msgid ""
"Practice some basic calisthenics like pushups, squats, dips and crunches."
msgstr "练习一些基本的健身操，如俯卧撑、深蹲、屈伸和仰卧起坐。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/athletics.json
msgid "athletics (intermediate)"
msgstr "运动（中级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "athletics (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/athletics.json
msgid "Practice calisthenics using specialized equipment."
msgstr "使用专业设备练习健身。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/athletics.json
msgid "parkour"
msgstr "跑酷"

#. ~ Description of practice "parkour"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/athletics.json
msgid "Practice parkour using a complex obstacle course."
msgstr "使用复杂的障碍路线练习跑酷。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/computers.json
msgid "computer (beginner)"
msgstr "计算机学（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "computer (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/computers.json
msgid "Practice the basics of using a computing device."
msgstr "练习使用计算机的基础知识。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/computers.json
msgid "computer (intermediate)"
msgstr "计算机学（中级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "computer (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/computers.json
msgid ""
"Practice using the command line, writing and running scripts making use of "
"common algorithms and data structures."
msgstr "练习使用命令行，使用常用算法和数据结构编写和运行脚本。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/computers.json
msgid "computer (advanced)"
msgstr "计算机学（高级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "computer (advanced)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/computers.json
msgid ""
"Practice the use of software exploits to gain elevated privileges on "
"computer systems."
msgstr "练习使用软件漏洞攻击在计算机系统上获得提升权限。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/devices.json
msgid "lockpicking (improvised)"
msgstr "撬锁（简单）"

#. ~ Description of practice "lockpicking (improvised)"
#. ~ Description of practice "lockpicking"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/devices.json
msgid "Practice picking simple locks."
msgstr "练习撬开简单的锁。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/electronics.json
msgid "electronics soldering"
msgstr "电子焊接"

#. ~ Description of practice "electronics soldering"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/electronics.json
msgid "Practice soldering and de-soldering wires and electronic components."
msgstr "使用电线和电子元件练习焊接和除锡。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/electronics.json
msgid "electrical circuit design"
msgstr "电路设计"

#. ~ Description of practice "electrical circuit design"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Practice designing and building simple electrical circuits, such as a "
"battery-powered motor or light bulb, and measuring their properties to "
"understand the flow of current."
msgstr "练习设计和构建简单的电路，如电池驱动的电机或灯泡，并测量电路特性以了解电流方向。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/electronics.json
msgid "semiconductor circuits"
msgstr "半导体电路"

#. ~ Description of practice "semiconductor circuits"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Practice prototyping circuits using transistors for switching or amplifying "
"electrical signals."
msgstr "使用晶体管练习搭建开关或放大电信号的原型电路。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/electronics.json
msgid "integrated circuits"
msgstr "集成电路"

#. ~ Description of practice "integrated circuits"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Practice building electronic circuits using standard IC chips for voltage "
"regulation, timing, logic, and simple processing."
msgstr "使用标准IC芯片练习搭建电子电路，搭建稳压器、定时器、逻辑和简单处理器电路。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid "fletching"
msgstr "制箭"

#. ~ Description of practice "fletching"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"Practice fletching by modifying, studying and testing the aerodynamics of "
"some arrows or bolts."
msgstr "通过调整、研究和测试各类箭头或弩矢的空气动力特性来练习制箭。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid "carving"
msgstr "雕刻"

#. ~ Description of practice "carving"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid "Practice carving different forms and shapes in a piece of wood."
msgstr "练习将木头雕刻不同的形状。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid "basic carpentry"
msgstr "木工基础"

#. ~ Description of practice "basic carpentry"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"Practice basic carpentry by cutting, shaping and uniting some planks or "
"sticks with nails."
msgstr "通过切割、加工以及用钉子把木板及木棍拼接成型来练习基本的木工技能。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid "welding (beginner)"
msgstr "焊接（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "welding (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"Practice welding and separating some small metal sheets to one another in "
"some simple forms and designs."
msgstr "用简单的样式及设计练习焊接及分离一些小金属板。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid "welding (advanced)"
msgstr "焊接（高级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "welding (advanced)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"Practice welding, separating and giving form to some metal sheets in "
"intricate patterns and complicated designs."
msgstr "练习焊接、分离以及把金属板塑形成一些复杂图案和复杂设计。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/health.json
msgid "bandaging (beginner)"
msgstr "包扎（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "bandaging (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/health.json
msgid ""
"Practice bandaging imaginary wounds while making sure your bandage won't "
"fall off during activities."
msgstr "对着假想的伤口练习包扎，同时确保绷带不会在活动时脱落。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/health.json
msgid "bandaging (advanced)"
msgstr "包扎（高级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "bandaging (advanced)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/health.json
msgid ""
"Practice bandaging different limbs and less accessible parts of your body "
"using both hands and each of your hands alone."
msgstr "练习用双手和单手单独包扎不同肢体以及身体上不易触及的部位。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
msgid "basic mechanics - hydraulics"
msgstr "基础机械学（液压）"

#. ~ Description of practice "basic mechanics - hydraulics"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
msgid ""
"Practice basic mechanics by using a pre-Cataclysm edutainment set.  Learn "
"about hydraulics."
msgstr "使用大灾变前教育娱乐设备练习基础机械学。了解液压系统。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
msgid "basic mechanics - robotics"
msgstr "基础机械学（机器人）"

#. ~ Description of practice "basic mechanics - robotics"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
msgid ""
"Practice basic mechanics by using a pre-Cataclysm edutainment set.  Learn "
"about robots."
msgstr "使用大灾变前教育娱乐设备练习基础机械学。了解机器人系统。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
msgid "basic mechanics - engines"
msgstr "基础机械学（引擎）"

#. ~ Description of practice "basic mechanics - engines"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
msgid ""
"Practice basic mechanics by using a pre-Cataclysm edutainment set.  Learn "
"about engines."
msgstr "使用大灾变前教育娱乐设备练习基础机械学。了解发动机系统。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "melee (beginner)"
msgstr "近战（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "melee (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice close quarters combat with and without weapons against an imaginary"
" opponent."
msgstr "和一个假想的对手进行有武器和无武器的近距离搏斗。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "cutting (beginner)"
msgstr "斩击（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "cutting (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice the use of the sword and similar weapons against a training dummy."
"  You will need something to mark the striking points while you train."
msgstr "对着训练假人练习刀剑和类似斩击武器的使用。你需要在训练时用些东西来标记打击点。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "cutting (intermediate)"
msgstr "斩击（中级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "cutting (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice advanced handling of the sword and similar weapons against an "
"armored training dummy.  You will need to make repairs to the dummy while "
"you train."
msgstr "对着装甲训练假人练习刀剑和类似斩击武器的高级操控技巧。你需要在训练的同时修理假人。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "bashing (beginner)"
msgstr "钝击（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "bashing (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice the use of batons and similar weapons against a training dummy.  "
"You will need something to mark the striking points while you train."
msgstr "对着训练假人练习警棍和类似钝击武器的使用。你需要在训练时用些东西来标记打击点。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "bashing (intermediate)"
msgstr "钝击（中级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "bashing (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice advanced handling of bashing weapons against an armored training "
"dummy.  You will need to make repairs to the dummy while you train."
msgstr "对着装甲训练假人练习警棍和类似钝击武器的高级操控技巧。你需要在训练的同时修理假人。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "stabbing (beginner)"
msgstr "刺击（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "stabbing (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice the use of spears and similar stabbing weapons against a training "
"dummy.  You will need something to mark the striking points while you train."
msgstr "对着训练假人练习长矛和类似刺击武器的使用。你需要在训练时用些东西来标记打击点。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "stabbing (intermediate)"
msgstr "刺击（中级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "stabbing (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice advanced handling of stabbing weapons against an armored training "
"dummy.  You will need to make repairs to the dummy while you train."
msgstr "对着装甲训练假人练习长矛和类似刺击武器的高级操控技巧。你需要在训练的同时修理假人。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "unarmed (beginner)"
msgstr "徒手（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "unarmed (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "Practice some unarmed moves against a training dummy or punching bag."
msgstr "对着训练假人或者沙袋练习徒手格斗招式。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "dancing"
msgstr "舞蹈"

#. ~ Description of practice "dancing"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "Practice some dancing moves with your imaginary partner."
msgstr "和你想象中的舞伴练习一些舞蹈动作。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid "dodge (beginner)"
msgstr "闪避（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "dodge (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
msgid ""
"Practice your dodging by throwing a ball at a wall and dodging it when it "
"bounces off."
msgstr "通过朝着墙上扔球并在其反弹时躲闪来练习你的闪避。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "throwing (beginner)"
msgstr "投掷（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "throwing (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid ""
"Practice your throwing by throwing something and trying to hit a spot on the"
" wall."
msgstr "通过投掷物品以试图击中墙上某个点的方式来练习投掷。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "archery (beginner)"
msgstr "弓术（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "archery (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "Practice firing unfletched arrows at a spot on the wall."
msgstr "练习向墙上的一个点射击无翎箭。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "crossbows (beginner)"
msgstr "弩（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "crossbows (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "Practice firing unfletched bolts at a spot on the wall."
msgstr "练习向墙上的一个点射击无翎弩矢。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "archery (intermediate)"
msgstr "弓术（中级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "archery (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid ""
"Practice the best ways of firing fletched arrows into a target.  Requires a "
"decent quality bow."
msgstr "练习向着箭靶射箭的最佳方式。需要一把质量还可以的弓。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "crossbows (intermediate)"
msgstr "弩（中级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "crossbows (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid ""
"Practice the best ways of firing fletched bolts into a target.  Requires a "
"decent quality crossbow."
msgstr "练习向着箭靶射弩矢的最佳方式。需要一把质量还可以的弩。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "expert archer's form"
msgstr "弓术（专家）"

#. ~ Description of practice "expert archer's form"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "Practice drawing, holding, and releasing a heavy bow."
msgstr "练习拉开、握住和放开沉重的弓。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "marksmanship (beginner)"
msgstr "枪法（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "marksmanship (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "Practice your shooting by dry firing a gun."
msgstr "通过打空枪来练习你的射击技巧。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "handguns (beginner)"
msgstr "手枪（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "handguns (beginner)"
#. ~ Description of practice "rifles (beginner)"
#. ~ Description of practice "shotguns (beginner)"
#. ~ Description of practice "submachine guns (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid ""
"Practice your shooting by using a set of practice targets and a laser aiming"
" module."
msgstr "用激光瞄具和一组练习靶来练习你的特定枪械技巧。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "rifles (beginner)"
msgstr "步枪（入门）"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "shotguns (beginner)"
msgstr "霰弹枪（入门）"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "submachine guns (beginner)"
msgstr "冲锋枪（入门）"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "launchers (beginner)"
msgstr "发射器（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "launchers (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/ranged.json
msgid "Use a compressed air launcher to safely practice aiming trajectories."
msgstr "使用压缩空气驱动的发射器，安全地练习瞄准轨迹。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid "social (beginner)"
msgstr "社交（入门）"

#. ~ Description of practice "social (beginner)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid ""
"Practice speaking in front of a mirror to improve your poise and eloquence "
"and project confidence."
msgstr "练习对着镜子说话，以提高你的仪态、口才和自信。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid "social (intermediate)"
msgstr "社交（中级）"

#. ~ Description of practice "social (intermediate)"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid ""
"Practice advanced persuasion and negotiation techniques while acting out "
"both sides of a dialogue in front of a mirror."
msgstr "在镜子前练习表演双方的对话，以进一步提升说服和谈判技巧。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/survival.json
msgid "basic knapping"
msgstr "磨石基础"

#. ~ Description of practice "basic knapping"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/survival.json
msgid "Practice basic knapping by hammering some rocks into rough shapes."
msgstr "通过将岩石锤打成粗糙的形状来练习基础的磨石技能。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/survival.json
msgid "speed knapping"
msgstr "快速磨石"

#. ~ Description of practice "speed knapping"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/survival.json
msgid ""
"Practice more advanced knapping by shaping some rocks into precise forms and"
" shapes."
msgstr "通过将岩石塑造成精致的形状来练习更高级的磨石技能。"

#. ~ Description of practice "knitting"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/tailoring.json
#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Practice knitting whatever comes to your mind, from simple forms to "
"elaborate and rich designs."
msgstr "练习编织你能想到的任何东西，从简单款式到精巧而复杂的计。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/tailoring.json
msgid "garment closures"
msgstr "服装收口"

#. ~ Description of practice "garment closures"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Practice the principles of garment closures by sewing some buttons and "
"similar fasteners to some cotton patches."
msgstr "通过在布块上缝些纽扣和类似的按扣来练习服装收口。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/tailoring.json
msgid "fabric waterproofing"
msgstr "织物防水"

#. ~ Description of practice "fabric waterproofing"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Practice the principles of sealing garments and fabric against water by "
"making a basic waterproof layer from plastic bags duct taped together, you "
"will need some water and a rag."
msgstr "通过用胶带将塑料袋做成一层基本防水层，来学习让服装和织物防水的原理，你还需要些水和布条。"

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/tailoring.json
msgid "advanced polymer sewing"
