"Cheddar 是一只三岁半的雄性棕色孟加拉猫，于4月8日失踪。她最后一次被人看到时戴着条纹项圈。\n"
"\n"
"如果您看到他，请立即联系我们：978-555-3760\n"
"\n"
"你可以帮忙！\n"
"请拍摄这张海报并在社交媒体上分享。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"DEXTER IS LOST!\n"
"AGAIN!!!  He was scared off by the neighbor's dogs on 6th May & doesn't know how to get home…\n"
"…he's not very clever at finding his way back!\n"
"He's a 3 y/o male Devon Rex cat with soft gray fur and big blue eyes.\n"
"He's chipped and should be wearing a yellow collar with a tag that has his name & my phone number on it.\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a short-haired gray cat sitting next to four similar-looking felines.  Dexter is circled in and has a bright red arrow pointing at him.]\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU SEE MY DEXTER, PLEASE DIAL 978-555-8152!\n"
"\n"
"!!!REWARD OFFERED!!!"
msgstr ""
"德克斯特迷路了！\n"
"又一次！！！5 月 6 日，他被邻居的狗吓跑了，不知道怎么回家……\n"
"……他在寻找回来的路方面不是很聪明！\n"
"他是一只3岁的雄性德文雷克斯猫，有着柔软的灰色毛皮和蓝色的大眼睛。\n"
"他有芯片，应该戴着黄色项圈，上面有一个标签，上面有他的名字和我的电话号码。\n"
"\n"
"[照片：一只短毛灰猫坐在四只长相相似的猫科动物旁边。德克斯特被圈了进去，有一个鲜红色的箭头指向他。]\n"
"\n"
"如果您看到我的德克斯特，请拨打 978-555-8152！\n"
"\n"
"!!!有奖金回报!!!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"ATTENTION\n"
"MISSING CAT\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a hairless, wrinkled cat with lemon-shaped eyes wearing a striped T-shirt.]\n"
"\n"
"RAMSES went missing from the car park at Companion Care Vets in Oakland on 30th March.\n"
"He is a Canadian Sphynx with a gray spot covering its stomach.\n"
"She is wearing a striped T-shirt and a pink collar.\n"
"\n"
"If found, please contact me at: ifoundramsesthecat@gmail.com"
