#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"HAVE YOU SEEN MARBLES?\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a gray cat with gently curving stripes covering its body.  It stares at the camera as if it's hypnotized by it.]\n"
"\n"
"MARBLES IS VERY FRIENDLY AND ENERGETIC.  MISSING SINCE THE EVENING OF MARCH 21.  IF SPOTTED OR FOUND, PLEASE CALL ME AT 774-555-9361.\n"
"\n"
"THANK YOU!!!"
msgstr ""
"你见过大理石吗？\n"
"\n"
"[照片：一只灰色的猫，身体上有轻微弯曲的条纹。它盯着摄像机，好像被它催眠了一样。]\n"
"\n"
"大理石非常友好和充满活力。在3月21日晚上失踪。如果见过或找到，请致电 774-555-9361 与我联系。\n"
"\n"
"谢谢你！！！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"PLEASE PLEASE HELP ME!\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a longhaired tri-color coat with heterochromia lying on top of a cat tree.]\n"
"\n"
"My name is Buttons and I'm a calico cat with large orange and black patches.  My left eye is blue and the other is green.  I went missing on the evening of April 15th and I haven't been seen since.  I love people and will come if called.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU HAVE SEEN BUTTONS, PLEASE DON'T HESITATE TO CONTACT ME: 508-555-1050"
msgstr ""
"请帮帮我！\n"
"\n"
"[照片：猫爬架顶上的一只异色瞳长毛三色猫。]\n"
"\n"
"我的名字是纽扣，我是一只带有橙色和黑色大斑块的三花猫。我的左眼是蓝色的，另一只是绿色的。我在4月15日晚上失踪了，从那以后我就再也没有出现过。我和人们很亲近，如果有人打电话，我会回来。\n"
"\n"
"如果您看到纽扣，请不要犹豫与我联系：508-555-1050"

