#. ~ Description of vehicle part ""
#: data/json/vehicleparts/alternator.json
msgid "An alternator."
msgstr "一个发电机。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/armor.json
msgid "rebar reinforcement"
msgstr "钢筋加强件"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "shock absorber"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/armor.json
msgid ""
"A system of springs and pads, intended to cushion the effects of collisions "
"on the interior of your vehicle."
msgstr "一套弹簧和垫片组合而成的缓冲系统，用于吸收碰撞对载具内部造成的冲击。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "car battery"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "large storage battery"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid ""
"A battery for storing electrical power, and discharging it to power "
"electrical devices built into the vehicle."
msgstr "一块能够储存电能的电池，并能够为车上的各类电子设备提供电力。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "motorbike battery, small"
msgstr "摩托车电池（小型）"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "swappable very large storage battery"
msgstr "可更换蓄电池（超大型）"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "swappable very large storage battery"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid ""
"A battery for storing electrical power, and discharging it to power "
"electrical devices built into the vehicle.  This one is mounted on a quick "
"release framework to allow it to be easily swapped, though it still weighs "
"so much that a lifting tool of some kind is necessary for most people."
msgstr ""
"一块能够存储电力的电池，能够为车上其他电子设备提供所需电力。这块电池安装在一个能够快速插拔的框架上，可以方便地替换。但对普通人来说还是需要一些起重工具才能提起这么重的东西。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "swappable large storage battery"
msgstr "可更换蓄电池（大型）"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "swappable large storage battery"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid ""
"A battery for storing electrical power, and discharging it to power "
"electrical devices built into the vehicle.  This one is mounted on a quick "
"release framework to allow it to be easily swapped, though it still weighs "
"so much that a lifting tool of some kind is necessary for some people."
msgstr ""
"一块能够存储电力的电池，能够为车上其他电子设备提供所需电力。这块电池安装在一个能够快速插拔的框架上，可以方便地替换。但对普通人来说还是需要一些起重工具才能提起这么重的东西。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid "board"
msgstr "隔板"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "board"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid ""
"A metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle and prevents people from "
"seeing through it."
msgstr "一块金属隔板。能够阻挡丧尸和其他人的视线。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid "quarterpanel"
msgstr "半隔板"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "quarterpanel"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid ""
"A half-height metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle but allows "
"people to see over it."
msgstr "一块半高金属隔板。能够阻挡丧尸但是无法阻挡其他人的视线。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid "cloth board"
msgstr "布隔板"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cloth board"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
