msgstr "一扇坚固的车门。它是实心的，所以关上门时你不能透过它来观察。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
msgid "internal door"
msgstr "内部车门"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "internal door"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
