#. ~ Description of effect type "Synthblood, Synthblood Comedown"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your breaths instinctively grows more shallow as the synthetic blood carries"
" oxygen throughout your body, increasing your speed, stamina, and general "
"endurance."
msgstr "随着合成血将氧气输送到全身，你的呼吸本能地变得更浅，从而提高你的速度和耐力。"

