msgstr "挑战-畸形人体强化"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Abnormal Augmentations" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've already been modified mutagenically but now you were all ready for a "
"bionic implant or three - the bill footed by the corp., of course - when "
"everything went pear-shaped and all you could hear from the other rooms was "
"screaming.  For a few hours, at least.  Now all you can hear is shuffling, "
"crackling, the occasional gurgling, burbling moan, and heavy, wet thumps.  "
"Hopefully your surgery was registered as an elective because you've elected "
"to get the heck out of here!"
msgstr ""
"你已经被基因改造过了，但现在你已经准备好再植入一个或三个生化插件了——当然是公司付钱——当一切都出问题时，你能听见隔壁房间里的尖叫声。至少持续了几个小时。而现在你所能听到的只有脚步声、噼啪声、偶尔的咕噜声、咕噜声、呻吟声和沉闷潮湿的重击声。希望你的后续手术被登记为可选的，因为你选择立刻离开这里！"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Abnormal Augmentations" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've already been modified mutagenically but now you were all ready for a "
"bionic implant or three - the bill footed by the corp., of course - when "
"everything went pear-shaped and all you could hear from the other rooms was "
"screaming.  For a few hours, at least.  Now all you can hear is shuffling, "
"crackling, the occasional gurgling, burbling moan, and heavy, wet thumps.  "
"Hopefully your surgery was registered as an elective because you've elected "
"to get the heck out of here!"
msgstr ""
"你已经被基因改造过了，但现在你已经准备好再植入一个或三个生化插件了——当然是公司付钱——当一切都出问题时，你能听见隔壁房间里的尖叫声。至少持续了几个小时。而现在你所能听到的只有脚步声、噼啪声、偶尔的咕噜声、咕噜声、呻吟声和沉闷潮湿的重击声。希望你的后续手术被登记为可选的，因为你选择立刻离开这里！"

#. ~ Starting location of scenario "Challenge - Abnormal Augmentations"
