#. ~ Snippet of item "XL work t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "An XL blue work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "一件特大号的蓝色T恤，前面还有个小口袋。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "XL work t-shirt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "An XL gray work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "一件特大号的灰色T恤，前面还有个小口袋。"

#. ~ Snippet of item "XL work t-shirt"
