msgstr "这是一把动力装甲级别的沉重登船斧，折叠成一个紧凑的模块。激活以展开。"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "collapsed boarding axe"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
msgid "With a snap of your arm, the axe extends."
msgstr "你用手臂一甩，斧子展开了。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
