msgid "county mortuary roof"
msgstr "郡停尸间（屋顶）"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "robot dispatch center"
msgstr "机器人调度中心"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "Desolate Arcology - Ground Level"
msgstr "荒废生态建筑（地表）"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "Arcology - Ground Level"
msgstr "生态建筑（地表）"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alienciv.json
msgid "coral obelisk"
msgstr "珊瑚方尖碑"

#. ~ Description of furniture "coral obelisk"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alienciv.json
msgid ""
"Facets of white coral erupt from the ground and assemble themselves into a "
"free standing column.  The living surface is bioluminescent and rarely "
"sparkles with golden light."
msgstr "白色珊瑚从地面上喷发出来，形成一个独立的柱子。活体的表面是生物发光的，偶尔闪烁出金色光芒。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alienciv.json
msgid "coral pedestal"
msgstr "珊瑚基座"

#. ~ Description of furniture "coral pedestal"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alienciv.json
msgid "Fluted white coral gently coils itself into a short pedestal."
msgstr "有凹槽的白珊瑚轻轻地盘绕成一个矮基座。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid "habitat kitchenette"
msgstr "殖民站厨房套"

#. ~ Description of furniture "habitat kitchenette"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
msgid ""
"A tiny sink and cooking surface only big enough to fit an electric hotplate,"
" placed above and below many integrated storage units.  The minimal space in"
" which you could technically cook."
msgstr "一个小小的水槽和料理台面，其大小仅能容纳一个电炉，它的上下都有许多集成的储存设施。理论上能够让人烹饪的最小空间。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "foamcrete wall"
msgstr "泡沫水泥墙"

#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight wall made from unreinforced foamcrete.  Not nearly as "
"resilient as a real wall, but it will block sight and the elements "
"nonetheless."
msgstr "用泡沫水泥建成的轻便墙壁。不如一般的墙壁结实，但是仍然能够遮挡视线和天气。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "foamcrete floor"
msgstr "泡沫水泥地板"

#. ~ Description of terrain "foamcrete floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "A relatively flat slab of unreinforced foamcrete."
msgstr "一块较为平坦的未加固泡沫水泥。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "clearcrete wall"
msgstr "清凝土墙"

#. ~ Description of terrain "clearcrete wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid ""
"A barrier made of clearcrete, perfect for greenhouses but looks extremely "
"fragile.  It is most definitely not fragile, and it's probably alarmed in "
"the event of a breach."
msgstr "清凝土制成的屏障，很适合温室，看起来很脆弱。但它肯定一点都不脆弱，而且很可能安装了报警装置，一旦破碎就会被触发。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "clearcrete wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
msgid "a cross between steel bending and stone shattering!"
msgstr "金属弯曲和石头破碎声！"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
msgid "coral floor"
msgstr "珊瑚地板"

#. ~ Description of terrain "coral floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
msgid ""
"Thin shelves of coral latch together into a flat mosaic and portray the "
"geometries of life."
msgstr "薄薄的珊瑚架嵌在一起，形成扁平的马赛克拼花图案，描绘出生命的几何形状。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "coral floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alienciv.json
msgid ""
"Filaments of white coral grow tall and weave themselves into a sinuous wall."
"  The living surface is ornately grooved, and golden light slowly flows "
"within its gaps."
msgstr "细丝状的白珊瑚长得很高，编织成一道蜿蜒的墙。活体的表面有华丽的凹槽，金色光芒在缝隙中缓慢流动。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "leviathan annelids"
msgstr "巨型环节虫"

#. ~ Description of terrain "leviathan annelids"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"Several massive protrusions emerge from the ground, coiled together into a "
"tower.  At the top, blue and purple tentacles sway in the wind."
msgstr "几个巨大的突出物从地上冒出来，盘绕成一座塔。在顶部，蓝色和紫色的触须在风中摇摆。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "lichen tree"
msgstr "地衣树"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen tree"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A massive corrugated body sprouts from the lichen here, branching out into "
"mushroom-like limbs, dust filling the air as the wind meets it."
msgstr "一个巨大的褶皱新芽从这里的苔藓中长出来，分叉成蘑菇状的肢体，当风吹来时，空气中充满了灰尘。"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "lichen tree"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "squish!"
msgstr "嘎吱！"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "fossilized conifer"
msgstr "石化针叶树"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fossilized conifer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers "
"into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron."
msgstr "一棵早已枯死的高树，枝干十分细长，类似于柏树，向上逐渐变细成为一个点，然后顶部展开成一个中空的十二面体。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "infested fossilized conifer"
msgstr "感染石化针叶树"

#. ~ Description of terrain "infested fossilized conifer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers "
"into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron.  The trunk seems "
"to be splitting as tendrils of mold dig into it, clinging onto the tree like"
" a frame."
msgstr ""
"一棵早已枯死的高树，枝干十分细长，类似于柏树，向上逐渐变细成为一个点，然后顶部展开成一个中空的十二面体。树干似乎被深深扎入其中的霉菌触须撑裂开来，这些触须像框架一样紧贴在树上。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "lichen shrub"
msgstr "地衣丛"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen shrub"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A small mound of lichen grows here, noticeably bigger than the lichen and "
"moss around it."
msgstr "这里生长着一小丛地衣，明显比周围的地衣和苔藓要大。"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "lichen shrub"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "moss bush"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "breather"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "overgrown vent"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "squish."
msgstr "嘎吱。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen shrub"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"A small mound of lichen grows here, noticeably bigger than the lichen and "
"moss around it.  A few clumps have been removed."
msgstr "这里生长着一小丛地衣，明显比周围的地衣和苔藓还要大。一些地衣已被挖开。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "moss bush"
msgstr "苔藓丛"

#. ~ Description of furniture "moss bush"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "A mound of moss, with large colorful stems protruding out of it."
msgstr "一大堆苔藓，有大而多彩长茎从其中突出来。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "geothermal bladder"
msgstr "地热排气囊"

#. ~ Description of furniture "geothermal bladder"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"Black veins support a large formation of bleached coral as it grows around "
"the rim of this geothermal vent.  Above it, red and purple tentacles caress "
"a balloon-shaped organ as it breathes."
msgstr "在这个地热排气孔的四周有着许多黑色藤网支撑着大量被漂白的珊瑚。在它的上方，红色和紫色的触手抚摸着一个气球形状的器官，它仿佛在呼吸。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "breather"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"On the ground here lay several colorless coral reefs, the black veins are "
"noticeably more engorged as they breathe."
msgstr "这里的地面铺着一些缺乏色泽的珊瑚礁，黑色藤网在它们呼吸时明显变得愈发饱满。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid "overgrown vent"
msgstr "蔓生脉络"

#. ~ Description of furniture "overgrown vent"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
msgid ""
"The coral and veins on the ground here have fused into a sea anemone-like "
"structure; pufts of smoke and hot air emit from its mouth."
msgstr "这里的珊瑚和藤网融合成一个海葵状的结构。烟团与热气从其口中喷涌而出。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "lichen"
msgstr "地衣"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"Many colorful species of ice-lichen, thriving above an uncharacteristically "
"fertile segment of ice.  Either endemic, or surviving genecraft from an "
"aborted terraforming project."
msgstr "许多五颜六色的冰原地衣，在异常肥沃的冰上旺盛生长。可能是本地原生物种，也可能是从某个地质改造工程中幸存下来的基因工程产物。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "lichen"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "lichen bed"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "bleached coral floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "splosh."
msgstr "啪叽。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "lichen bed"
msgstr "地衣床"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lichen bed"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"Familiar, yet unfamiliar.  Lichens and moss cling to rocks and lifeless dirt"
" here, providing a squishy but colorful grass."
msgstr "地衣和苔藓附着在岩石和死气沉沉的泥土上，提供了一处粘糊糊却色彩丰富的草床，熟悉又陌生。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "glacial ice"
msgstr "冰层"

#. ~ Description of terrain "glacial ice"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A small segment from the near planet-wide glacier of Salus IV.  Gets called "
"'ground' around these parts."
msgstr "覆盖了近乎整个Salus IV卫星的冰川的一小部分，被称为“地面”，环绕着其他部分。"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "glacial ice"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "dirt"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "basalt floor"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "snow"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "singing sand"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
msgid "fweet!"
msgstr "哗啦！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A relatively flat area of black dirt with no observable growth on it, caked "
"with shards of rock.  The only real ground besides the glacial ice."
msgstr "一块相对平坦的黑色泥土区域，上面没有明显的植被，由岩石碎片凝结而成。除了冰层之外唯一的真正的地面。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "basalt floor"
msgstr "玄武岩地面"

#. ~ Description of terrain "basalt floor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A relatively flat area of gray stone, warm to the touch."
msgstr "一片相对平坦的灰色石头区域，触感温暖。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "geothermal vent"
msgstr "地热排气孔"

#. ~ Description of furniture "geothermal vent"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A basalt column stands here, perpetually emitting foul-smelling gas, similar"
" to rotten eggs.  It is very warm to the touch, hot enough to burn you if "
"you aren't careful."
msgstr "一根玄武岩柱矗立在这里，不停地散发出类似于臭鸡蛋的恶臭气体。它摸起来很暖和，如果你不小心就会被烫到手。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "fumarolic ice tower"
msgstr "凝华冰塔"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fumarolic ice tower"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust"
" and meets the freezing air.  It is still emitting some gases."
msgstr "一种固态的云状结构，从地壳中逸出的水蒸气遇到冷空气时形成。现在它仍然在冒着白气。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fumarolic ice tower"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid ""
"A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust"
" and meets the freezing air."
msgstr "一种固态的云状结构，从地壳中逸出的水蒸气遇到冷空气时形成。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "fumarole"
msgstr "喷气孔"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fumarole"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A hole in the ground from which steam and other gases are escaping."
msgstr "地上开了一个洞，蒸汽和其他气体从中逸出。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "basalt rocks"
msgstr "玄武岩块"

#. ~ Description of furniture "basalt rocks"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "Various sharp rocks jut out of the ground here."
msgstr "各种形状锋利玄武岩在这里突了出来。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "snow"
msgstr "积雪"

#. ~ Description of terrain "snow"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A patch of thick snow, very cold."
msgstr "一片厚厚的雪地，非常冷。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "snow"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A patch of thick snow on top of rocks, very cold."
msgstr "岩石上有一层厚厚的雪，非常冷。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "basalt wall"
msgstr "玄武岩墙"

#. ~ Description of terrain "basalt wall"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "A sturdy basalt wall."
msgstr "一堵坚固的玄武岩墙。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
