#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Robot Scavenger"
msgstr "机器人拾荒者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Robot Scavenger" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Scavenging and reselling abandoned robotics is what you call your \"job.\" "
"It certainly isn't official in any means of the word, but it rakes in the "
"dough and that is all that matters to you, even if it involves dangerous "
"activities, be it cracking old Wraitheon security cyphers or crossing well-"
"worn wires on ancient mining drones."
msgstr ""
"搜寻转卖废弃的机器人是你所谓的“工作”。这当然不是官方的说法，但它能赚大钱，这对你来说才是最重要的，即使它涉及到危险行动，不管是破解老旧的\"鬼神\"安防系统密码还是理清古老的采矿无人机上磨损的导线。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Robot Scavenger"
msgstr "机器人拾荒者"

#. ~ Description of profession "Robot Scavenger" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
