#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rocket Jumper"
msgstr "火箭飞行兵"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rocket Jumper" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A skilled airborne scout and salvager equipped with a rocket pack, eking out"
" a living on the edge of legality.  Confident that your ability to find "
"opportunity in the skies will be your edge towards success."
msgstr "技术娴熟的空降侦察员和拾荒者，配备火箭背包，游走于灰色地带的边缘谋生。相信你在天空中寻找机会的能力将是你走向成功的优势。"

