msgid "Let's expand our production by adding a pottery kiln area."
msgstr "让我们建一个砖窑区域来提高产能。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A mountainside in the distance is littered with erratic flashes of light "
"that suggest extended combat.  It's too far to tell any other details."
msgstr "远处的山腰上散布着不稳定的闪光，表明战斗仍在继续。距离太远了，看不到其他细节。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You hear a sudden CRACK of ice breaking and then the low roar of what must "
"be an avalanche just outside your line of sight."
msgstr "你突然听到一声冰块破裂的声音，随后是在你的视线之外的低沉巨响，那一定是一场雪崩。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Winged shadows cross the ground, but when you look into the sky you can't "
"seem to see any movement or shapes at all."
msgstr "带有翅膀的影子掠过地面，但当你仰望天空时，你似乎根本看不到任何运动或形状。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Catch a falling star and put it in your pocket, watch it blaze on through "
"the night sky.  It's a peaceful sign despite all the chaos here below."
msgstr "抓住一颗流星，把它放进口袋，看着它在夜空中闪耀。这是和平的象征，尽管下面一片混乱。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Some craft swiftly hovers across the night sky, searchlights flaring out "
"from its belly in figure-eight patterns.  It circles in an ever larger "
"pattern until it pauses and weapons fire lashes from it to the ground like "
"lightning.  A full five seconds of broadsides to the ground, then only the "
"searchlights pointed where the shots seemed to land, then those lights cut "
"off and it might as well be invisible to you."
msgstr ""
"一些飞船迅速地在夜空中飞过，探照灯从它的腹部发出八字形的闪光。闪光轨迹越来越大，直到它停下来，武器冒出的火光像闪电一样从它身上向地面倾泄。整整5秒钟的全速射击，然后只剩下探照灯指向射击地点，然后灯光被切断，它似乎就此消失无踪。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"From where you stand, you can see at the edge of the horizon something "
"rocketing from planetside into orbit."
msgstr "从你站的地方，你可以看到在地平线的边缘有什么东西从星球表面飞向轨道。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"There is a picture of a shuttle taking off with happy people waving from the viewports.  \"Salus is cold.\n"
"\n"
" Our love is true\n"
"\n"
" I hope to see you\n"
"\n"
" On Croatan 2\n"
"\n"
" My dearest, please join me.  I don't believe there are many shuttles left before people will be stuck here forever.\""
msgstr ""
"一张航天飞机起飞的照片，人们高兴地从观察窗中朝外面挥手致意。\n"
"“Salus 很冷。\n"
"我们的爱很真\n"
"希望与你相遇\n"
"在 Croatan 2 星\n"
"亲爱的，请加入我。我觉得距离人们被永远困在这颗星球之前剩不下几艘航天飞机了。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"A person wrapped up in bandages in a hospital bed is pictured on the front of this card.  \"Get well soon!!!\n"
"\n"
" Torrance, I'm sorry you feel ill but many new colonists forget to process any foodstuffs from Salus IV to remove the macronutrient.\""
msgstr ""
"这张卡片的正面是一个裹着绷带躺在病床上的人。“祝你早日康复！！！\n"
"托伦斯，我很抱歉让你生病了，但许多新殖民者忘记处理食物，Salus IV中的任何食物中都含有的神经毒素。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"A picture of a bloody steak.  This card appears particularly old.  \"Gauchos"
" Steaks.  Deliveries made monthly from Brazil to Salus IV.  Sign up today!\""
msgstr "一张血淋淋的牛排的照片。这张卡看起来特别旧。“高乔牛排。每月从巴西直送Salus IV。今天就加入会员吧！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"A glossy image of flowers and funeral statuary.  \"I'm sorry for your loss."
"  Ebby was an excellent grandparent and we hate for you that he was infected"
" with the Moxphoria and wandered into the wastes.\""
msgstr "一张鲜花和葬礼雕像的浮华照片。“我为你失去亲人感到遗憾。埃比是一位优秀的祖父，我们和你同样心痛，他感染了莫斯佛病毒，流落在荒野中。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"An orbital view of Salus IV.  \"Happy Colonization Day!\n"
"\n"
" Leonid,\n"
"\n"
" This place is cold as Hell but we've made a life out here in the last ten years.\""
msgstr ""
"一张Salus IV卫星的轨道照片。“殖民日快乐！\n"
"利奥尼德，\n"
"这地方冷得要命，但过去十年我们在这里过得很好。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
msgid ""
"An old style movie theater.  \"Showing the vintage film Aelita!\n"
"\n"
" Tovarishch,\n"
"\n"
" Come with me to the movies.  My grandfather says that this movie is one of the classics.\""
msgstr ""
"一家老式电影院海报。”播放古董电影《艾莉塔》！\n"
"达瓦里希，\n"
"跟我去看电影吧。我爷爷说这部电影是经典之一。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A strange lumpy pink organ, it pulsates in your hand."
msgstr "一个奇怪的长满结节的粉色器官，在你手中跳动。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A trio of bean-shaped organs connected by webbing."
msgstr "三个被网状结构连接起来的豆子形状的器官。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A spiral covered in spines, it unfolds in your hand."
msgstr "一个布满棘刺的螺旋，放在手上时会展开。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A hollow organ filled with awful-smelling mucus."
msgstr "一个空心的器官，里面充满了恶臭的黏液。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A worm-like object."
msgstr "一个蠕虫一般的物体。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Holographic Field"
msgstr "全息力场"

#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Field"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Creates several short-lived holograms around you."
msgstr "在你四周创造出几个持续时间很短的全息投影。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Holographic Decoy"
msgstr "全息诱饵"

#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Decoy"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Creates a short-lived hologram."
msgstr "创造出一个持续时间很短的全息投影。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Holographic Flash"
msgstr "全息闪光"

#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Flash"
#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Flash Explosion"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid ""
"Causes an existing hologram to explode into burning light, harming and "
"stunning enemies close to it."
msgstr "让一个已有的全息影响爆炸成炫目的光芒，伤害并晕眩它附近的敌人。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
msgid "Holographic Flash Explosion"
msgstr "全息闪光爆"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
msgid "Holographic Transposition"
msgstr "全息换位术"

#. ~ Description of spell "Holographic Transposition"
#. ~ Technomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Holographic Transposition"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/hologram_spells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Allows you to swap places with a previously existing holographic image of "
"yourself.  If the universe itself can't tell you apart, who could?"
msgstr "让你能够和已存在自身的全息投影交换位置。如果宇宙本身无法区分你们，谁还能呢？"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
msgid "Rocket Jump"
msgstr "火箭跳跃"

#. ~ Description of spell "Rocket Jump"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
msgid ""
"Take to the skies with a rocket assisted jump or dash.  You might target a "
"hostile creature to perform a powerful rocket kick at the end of the dash.  "
"The rocket pack allows for a brief moment of air control or hovering after a"
" jump."
msgstr ""
"进行火箭辅助的短距离跳跃或空中冲刺。你可以在冲刺结束时以一个敌对生物为目标，给它来一脚威力强大的火箭踢。火箭背包可以在跳跃后进行短暂的空中控制或悬停。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
msgid "Rocket Jump Levitation"
msgstr "火箭跳跃悬浮"

#. ~ Description of spell "Rocket Jump Levitation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
msgid ""
"Chained before a rocket jump.  Grants a brief instant of levitation to "
"simulate a rocket pack-s limited flying ability."
msgstr "火箭跳跃前置法术。让你短暂悬浮片刻，以模拟火箭背包有限的飞行能力。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/monster_spells.json
msgid "Isohypsa Coordination"
msgstr "等高图型无人机协调"

#. ~ Description of spell "Isohypsa Coordination"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/monster_spells.json
msgid "Increases the speed of simpler Wraitheon drones."
msgstr "提升其他\"鬼神\"无人机的速度。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Heat Drain"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/monster_spells.json
msgid "Spews a burst of very cold air."
msgstr "喷出一股冰冻空气。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
msgid "Translocation"
msgstr "易位术"

#. ~ Description of spell "Translocation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
msgid "Translocates the user to an encoded buoy."
msgstr "将使用者传送到一个已编码的位标。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Translocation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
msgid "Slowly translocates the user to an encoded buoy."
msgstr "缓慢地将使用者传送到一个已编码的位标。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid "ultralight frame"
msgid_plural "ultralight frames"
msgstr[0] "超轻车架"

#. ~ Description of "ultralight frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid "A sturdy, lightweight frame made from titanium.  Useful for crafting."
msgstr "一个由钛制成的坚固、轻便的框架。可以用来制造物品。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid "ultralight foldable frame"
msgid_plural "ultralight foldable frames"
msgstr[0] "超轻车架（可折叠）"

#. ~ Description of "ultralight foldable frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid "A sturdy, lightweight foldable frame made from titanium."
msgstr "一个由钛制成的坚固、轻便的可折叠框架。用于制造载具。"

#. ~ Description of "control station"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid ""
"A large and complex piloting station from a military vehicle, including a "
"camera station, steering tools, and electronics controls."
msgstr "一台军用载具所使用的巨大而复杂的驾驶工作站，包括摄像站、转向工具和电子控制装置。"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "quantum solar panel"
msgid_plural "quantum solar panels"
msgstr[0] "太阳能板（超能）"

#. ~ Description of "quantum solar panel"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid ""
"This solar panel is obviously cutting-edge technology and given where you "
"found it, it should probably provide a LOT of power.  It's covered in "
"strange-looking material, but the covering looks rather fragile; it doesn't "
"look like it could support a reinforcing sheet, either."
msgstr "这种太阳能电池板是尖端技术的产物，拥有极高的光电转换效能。但是它表面覆盖特殊材料让它非常脆弱，同时也无法进行强化加固。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "cargo trough"
msgstr "货槽"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cargo trough"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"This is little more than a sheet metal basin welded to the bottom of the "
"vehicle, extending below it.  Though it holds a lot of stuff, its shoddiness"
" makes it fragile."
msgstr "一个将薄钢板焊在车底向下凸出的金属盆。尽管它能装很多东西，但粗劣的焊接工艺使其结构脆弱。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "crude plating"
msgstr "简易装甲板"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "crude plating"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"A piece of sheet metal welded onto a vehicle as armor.  Thin, and not as "
"protective as proper armor, but it'll do if there's nothing else available."
msgstr "一片被焊接在载具外侧的薄钢板。太薄了以至于没法像正规装甲那么有效，但总比没有好。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "control station"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"A large and complex dashboard mounted with steering controls and several LCD"
" touch screens for controlling vehicle systems."
msgstr "一个巨大而复杂的仪表板，装有转向控制器和几块LCD触摸屏。你可以用它来控制载具。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "mounted external tank (200L)"
msgstr "外置油箱（200升）"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ultralight frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An ultralight titanium framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted "
"on it, and it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's "
"size."
msgstr "一个超轻的钛合金框架。其他载具部件能够安装在它上面，在它四周增加新的车辆框架，就可以增加车辆大小。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "ultralight foldable frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An ultralight titanium foldable framework.  Other vehicle components can be "
"mounted on it, and it can be attached to other frames to increase the "
"vehicle's size."
msgstr "一个超轻的可折叠钛合金框架。其他载具部件能够安装在它上面，在它四周增加新的车辆框架，就可以增加车辆大小。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "quantum solar panel"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An extremely high-performance solar panel.  Will recharge the vehicle's "
"electrical power when exposed to the sun.  Clouds will slow the recharge "
"speed.  Extremely fragile and cannot be armored."
msgstr "一块超高性能太阳能板。当暴露于阳光照射之下时，会缓慢地为车辆电池充电。云层遮挡会让充电速度更慢。非常容易损坏，且不能安装装甲。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "robot_carrier"
msgstr "机器人托架"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "robot_carrier"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"A cargo space for carrying robots.  'e'xamine it to capture a robot next to "
"you, or to release the robot currently contained.  When selecting a robot to"
" capture, choose its tile relative to you, not the part."
msgstr "一个运输机器人的货舱。按\"e\"查看该部件选择需要装载的机器人，或者卸下机器人。当选择装载机器人时，机器人需要紧挨着你。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "exosuit maintenance gantry"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"A gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during maintenance and repair.  "
"Includes the specialized tools needed for complex repairs and will also "
"charge the suit's power when active."
msgstr "一台车载龙门吊，用于在维护和维修动力装甲时提供支撑。包括复杂维修所需的专用工具，激活时，还将为动力装甲充电。"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Atomic Compact"
msgstr "核动力紧凑型轿车"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Atomic SUV"
msgstr "核动力SUV"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Atomic Car"
msgstr "核动力轿车"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Robotic Taxi"
msgstr "机器人出租车"

#. ~ Vehicle name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicles.json
msgid "Armored Robot Carrier"
msgstr "装甲机器人运输车"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded wall"
msgstr "褪色的墙"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded wall"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A yellowed, numbingly monotonous wallpaper decorates these thin walls.  They"
" smell of mildew and have a faintly damp feel."
msgstr "一张泛黄且乏味的墙纸装饰着这些薄薄的墙壁。它们闻起来像是发霉了，有一种微湿的感觉。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded gray wall"
msgstr "褪色的灰色墙壁"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded gray wall"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A drab gray drywall barrier with no finishing.  Feels almost damp to the "
"touch and smells faintly of cleaner chemicals."
msgstr "没有完成的单调灰色石膏板屏障。摸起来几乎是潮湿的，并且有淡淡的清洁用化学品的气味。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded carpet, overhead light"
msgstr "褪色的地毯，顶灯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded carpet, overhead light"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A slightly moist carpet, stained yellow with age.  Overhead, a fluorescent "
"light hums a little too loudly."
msgstr "略微潮湿的地毯，随着时间的推移褪为黄色。头顶上的荧光灯嗡嗡声有点太响了。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded carpet"
msgstr "褪色的地毯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded carpet"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "A slightly moist carpet, stained yellow with age."
msgstr "略微潮湿的地毯，随着时间的推移褪为黄色。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded tile, overhead light"
msgstr "褪色瓷砖，顶灯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded tile, overhead light"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"These cheap white tiles, which seem to be plastic rather than actual "
"ceramic, are grayed with age and slightly warped at their corners.  "
"Overhead, a fluorescent light hums a little too loudly."
msgstr "这些廉价的白色瓷砖看起来是塑料的，而不是真正的陶瓷，随着年龄的增长而变灰，边角略微翘曲。头顶上，一盏荧光灯的嗡嗡声有点太大了。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "faded tile"
msgstr "褪色瓷砖"

#. ~ Description of terrain "faded tile"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"These cheap white tiles, which seem to be plastic rather than actual "
"ceramic, are grayed with age and slightly warped at their corners."
msgstr "这些廉价的白色瓷砖看起来是塑料的，而不是真正的陶瓷，随着年龄的增长而变灰，边角略微翘曲。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "water cooler"
msgstr "饮水机"

#. ~ Description of furniture "water cooler"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A plastic jug of water mounted on a dispenser.  Normally dispenses hot water"
" in addition to cold, but not with the power out.  You could probably "
"salvage the unwieldy jug on top with little effort, but any water still in "
"it would spill."
msgstr ""
"安装在饮水机上的塑料水罐。通常能够放出冰水和热水，但断电时就只有常温冷水了。你或许能不费吹灰之力抢救上面那个笨重的水罐，但是仍然在里面的任何水都会溢出。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "water cooler"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid "wobbling plastic!"
msgstr "塑料晃荡声！"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid "water cooler jug"
msgid_plural "water cooler jugs"
msgstr[0] "桶装水罐"

#. ~ Description of "water cooler jug"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A sizable blue plastic jug meant to hold and supply water in a water cooler "
"or similar dispenser.  Holds a lot of liquid, but unfortunately it doesn't "
"come with a cap, making it hard to carry around when full."
msgstr "一个相当大的蓝色塑料壶，用于在饮水机之类的地方盛水和供水。可容纳大量液体，但不幸的是它没有带盖，装满时很难随身携带。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  The date on it is so old it seems "
"actually impossible for it to have lasted this long in such good condition."
"  Most of the information on there is shockingly uninteresting for an "
"artifact so old, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr ""
"仅余单张的报纸。上面的日期如此久远，照理说不可能让它维持在如此良好的状态。在这古老遗物中的大多数信息都无趣地要命，然而其中一件事稍微引起了你的注意。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  The date on it suggests it's "
"decades old, but miraculously it appears to be much newer.  Most of the "
"information on there is terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing "
"catches your eye briefly."
msgstr ""
"仅余单张的报纸。上面的日期表明它已有几十年历史，但奇妙的是看起来显然新得多。其中大多数信息都非常琐碎或过时，但其中一件事稍微引起了你的注意。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It doesn't look like any newspaper "
"you're familiar with and the text on it makes no sense…"
msgstr "一张报纸。它看上去和你之前见过的报纸都不像，上面的文字毫无意义……"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It was printed a few years ago.  "
"Most of the information on there is terribly trivial, or out of date, but "
"one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr "一张报纸。上面的日期是好几年前的，能完整的保存下来真是蛮奇怪的。大多是些琐碎或者过时的信息。但有一件事吸引你的目光。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  There seems to be an important "
"article about a missing person."
msgstr "一张报纸。上面似乎印着一篇寻找失踪者的重要文章。"

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/items.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It was printed within the last few "
"months.  Most of the information on there is terribly trivial, or out of "
"date, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr "一张报纸。上面的日期是好几个月前的，能完整的保存下来真是蛮奇怪的。大多是些琐碎或者过时的信息。但有一件事吸引你的目光。"

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/Backrooms/map_extras.json
msgid "Red room"
msgstr "红色房间"

#. ~ Description of map extra "Red room"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/map_extras.json
msgid "There's a red room here."
msgstr "这里有一个红色的房间。"

#. ~ MOD name
#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_backrooms"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/modinfo.json data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
msgid "The Backrooms"
msgstr "后室"

#. ~ Description of MOD "The Backrooms"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"A strange place between dimensions traps you.  Can you survive among endless halls of yellowed carpet and harshly humming fluorescents?\n"
"\n"
"Replaces all normal worldgen: no wilderness, no rivers, no cities, no farms, no sky.  Just endless, winding indoor halls of mildewy carpeting, faded drywall, desolate breakrooms and abandoned boardrooms.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended city size is 0.  Play Now!  (Default Scenario) is not supported."
msgstr ""
"一个介于维度之间的奇怪地方困住了你。你能在无尽的发黄地毯和刺耳的嗡嗡声的大厅中生存吗？\n"
"\n"
"取代了所有正常的世界生成：没有荒野，没有河流，没有城市，没有农场，没有天空。只有无尽的、蜿蜒的室内大厅，发霉的地毯、褪色的干墙、荒凉的休息室和废弃的会议室。\n"
"\n"
"建议城市规模为0。不支持\"直接游戏！（默认场景）\"。"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Backrooms/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "backroom chamber"
msgstr "后室房间"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Backrooms"
msgstr "后室"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Backrooms"
msgstr "后室"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Backrooms" for male
#: data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "What is this place?  You can't seem to find your way back out."
msgstr "这是什么地方？你似乎找不到回去的路了。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Backrooms" for female
#: data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "What is this place?  You can't seem to find your way back out."
msgstr "这是什么地方？你似乎找不到回去的路了。"

#. ~ Starting location of scenario "Backrooms"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "The Backrooms"
msgstr "后室"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"I took all the supplies.  I'm sorry.\""
msgstr "“我带走了所有的补给。抱歉。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Someday I will wake up.  Someday I will wake up.  Someday I will wake up."
"  Someday I will\""
msgstr "“总有一天我会醒来。总有一天我会醒来。总有一天我会醒来。总有一天我会”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"eat the walls\""
msgstr "“吃墙去吧”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"STAY QUIET\""
msgstr "“保持安静”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"pray that you find the same peace I have found\""
msgstr "“祈祷你能找到和我一样的宁静”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"IF YOU MOVE IT WILL HEAR YOU\""
msgstr "“如果你敢动，它会听见的”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"My name is Susan Li.  If you're reading this, I'm dead.  I leave "
"everything I own to\""
msgstr "“我叫苏珊·李。如果你能读到这个，我应该已经死了。我把所有的东西都留在了”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"225 steps from the vending machines to the couch room…  Turn left…  141 "
"steps from the couch room to the portal…\""
msgstr "“从自动售货机向沙发房走225步……左拐……在从沙发房朝传送门走141步……”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"Welcome to Hell :)\""
msgstr "“欢迎来到地狱：）”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"know because I was wearing my watch.  Today was another bad day.  They "
"nearly saw me as I hauled wood back to the big room, and I lost half of it "
"running away.  Tomorrow, I plan\""
msgstr "“知道是因为我戴着手表。今天又是糟糕的一天。当我把木柴拖回大房间时，差点被它们看到，逃跑时又丢了一半。明天，我计划”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"I AM IN A TOP SECRET FACILITY BUILT BY THE GOVERNMENT!!  I HAVE BEEN "
"ILLEGALLY KIDNAPPED!!  PLEASE HELP ME!!\""
msgstr "“我在政府建造的最高机密设施里！！我被非法绑架了！！请帮帮我！！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"What do you want?  Am I supposed to confess??  What am I waiting for???\""
msgstr "“你想要什么？我应该忏悔吗？？我在等什么？？？”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"…602,651  602,652  602,653  602,654  602,655  602,656  602,657…\""
msgstr "\"……602,651 602,652 602,653 602,654 602,655 602,656 602,657……\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"I AM IN A SMALL ROOM WITH MANY DESKS.  I CAN'T STAY HERE.  COME FIND ME.\""
msgstr "“我在一个有很多桌子的小房间里。我不能一直呆在这里。快来救救我。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"This note has a bunch of lines all over it.  It looks like it might be a "
"map, but nothing is labeled and you're already hopelessly lost."
msgstr "这张纸条上画着许多线。看起来它也许是张地图，但没有任何标记，你已经完全看糊涂了。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "This paper is covered in dried blood…  Gross."
msgstr "这张纸上满是干涸的血迹……真恶心。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "This note is covered with tally marks, front to back."
msgstr "这张纸条的正面到背面都画满了计数标记。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO\""
msgstr "“不要不要不要不要不要不要不要”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"I KILLED THEM.  I HAD TO.\""
msgstr "“我杀了他们。我必须杀。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Casey Blumenthal.  Age 34.  Bangor, Maine.  Hotel receptionist.  The last "
"thing I remember was tripping on a power cord.\""
msgstr "“凯西·布鲁门撒尔，34岁，缅因州，班戈市，酒店接待员。我记得的最后一件事是被一根电线绊倒。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"STOP FOLLOWING ME\""
msgstr "“别再跟着我了”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"IT'S CHASING ME\""
msgstr "“它在跟踪我”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"Abandon hope, all ye who read this.\""
msgstr "“给所有读到纸条的人，放弃希望吧。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "This note just has scribbles on it."
msgstr "这张纸条上只有潦草的字迹。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"Let me out.  Let me out.  Let me out.  Let me OUT.  LET ME OUT.\""
msgstr "“让我出去。让我出去。让我出去。让我出去。让我出去。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"STAY HERE\""
msgstr "“留在这里”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid "\"I have been blessed.\""
msgstr "“我走大运了。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_ancient_news"
#. ~ This category is for news before 1950 and should adopt the tone of voice
#. of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"CIGARET SHORTAGE EASILY EXPLAINED!  The cigaret industry says Americans are "
"smoking at the fastest rate in history - that's why there's a shortage!  The"
" final production figure will be 257 million in 1943, compared with 243 "
"million in 1942.  Add to this tax-free shipments to armed forces - which "
"were 32 million this year and increasing, up from 8 million in 1942 - and "
"civilians would be struggling this year were it not for excellent crops!"
msgstr ""
"《香烟短缺原因详解！》烟草业代表近日表示，美国人吸烟率已达历史顶峰——这就是为什么会出现香烟短缺的原因！1943年的最终产量预计将达到2.57亿根，而上年度数据为2.43亿根。再加上向军队输送的免税货物——今年为3200万根，比上年度的800万根有所增加——如果不是因为今年作物丰收，民用需求将会很难满足！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_ancient_news"
#. ~ This category is for news before 1950 and should adopt the tone of voice
#. of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"STRIKE ORE NEAR KENDALL!  A special of the 15th to the Miner from Lewistown "
"states that there is much excitement around Kendall over the reported "
"striking of a hitherto unknown ore in the Fergus tract, extending out on the"
" flat from the Bullard property, and claims are being located in all "
"directions!  Potential experts on the unknown metal are to arrive in the "
"week."
msgstr ""
"《肯德尔附近发现新矿石！》来自路易斯敦的矿工15日的独家报道，肯德尔的人们对在弗格斯矿区发现迄今为止未知矿石感到无比兴奋，这些矿石从布拉德矿区延伸开来，据称到处都是！对未知金属的潜在用途进行研究的专家将于本周抵达。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_ancient_news"
#. ~ This category is for news before 1950 and should adopt the tone of voice
#. of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"THE WEATHER: Fair tonight and Wednesday.  THIS IS REAL COMFORT!  That is "
"what they say when they try one of TROUTMANS' Vudor chair hammocks, $3.50; "
"ask to see them!  Buy one of these for the Fourth of July: Flag, size 5x8 "
"feet, pole and rope ready to hang; price, while they last, $1.75 -- "
"TROUTMANS'!"
msgstr ""
"天气预报：今晚至周三晴天。这可真让人舒心！任何一个尝试过特劳特曼的Vudor牌帆布椅的人都会这么说的，仅售3.5美元；快来试试吧！七月四日买什么：国旗，尺寸5x8英尺，可挂在柱子和绳子上；价格，热销中，仅售1.75美元——特劳特曼！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"ABRAMS CONFIDENT S. VIET TAKEOVER IS SUCCESS:  Gen. Creighton W. Adams, "
"commander of US troops in South Vietnam, praised the South Vietnamese army "
"today and said its forces have \"tremendous confidence\" in their continued "
"success.  The disappearance of Gen. Bessemer last month has \"not "
"disheartened the troops\", although Adams has admitted his death at enemy "
"hands is \"likely\"."
msgstr ""
"《阿布拉姆斯的南越秘密接管行动大获成功》美国驻南越部队指挥官克雷顿·W·亚当斯将军今天赞扬了南越军队，并表示其部队对继续取得成功“充满信心”。尽管亚当斯承认自己“很可能”死于敌人手中，但贝塞麦将军上月的失踪“并没有让军队灰心”。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"LUNCH MENUS:  MONDAY, February 16 - NO SCHOOL.  TUESDAY, February 17 - Corn "
"dog with catsup and mustard, potatoes au gratin, bread and butter, buttered "
"spinach, apple half, milk.  WEDNESDAY February 18 - Wildcat goulash, "
"buttered green beans, hot rolls and butter, orange jello with pears, milk.  "
"THURSDAY, February 19 - Tacos with cheese and lettuce, applesauce, milk.  "
"FRIDAY, February 20 - Creamed turkey over mashed potatoes, peanutbutter "
"sandwiches, cherry shortcake, chocolate milk."
msgstr ""
"午餐菜单：\n"
"2月16日，周一：无课。\n"
"2月17日，周二：玉米热狗配番茄酱和芥末、烤土豆、面包配黄油、黄油菠菜、半个苹果、牛奶。\n"
"2月18日，周三：野猫匈牙利汤、黄油青豆、辣面包黄油卷、橙子果冻配梨、牛奶。\n"
"2月19日，周四：墨西哥奶酪卷饼配生菜、苹果酱、牛奶。\n"
"2月20日，周五：奶油火鸡配土豆泥、花生酱三明治、樱桃酥饼、巧克力牛奶。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT SOUGHT:  Eberhard Technologies, Inc. is looking for"
" a full-time (37.5 hours) Administrative Assistant.  This position requires "
"a person with excellent organizational and computer skills, capable of "
"professional discretion in their daily life.  Extensive benefits offered.  "
"Send resume to thaskins@eberhardphoenix.com."
msgstr ""
"行政助理招聘：Eberhard科技股份有限公司正在寻找一名全职（37.5小时）行政助理。这个职位需要一位具有出色组织能力和计算机技能，能够在日常生活中进行专业判断的人。提供各类福利奖金。请将简历发送至thaskins@eberhardphoenix.com。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"SEARCH FOR PILOT WHO SAW UFO, DISAPPEARED:  Authorities Wednesday called of "
"a ground, air, and sea search for a pilot who vanished after radioing that "
"his lightplane was being pursued by an unidentified flying object.  An air "
"force reconnaissance plane searched 1,000 square miles of ocean for George "
"Valentina and his Cessna 182.  At one point, Valentina radioed, \"It's not "
"an aircraft…  It's…\" before the transmission broke off.  Residents of King "
"Island have reported sightings of bright and trailing lights over the past "
"six weeks."
msgstr ""
"《搜救遭遇不明飞行物的失踪飞行员》当局星期三要求开展对一名飞行员的陆海空全面搜救行动，该名飞行员在用无线电报告其轻型飞机被不明飞行物追击后失踪。一架空军侦察机在1000平方英里的海洋中搜寻乔治·瓦伦蒂纳和他的塞斯纳182型飞机。在传输中断之前，瓦伦蒂纳曾用无线电发出“这不是飞机……这是……”的通报。国王岛的居民报告称，在过去六周内，他们总能在空中看到一行明亮的尾灯。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"HALLOWAY ANNOUNCES SWEEPING BUDGET BILL.  As rhetoric surrounding national "
"defense spending ramps up, Senate Majority Leader Halloway has announced a "
"controversial bill that would cut over $700 billion from multiple federal "
"organizations, including arts funding and welfare.  He introduced the bill "
"by saying, \"We stand on the edge of a new age of science and discovery, and"
" a new age of danger from enemies abroad.  Hardworking Americans can benefit"
" most by getting involved in our new civilian science programs and making a "
"difference there.  No more sitting at home playing video games!\""
msgstr ""
"《Halloway公布预算清单》随着围绕国防开支的言论愈演愈烈，参议院多数党领袖Halloway宣布了一项极富争议的法案，将从多个联邦部门削减近7000多亿美元经费，其中包括艺术基金和福利。他在介绍该法案时说：“我们正站在一个科学和发现的新时代的前沿，同时也是一个面临国外敌人不断威胁的新时代。辛勤工作的美国人可以通过参与我们新的民用科学项目并在那里发挥作用而获得最大的利益。不要再坐在家里玩电子游戏了！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"COUNTRY MUSIC FESTIVAL STILL ON.  Predictions of inclement weather won't "
"stop Huey Brooks, owner of Brooks Entertainment, from putting on his famous "
"country music festival.  The event has moved to the Springfield Masonic "
"Center and begins two hours earlier, at 5PM.  As the whereabouts of self-"
"admitted \"party boy\" Jerry Kenny remain unknown, local legend Poppy "
"Summerfield has been brought in to fill his slot."
msgstr ""
"《乡村音乐节仍在举行》预测恶劣天气不会阻止布鲁克斯娱乐公司老板休伊·布鲁克斯举办他著名的乡村音乐节。活动已移至斯普林菲尔德共济会中心，并于两小时前下午5点开始。由于自称为“派对男孩”的杰里·肯尼仍旧下落不明，当地传奇人物波比·萨默菲尔德被请来填补他的空缺。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"KIDNAPPING IN WESTFIELD?  After a week of intense searching, chasing leads "
"across the state, the Oriole County Sheriff's Department have still "
"uncovered no leads in the disappearance of Kasey Akron, 31, postal worker "
"and mother of two.  Akron disappeared without a trace while on the job in "
"Westfield, a small village with a population of only 824, on September 24th."
"  Her vehicle was found still running, undelivered mail left inside.  Her "
"mother tearfully testified to the Oriole Free Press, \"Kasey was a happy and"
" loved woman.  Wherever she is, we know she wants to come home!\"  "
"Detectives previously suggested that Akron may have departed with someone "
"she knew, but have not made any arrests so far."
msgstr ""
"《西菲尔德绑架案？》经过一周的紧张搜索，在全州范围内追查线索，奥利奥尔县警长部门仍然没有发现31岁的邮递员、两个孩子的母亲凯西·阿克伦失踪的线索。9月24日，阿克伦在西菲尔德，这个只有824人口的小镇工作时，无影无踪地失踪了。她的车被人发现时引擎仍在工作，而邮件却一封未送。她的母亲含泪向《黄鹂自由报》作证说：“凯西是一个快乐且惹人爱的姑娘。无论她在哪里，我们都知道她想回家！”警探们此前曾暗示，阿克伦可能已经和某位熟人一同离开了，但到目前为止还没有逮捕任何人。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"MYSTERY IN DRESDEN: Nefarious happenings are nothing new for the ever-"
"tumultuous GDR, but the peculiar mystery of two missing actors has captured "
"international attention.  Nani Wolf and Angela Weiss were slated to perform "
"in mere moments, spotted entering their dressing room with fellow company "
"members testifying to every minute and every angle, but when the curtain "
"call came, they were nowhere to be found!  Region police are baffled, but "
"have concluded there was no sign of foul play.  The girls just disappeared!"
msgstr ""
"《德累斯顿的谜团》对于动荡不安的民主德国（东德）来说，发生各种邪恶的事情并不稀奇，然而两名失踪演员的神秘故事引起了国际关注。纳尼·沃尔夫和安吉拉·韦斯在原定表演即将开始之时，在众目睽睽下走进了更衣室，公司同事们从各个角度、各个时刻都能作证，但当该上场时，她们却无迹可寻！当地警方对此感到十分困惑，但得出结论认为，目前没有任何违法痕迹。女孩们就这样消失了！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"MISSING MAN: Gerald Bienkowski, age 47.  Disappeared: April 14.  Last seen "
"leaving Tony's Watering Hole in Burlington.  Believed to be of sound mind, "
"but possibly in danger.  If seen, contact local police.  Do not approach."
msgstr ""
"失踪男子：杰拉尔德·比恩科夫斯基，47岁。失踪时间：4月14日。最后一次见到他是在伯灵顿托尼的水坑。据信心理健康，但可能十分危险。如果看到，请联系当地警方。不要靠近。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"MISSING WOMAN: Anne Demir, age 33.  Disappeared: May 3.  Last seen driving "
"SOUTH of Dallas on I-45 at 8:45pm.  NEW DETAILS HAVE RE-OPENED THIS "
"INVESTIGATION.  New witness footage confirms Demir's car driving SOUTH "
"rather than north, as previously reported."
msgstr ""
"失踪女子：安妮·德米尔，33岁。失踪时间：5月3日。最后一次被看到是晚上8:45驾驶在达拉斯南部的I-45公路上。新的细节重新开启了这项调查。新的目击者录像证实，戴米尔的汽车是向南行驶，而不是之前报道的向北行驶。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
msgid ""
"NO TRACE FOUND in search for missing Lisa Hawthorne and her boyfriend Shaun "
"after 58 Civil Air Patrol members spent three days scouring the area near "
"Twelve Mile Trail.  The couple's car was found roadside near the northern "
"trailhead and they were reported missing shortly after.  The couple were "
"\"on a daily hike in a place completely known to them\", says detective "
"Aretha Wesson, who personally knew the two intrepid young athletes."
msgstr ""
"《毫无踪迹》58名民航巡逻队成员花了三天的时间在十二英里小径附近地区搜索，没有找到失踪的丽莎·霍桑和她的男友肖恩的踪迹。这对夫妇的汽车在北侧小径附近的路边被发现，不久后据报失踪。警探阿雷莎·韦森说，这对夫妇“每天都在一个他们完全熟悉的地方徒步旅行”，他亲自认识这两位勇敢的年轻运动员。"

