msgstr "精于算计的眼神"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T Blade-work" in martial art "Calculating
#. Eyes"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid ""
"You have been taught how to properly utilize small to medium-sized sharp weaponry.\n"
"\n"
"+5 cut and stab armor penetration, +1 accuracy."
msgstr ""
"你已经学会如何正确使用小型和中型利刃。\n"
"\n"
"斩击/刺击护甲穿透 +5，命中 +1。"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "C.R.I.T Blade-work"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
