msgstr "久经磨练的动作"

#. ~ Description of buff "C.R.I.T Blade-work" in martial art "Honed Movements"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid ""
"Your skill with handling sharp weaponry has improved.\n"
"\n"
"+3 cut and stab damage."
msgstr ""
"你对利刃的掌控能力大大提高了。\n"
"\n"
"斩击/刺击伤害 +3。"

