#. ~ Message of martial technique "Roomsweeper"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> releases a crushing blow at %s"
msgstr "<npcname>对%s发动毁灭性打击。"

