"speed violence.  Things are looking grim; how long can you race laps around "
"the aliens before you get blocked for good?"
msgstr ""
"你曾经是地狱之轮。现在你的队友都挂了，如果不是因为对高速暴力的热爱，你也没法活这么久。事情看起来很严峻；在你被放翻之前，你还能绕着外星人转几圈呢？"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Game Master"
msgstr "地下城主"

#. ~ Description of profession "Game Master" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Trying to herd cats into meeting up every week has taught you something: "
"it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  For that reason,"
" when you had two no-shows and the other two got eaten, you ditched.  Maybe "
"you can find some new players in the ruins of the world."
msgstr ""
"每周一轮尝试着带领那些啥都不懂的\"小猫\"到达地下城的终点教会了你一些事：大多数时候都该果断止损并相信自己的直觉。因此，当你发现有两个朋友失约而另两个被外星人干掉时，你逃跑了。也许你能够在这个废墟一样的世界里找到一些新玩家。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Game Master"
msgstr "地下城主"

#. ~ Description of profession "Game Master" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
