#. ~ Description of "tyrant mutagenic primer"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"A super-concentrated mutagenic primer strongly resembling children's toy "
"slime."
msgstr "一种经过处理的诱变剂引物，像是儿童玩具里的黏液。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "tyrant mutagenic primer"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
