msgid_plural "boiled leather ostrich bardings with bones"
msgstr[0] "骨钉皮革鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description of "boiled leather ostrich barding with bones"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"Leather ostrich barding with decorative bones affixed, meant to invoke fear "
"in bandits and raiders and traders all!  You could put this on a friendly "
"ostrich."
msgstr ""
"一套鞣制皮革制成的鸵鸟铠，上面附加了许多装饰性的骨钉，足以使强盗、掠夺者和商人们感到恐惧！你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "ostrich rain sheet"
msgid_plural "ostrich rain sheets"
msgstr[0] "鸵鸟用雨衣"

#. ~ Description of "ostrich rain sheet"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin plastic covering, adapted to protect an ostrich from acid zombie "
"splashes and similar caustic substances.  You could put this on a friendly "
"ostrich."
msgstr "一层薄薄的能覆盖鸵鸟全身的塑料布，能够防护酸雨和其他腐蚀性物质。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "ostrich-sized holiday sweater"
msgid_plural "ostrich-sized holiday sweaters"
msgstr[0] "鸵鸟大小的节日毛衣"

#. ~ Description of "ostrich-sized holiday sweater"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A very large warm wool sweater with a festive holiday pattern.  You could "
"put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr "一件印着有节日图案的非常大的保暖羊毛衫。你可以将它穿在一头友好的双足鸵鸟型生物身上。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "iron ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "iron ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "铁鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description of "iron ostrich armor"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically placed iron plates and leather, suitably "
"made for ostriches as protection.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的铁甲，专门为保护鸵鸟打造。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一匹友好的鸵鸟身上。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "steel ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "steel ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "钢鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description of "steel ostrich armor"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of steel plate and leather, suitably made for ostriches as "
"protection.  You could put this on a friendly ostrich."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的钢板，专门为保护鸵鸟打造。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一匹友好的鸵鸟身上。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid "bronze ostrich armor"
msgid_plural "bronze ostrich armors"
msgstr[0] "青铜鸵鸟铠"

#. ~ Description of "bronze ostrich armor"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_ostrich_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of strategically placed bronze plates and leather, suitably"
" made for ostriches as protection.  You could put this on a friendly "
"ostrich."
msgstr "一套厚厚的皮甲，关键部位有精心放置的青铜甲，专门为保护鸵鸟打造。你可以将这套鸵鸟铠穿在一匹友好的鸵鸟身上。"

#. ~ Computer name placed on map lab_finale_1level
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mapgen/DinoLabFinale.json
msgid "DinoLab Operating Theater Controls"
msgstr "恐龙实验室手术中心控制台"

#. ~ Computer name placed on map microlab_DinoLab
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mapgen/microlab_DinoLab.json
msgid "Dinosaur surgery room computer"
msgstr "恐龙手术室电脑"

#. ~ Description of species "DINOSAUR"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "a dinosaur"
msgstr "恐龙"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "coelophysis"
msgid_plural "coelophysis"
msgstr[0] "腔骨龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "coelophysis"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Small, thin predatory bipedal dinosaur with a long head and sharp teeth and "
"long grasping claws."
msgstr "一只又小又瘦的双足食肉恐龙，头很长，长着锋利的牙齿和长长的爪子。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "dilophosaurus"
msgid_plural "dilophosaurus"
msgstr[0] "双脊龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "dilophosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A medium dinosaur with sharp teeth and two prominent bony crests on its "
"head."
msgstr "一只中等体型的恐龙，牙齿很锋利，头部有两个突出的骨冠。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "ceratosaurus"
msgid_plural "ceratosaurus"
msgstr[0] "角鼻龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "ceratosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large, fast predatory bipedal dinosaur, decorated with three colorful "
"horns on its head and dotted with bright skin bones with long sharp teeth "
"and a long flexible tail."
msgstr "一种动作迅速的大型食肉两足恐龙，头上有三个彩色的角，身上点缀着鲜艳的条纹皮肤，长有锋利的牙齿和一条柔软的长尾巴。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "spinosaurus"
msgid_plural "spinosaurus"
msgstr[0] "棘龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "spinosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge dinosaur about the size of a small house, with a ferocious crocodile-"
"like head and a sail on its back."
msgstr "一种巨型恐龙，有一栋小房子那么高，有着凶猛的像鳄鱼一样的头，背上有一个帆一样的东西。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "torvosaurus"
msgid_plural "torvosaurus"
msgstr[0] "蛮龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "torvosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large bipedal predator dinosaur with a large head, long sharp teeth, short"
" strong arms, and long tail."
msgstr "一种大型两足食肉恐龙，头部很大，牙齿长而锋利，手臂短而有力，尾巴长。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "allosaurus"
msgid_plural "allosaurus"
msgstr[0] "异特龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "allosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "A large bipedal dinosaur with a mouth full of sharp serrated teeth."
msgstr "一种大型两足恐龙，嘴上长满了锋利的锯齿状牙齿。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "acrocanthosaurus"
msgid_plural "acrocanthosaurus"
msgstr[0] "高棘龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "acrocanthosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Huge predatory bipedal dinosaur with a tall ridge running the length of its "
"back covered with heavy muscles.  Its teeth are curved and serrated like "
"sawblades."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的双足食肉恐龙，背上长着一条长长的脊梁，覆盖着厚重的肌肉。它的牙齿是弯的，呈锯齿状。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "siats"
msgid_plural "siats"
msgstr[0] "西雅茨龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "siats"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Huge predatory bipedal dinosaur with long claws and strong arms for "
"grappling."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的双足食肉恐龙，长着长长的爪子和强壮的手臂，可以轻松抓住你。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "dryptosaurus"
msgid_plural "dryptosaurus"
msgstr[0] "伤龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "dryptosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Large sharp teeth and a lean frame, with long wicked claws and a feathered "
"mullet and tail."
msgstr "大而锋利的牙齿和瘦削的身躯，长着邪恶的爪子，背部和尾部长着羽毛。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "appalachiosaurus"
msgid_plural "appalachiosaurus"
msgstr[0] "阿巴拉契亚龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "appalachiosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Enormous teeth, fierce eyes, and a powerful frame to drive it forward, with "
"two small arms and a feathered mullet and tail.  The snout is long with six "
"ridges."
msgstr "它长着巨大的牙齿，凶猛的眼睛，两个短小的手臂，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。鼻子很长，上面长着六个脊。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "gorgosaurus"
msgid_plural "gorgosaurus"
msgstr[0] "戈尔冈龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "gorgosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Enormous teeth, fierce eyes, and a powerful frame to drive it forward, with "
"two small arms and a feathered mullet and tail."
msgstr "它长着巨大的牙齿，凶猛的眼睛，两个短小的手臂，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "albertosaurus"
msgid_plural "albertosaurus"
msgstr[0] "阿尔伯塔龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "albertosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Enormous teeth, fierce eyes, and a powerful frame to drive it forward, with "
"short arms and a feathered mullet and tail."
msgstr "它长着巨大的牙齿，凶猛的眼睛，短小的手臂，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "qianzhousaurus"
msgid_plural "qianzhousaurus"
msgstr[0] "虔州龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "qianzhousaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This large, bipedal, feather-covered dinosaur has a long, gator-like mouth "
"with sharp teeth."
msgstr "这只长满羽毛的巨型双足恐龙长着一张长长的、像鳄鱼一样的嘴和许多锋利的牙齿。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "nanuqsaurus"
msgid_plural "nanuqsaurus"
msgstr[0] "白熊龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "nanuqsaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Bipedal dinosaur with long sharp teeth in a massive jaw, fierce eyes, and a "
"powerful frame to drive it forward, short arms, with a feathered white "
"mullet and tail."
msgstr "一只两足恐龙，巨大的下颌里长满了锋利的牙齿，它长着一双凶猛的眼睛和短短的手臂，背部和尾部长着白色羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "daspletosaurus"
msgid_plural "daspletosaurus"
msgstr[0] "惧龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "daspletosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Bipedal dinosaur with long sharp teeth in a massive jaw, fierce eyes, and a "
"powerful frame to drive it forward, short arms, with a feathered mullet and "
"tail."
msgstr "一只两足恐龙，巨大的下颌里长满了锋利的牙齿，它长着一双凶猛的眼睛和短短的手臂，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "tyrannosaurus rex"
msgid_plural "tyrannosaurus rex"
msgstr[0] "雷克斯霸王龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "tyrannosaurus rex"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Enormous teeth in a massive jaw, fierce eyes, and a powerful frame to drive "
"it forward, short arms with large claws, with a feathered mullet and tail."
msgstr "巨大的下颌里长满了巨大的牙齿，它有一双凶猛的眼睛，短短的手臂上是一对巨大的爪子，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "compsognathus"
msgid_plural "compsognathus"
msgstr[0] "美颌龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "compsognathus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A fast moving bipedal dinosaur about the size of a turkey.  Its teeth and "
"claws are small but sharp."
msgstr "火鸡大小的小型的双足肉食性兽脚亚目恐龙，能够快速移动。牙齿和爪子看起来很小但是很锋利。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "gallimimus"
msgid_plural "gallimimus"
msgstr[0] "似鸡龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "gallimimus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur, standing as tall as a human.  It looks "
"somewhat like a reptilian ostrich."
msgstr "一种有羽毛的两足恐龙，站立时和人类一样高，它看上去有点像爬虫类的鸵鸟。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "struthiomimus"
msgid_plural "struthiomimus"
msgstr[0] "似鸵龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "struthiomimus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur, standing as tall as a human.  It looks "
"somewhat like a reptilian ostrich with a long stiff tail."
msgstr "一种有羽毛的两足恐龙，站立时和人类一样高，它看上去有点像长着一条又长又硬的尾巴的蜥蜴鸵鸟。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "ornithomimus"
msgid_plural "ornithomimus"
msgstr[0] "似鸟龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "ornithomimus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur, standing as tall as a human.  It looks "
"somewhat like a reptilian ostrich with a small toothless beak and curved "
"claws good for climbing."
msgstr "一种有羽毛的两足恐龙，站立时和人类一样高，它看上去有点像只长着小而无齿的喙和适于攀爬的弯爪的蜥蜴鸵鸟。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "albertonykus"
msgid_plural "albertonykus"
msgstr[0] "亚伯达爪龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "albertonykus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "A small, feathered bipedal dinosaur with a long feathered tail."
msgstr "一种小型、有羽毛的两足恐龙，尾巴长有羽毛。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "nothronychus"
msgid_plural "nothronychus"
msgstr[0] "懒爪龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "nothronychus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large feathered bipedal dinosaur with a pot-bellied stomach and a long "
"neck.  Sharp claws extend from its dexterous hands."
msgstr "长满羽毛的大型双足恐龙，颈部长而细、腹部相当大、手臂长，手部灵巧，手指上有10厘米长的弯曲指爪。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "anzu"
msgid_plural "anzu"
msgstr[0] "安祖维利龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "anzu"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large feathered bipedal dinosaur with a long neck, a beak and a large head"
" crest.  Sharp claws extend from its dexterous hands."
msgstr "长满羽毛的大型双足恐龙，脖子细长，长着喙和大头冠。锋利的爪子从它灵巧的双手伸出。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "saurornitholestes"
msgid_plural "saurornitholestes"
msgstr[0] "蜥鸟盗龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "saurornitholestes"
#. ~ Description of monster "velociraptor"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A small bipedal dinosaur covered with feathers.  Small, hooked claws emerge "
"from its feet and hands."
msgstr "一种身体覆盖有羽毛的小型两足恐龙。四肢上有钩状利爪。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "velociraptor"
msgid_plural "velociraptors"
msgstr[0] "伶盗龙"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "deinonychus"
msgid_plural "deinonychus"
msgstr[0] "恐爪龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "deinonychus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A medium-sized bipedal dinosaur covered with feathers.  At the end of each "
"foot is a large sickle-like claw."
msgstr "一种身体覆盖有羽毛的中型两足恐龙。每只脚的尽头有着巨大的镰刀状利爪。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "utahraptor"
msgid_plural "utahraptors"
msgstr[0] "犹他盗龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "utahraptor"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large bipedal dinosaur with feathered arms, a long tail, and scythe-like "
"claws."
msgstr "一种巨大的两足恐龙。有着被羽毛覆盖的胳膊、一个长尾巴和镰刀状的爪子。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "dromaeosaurus"
msgid_plural "dromaeosaurus"
msgstr[0] "驰龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "dromaeosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A small bipedal dinosaur covered with feathers.  Small, hooked claws emerge "
"from its feet and hands.  The teeth are large and sharp and the jaws look "
"strong."
msgstr "一种身体覆盖有羽毛的小型两足恐龙。四肢上有钩状利爪。牙齿又大又尖，大嘴看起来很强壮。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "stenonychosaurus"
msgid_plural "stenonychosaurus"
msgstr[0] "伤齿龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "stenonychosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A small bipedal dinosaur covered with feathers.  At the end of each foot is "
"a large sickle-like claw.  Its eyes suggest intelligence."
msgstr "一种身体覆盖有羽毛的小型两足恐龙。每只脚的尽头有着巨大的镰刀状利爪。它的眼中闪着智慧的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "eoraptor"
msgid_plural "eoraptors"
msgstr[0] "始盗龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "eoraptor"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A bipedal dinosaur about the size of a chicken.  It darts around quickly and"
" has long arms for grabbing what it desires.  It's holding something."
msgstr "一只和鸡差不多大的两足恐龙。它飞快地飞来飞去，长长的手臂能抓住它想要的东西。它好像拿着什么东西。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "sarahsaurus"
msgid_plural "sarahsaurus"
msgstr[0] "莎拉龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "sarahsaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A bipedal plant eating dinosaur with a long neck and tail, strong grasping "
"hands and leathery skin."
msgstr "一种大型两足食草恐龙，长着长脖子、长尾巴、有力的爪子和坚韧的皮肤。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "anchisaurus"
msgid_plural "anchisaurus"
msgstr[0] "近蜥龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "anchisaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A four legged plant eating dinosaur with a long neck, dexterous hands and "
"leathery skin."
msgstr "一种四足食草恐龙，长着长脖子、灵巧的爪子和坚韧的皮肤。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "issi"
msgid_plural "issi"
msgstr[0] "伊希斯龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "issi"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large bipedal plant eating dinosaur with a long neck and tail and leathery"
" skin."
msgstr "一种大型两足食草恐龙，长着长脖子、长尾巴和坚韧的皮肤。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "haplocanthosaurus"
msgid_plural "haplocanthosaurus"
msgstr[0] "简棘龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "haplocanthosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with a whip-like tail and tall "
"shoulders."
msgstr "巨型的四足恐龙，具有极长的颈部与尾巴，肩部高耸，身躯笨重。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "amargasaurus"
msgid_plural "amargasaurus"
msgstr[0] "阿马加龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "amargasaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with a whip-like tail and two "
"rows of tall spines running down the neck and back."
msgstr "一只巨型长颈四足恐龙，尾巴像鞭子一样，颈部和背部有两排平行的高棘。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "apatosaurus"
msgid_plural "apatosaurus"
msgstr[0] "迷惑龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "apatosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with a long, whip-like tail.  The"
" head is upright and the neck looks like it would make a good strong club."
msgstr "一只巨大的长颈四足恐龙，尾巴非常长，像鞭子一样。它的头能够直立起来，脖子看起来像一根巨大而坚固的棍子。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "brontosaurus"
msgid_plural "brontosaurus"
msgstr[0] "雷龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "brontosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with bulky torso and long, whip-"
"like tail."
msgstr "巨型的四足恐龙，具有极长的颈部与尾巴，身躯笨重。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "diplodocus"
msgid_plural "diplodocus"
msgstr[0] "梁龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "diplodocus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "Huge, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with a long, whip-like tail."
msgstr "一只巨大的长颈四足恐龙，尾巴非常长，像鞭子一样。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "barosaurus"
msgid_plural "barosaurus"
msgstr[0] "巴洛龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "barosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Huge, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with a long, whip-like tail and one "
"large claw on each foreleg."
msgstr "一只巨大的长颈四足恐龙，尾巴非常长，像鞭子一样，每条足上都长有大爪子。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "camarasaurus"
msgid_plural "camarasaurus"
msgstr[0] "圆顶龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "camarasaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Huge four-legged dinosaur with a square head and a shorter neck and tail "
"than similar dinosaurs."
msgstr "一只巨大的四足恐龙，与其他同类恐龙相比，它长着方形的头和更短的脖子和尾巴。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "brachiosaurus"
msgid_plural "brachiosaurus"
msgstr[0] "腕龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "brachiosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with longer forelegs and a whip-"
"like tail."
msgstr "前腿较长的巨型四足恐龙，具有极长的颈部与尾巴，身躯笨重。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "alamosaurus"
msgid_plural "alamosaurus"
msgstr[0] "阿拉摩龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "alamosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Gigantic four-legged dinosaur with a long neck and spiked tail protected by "
"natural bone armor."
msgstr "巨型四足恐龙，具有极长的颈部与尾巴，尾巴有尖刺，有天然的骨甲保护。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "scutellosaurus"
msgid_plural "scutellosaurus"
msgstr[0] "小盾龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "scutellosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Small, four-legged dinosaur with five rows of protective plates running down"
" its back."
msgstr "一只小型四足恐龙，背上长着五排保护性骨板。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "stegosaurus"
msgid_plural "stegosaurus"
msgstr[0] "剑龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "stegosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge slow quadruped dinosaur with two rows of tall plates on its back, and"
" a spiked tail."
msgstr "一只巨大而迟缓的四足恐龙，背上长有两排骨板，尾巴上有骨钉。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "hesperosaurus"
msgid_plural "hesperosaurus"
msgstr[0] "西龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "hesperosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge slow quadruped dinosaur with two rows of long plates on its back, and"
" a spiked tail."
msgstr "一只巨大而迟缓的四足恐龙，背上长有两排长长的骨板，尾巴上有骨钉。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "gastonia"
msgid_plural "gastonia"
msgstr[0] "加斯顿龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "gastonia"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur has a long tail, a beak, and large"
" shoulder spikes."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重甲板的四足恐龙，背部长有尖刺，长有喙和长尾巴，肩部有着刺突。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "gargoyleosaurus"
msgid_plural "gargoyleosaurus"
msgstr[0] "怪嘴龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "gargoyleosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This lightly armored four legged dinosaur has a rigid spiked tail, a beak, "
"and sturdy spikes along the sides."
msgstr "一种体表有着轻薄甲板的四足恐龙，坚硬的尾巴长着尖刺，长有喙和身体两侧的刺突。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "sauropelta"
msgid_plural "sauropelta"
msgstr[0] "蜥结龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "sauropelta"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur has a beak, a long tail, and long "
"wicked-looking spikes jutting out of the neck."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重甲板的四足恐龙，长有喙和长尾巴，颈部长有长长的巨大尖刺。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "nodosaurus"
msgid_plural "nodosaurus"
msgstr[0] "结节龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "nodosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur has a beak and large bony plates "
"covering the back."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重鳞甲的四足恐龙，长有喙，背部覆满骨质瘤。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "panoplosaurus"
msgid_plural "panoplosaurus"
msgstr[0] "胄甲龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "panoplosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur has a lumpy armored head with a "
"beak and thick plates protecting the cheeks, thick back armor, and small "
"short spikes along the sides."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重鳞甲的四足恐龙，凹凸不平的甲板覆盖头部，背部有着厚重的鳞甲，长有喙，身体两侧长有细小的刺突。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "edmontonia"
msgid_plural "edmontonia"
msgstr[0] "埃德蒙顿甲龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "edmontonia"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored dinosaur is covered with small ridged bony plates with "
"long bony spikes."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重甲板的四足恐龙，全身覆满脊状骨板，体侧有着长长的骨质尖刺。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "zuul"
msgid_plural "zuul"
msgstr[0] "祖鲁龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "zuul"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This four-legged armored dinosaur has horns on the head and large spikes in "
"rows along the back and side.  Its spiked tail ends in a similarly pointy "
"club of bone."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重甲板的四足恐龙，头颈长有骨刺，骨质尖突长满了背部和体侧，布满突刺的尾部末端有着骨质尾锤。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "dyoplosaurus"
msgid_plural "dyoplosaurus"
msgstr[0] "倍甲龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "dyoplosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur has a beak and a long tail ending "
"in a spiked club of bone."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重甲板的四足恐龙，有着喙和长尾巴，尾部末端长有一个骨质尾槌。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "ankylosaurus"
msgid_plural "ankylosaurus"
msgstr[0] "甲龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "ankylosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur has a long tail ending in a "
"massive spiked club of bone."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重甲板的四足恐龙，长长的尾巴末端长有一个巨型骨质尾槌。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "euoplocephalus"
msgid_plural "euoplocephalus"
msgstr[0] "包头龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "euoplocephalus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur has a horny beak, two bony rings "
"protecting the neck, and a long tail ending in a heavy club of bone."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重甲片的四足恐龙，长有坚硬的喙，颈部覆盖着厚重的鳞甲带防护，长长的尾巴在末端长有沉重的骨槌。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "scolosaurus"
msgid_plural "scolosaurus"
msgstr[0] "厚甲龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "scolosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur has several long spikes along the "
"back and a long spiked tail ending in a club of bone."
msgstr "一种体表有着厚重甲片的四足恐龙，背部长有尖刺，骨质的尾巴上缀满刺突。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "tenontosaurus"
msgid_plural "tenontosaurus"
msgstr[0] "腱龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "tenontosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "A feathered dinosaur with four legs, a beak, and a long broad tail."
msgstr "一种有羽毛的四足恐龙，长有喙和宽阔的长尾巴"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "dryosaurus"
msgid_plural "dryosaurus"
msgstr[0] "橡树龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "dryosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A small feathered dinosaur standing on two legs with short arms, a long "
"neck, and a horned beak."
msgstr "一种长着羽毛的小型双足恐龙，臂短脖子长，长着带角的喙。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "camptosaurus"
msgid_plural "camptosaurus"
msgstr[0] "弯龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "camptosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large feathered dinosaur with four strong legs, broad shoulders and a "
"pointed beak.  It moves slowly but with enormous strength."
msgstr "一只长有羽毛的大型四足恐龙，腿很强壮，肩膀宽阔，长着尖喙。它动作缓慢，但力量巨大。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "hadrosaurus"
msgid_plural "hadrosaurus"
msgstr[0] "鸭嘴龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "hadrosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A bulky, beaked dinosaur with hooved front legs and strong clawed back legs."
msgstr "一只体型庞大的有喙恐龙，前腿长着蹄，强壮的后腿长着爪。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "maiasaura"
msgid_plural "maiasaura"
msgstr[0] "慈母龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "maiasaura"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with hooves and long heavy tail.  Has a flat beak, "
"thick nose, and small spiky head crest."
msgstr "一只长着鳞片的巨型恐龙，有蹄子一样的脚和长而沉重的尾巴。头上长着一个扁平的喙，厚厚的鼻子，和一个小尖状冠饰。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "gryposaurus"
msgid_plural "gryposaurus"
msgstr[0] "格里芬龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "gryposaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with hooves and a broad toothless beak with a narrow "
"arching nasal hump."
msgstr "一种体型巨大的长着鳞甲的四足恐龙，长着没有牙齿的宽喙，有蹄子一样的脚和狭窄隆起的鼻子。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "prosaurolophus"
msgid_plural "prosaurolophus"
msgstr[0] "原栉龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "prosaurolophus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with hooves and a broad beak filled with hundreds of "
"small teeth with a small nasal crest just above and in front of the eyes."
msgstr "一种体表附着鳞片的恐龙，有着粗壮的蹄足，喙内长有数百颗牙齿，头部和眼睛前端长有突起的鼻骨。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "saurolophus"
msgid_plural "saurolophus"
msgstr[0] "龙栉龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "saurolophus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with hooves and a broad beak filled with hundreds of "
"small teeth with a spiky head crest at the top of the skull reaching behind."
msgstr "一种体表附着鳞片的恐龙，有着粗壮的蹄足，喙内长有数百颗牙齿，头顶有着向后生长的长尖头冠。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "edmontosaurus"
msgid_plural "edmontosaurus"
msgstr[0] "埃德蒙顿龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "edmontosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with hooves and a broad toothless beak.  There are "
"teeth deeper in the mouth."
msgstr "一种体型巨大的草食性恐龙，长有蹄足和没牙的喙状嘴，牙齿位于嘴部深处。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "parasaurolophus"
msgid_plural "parasaurolophus"
msgstr[0] "副栉龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "parasaurolophus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge mottled dinosaur with four legs, a narrow beak, and a curved head "
"crest."
msgstr "一只体色斑驳的巨型四足恐龙，长着细长的喙和一个弯曲的头冠。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "lambeosaurus"
msgid_plural "lambeosaurus"
msgstr[0] "赖氏龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "lambeosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with a long stiff tail and hooves.  Has a narrow beak "
"and a tall head crest that looks like a mitten with the thumb pointed up."
msgstr "一种长有鳞片的巨大的恐龙，尾巴和蹄又长又硬。有狭窄的喙和一个高高的头冠，整体看起来像一个拇指朝上的手套。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "corythosaurus"
msgid_plural "corythosaurus"
msgstr[0] "冠龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "corythosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with a thick neck and tail and hooves.  Has a short "
"beak and a tall rounded head crest."
msgstr "一种巨大的、长着鳞片的恐龙，脖子、尾巴和脚都很粗壮。长着一个短喙和一个高高的头冠。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "hypacrosaurus"
msgid_plural "hypacrosaurus"
msgstr[0] "亚冠龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "hypacrosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with a tall ridge down the back, a tail and hooves.  "
"Has a short beak and a wide, rounded head crest."
msgstr "一种巨大的、长着鳞片的恐龙，长有蹄足和喙，背部如山脊般高高突起。头部有短喙和形状较圆的宽头冠。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "stegoceras"
msgid_plural "stegoceras"
msgstr[0] "顶角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "stegoceras"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A small feathered bipedal dinosaur about the size of a goat.  It looks like "
"a reptilian ostrich with a round hard-looking domed head."
msgstr "一种有羽毛的小型双足恐龙，体型和山羊差不多。它看起来像一个爬行类的鸵鸟，有一个圆而坚硬的圆头。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "pachycephalosaurus"
msgid_plural "pachycephalosaurus"
msgstr[0] "厚头龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "pachycephalosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur, standing as tall as a human.  It looks like a "
"reptilian ostrich with a round hard-looking domed head."
msgstr "一种有羽毛的两足恐龙，站立时和人类一样高。它看起来有点像爬虫类的鸵鸟，坚硬的头部呈半球状。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "aquilops"
msgid_plural "aquilops"
msgstr[0] "鹰角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "aquilops"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A small rhino-like dinosaur with a bony crest studded with small horns and a"
" hooked beak."
msgstr "一只类似犀牛的小型恐龙，其骨冠上布满小角，长着钩喙。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "leptoceratops"
msgid_plural "leptoceratops"
msgstr[0] "纤角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "leptoceratops"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A rhino-like dinosaur with a bony crest and sharp beak able to walk on two "
"legs and four."
msgstr "一只类似犀牛的恐龙，长着骨冠和锋利的喙，能够用两腿或四腿行走。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "zuniceratops"
msgid_plural "zuniceratops"
msgstr[0] "祖尼角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "zuniceratops"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A rhino-like dinosaur with a tall thin bony head crest, two long brow horns,"
" and a beak."
msgstr "一只类似犀牛的恐龙，长着瘦高的骨冠，两根长长眉角和尖喙。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "styracosaurus"
msgid_plural "styracosaurus"
msgstr[0] "戟龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "styracosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large stocky four-legged dinosaur with a bony crest with several long "
"spikes and one large horn above the beak and a short tail."
msgstr "一种体型粗壮的四足恐龙，其骨冠上长有几根长刺，喙上方有根大角，还有一条短尾巴"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "centrosaurus"
msgid_plural "centrosaurus"
msgstr[0] "尖角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "centrosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large stocky rhino-like dinosaur with a bony crest and one large horn "
"above the nose."
msgstr "一种像犀牛一样结实的大恐龙，长有骨冠和鼻子上方的一个大角。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "einiosaurus"
msgid_plural "einiosaurus"
msgstr[0] "野牛龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "einiosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large stocky rhino-like dinosaur with a tall bony crest and one large horn"
" above the nose curving forward towards the beak."
msgstr "一只大而结实的类似犀牛的恐龙，长着高高的骨冠，鼻子上方长着大角，朝着喙向前弯曲。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "achelousaurus"
msgid_plural "achelousaurus"
msgstr[0] "河神龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "achelousaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large stocky rhino-like dinosaur with a tall bony crest with two long "
"curved spikes and three rough bosses above the eyes and nose as well as a "
"short tail and hooked beak."
msgstr "一只大而结实的类似犀牛的恐龙，长着高高的骨冠，两根长而弯曲的尖角，眼睛和鼻子上方长着三个粗糙的凸起，还长着一条短尾和钩喙。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "pachyrhinosaurus"
msgid_plural "pachyrhinosaurus"
msgstr[0] "厚鼻龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "pachyrhinosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A massive four-legged dinosaur with a bony crest from which two curved horns"
" and a broad bony nose emerge.  There is also a curved beak and short tail."
msgstr "一只巨大的四足恐龙，长着骨冠，两根弯曲的角和一根粗矮的骨质鼻角。还长着弯喙和短尾。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "chasmosaurus"
msgid_plural "chasmosaurus"
msgstr[0] "开角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "chasmosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A massive rhino-like dinosaur with a tall bony crest from which three short "
"horns emerge above the eyes and beak."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的犀牛一般的恐龙。头上长着高高的骨冠，三根短角从眼睛和喙上面长出来。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "pentaceratops"
msgid_plural "pentaceratops"
msgstr[0] "五角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "pentaceratops"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A massive rhino-like dinosaur with a tall bony crest from which four long "
"horns and a short nose horn emerge."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的犀牛一般的恐龙。头上长着高高的骨冠，上面有四根长长的角和一根粗矮的骨质鼻角。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "kosmoceratops"
msgid_plural "kosmoceratops"
msgstr[0] "科斯莫角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "kosmoceratops"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A massive rhino-like dinosaur with an ornate spiked neck crest and two long "
"horns curving up and to the sides from above its eyes."
msgstr "一只类似犀牛的巨型恐龙，长着华丽的尖刺颈冠和两个从眼睛上方向外生长出来的弯曲长角。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "torosaurus"
msgid_plural "torosaurus"
msgstr[0] "牛角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "torosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A massive rhino-like dinosaur with a tall bony crest from which two long "
"wicked horns emerge."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的犀牛一般的恐龙。头上长着高高的骨冠，上面有两根凶猛的尖角。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "triceratops"
msgid_plural "triceratops"
msgstr[0] "三角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "triceratops"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A massive rhino-like dinosaur with a bony crest from which three large horns"
" emerge."
msgstr "一只体型巨大的犀牛一般的恐龙。头上有三个大角和一个骨质头冠。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "nanosaurus"
msgid_plural "nanosaurus"
msgstr[0] "侏儒龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "nanosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur about the size of a cat with a small head and "
"arms, long legs, and a tail."
msgstr "一只有羽毛的双足恐龙，体型和猫差不多大，头部和手臂较小，腿部和尾巴较长。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "oryctodromeus"
msgid_plural "oryctodromeus"
msgstr[0] "掘奔龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "oryctodromeus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur with long claws about the size of a turkey."
msgstr "一种长着羽毛的两足恐龙，有长爪，体型和火鸡一般大小。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "thescelosaurus"
msgid_plural "thescelosaurus"
msgstr[0] "奇异龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "thescelosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A sturdily built feathered bipedal dinosaur with a long narrow beak and "
"strong arms about the size of a cow."
msgstr "一种躯体健壮，长着羽毛的两足恐龙，有狭长的喙和牛腿粗的强壮肢体。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "dimorphodon"
msgid_plural "dimorphodon"
msgstr[0] "双型齿翼龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "dimorphodon"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A feathered flying reptile over three feet long, with short wings and a big "
"colorful beak."
msgstr "一种长着羽毛的会飞的爬行动物，有三英尺长，长着较短的翅膀和颜色鲜艳的大嘴。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "pteranodon"
msgid_plural "pteranodon"
msgstr[0] "无齿翼龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "pteranodon"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A large feathered flying reptile, with a long pointed toothless beak and a "
"long pointy head crest."
msgstr "一只长着羽毛的会飞的大型爬行动物，长着长而尖的无齿喙和长而尖的头冠。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "quetzalcoatlus"
msgid_plural "quetzalcoatlus"
msgstr[0] "风神翼龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "quetzalcoatlus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge feathered flying reptile, with a long pointed toothless beak and a "
"long stiff neck."
msgstr "一只长着羽毛的会飞的巨型爬行动物，长着长而尖的无齿喙和长而坚硬的脖子。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "mosasaurus"
msgid_plural "mosasaurus"
msgstr[0] "沧龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "mosasaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"A huge aquatic reptile about the size of a small house, with a ferocious "
"crocodile-like head and powerful swimming fins."
msgstr "一只巨型水生恐龙，有一栋小房子那么高，长着凶猛的像鳄鱼一样的头和有力的游泳脚蹼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "spinosaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "spinosaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化棘龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "spinosaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A massive theropod with a huge fin on its back and a crocodile-like snout.  "
"It is silver from armor plating and cybernetics crackle all over its body.  "
"There seems to be a laser rifle mounted to its head.  It scans endlessly for"
" its next target."
msgstr ""
"一只巨大的兽脚类恐龙，背上有巨大的鳍，长着像鳄鱼的喙。它浑身上下装满了闪亮的盔甲，生化插件在它身上噼啪作响。头上好像装了一把激光步枪。它正在不停地寻找下一个目标。"

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "spinosaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "\"TARGET ACQUIRED.\""
msgstr "\"目标已确认。\""

#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "spinosaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "TARGET ACQUIRED.  *beeeeeeeeep*.  OUT OF AMMO."
msgstr "\"目标已确认。\"*哔————*\"弹药已耗尽。\""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "tyrannosaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "tyrannosaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化霸王龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "tyrannosaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"Enormous glowing teeth in a massive jaw, fierce eyes, and a powerful frame "
"to drive it forward, short arms with large claws, with a feathered mullet "
"and tail.  The entire body is studded with an intricate pattern of crackling"
" bionics."
msgstr ""
"巨大的下颌里长满了巨大发光的牙齿，它有一双凶猛的眼睛，短短的手臂上是一对巨大的爪子，背部和尾部长着羽毛，强而有力的躯干驱动着它前行。浑身上下布满了复杂的噼啪作响的生化插件。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "compsognathus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "compsognathus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化美颌龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "compsognathus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A small fast-moving bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  Its "
"sharp claws and teeth glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只快速移动的小型双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它锋利的爪子和牙齿发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "gallimimus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "gallimimus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化似鸡龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "gallimimus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A fast-moving feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  Its"
" curved claws glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只快速移动的有羽毛的双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它弯曲的爪子发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "albertonykus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "albertonykus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化亚伯达爪龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "albertonykus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A fast-moving feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics and a"
" long tail."
msgstr "一只快速移动的有羽毛的双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件，长着长尾巴。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "saurornitholestes bio-operator"
msgid_plural "saurornitholestes bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化蜥鸟盗龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "saurornitholestes bio-operator"
#. ~ Description of monster "velociraptor bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A small feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  Its "
"small, hooked claws glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只有羽毛的小型双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它带钩的小爪子发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "velociraptor bio-operator"
msgid_plural "velociraptor bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化伶盗龙"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "deinonychus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "deinonychus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化恐爪龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "deinonychus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A bipedal dinosaur covered with feathers and crackling bionics.  Each foot "
"has a large glowing sickle-like claw."
msgstr "一具体表覆盖着羽毛的中型两足恐龙，它体内的生化插件正噼啪作响。双脚前端巨大发光的镰刀状利爪正不断挥舞着。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "dromaeosaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "dromaeosaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化驰龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "dromaeosaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A small feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  Its "
"small, hooked claws and many sharp teeth glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只有羽毛的小型双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它带钩的小爪子和许多尖利的牙齿发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "stenonychosaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "stenonychosaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化伤齿龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "stenonychosaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A small feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  Each foot"
" has a large glowing sickle-like claw."
msgstr "一具体表覆盖着羽毛的小型两足恐龙，它体内的生化插件正噼啪作响。双脚前端巨大发光的镰刀状利爪正不断挥舞着。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "eoraptor bio-operator"
msgid_plural "eoraptor bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化始盗龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "eoraptor bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A small bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics with long arms.  The "
"sharp teeth glow menacingly"
msgstr "一只长有长臂的小型双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它锋利的牙齿发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "amargasaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "amargasaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化阿马加龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "amargasaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  "
"The whip-like tail and two rows of tall spines running down the neck and "
"back glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只巨型长颈四足恐龙，尾巴像鞭子一样，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。颈部和背部上两排平行的高棘发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "dryosaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "dryosaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化橡树龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "dryosaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A long-necked bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics with long legs "
"and short arms.  Its hooked beak glows menacingly."
msgstr "一只长着长腿和短臂的长颈双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它带钩的尖喙发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "stegoceras bio-operator"
msgid_plural "stegoceras bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化顶角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "stegoceras bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A small feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics and "
"sporting a round hard-looking domed head.  Its curved claws glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只长着坚硬圆头的有羽毛的小型双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它弯曲的爪子发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "pachycephalosaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "pachycephalosaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化厚头龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "pachycephalosaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics and sporting a "
"round hard-looking domed head.  Its curved claws glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只长着坚硬圆头的有羽毛的双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它弯曲的爪子发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "aquilops bio-operator"
msgid_plural "aquilops bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化鹰角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "aquilops bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A small four legged dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics with a glowing "
"beak and small horns"
msgstr "一只小型四足恐龙，浑身上下布满了噼啪作响的生化插件，长着发光的钩喙和小角。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "triceratops bio-operator"
msgid_plural "triceratops bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化三角龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "triceratops bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A massive three-horned four-legged dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  "
"The horns glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只巨大的三角四足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它的角发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "nanosaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "nanosaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化侏儒龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "nanosaurus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A small feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  The tiny "
"claws glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只有羽毛的小型双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它的小爪子发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "oryctodromeus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "oryctodromeus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化掘奔龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "oryctodromeus bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A small feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  The claws"
" glow menacingly."
msgstr "一只有羽毛的小型双足恐龙，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。它的爪子发出可怕的光。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid "dimorphodon bio-operator"
msgid_plural "dimorphodon bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "生化双型齿翼龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "dimorphodon bio-operator"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur_CBM.json
msgid ""
"A feathered flying reptile with short wings dotted with crackling bionics "
"and a colorful glowing beak."
msgstr "一种长着羽毛的会飞的爬行动物，上面点缀着噼啪作响的生化插件。长着较短的翅膀和颜色鲜艳的大嘴。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/fungus.json
msgid "fungal dilophosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal dilophosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "真菌丧尸双脊龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal dilophosaurus zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/fungus.json
msgid ""
"Once a predator dinosaur with sharp teeth and two prominent bony crests on "
