"A bulky, beaked dinosaur with hooved front legs and two heads.  The four "
"eyes are wide and rolling."
msgstr "一只体型庞大的双头有喙恐龙，前腿长着蹄。四只眼睛睁得大大的，不停转动着。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid "dilophosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "dilophosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "丧尸双脊龙"

