"This heavily armored four legged dinosaur corpse has a long tail, a beak, "
"and large shoulder spikes.  Its eyes ooze black, putrid tears."
msgstr "一具身长厚甲的四足恐龙尸体，有一条长长的尾巴、一个喙和巨大的肩刺。它的眼睛里渗出黑色的、腐败的眼泪。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
