msgstr ""
"这只丧尸恐龙被一层不可思议的阴影所笼罩，看上去似如光线也拒绝去接触它一般。你唯一能够分辨出来的是一个步履蹒跚的模糊的巨型恐龙轮廓。头看起来很大，下面是一对贪婪的长爪。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "shady qianzhousaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "shady qianzhousaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "暗影丧尸虔州龙"

#. ~ Description of monster "shady qianzhousaurus zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "shady daspletosaurus zombie"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of a"
