#. ~ Description of "beanbag grenade cartridge"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/grenade.json
msgid ""
"A less-lethal beanbag grenade cartridge that delivers strong impact on "
"target, causing major pain and disorientation.  May still injure or kill."
msgstr "一款低初速低杀伤榴弹，弹头内装着泡沫和塑料弹丸，目的是使得受攻击目标疼痛并迷失方向。但仍可能造成伤害并导致死亡。"

#. ~ Item name
