#. ~ Description of effect type "Ogre's Strength"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You have the strength of an Ogre!"
msgstr "你拥有巨魔的力量！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Ogre's Strength"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel strong!"
msgstr "你感到自己非常强壮！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Ogre's Strength"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your strength deflates."
msgstr "你的力量减弱了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "safe_shoppers"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Safe Shopping Experience"
msgstr "安全购物体验"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Safe Shopping Experience"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Magical Store Security"
msgstr "魔法商店安防系统。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Safe Shopping Experience"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel very seen!"
msgstr "你觉得自己被人盯上了！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Safe Shopping Experience"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You no longer feel like somebody's watching you."
msgstr "你不再觉得有人在盯着你了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Eagle's Sight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You have the perception of an Eagle!"
msgstr "你拥有鹰的感知！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Eagle's Sight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You notice small details!"
msgstr "你能发现更多细节！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Eagle's Sight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your vision returns to normal."
msgstr "你的视力恢复正常。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cat's Grace"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You have the dexterity of a cat!"
msgstr "你像猫一样灵活！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Cat's Grace"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your reflexes are heightened!"
msgstr "你的反应能力提高了！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Cat's Grace"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your reflexes return to normal."
msgstr "你的反应恢复正常。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Fox's Cunning"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You have the cunning of a Fox!"
msgstr "你像狐狸一样狡猾！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Fox's Cunning"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your intelligence is heightened!"
msgstr "你的智力提高了！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Fox's Cunning"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your intelligence returns to normal."
msgstr "你的智力恢复正常。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Debug Full Protection"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your skin tingle with the power of the Devs!"
msgstr "开发者之力刺痛着你的皮肤！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Debug Full Protection"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your skin stops tingling, your life is empty and meaningless again."
msgstr "你的皮肤不再刺痛，你的生活再次变得空虚又毫无意义。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Pluma"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are light as a feather and fall like one."
msgstr "你像羽毛一样轻盈地掉落。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Pluma"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your body feels light as a feather."
msgstr "你感觉身体轻如鸿毛。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Pluma"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "The earth pulls you down hard."
msgstr "你被引力狠狠拉向了地面。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "eff_frightful_presence"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Frightened"
msgstr "受惊"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "eff_frightful_presence"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Scared"
msgstr "惊恐"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "eff_frightful_presence"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Terrified"
msgstr "十分惊恐"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Frightened, Scared, Terrified"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your knees are shaking, your heart beats fast, and your stomach rebels."
msgstr "你的膝盖颤抖，你的心跳加快，你的胃中一阵作呕。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Frightened, Scared, Terrified"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are afraid!"
msgstr "你感到非常害怕！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Frightened, Scared, Terrified"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your fear dissipates."
msgstr "你的恐惧消散了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "biomancer_visceral_side_effects"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Visceral Overexertion"
msgstr "脏腑过劳"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Visceral Overexertion"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You feel sickened from overtaxing your body, having extended your influence "
"over such a wide area."
msgstr "你因为将自身脏腑过度膨胀以将其覆盖这么大一片范围而感到恶心难受。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Coagulant Weave"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Blood Weave"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Immunity to bleeding and bites, increased stamina regeneration, increased "
"hunger and thirst gain."
msgstr "对流血和咬伤免疫，增加耐力重生速度，饥渴增长速度。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Coagulant Weave"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Blood Weave"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The tension running through your flesh fades."
msgstr "你感到血肉中的紧绷感消退了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "biomancer_dart_venom"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Biomantic Venom"
msgstr "生化毒素"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Biomantic Venom"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel sluggish and weak, from magically-induced poisoning."
msgstr "你感觉到由于生化魔法导致的迟钝及虚弱。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "tornskin_pain"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Sharp Thorns"
msgstr "尖刺荆棘"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sharp Thorns"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Thorns are whirling around you, regularly causing cuts into you."
msgstr "荆棘在你周围旋转，导致你经常被割伤。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sharp Thorns"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Thorns in the wind begin slicing into you!"
msgstr "风中的荆棘刺痛着你的身体！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sharp Thorns"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "The thorns fall to the ground."
msgstr "荆棘都落到地上了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "neuro_boost"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Mental Boost"
msgstr "精神刺激"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mental Boost"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your mind is working incredibly fast, but your body cannot keep up"
msgstr "你的大脑运转得非常快，但你的身体却跟不上。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "vault_atmosphere"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Vault Air"
msgstr "宝库气息"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Vault Air"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel at home."
msgstr "你有宾至如归的感觉。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Vault Air"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "This smells like home."
msgstr "闻起来有种到家的感觉。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Vault Air"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Time to go."
msgstr "该走了。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "slow_freeze_effect"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Slow Freeze"
msgstr "渐冻"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Slow Freeze"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "The cold slows down your foes."
msgstr "寒冷减慢了你的敌人。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nature's Commune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You can feel Mother Nature welcoming you, revitalizing your body and calming"
" the natural fauna around you."
msgstr "你能感受到自然之母正欢迎着你的到来，你的身体恢复活力，四周的野生动物也平静下来。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Nature's Commune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "A warm embrace surrounds you, like that of a mother with her child."
msgstr "一股温暖的怀抱围绕着你，如同母亲抱着她的孩子一般。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Nature's Commune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your commune with Mother Nature fades."
msgstr "你同自然之母的联结逐渐消散。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cold Heart"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Full of chilled blood, the heart slows as it grows cold."
msgstr "充满了冰冷的血液，心跳随着变冷而变慢。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Cold Heart"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You feel yourself getting slower, as ice seems to run through your veins."
msgstr "你感觉自己的速度越来越慢，因为似乎有寒冰流入你的血管。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Cold Heart"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel yourself recovering your normal speed."
msgstr "你感觉自己恢复了正常的速度。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Overdrive"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Is it possible to dart aside and avoid a cannon ball?  Is it possible to "
"grab an arrow in flight with one hand?"
msgstr "真有可能闪身躲开炮弹吗？真有可能单手抓住飞箭吗？"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Overdrive"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel yourself move faster than a bullet."
msgstr "你觉得自己比子弹还快。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Overdrive"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel yourself returning to your normal speed."
msgstr "你感觉自己回到了正常速度。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "alkahest"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Stepped on alkahest"
msgstr "踩上万能溶剂"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stepped on alkahest"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You're standing in alkahest!"
msgstr "你踩到了万能溶剂！"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "biomechanic"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Biomechanism"
msgstr "生物力学"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Biomechanism"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Hunt.  Let them feel."
msgstr "猎杀。让他们感受一下。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Biomechanism"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your body returns to normal state."
msgstr "你的身体恢复到了正常状态。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "ice_energy"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Ice erosion"
msgstr "冰霜侵蚀"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Ice erosion"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Ice crystals erode your body from all directions."
msgstr "冰晶从各个方向侵蚀你的身体。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "eshaper_melee_damage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Heft"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Heft"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your body is heavy as the heaviest rocks.  Your attack speed is slowed down,"
" but your melee damage increased drastically."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Heft"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel your body compress and harden."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Heft"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You no longer feel encumbered."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Crystal Wrapping"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Thin layer of almost living crystals, that rapidly grows and moves on the "
"body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Crystal Wrapping"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel a light, purple material cover your body and clothes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Crystal Wrapping"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "The crystals crumble."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Electric Eye"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Enhance your sight with your powers.  It allows you to see creatures of the "
"same energy around you, and some minor bonuses."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Electric Eye"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your sight is enhanced."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Electric Eye"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your sight turn back to usual state."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Electric Waves"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your body throw a massive electric charges when you attack monsters."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Electric Waves"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "A powerful energy streams out of your hands."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Electric Waves"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Energy streams calm down."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Electric Arts"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Make you less vulnerable to electric damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Electric Arts"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel a small sparks under your skin.  They do not harm you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Electric Arts"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Sparks under your skin vanish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of effect type id "ice_age_eff"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Glaciation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Glaciation"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are frozen, your bones are fragile; cracking in the cold, and your "
"muscles are cut by razor sharp ice."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of effect type id "flower_fern_eff"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Positivity"
msgstr "积极乐观"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Positivity"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your feel yourself a bit better."
msgstr "你感觉自己好了一些。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "glowing_mushroom_eff"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Lightness"
msgstr "轻盈"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lightness"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You feel yourself a bit lighter.  You doubt you can lose weight from this."
msgstr "你觉得自己更轻盈了。但你不觉得自己的体重会因此下降。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Velocitas"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Make you faster, and allow to hold this state for a while."
msgstr "让你在一段时间内速度更快。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Velocitas"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel your legs can work much better than before"
msgstr "你感觉腿脚比以前更好使了。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Velocitas"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your speed slows down."
msgstr "你的速度慢了下来。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Constantia"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel an energy in your muscles, untired and jazzed."
msgstr "你感觉一股能量充满了你的肌肉，让你不知疲惫，精神振奋。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Constantia"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Circulatory"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The energy in your body fades away."
msgstr "你身体里的能量消失了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Motus"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your reaction now is way better than before."
msgstr "你的反应能力显著提升了。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Motus"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You can feel the fly wings movement now."
msgstr "你感觉健步如飞。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Motus"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your reflexes turn back to normal."
msgstr "你的反应恢复正常。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Resistentia"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your touch sense are blunted for a bit, but your skin feels more dense."
msgstr "你的触觉有一点迟钝，但你的皮肤感觉更致密了。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Resistentia"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Endurance"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The sturdy feeling is gone."
msgstr "身体的坚固感消失了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Illuminatio"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your body emit a lot of light around."
msgstr "你的身体向周围散发出大量光芒。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Illuminatio"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin glow like an old lantern.  You feel no discomfort for some reason."
msgstr "你的皮肤像旧灯笼一样在发光。不过出于某种原因，你没有感到不适。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Illuminatio"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your skin turn back to normal state."
msgstr "你的皮肤恢复到了正常状态。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Recuperatio"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You can feel the thinnest ley lines around you."
msgstr "你能感受到身边最纤细的灵脉。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Recuperatio"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "The mana senses blunts."
msgstr "对魔力的感应又变得迟钝了。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Augere"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Increase the amount of mana you can operate."
msgstr "增加你可以操控的魔力量。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Augere"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel a deep mana well inside your body."
msgstr "你感觉到身体里存储的魔力进入了一口深井。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Augere"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your well feels empty now."
msgstr "你无法再感受到那口深井了。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Regeneration"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your flesh and bones start to regenerate before your eyes."
msgstr "你的骨肉开始以可见的速度再生。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Regeneration"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your regeneration slows down."
msgstr "你身体的再生速度慢了下来。"

