#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/debug_mutations.json
msgid ""
"This is a spell that represents the Soulfire putting a burning pressure on "
"nearby opponents.  If you are seeing this spell, you have debugged it in."
msgstr "这个法术代表了灵魂之火法术对附近的敌人所施加的燃烧压力。如果你看到了这个法术，说明你用了调试功能。"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Soul Pressure"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/enchantments/Soulfire.json
msgid "a grunt and a sizzle"
msgstr "咕噜声和嘶嘶声"

#. ~ Description of "Soul Burn"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/enchantments/Soulfire.json
msgid ""
"A little of your soul has been burned away, leaving you in a weakened state."
"  The soul heals quickly, so rest for now."
msgstr "你的部分灵魂被燃烧掉了，这让你处于某种衰弱的状态。灵魂很快就会恢复，所以先休息一会吧。"

