msgid_plural "Earthshaper cestuses"
msgstr[0] "塑地者拳套"

#. ~ Description of "Earthshaper cestus"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_unarmed.json
msgid ""
"A stone battle glove with carved runes encasing the hand, protecting it "
"while increasing striking power.  There is an Earthshaper rune embedded in "
"the palm."
msgstr "一个石制手套，上面围绕手的四周刻着符文，保护手的同时增强打击力量。手套的掌心镶嵌着塑地者符文。"

