#. ~ Druid spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Cause Rot"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"A spell from a darker sect of druidry, created to forcibly begin the circle "
"of life anew.  For without rot, you cannot have growth.  Affects a huge "
"area, but is indiscriminate and slow both in casting and effect.  Once lost "
"entirely to the passage of time, this spell was thought to be no more than a"
" myth, the stuff of fairy tales, albeit grim ones."
msgstr ""
"来自德鲁伊黑暗教派的法术，用来强行重启生命循环。因为没有腐化，就无法生长。影响范围很大，且不分敌我；即便是机器也会生锈化为尘土，施法及起效速度都很慢。曾经完全失传在时间的流逝中，这个法术被认为只不过是神话传说，是童话故事的素材，虽然是黑暗童话。"

