#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow kid"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of marshmallow.  It bumbles about on its stubby "
"cushiony legs.  How cute!"
msgstr "一只完全由棉花糖组成的小型类人生物。它用粗短软垫状的腿蹒跚乱步。多么可爱呀！"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "marshmallow guy"
msgid_plural "marshmallow guys"
msgstr[0] "棉花糖人"

#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow guy"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A marshmallow humanoid with a smile drawn on its face.  It bumbles around as"
" if looking for something.  It's oddly adorable."
msgstr "一只由棉花糖组成的类人生物，脸上勾勒着微笑。它蹒跚乱步，似乎在寻找着什么。看起来异常可爱。"

#. ~ Monster name
