msgid ""
"Starter evacuee gear, no skills - probably not going to have a good time."
msgstr "初始被疏散者装备，没有技能——可能活得不会很开心。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
