#. ~ Description of profession "Midgame" for male
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Scavenged armor and mid-range skills, meant to represent an established "
"survivor before making the jump to (self)-fabricated custom gear."
msgstr "拾荒得来的护甲和中级技能，代表一个安定下来，但还没有开始自制装备的幸存者。"

