"Heavy (survivor pneumatic) post-cataclysm gear, excluding rare lootables."
msgstr "大灾变后期的重型装备，不包括稀有战利品。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
