msgid ""
"Heavy (survivor pneumatic) post-cataclysm gear, excluding rare lootables."
msgstr "大灾变后期的重型装备，不包括稀有战利品。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/StatsThroughSkills/modinfo.json
msgid "Stats Through Skills"
msgstr "技能提升属性"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Stats Through Skills"
#: data/mods/StatsThroughSkills/modinfo.json
