#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
msgid "Reindeer fawn"
msgid_plural "Reindeer fawns"
msgstr[0] "驯鹿幼崽"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/modinfo.json
msgid "Tamable Wildlife"
msgstr "驯服野兽"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Tamable Wildlife"
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/modinfo.json
msgid "Makes a lot of docile, but generally untamable wildlife, tamable."
msgstr "使许多温顺但通常无法驯服的野生动物变得可以被驯服。"

#. ~ Description of the category "tame eggs"
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/recipes/nested.json
msgid "Recipes related to taming the eggs of aggressive invertebrates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of effect type id "toxic_glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "Termite Glue"
msgstr "白蚁胶"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Termite Glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in thick toxic glue!"
msgstr "厚厚的毒胶覆盖住了你！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Termite Glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in thick noxious glue!"
msgstr "厚厚的毒胶覆盖住了你！"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Termite Glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "The glue has washed up but it surely left a mark."
msgstr "毒胶洗干净了，但肯定留下了痕迹。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Termite Glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "The glue restricts your movement."
msgstr "毒胶限制了你的行动。"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid "TropiCataclysm"
msgstr "热带大灾变"

#. ~ Description of MOD "TropiCataclysm"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Changes the setting from New England to an undescribed region in the "
"tropics, initially based out of Desert Region mod."
msgstr "将地区设置从新英格兰变更为一个位于热带的不明地区，最初基于沙漠地区模组。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Spread Glue"
msgstr "散布毒胶"

#. ~ Description of spell "Spread Glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Splatters a glue-like substance along the ground in a cone."
msgstr "在一片锥形区域的地面上喷射出有毒粘胶。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Pollen Breath"
msgstr "花粉呼吸"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pollen Breath"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Spews pollen in a cone."
msgstr "在一片锥形区域喷出花粉。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Bad Breath"
msgstr "有毒呼吸"

#. ~ Description of spell "Bad Breath"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Spews toxic gas in a cone."
msgstr "在一片锥形区域喷出毒气。"

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_overmap_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/overmap/desert_overmap_terrain.json
msgid "desert"
msgstr "沙漠"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
msgid "singing sand"
msgstr "鸣沙"

#. ~ Description of terrain "singing sand"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A formation of sand containing special minerals to produce whistling noises "
"when stepped on and from the wind."
msgstr "一种含有特殊矿物的沙子的形成，当踩在风上或从风中发出口哨声。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid "outcrop"
msgstr "露岩"

#. ~ Description of terrain "outcrop"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
msgid ""
"An assortment of various large, sharp rocks that jut out from the "
"surrounding terrain.  Could be used as a surface for a number of things or "
"climbed on if worn with proper footwear."
msgstr "从周围地形中突出来的各种大而尖的岩石。可以作为很多东西的表面，如果穿着合适的鞋子，也可以爬上去。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid "dune"
msgstr "沙丘"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dune"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A huge sand dune that is continually reshaped by the wind.  Climbing it will"
" be troublesome."
msgstr "一个巨大的沙丘，被风不断地重塑。很难爬上去。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/overmap/desert_overmap_terrain.json
msgid "desert pavement"
msgstr "岩漠"

#. ~ Description of terrain "desert pavement"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Not that kind of pavement!  Naturally occurring pockets of densely packed "
"rock fragments that is easier to traverse than sand, with the right "
"footwear."
msgstr "它不是一种人工路面！由密集的天然空腔碎岩石组成，比沙漠更容易穿行，只要穿着合适的鞋子。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "scorched earth"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Cracked and dry soil that doesn't look like it will be capable of supporting"
" anything in your lifetime."
msgstr "龟裂的土地，看起来不像是可以支撑什么东西。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid "fungal mat"
msgstr "菌毯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal mat"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid ""
"A dense layer of mutated underground fungus grown by the termites.  "
"Completely unrelated to the alien fungus found in the surface."
msgstr "白蚁生长出一层密集的变异地下真菌。与在地表发现的异界真菌完全无关。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid "underground fungus"
msgstr "地下真菌"

#. ~ Description of terrain "underground fungus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid ""
"This is a large clump of mutated fungi grown by the termites deep "
"underground.  It looks slightly toxic but edible and it should be ripe for "
"harvest on winter."
msgstr "这是地下深处白蚁生长出一大块变异真菌。它看起来带有微毒，但仍可以食用，应该在冬天能成熟收割。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "underground fungus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid ""
"This is a large clump of mutated fungi grown by the termites deep "
"underground.  It doesn't seem to be ready for harvest yet."
msgstr "这是地下深处白蚁生长出一大块变异真菌。它看起来还不能被收割。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "mango tree"
msgstr "芒果树"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mango tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Mangifera' genus, producing fruit commonly "
"known as mangoes.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could "
"probably find a few mature ones in summer."
msgstr "一棵在夏天能够结出芒果果实的树，分类学上属于芒果属。如果你顺着枝干仔细观察的话，就可以找到几个成熟的芒果。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mango tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Mangifera' genus, producing fruit commonly "
"known as mangoes.  There do not appear to be any ripe mangoes now."
msgstr "一棵在夏天能够结出芒果果实的树，分类学上属于芒果属。看起来上面成熟的芒果都被摘光了。"

