msgstr "这株仙人掌属于“仙人掌”属，其果实通常被称为梨果仙人掌。现在似乎没有任何梨果。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
msgid "alien coral"
msgstr "异界珊瑚"

#. ~ Description of furniture "alien coral"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
msgid ""
"A colony of alien organisms forming what appears to be some kind of rocky "
"structure.  It looks sturdy as stone."
msgstr "形成某种岩石结构的异界生物种群。它看起来像石头一样坚固。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
msgid "alien sponge"
msgstr "异界海绵"

#. ~ Description of furniture "alien sponge"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
msgid ""
"This looks like some kind of alien sponge.  It has a bluish color and seems "
"sturdy as a rock."
msgstr "这看起来像某种异界海绵。它呈蓝色，看起来像岩石一样坚固。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
msgid "alien polyp"
msgstr "异界水螅"

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien polyp"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
msgid ""
"This is an alien creature resembling some kind of cnidarian like a hydra or "
"anemone.  Probably not a good idea to touch or step on it."
msgstr "某种异界生物，类似于水螅或海葵等腔肠动物。触摸或是踩上去可能不是个好主意。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
msgid "alien lily"
msgstr "异界海百合"

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien lily"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_nether.json
msgid ""
"This is an alien creature resembling some kind of sea lily.  Its feathery "
"arms spread open like palm tree to catch the aero plankton in the area."
msgstr "某种异界生物，类似于某种海百合。它羽毛般的手臂像棕榈树一样张开，捕捉该地区的浮游生物。"

#. ~ Nutrition information roughly based on edible sea cucumbers, if you know
#. more pls expand
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of echinoderm flesh"
msgid_plural "chunks of echinoderm flesh"
msgstr[0] "棘皮肉块"

#. ~ Nutrition information roughly based on edible sea cucumbers, if you know
#. more pls expand
#. ~ Description of "chunk of echinoderm flesh"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"The flesh of an echinoderm.  Considered a delicacy in several parts of the "
"world but otherwise poor in nutritional value."
msgstr "棘皮动物的肉块。在世界上许多地方被认为是美味佳肴，但其他方面的营养价值很低。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked echinoderm"
msgid_plural "cooked echinoderm"
msgstr[0] "熟棘皮肉"

#. ~ Description of "cooked echinoderm"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Freshly cooked echinoderm.  Not so glamorous without the rest of "
"ingredients."
msgstr "新鲜烹制的棘皮动物的肉块。没有其他佐料就不那么美味了。"

