"The flesh of a cnidarian.  Cultivated in some parts of the planet as an "
"exotic ingredient but otherwise a low nutrient edible."
msgstr "腔肠动物的肉块。在地球的某些地方被认为是一种猎奇食材，但其他方面的营养价值很低。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
