"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a mix between "
"fish and bird."
msgstr "空间风暴带来的异界生物。它的外形像是鱼和鸟的混合体。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "cloud scale"
msgid_plural "cloud scales"
msgstr[0] "云鳞鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "cloud scale"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
