"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a tiny "
"tropical fish, its scales shifting color with the sky."
msgstr "空间风暴带来的异界生物。它的外形像是一条小小的热带鱼，鳞片变换着天空的色彩。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "flag tail"
msgid_plural "flag tails"
msgstr[0] "旗尾鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "flag tail"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a tropical "
"fish with a long flowing tail."
msgstr "空间风暴带来的异界生物。它的外形像是一条热带鱼，长着飘动的长尾巴。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid "balloon drifter"
msgid_plural "balloon drifters"
msgstr[0] "气球漂鱼"

#. ~ Description of monster "balloon drifter"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
msgid ""
"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a rotund fish "
"filled with gas."
msgstr "空间风暴带来的异界生物。它的外形像是一条充满了气的圆鼓鼓的鱼。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
