"An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a sleek fish "
"with long angelic fins."
msgstr "空间风暴带来的异界生物。它的外形像是一条光滑的鱼，长着天使般的鳍。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_nether.json
