"United States had ripped from other worlds.  They probably had sent people "
"to your homeland to do the same.  You were out performing recon when the "
"Cataclysm struck and caught a ride with a stranger trying to find safety.  "
"Sadly you lost your companion and vehicle, getting lost in the process and "
"with now only a vague idea on how to get back to the safehouse, where you "
"hope your hidden gear remains untouched."
msgstr ""
"你从另一个国家来到这里，试图获取美国从其他世界窃取的秘密。他们可能已经派人到你的祖国去做同样的事了。你正在执行侦察任务，大灾变突然发生，不得不与一个陌生人搭车试图寻求庇护。遗憾的是，你失去了同伴和车辆，同时还迷路了，现在对于如何返回安全屋只剩下一个模糊的想法，你只能祈祷先前藏起来的装备还完好无缺。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Xedra Offworld Team: Jotunn Hunter"
msgstr "XEDRA异界小队：巨人猎手"

#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Jotunn Hunter" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Aquisitions group, you specialized in tracking, "
"killing and retrieving useful components from the cyborg tribes that seem to"
" exist on some of the worlds Xedra had access to.  Do you feel guilt about "
"bringing back the cybernetic components that are now inside you or your "
"teammates?  Or do you worry that now they might be on this world hunting "
"you?  You've lost your sidearm and spent half of your heavy ordnance.  Worst"
" of all, you're out of smokes."
msgstr ""
"作为XEDRA异界猎获小队的一员，你专门跟踪、杀死并回收来自改造人部落的有用组件，他们似乎存在于XEDRA能够到访的部分世界上。你是否为带回这些现在位于你和你的队友体内的生化插件感到过一丝内疚？还是担心现在他们可能会来到这个世界追杀你？你失去了你的副武器，用光了一半的重型弹药。最糟糕的是，你没有烟了。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Xedra Offworld Team: Jotunn Hunter"
msgstr "XEDRA异界小队：巨人猎手"

#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Jotunn Hunter" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Aquisitions group, you specialized in tracking, "
"killing and retrieving useful components from the cyborg tribes that seem to"
" exist on some of the worlds Xedra had access to.  Do you feel guilt about "
"bringing back the cybernetic components that are now inside you or your "
"teammates?  Or do you worry that now they might be on this world hunting "
"you?  You've lost your sidearm and spent half of your heavy ordnance.  Worst"
" of all, you're out of smokes."
msgstr ""
"作为XEDRA异界猎获小队的一员，你专门跟踪、杀死并回收来自改造人部落的有用组件，他们似乎存在于XEDRA能够到访的部分世界上。你是否为带回这些现在位于你和你的队友体内的生化插件感到过一丝内疚？还是担心现在他们可能会来到这个世界追杀你？你失去了你的副武器，用光了一半的重型弹药。最糟糕的是，你没有烟了。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Xedra Offworld Team: Troll Slayer"
msgstr "XEDRA异界小队：巨魔杀手"

#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Troll Slayer" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Aquisitions team, you were sent to gather "
"biological specimens, they often objected strenuously to being gathered.  "
"You've got some CBMs in you but understand they probably came out of someone"
" that might have friends."
msgstr ""
"作为XEDRA异界猎获小队的一员，你被派去获取生物标本，虽然他们经常极力抵抗。你体内安装了一些CBM，但要知道它们都可能来自于某个可能有朋友的人。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Xedra Offworld Team: Troll Slayer"
msgstr "XEDRA异界小队：巨魔杀手"

#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Troll Slayer" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Aquisitions team, you were sent to gather "
"biological specimens, they often objected strenuously to being gathered.  "
"You've got some CBMs in you but understand they probably came out of someone"
" that might have friends."
msgstr ""
"作为XEDRA异界猎获小队的一员，你被派去获取生物标本，虽然他们经常极力抵抗。你体内安装了一些CBM，但要知道它们都可能来自于某个可能有朋友的人。"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Xedra Offworld Team: Specter"
msgstr "XEDRA异界小队：幽魂"

#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Specter" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Aquisitions team, you were trained to infiltrate "
"any human compatible cultures that were discovered.  You never found any "
"with technology worth stealing and you aren't sure what that says about "
"humanity."
msgstr ""
"作为XEDRA异界猎获小队的一员，你受训并被派去渗透任何被发现与人类相容的文化世界。你从来没有发现任何值得窃取的技术，你也不知道这说明了什么人性问题。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Xedra Offworld Team: Specter"
msgstr "XEDRA异界小队：幽魂"

#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Specter" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Aquisitions team, you were trained to infiltrate "
"any human compatible cultures that were discovered.  You never found any "
"with technology worth stealing and you aren't sure what that says about "
"humanity."
msgstr ""
"作为XEDRA异界猎获小队的一员，你受训并被派去渗透任何被发现与人类相容的文化世界。你从来没有发现任何值得窃取的技术，你也不知道这说明了什么人性问题。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid "Fleshy Root Structures"
msgstr "肉质根结构"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Fleshy Root Structures"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid ""
"A fairly disturbing bionic module created by vampires for their servants.  "
"Installed by planting the seed next to the heart inside of the chest, then "
"sealed back up, the remainder of the surgery the seed spreads its root "
"structures across the body and limbs.  The roots large enough to help "
"obstruct damage to the body don't extend into the feet and hands but they do"
" wrap around the skull in places.  They take up very little space for a body"
" plus limbs CBM running mostly along the top layers of the skin.  Rumored to"
" grow denser and thicker as they age over decades and centuries."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid "Vampire Blood Power Generator"
msgstr "吸血鬼血液燃料电池"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Vampire Blood Power Generator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid ""
"Embedded into your back and connected to your bionic power supply is a "
"device to convert the blood of vampires to produce a facsimile of bionic "
"power.  It can store up to 100 mL of blood.  For unknown reasons if "
"installed into an active vampire it will not function when filled with its "
"bearers blood.  No one who talks about it knows why."
msgstr ""
"你的背部装有一个转化设备，并连接至你的生化能量系统，能够消耗吸血鬼的血液以产生生化能量。可以存放最多 100 "
"毫升血液。出于未知的原因，如果安装在一只吸血鬼身上，当充入自身血液时装置无法运作，没人知道为什么会这样。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid "internal vampire blood bank"
msgid_plural "internal vampire blood banks"
msgstr[0] "内置吸血鬼血液血库"

#. ~ Description of "internal vampire blood bank"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid "Internal tank for vampire blood power generator bionic."
msgstr "用于吸血鬼血液燃料电池CBM的内置储罐。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid "Chiropteran Vocal Cords"
msgstr "手翅目声带"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Chiropteran Vocal Cords"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid ""
"Your vocal cords have been enhanced, able to resonate like a bat to draw in "
"a swarm to protect you."
msgstr "你的声带得到了增强，能够像蝙蝠一样产生共鸣，吸引一群人来保护你。"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalizer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid ""
"Your vocal cords have been reinforced and enlarged.  You can make a strange "
"noise with it, but you don't know what it's supposed to communicate."
msgstr "您的声带得到了加强和扩大。 你可以用它发出奇怪的声音，但你不知道它应该传达什么。"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid "Crypt Spore Enhancement System"
msgstr "隐窝孢子增强系统"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Crypt Spore Enhancement System"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/renfield_cbms.json
msgid ""
"There are fungi that grow in the corpse dirt that vampires rest in.  In "
"unexposed humans these fungal spores can cause crippling coughing fits and "
"even death.  But when treated with a solution made of vampire blood or "
"harvested straight from the still-warm lungs of a previous recipient they "
"can be migrated into a living host body where they will speed up reactions "
"and increase strength slightly."
msgstr "有一些真菌生长在吸血鬼休息的尸体泥土中。在基准人类中，这些真菌孢子会导致令人残废的咳嗽，甚至死亡。但是当用吸血鬼血液制成的溶液处理时，或者直接从以前的接受者仍然温暖的肺部收获时，它们可以迁移到活着的宿主身体中，在那里它们会加速反应并略微增加力量。"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_fetch_child
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/changeling_speech.json
msgid "\"*giggles* Would you like to play tag?\""
msgstr "“*咯咯笑*你想玩捉迷藏吗？”"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_fetch_child
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/changeling_speech.json
msgid "\"*whispers* I want to tell you a secret.\""
msgstr "“*轻声低语*我想告诉你一个秘密。”"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_fetch_child
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/changeling_speech.json
msgid "\"My last friend went all red and stopped moving.\""
msgstr "“我的上一个朋友全身通红，不动了。”"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_fetch_child
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/changeling_speech.json
msgid "\"You're it, I'm gonna catch you!\""
msgstr "“轮到你了，我会抓住你的！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"The clopping of hooves pass you by with a swift breeze, yet you did not see "
"anything except for local flora brushed by the wind."
msgstr "一阵阵马蹄声随着微风从你身边掠过，但除了被风拂过的当地植物，你什么也没有看见。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"As you are walking you suddenly hear a woman singing mournfully.  As you "
"look around trying to see where the sound is coming from you slowly realize "
"that if you take more than a step and a half in any direction the song fades"
" away.  Eventually you are unable to find it again."
msgstr ""
"走着走着，忽闻妇人悲歌。当你环顾四周，试图寻找声音来源，你慢慢意识到，如果你向任何方向多走出一步半，歌声就会逐渐消失。最终，一切已如往常一样寂静。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"There is a bright red star with a dark heart that looks like a pupil, "
"staring down on you from the sky above.  Is that star in the sky every "
"night?  Is it coming closer to the planet?"
msgstr "有一颗鲜红的星星，一颗黑心，看起来像瞳孔，从头顶的天空凝视着你。 那颗星星每晚都在天空中吗？ 它离地球越来越近了吗？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A helicopter passes by overhead.  All it's running lights have been blacked "
"out and you suspect the rotors have been muffled.  If it hadn't passed right"
" over you, you'd have never known it was there."
msgstr "一架直升机从头顶掠过。它的所有指示灯都已熄灭，你觉得螺旋桨都已被消音。如果它没有从你上方经过，你根本没有察觉到它。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Something roars in the night, similar sounding to one of the Kaiju you heard"
" destroying a nearby town during the Cataclysm."
msgstr "夜里有什么东西在咆哮，听起来就像你在大灾变期间听到的一种怪兽摧毁附近城镇的声音。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The night suddenly goes dead silent."
msgstr "夜突然变得死一般的寂静。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You realize that all of your empty pockets have been turned inside out.  How"
" long ago this happened you can't say."
msgstr "你意识到你所有的空口袋都被翻了个底朝外。你没意识到这是多久以前发生的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You hear a tinkling sound on the wind."
msgstr "你听到风中发出叮当声。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A horn plays somewhere far in the distance; deep, mournful, and low."
msgstr "远处的某处吹响号角；深邃、哀伤、低沉。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Suddenly you smell rotten wood and tobacco."
msgstr "突然间你闻到腐木和烟草的味道。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You hear a distant explosion.  You can't tell if it came from one of the "
"tendrils of smoke at the edge of your vision or if it's new."
msgstr "你听到远处的爆炸声。你无法判断它是来自你视线边缘的某一卷烟雾，还是新产生的。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A single shot fires in the distance then silence."
msgstr "远处传来一声枪响，然后一片寂静。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The birds are no longer singing here.  It's quiet, scary quiet."
msgstr "鸟儿不再歌唱。很安静，安静得可怕。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A rare plane leaves contrails high in the sky.  You wonder where it could be"
" coming from and where it could possibly be going."
msgstr "一架罕见的飞机在高空留下尾迹。你想知道它可能来自哪里，以及它可能要去哪里。"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver, mon_mi_go_myrmidon
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/migo_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"We negotiated salvage rights to any biological matter remaining in the "
"event of civilizational collapse.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver, mon_mi_go_myrmidon
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/migo_speech.json
msgid "\"Come with us if you want to live!\""
msgstr "“如果想活命就跟我们走！”"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver, mon_mi_go_myrmidon
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/migo_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"Cease opposition our rights here are guaranteed by treaty M-A-J-I-K-1-2.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver, mon_mi_go_myrmidon
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/migo_speech.json
msgid "\"Your government no longer exists, we will adopt you.\""
msgstr "“你们的政府不再存在，我们会收养你。”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "fae_organs_desc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
msgid ""
"These organs came from a glittering nether beast, and you really aren't sure"
" what to make of them.  There are things you've possibly seen in an anatomy "
"book, but in colors and shapes that leave you doubtful."
msgstr "从巨大的发光异界怪兽身上切下的奇怪器官，你真的不知道如何利用它们。有些东西你可能在某本解剖学书上看到过，但这种颜色和外形让你不太敢确定。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "fae_organs_desc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
msgid ""
"These might be a kidney equivalent but they smell of rosemary at your touch."
msgstr "这些器官可能类似肾脏，但你一碰它们就能闻到一股迷迭香的味道。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "fae_organs_desc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
msgid "The lung looking organs are oozing a shimmering green substance."
msgstr "这个看起来像是肺脏的器官正不停地渗出某种闪闪发光的绿色物质。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "spy_note"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
msgid ""
"I've tracked down rumors an intradimensional contact unit based out a local "
"government building.  I'm going to go recon it, see you in a few days."
msgstr "我追踪到了关于某个跨界联系单位的传言，最终藏身处就在本地的政府大楼内。我去侦察一下，几天后见。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
msgid ""
"The weird creatures that seem to come out of peoples nightmares don't seem "
"to be able to track by smell like so many of the other monsters.  I wonder "
"if that's because smell isn't a strong sense in dreams?"
msgstr "从人们的噩梦中出现的奇怪生物似乎不像其他怪物那样能够通过气味追踪猎物。我想知道这是不是因为在梦中嗅觉这种感官并不强烈？"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_renfield, mon_renfield_9mm, mon_renfield_shotgun,
#. mon_renfield_flamethrower, mon_renfield_bionic_monster,
#. mon_renfield_abomination
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/vampire_speech.json
msgid "\"The masters have come, and they have promised to make me immortal!\""
msgstr "\"主人来了，答应让我长生不老！ \" z"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_renfield, mon_renfield_9mm, mon_renfield_shotgun,
#. mon_renfield_flamethrower, mon_renfield_bionic_monster,
#. mon_renfield_abomination
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/vampire_speech.json
msgid "\"I am here to do the masters' bidding!\""
msgstr "“我在这里执行主人的命令！”"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_renfield, mon_renfield_9mm, mon_renfield_shotgun,
#. mon_renfield_flamethrower, mon_renfield_bionic_monster,
#. mon_renfield_abomination
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/vampire_speech.json
msgid "\"Who's there?  Is that blood for the masters?\""
msgstr "“谁在那？那血是给主人的吗”"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_renfield, mon_renfield_9mm, mon_renfield_shotgun,
#. mon_renfield_flamethrower, mon_renfield_bionic_monster,
#. mon_renfield_abomination
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/vampire_speech.json
msgid "\"Can you help me?  The masters are so very hungry.\""
msgstr "“你能帮帮我吗？主人真的很饿。”"

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_renfield, mon_renfield_9mm, mon_renfield_shotgun,
#. mon_renfield_flamethrower, mon_renfield_bionic_monster,
#. mon_renfield_abomination
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/vampire_speech.json
msgid "\"Why won't you just surrender to the masters' needs!\""
msgstr "“为什么你就是不肯交出主人需要的！”"

#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Field Report CO001141: We've managed to capture one of what we are calling "
"the nobles of these people.  It claims to be a 'March Lord' and that it "
"rules a small barony right across the border between our worlds."
msgstr "现场报告CO001141：我们设法抓住了一个被我们称之为\"贵族\"的人，他们宣称他们是\"三月领主\"并统治着一块正好联通两界的领地"

#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141-a1: Chapfax Æelgar Llywelyn, as our prisoner "
"has identified himself can both speak and write our language.  Chapfax had "
"listened to use speak about him for days and only today did he respond to "
"any of our questions.  He claims this is because we just now began to "
"interest him."
msgstr "审讯报告：CO001141-a1：Chapfax Æelgar Llywelyn，我们的一个囚犯表明了他懂得如何使用我们的语言，Chapfax已经听我们讨论他好几天了，直到今天他才对我们的问题有所回应，他表明这一切都是因为我们现在让他感兴趣了"

#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141: The creature has spent three days sitting "
"and watching our attempts to communicate.  It has made no attempts to "
"communicate back to us."
msgstr "审讯报告：CO001141：这个生物就只是在那坐了三天，看着我们尝试与他交流，它并没有尝试回应我们，或者说，它根本不想回应我们。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141-b2: Chapfax has only spoken with specific "
"staff members and ignores any interaction from others.  We are trying to "
"find a pattern of who he is choosing and why."
msgstr "审讯报告：CO001141-b2：Chapfax只与那些特定的研究人员交流且无视其他任何人的审讯，我们在尝试找出一种他所选择之人的规律，以及原因。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141-f7: In the last 24 hours half of the staff "
"members Chapfax interacted with have gone missing.  Some even disappeared "
"from this office, we have no idea what has happened to them and if this is "
"some kind of kidnapping to ransom back Chapfax.  The so-called March Lord, "
"has said that he doesn't imagine it is anyone from his barony but that there"
" are many across the borderlands.  And that beyond those border lands are "
"the great states of the 'Far Lands'."
msgstr "CO001141-f7：在过去的24小时中，半数与Chapfax交流过的人都消失了，有的人甚至从自己的办公室里原地蒸发了，我们对此毫无头绪，这可能是一种以换回Chapfax为目的的绑架，但是所谓的\"三月领主\"说他不觉得这些鬼东西属于他的领土，并说我们的世界之间有很多特异点，而在特异点之外是一片叫\"远土\"的伟大国度"

#. ~ Snippet in category "changeling_march_lord_report"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Interrogation Report: CO001141-f75: Chapfax has been unusually talkative "
"since we informed him of the missing staff, I finally asked him why he was "
"being so talkative suddenly and he looked at me right in the eyes and "
"sorrowfully said 'I don't imagine anything I say will matter soon, I can "
"feel a change coming in your world and I'd prefer to watch it from my home."
"  I'll grant you and your family safe passage if we leave before nightfall.'"
"  I know the riots and weirdness have been escalating *the report stops "
"midsentence*."
msgstr "审讯报告：CO001141-f75：自从我们告诉Chapfex那起集体失踪事件之后他就变得异常健谈，当我问起原因时，他悲伤的看着我的眼睛说：\"我不认为一切我对你们说过的话在不久的将来还有价值，我感觉到你的世界马上要发生一场很大的变化，出于安全考虑，我还是想在我的领土上观看这场闹剧，如果我们能在夜幕（应该是代指大灾变）到来之前离开这里的话，我会保证你和你家人的安全\"我知道外面的暴动和古怪的事情已经到了一种难以控制的地步，因此我选择……*报告到此戛然而止*"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Remember to make the mortgage payment every month by the 5th!"
msgstr "记得每月五号之前还款！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Password: J@ckboot1"
msgstr "密码：J@ckboot1"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Call neighbors and try to identify date the McFarland's went missing."
msgstr "给他的邻居打电话并尽快确定麦克福兰德的失踪日期"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Cultists?  Foreign Agents?  Pod people?"
msgstr "邪教徒？外国特工？豆荚人（译注：出自科幻邪典片《天外魔花》，由外星植物感染制造的没有自我意志的人类复制品）？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Carcosa?  Leng?."
msgstr "卡尔克萨?  冷原?（注：这两都是克苏鲁神话里的地名）"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Delta Green?  Majestic 12?"
msgstr "绿色三角洲？MJ-12？（注：这两均是克苏鲁神话中的特殊行动小队）"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Surveillance to continue on home until Jamison returns."
msgstr "保持高强度监视吉米森的住宅，直到看见他回家为止"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Suspect appears to have hung from the ceiling waiting for the Smith's to "
"return home."
msgstr "嫌疑人似乎一直悬吊在天花板上等待Smith一家回来"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Local doctor said it looked like viral cancer similar to some stories he'd "
"seen out of Tazmania."
msgstr "当地的医生说，这似乎是一种病毒性癌症，症状与他在一个来自于塔兹马尼亚的故事中看到的极其相符。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "desk_postit_field_agent"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Requisition heavier weaponry"
msgstr "记得去向上级请求更多的重武器"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Several of the victims appear to have been exsanguinated and the others were"
" killed while they fled.  Suspicion that the first victims in the club were "
"killed by exsanguination and only upon their death did the other club goers "
"recognize the danger and attempt to flee."
msgstr "一部分人死于失血过多另一部分应该是在逃跑的过程中被杀，合理怀疑在第一批人被放血致死后余下的俱乐部成员才意识到危险并尝试逃跑"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Every scene is permeated by the smell of rosemary and mint.  All victims set"
" on fire after their death."
msgstr "每处地方都弥漫着\"迷迭香\"和\"薄荷\"的香气，所有受害者死后都被焚烧了"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Three different types of shapechangers found in the last month?  Separate "
"successful experiments from one power or different incursions that we should"
" expect more from each type?"
msgstr "在过去一个月里发现了三种不同类型的变形者？将成功的实验与一种力量或不同的入侵分开，我们应该对每种类型都期待更多吗？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Does Danvers State have room for more guests?"
msgstr "丹弗斯州有没有足够的空房来接待更多的客人？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Field Office in Utah was recently hit by some kind of strike team unsure if "
"it was a foreign squad trying to grab something specific or if they had "
"attracted the attention of other forces that decided to cross over."
msgstr "最近，犹他州的外勤办公室遭到了某种突击小队的袭击，不确定是外国小队试图夺取特定目标，还是他们引起了其他势力的注意并决定越境行动。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Need more armor piercing rounds."
msgstr "需要更多穿甲弹。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Victims found decapitated and staked.  Send bodies out for autopsy."
msgstr "发现被斩首和钉死的受害者。将尸体送去验尸。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Folklore says to burn any remains and then scatter the ashes in running "
"water."
msgstr "民间传说称应将任何遗骸烧毁，然后将灰烬撒在流动的水中。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Shapeshifter Suspect is *NOT* allergic to salt."
msgstr "变形者嫌疑人对盐*不过敏*。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_gray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid "Call requisitions to find out about silver rounds?"
msgstr "打电话申请了解银圆的情况吗？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_migo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Any missions that end up discovering 'mi-go' class aliens require approval "
"from an external agency before engagement."
msgstr "任何可能会遭遇米·戈类异形的任务都需要在开始之前获得外部机构的批准。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_migo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Aliens are mirrorshades territory, and you know how they feel about us. "
"Cowboys and adventurers they call us."
msgstr "异界是镜像的领土,你知道他们对我们的看法 他们称我们为牛仔和冒险者。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_migo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Off books, there are bonuses available to any agent that is able to execute "
"any 'mi-go' and make it disappear."
msgstr "非正式记录，对于能够处决任何“米戈”并使其消失的特工，有额外奖金可获得。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_migo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Memo: Several agents appear to have broken protocols and gone rogue in "
"regards to mi-go interactions.  They have been missing for three weeks and "
"became presumed dead after pieces of their bodies totalling 30% of their "
"weight had been mailed home in individual packages."
msgstr "备忘录：一些代理似乎已经违反了协议，并且在mi-go交互方面变得流氓。他们已经失踪了三个星期，在他们的总计30%的重量尸体碎片被单独邮寄回家后，他们被推定死亡。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_migo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"They seem to be here to take captives and animals to go back to their "
"homeworld/s."
msgstr "他们来这里的目的似乎是把俘虏和动物带回他们的世界。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "agent_postit_migo"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/xedra.json
msgid ""
"Off books, we need more intel on the mirrorshades so we can avenge Tony, "
"Martell, and Picarelli."
msgstr "非正式记录,我们需要更多镜像的情绪才能为托尼,马泰尔和皮卡雷利报仇。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Night Sight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes glow lavender for a moment.  Now your sight can pierce the darkest"
" shadows."
msgstr "你的眼睛闪着淡紫色的光芒。现在你的目光可以穿透最深沉的阴影。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Weight of Dread"
msgstr "恐惧重担"

#. ~ Description of spell "Weight of Dread"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"Everything around you faces an existential crisis and moves slower as a "
"result.  Including things that you wouldn't expect to suffer from "
"existential crises, like the undead.  The air around the targets' "
"extremities chills dramatically.  Higher levels allow a bigger AoE, and "
"longer effect."
msgstr ""
"你周围的一切都面临着生存恐惧，因此行动缓慢。包括那些你通常不认为会有生存恐惧的东西，比如不死生物。目标四肢周围的空气急剧冷却。等级越高，范围越大，影响越久。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "模糊术"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blur"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"The edges of your form seem to blur and distort, increasing the amount of "
"attacks you might dodge in a given turn."
msgstr "你身体的边缘看起来模糊扭曲，增加了你在一个回合中所能闪避攻击的次数。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Damage Transfer"
msgstr "伤害转移"

#. ~ Description of spell "Damage Transfer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"Allow you to move some damage from your body to someone else.  Usually "
"people don't like it, but who cares now?"
msgstr "让你将一些伤害从自身转移到其他人身上。通常人们不喜欢这个法术，但现在谁在乎呢？"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Damage Transfer Heal"
msgstr "伤害转移治疗"

#. ~ Description of spell "Damage Transfer Heal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"Spell that will heal you for a bit.  You can see it only in debug mode."
msgstr "稍微治疗你的法术。只有在调试模式下才能看到它。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Pyroportation"
msgstr "炎爆传送"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pyroportation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid ""
"Transport you from one place to another, creating a huge fire explosion in "
"the end."
msgstr "将你从一个地方传送到另一个地方，并在终点处造成巨大的火焰爆炸。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Pyroportation Explosion"
msgstr "炎爆传送爆炸"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pyroportation Explosion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
msgid "Makes pretty big fire explosion around you."
msgstr "在你的四周制造出火焰爆炸。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Dream Blade"
msgstr "梦剑术"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dream Blade"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"This ephemeral blade allows you to defend yourself with dreams brought out "
"of your mind!"
msgstr "这把短暂存在的剑可以让你用脑海中的浮梦来保护自己！"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Dream Dagger"
msgstr "梦匕术"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dream Dagger"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"This ephemeral dagger allows you to defend yourself with dreams brought out "
"of your mind!  Summoning smaller objects is faster and cheaper than "
"summoning larger more complex items."
msgstr "这把短暂存在的匕首可以让你用脑海中的浮梦来保护自己！召唤小型物体比召唤更大更复杂的物品更快、更容易。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Dream Armor"
msgstr "梦甲术"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dream Armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid ""
"Armor that sits lightly on your body with little in the way of encumbrance "
"and rests on top of whatever you are wearing."
msgstr "召唤出一套轻轻盖在你身上的盔甲，几乎没有什么累赘，并且叠加在你所穿衣物的上方。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Bring forth Dreamdross"
msgstr "产生浮梦"

#. ~ Description of spell "Bring forth Dreamdross"
#. ~ Description of spell "Forge Dreamdross"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamsmithing.json
msgid ""
"This ritual pulls a small amount of dreamdross into our world and makes it "
"permanent.  These scraps of dreaming can then be used to make permanent "
"objects."
msgstr "这个仪式法术会将少量的浮梦残渣带入我们的世界，并使其永久存在。这些梦境的碎片可以用来制造永恒存在的物体。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Twin"
msgstr "分身"

#. ~ Description of spell "Twin"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Make fake copy of yourself to disrupt your enemies."
msgstr "制作一个自己的假分身来扰乱你的敌人。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Twin Flood"
msgstr "二重身大群"

#. ~ Description of spell "Twin Flood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamer_spells.json
msgid "Fill the reality with your own copies."
msgstr "用你自己的分身填满现实。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamsmithing.json
msgid "Call Oneiric Hammer"
msgstr "召唤梦之锤"

#. ~ Description of spell "Call Oneiric Hammer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamsmithing.json
msgid ""
"Creates a crystal blacksmith's hammer with which to build a new reality."
msgstr "召唤出一把魔法水晶铁匠锤，用它来打造出新的现实。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/dreamsmithing.json
msgid "Forge Dreamdross"
msgstr "锻造浮梦残渣"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat dreamdross"
msgstr "食用浮梦残渣"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat dreamdross"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "You consume dreamdross to regain mana."
msgstr "你吃下浮梦残渣来获取法力。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat more dreamdross"
msgstr "食用更多浮梦"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat more dreamdross"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "You can consume more dreamdross to regain mana in one sitting."
msgstr "一次吃下多份浮梦残渣来获取法力。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Eat dreamdross ingots"
msgstr "食用浮梦锭"

#. ~ Description of spell "Eat dreamdross ingots"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "You can consume ingots of dreamdross to regain mana in one sitting."
msgstr "一次吃下浮梦锭来获取法力。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Blood Boil"
msgstr "沸血术"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blood Boil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid ""
"With a shouted ancient word, the target's blood temperature begins to "
"increase dangerously."
msgstr "随着一声古代咒语，目标的血液温度开始危险地升高。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Trade dreams for health"
msgstr "梦愈治疗"

#. ~ Description of spell "Trade dreams for health"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Absorbs some dross and heals damage to yourself."
msgstr "消耗一些浮梦残渣并修复自身伤害。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Recover fatigue for dreams"
msgstr "浮梦恢复疲劳。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Recover fatigue for dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Absorbs some dross and heals fatigue to yourself."
msgstr "吸收一些浮梦残渣并治愈自己的疲劳。"

#. ~ Message of spell "Recover fatigue for dreams"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "You feel refreshed."
msgstr "你感到神清气爽。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Spring-heeled Leap"
msgstr "弹簧跳"

#. ~ Description of spell "Spring-heeled Leap"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Force pushes your feet off the ground and launches you several meters."
msgstr "魔力把你的脚推离地面，把你跃起离地面几米。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Banish interdimensional horrors"
msgstr "放逐异界怪物"

#. ~ Description of spell "Banish interdimensional horrors"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid ""
"Attempts to banish things clearly inimical to local physics back to their "
"home dimension."
msgstr "试图将明显不符合本地物理法则的怪物驱逐回他们的原始维度。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
