msgstr "放逐暗夜血肉"

#. ~ Description of spell "Banish darkness made flesh"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Attempts to banish monsters crafted from the darkest of nights."
msgstr "试图放逐由暗夜噩梦制造出的怪物。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blind Rage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Perfect hatred."
msgstr "完美的憎恨。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Circulatory"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Don't stop."
msgstr "不要停下来。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Dark Vision"
msgstr "黑暗视觉"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dark Vision"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Enhance your eyes to see at night same as in daylight."
msgstr "强化你的双眼，让你在夜晚视物如同白昼。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

#. ~ Description of spell "Hide"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Don't let them spot you."
msgstr "不要让他们发现你。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Open Mind"
msgstr "思维展开"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Pierce"
msgstr "刺击"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pierce"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Throw a long ethereal spear out of your hand."
msgstr "从你手中扔出一支空灵的长枪。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Rush"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Run.  Run as fast as you can.  Don't stop."
msgstr "跑，尽可能快地跑。不要停下来。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Weakening"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Make enemies around you more vulnerable."
msgstr "让你周围的敌人更加脆弱。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Make The Battery Miracle"
msgstr "创造电池奇迹"

#. ~ Description of spell "Make The Battery Miracle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Make a gun that uses energy from almost any type of battery to shoot hot "
"lasers."
msgstr "制造一把能够利用几乎任何类型的电池来发射热激光的枪。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Build a ray gun"
msgstr "制作射线枪"

#. ~ Description of spell "Build a ray gun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Make a gun that uses energy from batteries to shoot superhot rays of energy."
msgstr "制作一把利用电池内能量发射热能射线的枪。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Write ray gun schematics"
msgstr "编写射线枪示意图"

#. ~ Description of spell "Write ray gun schematics"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Use the experience from your ray diagram studies to create a gun able to "
"project them."
msgstr "使用来自你的射线图研究的经验来创建一个能够投影它们的枪。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Build a death ray"
msgstr "建造死光"

#. ~ Description of spell "Build a death ray"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Make a gun, using aether drawn from the void between all things, that shoots"
" beams able to melt anything in its path."
msgstr "用来自万物之间的虚空中抽取之以太打造一把枪械，放出的光束能融化所经之处一切。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Make The Wolf Sledge"
msgstr "打造恶狼战锤"

#. ~ Description of spell "Make The Wolf Sledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"You know how to make a really dreadful hammer.  It's a two-handed basher, "
"but it also can work as a boomerang."
msgstr "你知道如何打造一把真正可怕的战锤。双手握住捶打，但也可以像回旋镖一样使用。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Firmament-driver"
msgstr "苍穹推击"

#. ~ Description of spell "Firmament-driver"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Push the target  It's not really effective, but sometimes it helps."
msgstr "推开敌人，它并不是很有效，但有时还是可以派上用场。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Firmament-driver Damage"
msgstr "苍穹推击伤害"

#. ~ Description of spell "Firmament-driver Damage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Deal some damage to pushed enemy."
msgstr "对被推开的敌人造成一些伤害。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Make The Bio Detonator"
msgstr "制作生物爆炸装置"

#. ~ Description of spell "Make The Bio Detonator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"You know how to make a tool to explode the biosignature of nearly all living"
" creatures.  It's really powerful, but can't separate enemies from allies, "
"or enemies from user, so it's better to not use it in point-blank range."
msgstr "你知道如何制造一种能够爆破几乎所有生物的生物特征的工具。它非常强大，但无法区分敌人和盟友，或者敌人和使用者，所以最好不要在近距离使用它。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Make The Bio Detonator"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "You know how to make a warhead for your humming mortar to fire."
msgstr "你知道如何制造一个战斗头，用于发射你的鸣蜂迫击炮。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Make The Vancian Bill"
msgstr "制定万西安账单"

#. ~ Description of spell "Make The Vancian Bill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Somehow if you write some symbols on paper, and cover it with mana, you can "
"make a tool, that allow to tear small part of reality.  You found paper "
"dollar bills perfectly fit the required shape of ticket.  You find it "
"hilarious the reality can accept US currency."
msgstr "如果你在纸上写下一些符号并用法力覆盖，你就能制作出一种工具，让你撕裂现实的一小部分。 你发现一元纸币完全符合所需的形状。你发现现实竟然接受美钞，这太搞笑了"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Helmet of Creative Juices"
msgstr "创造力提取头盔"

#. ~ Description of spell "Helmet of Creative Juices"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"You know how to make a helmet, that will increase your creative abilities.  "
"Even with this improvement you don't really know how it works, it just came "
"to you in a flash of brilliance."
msgstr "你知道如何制作这个头盔，这能提高你的创造能力。 即使有了这种改进，你也不知道它是如何工作的，只是你的灵光一闪。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Make The Ion Rifle"
msgstr "制造离子步枪"

#. ~ Description of spell "Make The Ion Rifle"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Craft a small weapon that do… things, that allow you to… kill… things… "
"whatever, you have no idea how it works."
msgstr "制造一个可以干……某些事的小型武器，可以让你……杀死……某些东西……无论如何，你不知道它是怎样工作的。"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid "Minor Spark of Inspiration"
msgstr "微小的灵感火花"

#. ~ Description of spell "Minor Spark of Inspiration"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/inventor_spells.json
msgid ""
"Enters a manic creation episode in the appropriate workshop space and "
"creates… something."
msgstr "进入适当的工作坊空间，开始狂热创作，并创造出……某物。"

