msgstr "周围没人吗？没关系。只需要有你心爱的山羊就够了！"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lost Tribal"
msgstr "迷失部落民"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lost Tribal" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were out gathering for the tribe when the sky broke and the gods called "
"to you, then you collapsed.  When you woke up, you were in an unfamiliar "
"place with new memories crowding your thoughts."
msgstr "你正在为部落采集食物，突然天空开裂，众神呼唤着你，然后你就倒下了。当你醒过来时，你身处一处陌生的地方，新的记忆充斥着你的脑海。"

