#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Seems like you're on your own."
msgstr "不管怎么着，你发现自己身处一处山洞之中。看起来只有你一个人了。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "A Lonely Cave" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
