#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Runner"
msgstr "生化跑步运动员"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Runner" for male
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the kind of sportsman who couldn't get off the track.  You love "
"running, and you enhanced your body with cybernetics to go even faster.  Now"
" there's plenty to run from - this is your kind of game."
msgstr "你就是那种无法离开跑道的运动员。你喜欢跑步，你用生化插件改造了你的身体来跑得更快。现在有很多怪物需要你逃离跑开，这就是你的比赛。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Runner"
msgstr "生化跑步运动员"

