"当前已隐藏任务数：%d"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1283
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Plow any spaces that have reverted to dirt or grass.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"说明：\n"
"将已经变回泥土地或草地的农田重新犁成可供种植的土堆。\n"
"\n"

