"收获所有已成熟的作物并将其带回营地。\n"
"\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp:1341
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Will dump all harvesting products onto your location.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Time: 3 Min / Plot\n"
"Positions: 0/1\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
