#: src/iexamine.cpp:5593
msgid ""
"The Autodoc detected an anti-radiation drug in <npcname>'s bloodstream, so "
"it decided not to administer another dose right now."
msgstr "全自动医疗仪在 <npcname> 的血液中检测到了一种抗辐射药物，所以它决定现在不再使用第二剂。"

