msgstr "停下研磨机将中断碾磨过程。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6198
msgid "There's a mill here.  It is turning and milling."
msgstr "这里有个碾磨机，它在转动和碾磨。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6200
#, c-format
msgid "It should take about %s to finish milling."
msgstr "大概需要 %s 完成碾磨。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6204
msgid "There's a mill here."
msgstr "这里有个碾磨机。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6206 src/iexamine.cpp:6426
msgid "You inspect its contents and find: "
