msgstr "你吸了一口高级电子香烟中的烟雾。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:629
msgid "You don't have any nicotine liquid!"
msgstr "你没有尼古丁浓缩液！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:639
msgid "Ugh, too much nicotine… you feel nasty."
msgstr "妈的，尼古丁太多了……你感到有点作呕。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:647
msgid "You take some antibiotics."
msgstr "你服用了一些抗生素。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:648
msgid "<npcname> takes some antibiotics."
msgstr "<npcname> 服用了一些抗生素。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:659
msgid ""
"Maybe this is just the placebo effect, but you feel a little better as the "
