msgstr "你没有那个物品！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1656
msgid "Which signal should activate the item?"
msgstr "物品激活信号："

#: src/iuse.cpp:1657 src/iuse.cpp:1669
msgid "\"Blue\""
msgstr "\"蓝色\""

#: src/iuse.cpp:1657 src/iuse.cpp:1673
msgid "\"Green\""
msgstr "\"绿色\""

#: src/iuse.cpp:1657 src/iuse.cpp:1665
msgid "\"Red\""
msgstr "\"红色\""

#: src/iuse.cpp:1680
msgid "This item has been modified this way already."
msgstr "这件物品已经被如此改装过了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1687
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You modify your %1$s to listen for the %2$s activation signal on the radio."
msgstr "你将 %1$s 改装成使用 %2$s 无线电信号来启动。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1710
msgid "Remove mods from tool?"
msgstr "真的要移除工具的模组吗？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1711
msgid "You don't have any modified tools."
msgstr "你没有任何安装了模组的工具。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1723
#, c-format
msgid "You remove the %s from the tool."
msgstr "你从工具里取出了 %s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1744
msgid "You doubt you will have much luck catching fish here."
msgstr "你觉得这儿可能钓不到鱼。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1769 src/iuse.cpp:1810
msgid "You can't fish there!"
msgstr "你不能在那里钓鱼！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1772
msgid "You cast your line and wait to hook something…"
msgstr "你把鱼线扔出，等待有什么东西上钩……"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1799
msgid "Fish aren't foolish enough to go in here without bait."
msgstr "鱼儿还没傻到会上这个没饵的钩。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1803
msgid "Put fish trap where?"
msgstr "在哪里安放捕鱼器？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1821
msgid ""
"You place the fish trap; in three hours or so, you may catch some fish."
msgstr "你放置了捕鱼陷阱，估计两三个小时之后你可能会有所收获。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1918 src/iuse.cpp:5125
msgid "Spray where?"
msgstr "喷哪里？"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1941
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is sprayed!"
msgstr "%s 已经被喷过了！"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1943
#, c-format
msgid "The %s looks blinded."
msgstr "%s 看起来已经瞎了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1948
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is frozen!"
msgstr "%s 被冻住了！"

